    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。")},
    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("柄式手榴弹先落进敌壕。\n四人突击班，擅长近壕交战，也能损伤履带。烟幕掩护接近；远处机枪是主要威胁。")},
    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("Stick grenades lead the assault into the trench.\nFour men excel at close fighting and can damage tracks. Smoke covers the approach; distant machine guns are a serious threat.")},
    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("柄式手榴弹先越过胸墙。突击班擅长近壕交战，也能威胁履带；接近途中需要烟幕或机枪掩护。\n编制：4人。")},
    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("Stick grenades cross the parapet first. Assault men excel in close trenches and can threaten tracks; smoke or covering fire helps them survive the approach.\nSection: 4 men.")},
    {TEXT("柄式手榴弹越过胸墙，突击手随后跃出。哨音停下，枪声接替。\n四人小队；近距离清壕，损伤坦克履带\n烟幕或机枪掩护接近；远处机枪威胁大"), TEXT("Stick grenades pass the parapet; the assault party follows. The whistle stops and the firing begins.\nFour men; clear close trenches and damage tank tracks\nSmoke or machine guns cover the approach; distant guns threaten exposed men"), TEXT("Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close.")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("一名精确射手、一名持步枪的观察手，优先攻击敌方机枪手。烟幕、压制和近距离敌军会妨碍瞄准。")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("One marksman and one rifle-armed spotter prioritise enemy machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and nearby enemies disrupt their aim.")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("射手在胸墙上找到了机枪的闪光，身旁的观察手守住近处。稳定瞄准克制固定枪位；烟幕、压制和近敌会打断优势。\n编制：1名精确射手、1名普通步枪观察手。")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("制式步枪中挑出一支好枪。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手，优先射击机枪手。烟雾、压制与近敌会打断瞄准。")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("A selected rifle goes to the section marksman.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter prioritise machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and close attacks disrupt their aim.")},
    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("枪声之间，射手辨认敌方机枪的闪光。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪；烟雾、压制和近敌会妨碍瞄准。")},
