    {TEXT("观察手守着壕角，射手循枪口闪光瞄准。\n一名精确射手、一名步枪观察手\n优先攻击机枪手；烟幕、压制、近敌妨碍瞄准"), TEXT("The spotter guards the traverse while the marksman follows a muzzle flash.\nOne marksman, one rifle-armed spotter\nPrioritise machine gunners; smoke, suppression and close enemies disrupt aim"), TEXT("The marksman finds a gun flash while his spotter watches the close ground. Steady aim counters fixed guns; smoke, suppression and close attacks break the advantage.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("三人 Jäger 步枪巡逻队移动快、接敌迅速，适合抢占空壕、增援前线。远距离精确射击弱于英军狙击组。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("A three-man Jäger rifle patrol moves and acquires targets quickly, making it useful for taking empty trenches or reinforcing the front. It is less precise at long range than a British sniper team.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。")},
