    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("A selected rifle watches the long approach; a service-rifle spotter guards its flank. The marksman prioritises machine guns and must settle before changing aim.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("猎兵小队。老兵迅速接敌，在中等距离以准确步枪火力压住暴露步兵。缺乏掩护时，难以突破机枪与装甲。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances"), TEXT("Jäger patrol. Veteran riflemen close rapidly and deliver accurate fire at medium range. Effective against exposed infantry; machine guns and armour halt an unsupported advance.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士提高附近友军的命中率，停步时帮助部队重整。\n命中率提高 25%，每 8 秒缓解一次压制。同类指挥加成不叠加；军士受重压、离队或阵亡后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥的分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The NCO improves nearby aim and rallies troops while halted.\nAccuracy rises by 25%; suppression is reduced every 8 seconds. NCO bonuses do not stack and end if he is heavily suppressed, separated or killed.\nGold marks the NCO; silver marks sections under his command.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士把各处枪位纳入同一道命令。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥，同类加成不叠加。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士的口令沿交通壕传开。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。同类指挥不叠加，重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥。\n金星为指挥者，银星为受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The sergeant carries his orders down the trench.\nNearby troops gain 25% accuracy and rally every 8 seconds while he is halted. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression, separation or death ends the effect.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士沿壕传下口令。指挥组提高附近友军命中率，并在停步后缓解压制；组长阵亡、受重压或远离部队时，指挥加成失效。\n战术：命中率+25%，不叠加；每8秒重整。金星为指挥者，银星为受益分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士的口令沿壕传开。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
