    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The sergeant passes an order down the trench. His section improves nearby aim and rallies troops while halted; death, heavy suppression or separation ends the command bonus.\nTactics: +25% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 8 seconds. Gold marks the leader, silver the affected sections.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The sergeant's order passes down the trench.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士把口令送到相邻枪位。指挥组提高附近友军命中率，停步后缓解压制；失去组长或让他陷入重压都会中断指挥。\n战术：命中率+25%，不叠加；每8秒重整。金星为指挥者，银星为受益分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士把失联的枪位重新接起。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。同类指挥不叠加，重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥。\n金星为指挥者，银星为受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The NCO restores contact between the posts.\nNearby troops gain 25% accuracy and rally every 8 seconds while he is halted. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression, separation or death ends the effect.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士穿过交通壕，将零散的枪位重新接起。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%；停步时每 8 秒缓解压制。重压、离队或阵亡会中断指挥，同类加成不叠加。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("军士穿过交通壕，重新接起各处枪位。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The NCO brings the scattered posts back under command.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The NCO carries an order between gun posts. His section improves nearby aim and rallies troops while halted; losing the leader or pinning him down breaks command.\nTactics: +25% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 8 seconds. Gold marks the leader, silver the affected sections.")},
    {TEXT("军士举起哨子，伏地的士兵重新抬头。吹哨的人最先露出胸墙。\n指挥：附近友军命中率 +25%\n停步时每 8 秒重整一次\n受重压、离队或阵亡后失效"), TEXT("The NCO raises his whistle and the men lift their heads. He is the first to show above the parapet.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +25%\nRallies every 8 s while halted\nCommand ends under heavy suppression, separation or death"), TEXT("The NCO crosses the communication trench to restore contact.\nNearby troops gain 25% accuracy and rally every 8 seconds while he is halted. Heavy suppression, separation or death breaks command. Bonuses do not stack.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("Schilt 喷火分遣队擅长清理近处掩体，射程短，燃料有限。喷火手能承受少量枪击，但爆炸仍可将其击杀并引燃储罐。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("Schilt flame troops clear nearby cover, with short range and limited fuel. The operator can withstand some gunfire, but explosions can kill him and ignite the tank.")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("Schilt 操作手在壕口打开阀门。喷流清理近处掩体，燃料和射程有限；爆炸能当场击杀操作手并引燃储罐。\n操作手较能承受零星枪火，仍需步兵掩护。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("法军分遣队携 Schilt 接近敌壕。\n喷流清理近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较耐零星枪火；爆炸命中致命，并可能引燃储罐。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("A French detachment brings the Schilt to the trench.\nFlame clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator resists scattered rifle fire; a direct blast is fatal and may ignite the reservoir.")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("法军喷火手把 Schilt 带到壕口。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命；储罐可能被引燃。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("A French flame detachment brings its Schilt to the trench mouth.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal and can ignite the reservoir.")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军\n射程、燃料有限；可承受零星枪击\n爆炸致命，并可引燃储罐"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt clears close defenders\nLimited reach and fuel; withstands scattered shots\nBlasts kill and may ignite the reservoir"), TEXT("The Schilt operator opens the valve at the trench mouth. The jet clears nearby cover but has limited fuel and reach; a blast can kill the operator and ignite his reservoir.\nThe operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but still needs infantry cover.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("Wex 喷火工兵擅长清理近处掩体，射程短，燃料有限。用烟幕掩护接近；喷火手能承受少量枪击，但爆炸仍可将其击杀并引燃储罐。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("Wex flame pioneers clear nearby cover, with short range and limited fuel. Use smoke for the approach. The operator can withstand some gunfire, but explosions can kill him and ignite the tank.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("Wex 储罐贴着壕壁前移。喷流清理近处掩体，烟幕有助于接近；燃料有限，爆炸可能引燃储罐。\n操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸仍可当场击杀。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("Wex 储罐贴着胸墙前移。\n喷流清理近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较耐零星枪火，仍需烟幕掩护接近；爆炸命中致命，储罐可能起火。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves along the parapet.\nFlame clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator resists scattered rifle fire and benefits from smoke on the approach. A direct blast is fatal; the reservoir can ignite.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。枪手须把这只罐子带到近处。\nWex 清理近处掩体；射程、燃料有限\n可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命并可引燃储罐\n烟幕掩护接近"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse; the reservoir follows. The gunner must carry it close.\nWex clears close cover; limited reach and fuel\nWithstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir\nSmoke covers the approach"), TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves forward beside the trench wall. Its jet clears close cover, with smoke helping the approach; fuel is limited and blasts may ignite the tank.\nThe operator resists scattered rifle fire better, but a blast can still kill outright.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("皇家工兵可清除铁丝和地雷，连续施工可加固战壕，减少驻军遭到的正面枪击。炮火可摧毁工事。\n后期可抢修履带，恢复至半数耐久。附近有敌军或受到压制时，作业会中断。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Royal Engineers clear wire and mines. Sustained work fortifies a trench against frontal gunfire; shellfire can destroy the work.\nLater equipment allows track repairs to half durability. Nearby enemies or suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("皇家工兵剪开铁丝，清除地雷。\n连续施工可筑成壕肩，掩护驻军抵御正面枪火；炮火能摧毁工事。后期配发抢修器材，可将损坏的履带修至半数耐久。接敌或压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Royal Engineers cut wire and clear mines.\nUninterrupted work builds a revetment that protects its defenders against frontal fire. Shellfire can destroy it. Later repair equipment restores a damaged track to half strength. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间打开通路。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("皇家工兵把剪钳伸进铁丝。工兵清障、筑壕肩，后期可抢修坦克履带；近敌与压制会打断作业。\n第2关起：静止施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Royal Engineers cut a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Royal Engineers open a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Royal Engineers put their cutters into the wire. Sappers clear obstacles, build revetments and later repair tank tracks; nearby enemies and suppression interrupt work.\nFrom operation 2: build while stationary for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere 可清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，连续施工可加固战壕，减少驻军遭到的正面枪击。炮火可摧毁工事。\n后期可抢修履带，恢复至半数耐久。附近有敌军或受到压制时，作业会中断。")},
