    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝剪出缺口。工兵清障、加固壕肩，后期可抢修履带；施工需要停步和友军掩护。\n第2关起：施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次；近敌与压制会打断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere 穿过铁丝与未爆弹。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere cut a gap through the wire. They clear obstacles, reinforce revetments and later repair tracks; work requires a halt and covering fire.\nFrom operation 2: build for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side; enemies and suppression interrupt it.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere open a route through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications"), TEXT("Pioniere work through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("一名 No.23 枪榴弹射手、两名步枪手，适合打击固定枪位和密集步兵。弹着点散布较大，难以命中分散移动的敌军。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("One No.23 rifle-grenade gunner and two riflemen attack fixed gun posts and massed infantry. Wide scatter makes dispersed, moving enemies harder to hit.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹越过胸墙。\n一名枪榴弹射手、两名步枪手，擅长打击固定枪位与密集步兵。落点散布较大，分散移动的敌军较难命中。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("No.23 rifle grenades pass over the parapet.\nOne grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed guns and infantry concentrations. Wide scatter limits their effectiveness against dispersed moving troops.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹越过壕角。枪榴弹组压制固定阵位；散布较大，不善于追打奔跑的散兵。\n编制：1名枪榴弹射手、2名步枪手。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade drops behind the parapet.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen. Suited to fixed guns and infantry concentrations; wide scatter makes dispersed moving targets difficult to hit.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade passes over the traverse. The team suppresses fixed positions; broad scatter makes running stragglers poor targets.\nSection: 1 rifle grenadier and 2 riflemen.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名 No.23 射手、两名步枪手\n打击固定枪位、密集步兵\n散布大，难中分散移动目标")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne No.23 gunner, two riflemen\nAttack fixed guns and massed infantry\nWide scatter hinders hits on dispersed moving targets")},
