    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne No.23 gunner, two riflemen\nAttack guns and massed infantry; damage tracks\nMinor hull damage; wide scatter against moving targets")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年七月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\n反装甲射程短；散布大，移动目标难中")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nClose-range anti-armour fire; broad scatter against moving targets")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets"), TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\n反装甲射程短；散布大，移动目标难中")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("两人 Tankgewehr 反坦克枪组，以单发射击攻击车体和履带。距离较近、弹头接近垂直击中装甲板时，更容易击穿。装填缓慢，需要步兵保护。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("A two-man Tankgewehr team fires single rounds at hulls and tracks. Close range and a square hit on the armour plate improve penetration. Slow reloading leaves the crew reliant on infantry protection.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("Tankgewehr 在土堤上架稳。反坦克组逐发射击车体与履带；装填缓慢，敌方步兵能逼近枪位。\n编制：2人。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("两人 Tankgewehr 反坦克枪组，以单发射击攻击车体和履带。距离越近、入射角越接近垂直，越容易击穿。装填缓慢，需要步兵保护。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("A two-man Tankgewehr team fires single rounds at hulls and tracks. Short range and a perpendicular impact angle improve penetration. Slow reloading leaves them reliant on infantry protection.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("Tankgewehr 的重弹打向车体。\n两人枪组，逐发攻击装甲与履带。近距离正面入射更易击穿；装填缓慢，需要步兵掩护。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("The Tankgewehr sends a heavy round into the hull.\nA two-man crew attacks armour and tracks with single shots. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("Tankgewehr 的长枪管架上土堤。\n两人反坦克枪组，逐发攻击车体与履带。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿；装填慢，需步兵掩护。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("The Tankgewehr rests on an earth bank.\nA two-man crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 小队\n单发射击车体与履带\n近距离垂直命中利于击穿\n装填慢，须有步兵保护"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another round.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr team\nSingle rounds attack hulls and tracks\nClose, square hits improve penetration\nSlow reload; needs infantry protection"), TEXT("The Tankgewehr settles onto the earth bank. Its crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks; slow loading leaves time for enemy infantry to close.\nCrew: 2 men. Close, square hits penetrate more reliably.")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名持步枪的观察手，擅长远距离攻击固定枪位。烟幕和压制会妨碍瞄准，两人小组难以应付近战。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("One SMLE sniper and one rifle-armed spotter attack fixed posts at long range. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the two-man team is weak in close combat.")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("望远瞄准镜找到敌方枪口。狙击手擅长打击固定机枪，观察手近距掩护；人数少，烟雾和压制会打断瞄准。\n编制：1名狙击手、1名制式步枪观察手。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("镜瞄 SMLE 从狙击学校送往前沿。\n一名狙击手、一名步枪观察手，以更远、更准的射击威胁固定枪位。烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力薄弱。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("Scoped SMLEs arrive from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter threaten fixed guns with greater range and accuracy. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair is weak in close combat.")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat.")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪伸进射孔，观察手守着侧面。\n一名 SMLE 狙击手、一名步枪观察手\n远射固定枪位；烟幕、压制妨碍瞄准\n两人小队近战弱"), TEXT("The scoped rifle enters the loophole while the spotter watches the flank.\nOne SMLE sniper, one rifle-armed spotter\nLong-range attacks on fixed posts; smoke and suppression disrupt aim\nThe pair is weak at close quarters"), TEXT("A telescopic sight finds the enemy gun. The sniper counters stationary machine guns while his rifle-armed spotter guards the approach. Smoke and suppression interrupt aim.\nPair: one sniper and one service-rifle spotter.")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 突击队以自动火力和手雷夺取近处战壕。射程短，换弹时停止射击；接近远射步兵和坦克时需要掩护。")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 assault troops take nearby trenches with automatic fire and grenades. Short range and reload pauses leave them needing cover against long-range infantry and tanks.")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 随先遣队进入敌壕。\n自动火力与手雷擅长近距离突击。射程短，换弹中断火力；远射和坦克能阻止接近。")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18s enter the trench with the leading party.\nAutomatic fire and grenades excel at close assault. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 的短点射沿壕壁回响。风暴队以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕；射程短，换弹时需要掩护，无法独自对付坦克。")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
    {TEXT("弹鼓装上机匣，突击手伏在出壕口。哨音一响，后面的人也须跟上。\nMP 18 自动火力、手雷夺取近壕\n射程短，换弹停火\n接近远射步兵与坦克时须有掩护"), TEXT("A drum seats in the receiver; the assault party waits at the exit. At the whistle, the men behind must follow.\nMP 18 automatic fire and grenades take close trenches\nShort range; reload pauses\nNeed cover when approaching long-range infantry and tanks"), TEXT("Short MP 18 bursts echo along the trench wall. Storm troops contest close trenches with automatic fire and grenades; limited range and reload pauses leave them vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("一纸战地委任书，连队多了一名指挥官。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；军官停步时每 6 秒在较大范围内重整友军。同类加成不叠加，重压或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("战地委任状送到连部。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%。军官停步时可重整更大范围内受压制的部队；同类指挥不叠加，重压制或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观测训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. A halted officer rallies suppressed troops across a wider area. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nObservation training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官在壕口向前队传令。附近友军得到更强指挥，停步后可缓解更大范围的压制；重压或失去组长会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。观察研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。Webley用于近身自卫。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("A field commission appoints a company officer.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. While halted, he rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nWith observation training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer carries orders to the leading section. He gives stronger command support and rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or his death ends the bonus.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With observation training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets. The Webley is for close defence.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官握着 P08 跟上前队。附近友军得到更强指挥，行进中也能重整部队；指挥范围略小于英军，重压会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。炮位测地研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官随前沿队伍推进。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类指挥不叠加，重压制会中断指挥。\n完成测地训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer advances with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and recover from suppression even on the move. His reach is shorter than the British officer’s. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nSurvey training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官跟随前队，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。指挥范围略小于英军，同类加成不叠加；重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("P08 in hand, the officer follows the advance. He gives stronger command support and can rally while moving; his reach is shorter than the British officer's, and heavy suppression breaks command.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With battery-survey training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view"), TEXT("The officer moves with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and rally every 6 seconds, even on the move. His command reaches less far than the British officer's. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nWith survey training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("电话线接通，炮兵复诵方位。\n多轮炮火覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位与集结部队。传令延迟和散布使移动目标较难命中；友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the telephone.\nSeveral salvos strike the selected area, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets; friendly troops are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("电话那端，炮长复诵方位。野炮以多轮爆炸覆盖指定地段；传令延迟和散布使移动目标更难命中。\n落弹区内的友军同样受伤。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("At the other end of the wire, the battery repeats the bearing. Several salvos cover the chosen ground; delay and scatter make moving targets harder to hit.\nFriendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets"), TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed.")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("两轮烟幕掩护推进和撤退，遮蔽双方观察，降低枪弹命中率。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("Two smoke groups cover advances and withdrawals, obscure observation on both sides and reduce bullet accuracy. Shells can still pass through.")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("烟弹在无人区拉起屏障。烟幕掩护过壕和撤离，也削弱双方观察与直射火力；炮弹仍可穿过。\n投烟：2轮。")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("两轮烟幕掩护推进和撤退，遮蔽双方视线，阻断直射火力。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("Two smoke groups cover advances and withdrawals, obscuring both armies and blocking direct fire. Shells can still pass through.")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("烟弹接续在无人区起爆。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进与撤离，遮蔽双方观察和直射火力。炮弹仍可穿过烟幕。")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen advances and withdrawals, obscuring both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells pass through the screen.")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke.")},
    {TEXT("烟弹在枪位之间落下，白烟遮住胸墙。\n两轮烟幕；掩护推进、撤退\n遮蔽双方视线，降低枪弹命中率\n炮弹穿透烟幕"), TEXT("Smoke shells fall between the gun posts and hide the parapets.\nTwo smoke salvos cover advances and withdrawals\nObscure both armies and reduce bullet accuracy\nShells pass through smoke"), TEXT("Smoke shells raise a screen across no man's land. Smoke covers crossings and withdrawals while obscuring both sides' observation and direct fire; shells still pass through.\nDelivery: 2 groups.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("迫击炮以四轮炮弹攻击固定枪位和拥挤壕道。响应较慢，移动目标可能在炮弹抵达前离开；友军须避开弹着区。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("Four mortar salvos attack fixed posts and crowded trenches. The slow response gives moving targets time to leave before impact. Keep friendly troops clear of the target area.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("壕炮的炸弹越过胸墙。迫击炮打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道；响应较慢，友军须等最后一轮落弹后跟进。\n落弹：4组。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("迫击炮以四组炮弹攻击固定枪位和拥挤壕道。响应较慢，移动目标可能在炮弹抵达前离开；友军须避开弹着区。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("Four mortar groups attack fixed posts and crowded trenches. Slow response lets moving targets leave before impact. Keep friendly troops clear of the target area.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("壕炮弹越过前沿。\n四组落弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，移动目标易离开爆区；友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("Trench-mortar bombs pass over the front.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow delivery lets moving targets leave the area; friendly troops are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("携弹队把壕炮弹送到炮旁。\n四组迫击炮弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，适合预判敌军集结；落弹也会杀伤友军。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("Mortar bombs pass over the parapet. Mortars strike fixed guns and crowded trenches; their slow response calls for anticipation, with friendly troops following the final impacts.\nDelivery: 4 groups.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮架在壕底，携弹手将炮弹递向炮口。\n四轮齐射；打击固定枪位、拥挤壕道\n响应慢，移动目标可能先行离开弹着区"), TEXT("The mortar stands on the trench floor; a bearer passes bombs to the muzzle.\nFour salvos against fixed posts and crowded trenches\nSlow response lets moving targets leave the impact area before the shells arrive"), TEXT("The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation.")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("警铃响起，毒云顺风压向壕道。\n遮蔽视线，杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也危及友军。密封佩戴的呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("The gas alarm sounds as the cloud drifts downwind.\nObscures sight and kills infantry that remain exposed, including allies. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并威胁久留的步兵；风也会把毒气带向友军。\n戴好呼吸器可大幅减少毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("Gas shells burst and an alarm passes down the trench. Drifting clouds obscure sight and endanger men who remain; the wind can carry them towards friendly troops.\nA sealed respirator greatly reduces gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up"), TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("野炮迅速迎击指定区域内可见的装甲，最多发射 6 发。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离区域后，射击中断。")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("Field guns respond quickly against visible armour in the selected area, firing up to 6 rounds. Smoke, obstruction or a target leaving the area interrupts fire.")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("炮口压低，炮手等着敌车进入射界。反坦克野炮打击指定地域内可见装甲；烟幕、遮挡或驶离地域都会使射击停止。\n弹药：最多6发，响应较快。")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("炮口压低，敌车进入射界。\n快速反装甲支援，最多发射 6 发，只攻击指定地域内可见的装甲。烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断射击。")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("The gun is laid low as armour enters its sights.\nA quick anti-tank mission of up to 6 rounds, engaging visible armour inside the chosen sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")},
    {TEXT("炮手转动炮架，准星追住驶近的车体。\n迅速迎击选定区域内可见装甲；最多 6 发\n烟幕、遮挡或目标离区中断射击"), TEXT("The crew traverses the gun and follows the approaching hull through the sight.\nRapid fire against visible armour in the selected area; up to 6 rounds\nSmoke, obstruction or the target leaving the area interrupts fire"), TEXT("The muzzle lowers as a tank enters the gun's field of fire. Anti-tank guns engage visible armour in the chosen sector; smoke, cover or leaving the sector stops the engagement.\nAmmunition: up to 6 rounds, with a quicker response.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("飞机进行两次低空扫射，打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重装甲；航线内的友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("Two low strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets block some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. Friendly troops along the path are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("双翼机低掠前沿。窄幅扫射压制暴露步兵和纵队；胸墙能挡住部分火力，重装甲抵御机枪弹。\n航线：2次通场；航线内友军也会中弹。")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("双翼机压低机头扫过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪；友军同样会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("A biplane noses down over the front.\nTwo passes strafe exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets stop some bullets and heavy armour resists the guns. Friendly troops are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("双翼机压低机头，掠过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪火力；航线内的友军同样危险。")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射；打击航线内暴露步兵\n胸墙提供部分掩护；对重装甲无效"), TEXT("Wings cross the trench line; the guns point down the open approach.\nTwo low strafing passes against exposed infantry along the flight path\nParapets give partial cover; ineffective against heavy armour"), TEXT("A biplane sweeps low over the front. Narrow strafing runs suppress exposed infantry and columns; parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets.\nFlight: 2 passes; friendly troops in the lane are also exposed.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("步兵与炮兵对准表针。徐进弹幕逐段向敌后压制枪位；跟进过近会遭己方炮火。\n弹幕：6组，每组3发。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("步兵与炮兵按表针推进。\n六组弹幕，每组三发，逐段向敌后压进。连续阵位受压制；跟进过近的友军也会被炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("Infantry and gunners advance by the watch.\nSix groups of three shells lift towards the enemy rear, suppressing successive positions. Friendly troops following too closely enter the barrage.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area"), TEXT("Infantry and gunners set their watches. A creeping barrage suppresses successive positions towards the enemy rear; troops following too closely meet their own shells.\nBarrage: 6 groups of 3 rounds.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮\n杀伤开阔地密集步兵\n深壕、坚土提供掩护；对坦克无效"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells open above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one\nStrikes massed infantry in the open\nDeep trenches and firm earth protect; ineffective against tanks"), TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮\n杀伤开阔地密集步兵\n深壕、坚土提供掩护；对坦克无效"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells open above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one\nStrikes massed infantry in the open\nDeep trenches and firm earth protect; ineffective against tanks"), TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮\n杀伤开阔地密集步兵\n深壕、坚土提供掩护；对坦克无效"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells open above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one\nStrikes massed infantry in the open\nDeep trenches and firm earth protect; ineffective against tanks"), TEXT("引信刻度装定，榴霰弹在空中裂开。密集行军的步兵首当其冲，深壕和坚土遮挡弹珠。\n齐射：2轮，每轮3发；引信操练增加到3轮。不能伤害坦克，友军必须避开。")},
