    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮\n杀伤开阔地密集步兵\n深壕、坚土提供掩护；对坦克无效"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells open above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one\nStrikes massed infantry in the open\nDeep trenches and firm earth protect; ineffective against tanks"), TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks.")},
