    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("整壕前进时，仍有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，再次下令即可让其前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("When the trench advances, machine-gun sections with surviving gunners stay to cover it. Once only these sections remain, another advance order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("步枪班出壕，最后一挺机枪继续射击。\n整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("步枪班冲出战壕，机枪留下掩护。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪组暂留。壕内只剩机枪组后，再次前进命令将其送出。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("The rifles advance under the guns' cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. Once only gun crews remain, another advance order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("步枪班出壕，机枪留在胸墙后。\n战术：整壕冲锋会留下有枪手的机枪组掩护；壕内只剩机枪组时可继续前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("The rifles climb out while the gun stays at the parapet.\nTactics: A trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews covering the infantry. When no other sections remain, the guns can move on.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("The rifles leave the trench under the last gun's cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("军士晋升为军官，附近友军命中率加成提高至 50%，指挥范围扩大，每 6 秒重整一次友军。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥的分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("Promotes the NCO to an officer, raising the nearby accuracy bonus to 50%, extending command range and rallying allies every 6 seconds.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官，指挥命中加成提高至 50%，范围扩大，每 6 秒重整友军。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("战地委任书授予军士指挥权。\n晋升军官，指挥命中加成提高至 50%，范围扩大，每 6 秒重整友军。\n金星为指挥者，银星为受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("A field commission gives the sergeant an officer's authority.\nPromotes him to an officer: 50% command accuracy, wider reach and a rally every 6 seconds.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送抵连部。前任排长的名字已从名册上划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches company headquarters. The last platoon commander has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +50%\nRally interval 6 s; command range extended"), TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nPromotes the NCO to an officer: a 50% command accuracy bonus, wider reach and a rally every 6 seconds.\nGold marks the commander; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("突击队在己方烟幕中推进时，承受的枪弹压制减半，并靠得更近后再开火。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault troops advancing in friendly smoke receive half the suppression from gunfire and close to a shorter range before firing.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("突击手沿烟幕边缘接近壕口。\n战术：己方烟幕中推进的突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并在更近处接敌。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("突击队沿烟幕接近壕口。\n在己方烟幕中推进时，承受的枪弹压制减半，并在更近距离开火。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault parties close on the trench through smoke.\nInside friendly smoke, advancing assault troops take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("突击队沿烟幕遮住的低地接近。\n己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault men follow the edge of the smoke towards the trench.\nTactics: Assault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter contact distance.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault parties close through the smoke-covered low ground.\nAssault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance.")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("突击班在己方烟幕内更能顶住枪火，并把交火距离留得更近。先穿过空地，再让壕口听见你的武器。")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n在己方烟幕中推进：所受枪弹压制减半\n缩短接敌开火距离"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nAdvancing in friendly smoke: bullet suppression taken halved\nShorter opening range"), TEXT("Assault sections withstand fire better inside friendly smoke and hold their fire for closer contact. Cross the open ground before making the trench mouth hear your weapons.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("观察员报出地标，炮位修正诸元。\n有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可缩短炮击首轮等待，并收紧散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("The observer reports a landmark; the battery corrects its aim.\nA halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first artillery or mortar salvo sooner, with tighter scatter. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen can still report visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("观察员指认地标，传令兵记下方位。\n战术：指挥组携一名存活伴随兵停稳两秒，并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%。烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets"), TEXT("An observer points out a landmark and a runner notes the bearing.\nTactics: A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter, provided he can see the target. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their early target reports.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("炮兵把新坐标填进测地表。\n收紧迫击炮散布。有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可进一步缩短首轮等待、改善炮群精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("The battery enters new coordinates on its survey sheet.\nTightens mortar scatter. A halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first salvo sooner and further improves the battery’s accuracy. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("炮位测地表添上前沿的新坐标。\n战术：缩小迫击炮散布。指挥组携存活伴随兵停稳两秒并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%；烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("Fresh front-line coordinates are entered on the battery survey.\nTactics: Tightens mortar scatter. A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter if the target is visible. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("滤盒卸下补给车，面具逐一检查。\n战术：为突击班、工兵和喷火分遣队配发经气密检查的呼吸器；佩戴完成后减少 78% 毒气累积，仍会受压制，久留仍有危险。其他分队必须绕开或撤出毒区。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("滤盒与面罩发到前沿分遣队。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组获得呼吸器。密封佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；压制仍在，长时间暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("Filters and facepieces reach the forward detachments.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame troops. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections have no respirators.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("滤盒离开补给车，面罩逐一检查气密。\n为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("Filter boxes leave the supply wagon and each mask is checked.\nTactics: Issues checked respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. A completed seal reduces gas exposure by 78%; suppression and prolonged exposure remain dangerous. Other sections must avoid or leave the cloud.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("Filters are unloaded and each facepiece tested.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("喷火射程略增；首罐燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the first fuel tank runs out.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("备用燃料从交通壕送到喷火组。\n喷火射程略增；首次燃料耗尽后，可再喷射四次。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到。\n喷火射程略增；首罐耗尽后增加四次喷射。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Reserve fuel arrives through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increases modestly; four further bursts remain after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送来。\n战术：喷火射程略增，首次用尽燃料后追加四次喷射。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes up the communication trench.\nTactics: Flame reach increases modestly, with four additional bursts after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party along the trench.\nFlame reach increases modestly. Four more bursts become available after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与航空轰炸的整备时间缩短 22%。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("Below 35 friendly morale, creeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness time is reduced by 22%.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。\n己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸任务整备缩短 22%。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("求援信号升起，预备弹药启封。\n士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸整备时间缩短 22%。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal releases the reserve ammunition.\nBelow 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("连部启封最后一批预备弹药。\n战术：己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹齐射和投弹任务的整备缩短 22%。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises. The reserve ammunition is opened.\nBelow 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35 时：\n徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nWhen friendly morale is below 35:\nCreeping barrage, shrapnel and aerial bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("Headquarters opens the reserve ammunition stores.\nTactics: Below 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("同队携弹手存活且在专门射手附近时，装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("A surviving bearer near the specialist gunner reduces reload time by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("携弹手把下一发递到射手身旁。\n本组携弹手在旁协助时，专门武器装填时间缩短15%。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("携弹手守在射手身旁。\n存活的同队携弹手在附近时，专门武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
