    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。两种编制共用槽位和整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share a slot and readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("Fixed crews offer greater range and suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Switching affects new recruits. Both share a slot and preparation.")},
    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。两种编制共用槽位和整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share a slot and readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("固定枪组射程更远，压制更强。伴随枪组移动、架设更快。选择适用于后续征募，已部署部队与整备进度保持不变。")},
