    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。两种编制共用槽位和整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share a slot and readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("Fixed crews deliver stronger fire at longer range. Escort crews move and deploy faster. New recruits use the selected configuration.")},
    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。两种编制共用槽位和整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share a slot and readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("Fixed guns cover a longer field of fire. Mobile crews move and deploy faster. The choice applies to future recruits; existing sections and preparation time are unchanged.")},
