    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The cramped sponsons leave no room for hesitation. Cannon reload time falls 12%; accuracy and blast remain unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("侧舱炮组在狭窄工位反复操练。\n坦克炮装填时间缩短 12%，精度与爆炸范围不变。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("狭窄侧舱容不下迟疑。坦克炮装填时间缩短12%；精度与爆炸范围不变。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("Sponson crews drill in their cramped positions.\nCannon reload time falls 12%.")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("侧舱炮组在狭窄工位反复操练。\n坦克炮装填时间缩短 12%。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner’s word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组按口令轮流推弹入膛。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("The sponson crews load in turn on the gunner's word.\nTank cannon reload time −12%")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("菱形履带碾过铁丝，侧舱炮朝向敌壕。\nMark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Rhomboid tracks crush the wire; sponson guns cover the trench.\nThe Mark IV male supports breakthroughs and engages armour. Slow to advance and reliant on infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can fail separately.")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Mark IV 雄型驶过铁丝。火炮与机枪支援缓慢突破，也能迎击装甲；占壕仍靠步兵，敌方野炮威胁车体。\n损伤：履带与机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\n雄型 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援突破\n火炮迎击装甲；行驶慢，须有步兵清壕\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nMark IV Male: cannon and machine guns support breakthroughs\nCannon engage armour; slow movement needs infantry clearing trenches\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("A Mark IV male crosses the wire. Cannon and machine guns support a slow breakthrough and engage armour; infantry take the trenches while enemy field guns threaten the hull.\nDamage: tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour.")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("Whippet 越过重型坦克留下的车辙。\n机动快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遇到敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("The Whippet follows the heavy tanks' tracks.\nFast movement and machine guns suit pursuit of exposed infantry. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs gun support against enemy armour.")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("Whippet 跟进步兵打开的缺口。机枪和机动适合追击步兵；缺少反装甲主炮，需要野炮或反坦克分队配合。")},
    {TEXT("履带绕过弹坑，机枪随车体转向逃离的步兵。\nWhippet：快速追击暴露步兵\n无反坦克炮；对敌方装甲须有炮兵支援"), TEXT("Tracks skirt the shell hole; the guns turn with the hull towards withdrawing infantry.\nWhippet: rapid pursuit of exposed infantry\nNo anti-tank cannon; needs artillery support against armour"), TEXT("A Whippet follows the breach opened by the infantry. Mobility and machine guns suit pursuit; without an anti-armour cannon, it needs field guns or tank-rifle teams against enemy armour.")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("A7V 的炮口守住道路交叉口。\n火炮迎击装甲，多处机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，侧翼需友军掩护；履带和机枪可单独损坏，野炮能摧毁车体。")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("An A7V covers the road junction.\nIts cannon engages armour and multiple guns suppress infantry. A cumbersome hull needs flank protection. Tracks and guns can fail separately; field artillery can destroy the vehicle.")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("A7V 的枪口指向路口。火炮与机枪能压制步兵、迎击装甲；车体笨重，侧面需要友军掩护。\n损伤：野炮威胁车体，履带与机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("高大的车体遮住路口，侧面机枪向外展开。\nA7V：主炮迎击装甲，机枪压制步兵\n笨重，侧翼须有步兵\n野炮毁伤车体；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The tall hull fills the junction while side guns cover the approaches.\nA7V: cannon against armour, machine guns suppress infantry\nBulky; infantry must guard flanks\nField guns threaten hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("An A7V covers the junction. Cannon and machine guns suppress infantry and fight armour; the cumbersome hull needs infantry on its flanks.\nDamage: field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("德军识别十字覆盖了旧车号。\n缴获 Mark IV 以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢；野炮与反坦克步枪可毁伤车体，履带和枪位可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("German crosses cover the old vehicle number.\nA captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns. Slow-moving and vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and gun positions can fail separately.")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("旧车体换上德军识别标记。缴获 Mark IV 以火炮与机枪伴随步兵推进；行驶缓慢，野炮和反坦克步枪仍能毁伤它。")},
    {TEXT("修理队在缴获车体上涂好铁十字，炮口掉转方向。\n缴获的 Mark IV：火炮、机枪支援步兵\n行驶慢；野炮、反坦克步枪威胁车体\n履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("The repair crew paints the cross on a captured hull and turns the guns about.\nCaptured Mark IV: cannon and machine guns support infantry\nSlow; field guns and tank rifles threaten hulls\nTracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("German markings cover the old hull. A captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns; it moves slowly and remains vulnerable to field guns and anti-tank rifles.")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness.")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 的五挺刘易斯扫过胸墙。\n重型机枪坦克，整备快于雄型，行驶远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep the parapet from a female Mark IV.\nA heavy machine-gun tank, quicker to prepare than the male and much slower than a Whippet. Cannot damage enemy tank hulls. Tracks and guns can fail separately. All armour shares readiness.")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("雌型车的矮侧舱扫过胸墙。重型车体和机枪适合压制守军，整备快于雄型；速度远慢于 Whippet，无法损伤敌方坦克车体。\n战术：5挺刘易斯；三种装甲共用整备。履带、枪位可单独损坏。")},
    {TEXT("机枪伸出侧舱，弹药箱抵着车内钢板。\n雌型 Mark IV：五挺刘易斯机枪压制步兵\n整备快于雄型；移动远慢于 Whippet\n对坦克车体无效；履带、机枪独立受损"), TEXT("Machine guns project from the sponsons; ammunition boxes brace against the interior plates.\nMark IV Female: five Lewis guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than the male; much slower than Whippet\nIneffective against tank hulls; tracks and machine guns take separate damage"), TEXT("The female tank's low sponsons rake the parapet. Its heavy hull and machine guns suppress defenders and prepare sooner than the male; it is much slower than a Whippet and cannot damage enemy tank hulls.\nTactics: 5 Lewis guns; all armour shares readiness. Tracks and gun mounts can fail separately.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("缴获雌型驶出修理棚，旧侧舱重新装好机枪。\n五处机枪位压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法对抗坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("A captured female leaves the workshop with its guns refitted.\nFive machine-gun stations suppress infantry concentrations, with shorter preparation than cannon tanks. Cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. All armour shares readiness.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("缴获雌型驶出修理棚。机枪适合压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型；遭遇坦克时需要反装甲火力。\n战术：5处机枪位；三种装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的车体重新开动，侧舱机枪扫向原来的阵线。\n缴获的雌型 Mark IV：五挺机枪压制步兵\n整备快于火炮型；对坦克车体无效\n对敌装甲须有反装甲支援"), TEXT("The captured hull moves again, its side guns facing the line it once defended.\nCaptured Mark IV Female: five machine guns suppress infantry\nReadies sooner than cannon variants; ineffective against tank hulls\nNeeds anti-armour support against tanks"), TEXT("A captured female leaves the repair shed. Its guns suppress concentrated infantry and prepare sooner than cannon tanks; enemy armour calls for anti-tank support.\nTactics: 5 machine-gun stations; all armour shares readiness.")},
    {TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("新兵在靶场学习测距、瞄准与稳枪。\n步枪命中率提高 10%；距离、掩体与压制仍影响射击。")},
    {TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Recruits practise judging distance and keeping a steady aim.\nRifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot.")},
    {TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("枪托贴稳，准星落在胸墙缺口。\n战术：步枪命中机会提高 10%。距离、掩体与压制照常影响瞄准。")},
    {TEXT("靶场上，射手核对距离，重新抵紧枪托。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("On the range, the rifleman judges the distance and braces his stock.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("The stock settles and the sights find a gap in the parapet.\nTactics: Rifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot.")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("反复练习桥夹、弹盘和弹带装填，缩短战斗中的停火时间。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Drills with clips, drums and belts reduce pauses in combat.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("桥夹、弹盘与弹带，在黑暗里也要装得稳。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Clips, drums and belts must seat even in the dark.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("桥夹入槽，弹盘扣紧。\n战术：各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹盘扣上枪身。停火的空隙里，对面有人抬起头。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger and secure the pan magazine. Across the ground, a man lifts his head during the pause.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Clips slide home and drums lock into place.\nTactics: Weapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("军官走在前队之间，命令随队向前。\n士官升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("The officer carries his orders with the leading men.\nUpgrades the NCO to an officer: the command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with a rally every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("军官跟着前队传下新的口令。\n战术：士官升级为军官：附近友军命中收益由25%提高到50%，每六秒重整一次且可边走边下令。驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制另提高40%。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传进交通壕。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒；行进中下令\n驻壕步枪对移动目标压制 +40%"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order into the communication trench.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds; gives orders while moving\nEntrenched rifles: suppression of moving targets +40%"), TEXT("The officer carries a fresh order behind the leading section.\nTactics: Upgrades the NCO to an officer: nearby accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus. Rally orders come every six seconds, including while advancing. Trench rifles also suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，范围扩大，重整间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nUpgrades the sergeant to an officer: command accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus, reach increases, and the rally interval falls from 8 to 6 seconds.\nGold marks the commander; silver marks sections under orders.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接下新职。\n战术：军士升级为军官：附近友军命中收益由25%提高到50%，指挥范围扩大，重整间隔从八秒减至六秒。金星表示指挥者，银星表示受益分队。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("A commission reaches the front and the sergeant takes his new post.\nTactics: Upgrades the sergeant to an officer: the nearby accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command reach increases, and rally orders come every six seconds instead of eight. Gold marks the commander; silver marks affected sections.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander’s name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。友军须避开弹着区。")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke receives an extra group. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area.")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("炮位为烟幕后的枪口留下一轮弹药。\n向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("The battery holds one salvo for the guns behind the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("烟幕位置报回，炮手留下一组炮弹。\n战术：向己方烟幕地段呼叫野炮，追加一轮补射。")},
