    {TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("A burst carries into the next traverse.\nMP 18 bursts also suppress defenders beside the target.")},
    {TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("MP 18 的点射扫过相邻壕角。\n战术：MP 18 的邻近压制扩大到目标周围的守军。")},
    {TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("MP 18 bursts sweep across the next traverse.\nTactics: MP 18 bursts spread suppression to defenders beside the target.")},
    {TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("点射从一道壕角转向另一道，守军伏下身去。\nMP 18 点射压制目标附近的守军")},
    {TEXT("短点射越过壕角，邻近的守军伏低身子。\n十米内射击驻壕目标时，邻近压制范围扩大至4.5米。"), TEXT("Short bursts pass the traverse; nearby defenders duck below the lip.\nWithin 10 metres, firing on troops in a trench expands adjacent suppression to 4.5 metres."), TEXT("Bursts carry from one traverse to the next; the defenders crouch below the lip.\nMP 18 bursts suppress defenders near the target")},
    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("驻壕士兵在压制较低、连续 5 秒没有目标且弹药不足半数时，主动装填。")},
    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("Trench troops reload when suppression is low, no target has appeared for 5 seconds and less than half their ammunition remains.")},
    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("枪声稍歇，桥夹压入弹仓。\n驻壕士兵在低压制、5 秒无目标且弹药不足半数时主动装填。")},
    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("The firing eases. A fresh clip fills the magazine.\nEntrenched troops below half ammunition reload after 5 seconds without a target, provided suppression is low.")},
    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("枪声稍歇，士兵取出新的桥夹。\n战术：驻壕、低压制且五秒没有目标时，弹药不足半数的士兵主动装填。")},
