    {TEXT("枪声稍歇，壕内响起压弹入仓的声音。\n驻壕士兵：压制低且 5 秒无目标时\n弹药不足半数，自行装填"), TEXT("Firing eases; chargers press into the magazines along the trench.\nEntrenched troops: low suppression and no target for 5 seconds\nAutomatically reload if below half ammunition"), TEXT("Entrenched troops below half ammunition reload after 5 seconds without a target, provided suppression is low.")},
