    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒气区。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill"), TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid gas.")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("工兵排除爆炸物的速度提高 65%。")},
