    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("工兵标出引线，携剪钳的人随后跟上。\n工兵排除爆炸物的速度提高 65%。")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("The sapper marks the wire. The cutters follow.\nPioneers clear explosive hazards 65% faster.")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("老工兵在沙盘上指认引信。\n战术：工兵排除爆炸物的速度提高 65%。")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("An old sapper points out a fuze in the practice pit.\nTactics: Pioneers clear explosive hazards 65% faster.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("喷火射程略增；首次燃料耗尽后，可再喷射 4 次。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Slightly extends flame range and adds 4 bursts after the initial fuel runs out.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("徐进弹幕各组的推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集，炮弹总数不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("Creeping barrage groups advance at shorter intervals for denser coverage, with the same number of shells.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("炮兵表上的落点挨得更近。\n徐进弹幕各组推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集；炮弹总数不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("The fire plan brings each lift closer to the last.\nCreeping-barrage groups advance in shorter steps for denser coverage. Shell count is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("炮兵与步兵把表针对齐。\n战术：徐进弹幕各组推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集；总炮弹数不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("Gunners and infantry set their watches together.\nTactics: Successive creeping-barrage groups step forward over shorter distances for denser coverage; shell count is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("榴霰弹齐射由两轮增至三轮，每轮仍为 3 发。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("Shrapnel increases from two salvos to three, still with 3 shells per salvo.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("引信扳手转过，下一组炮弹送到炮尾。\n榴霰弹由两轮增至三轮，每轮仍为 3 发。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("The fuze key turns. Another rack reaches the breech.\nShrapnel fire increases from two to three salvos of 3 shells.")},
