    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("The fuze key turns at the shell nose. Another rack waits beside the breech.\nTactics: shrapnel salvos increase from two to three groups of three shells.")},
