    {TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟中放下枪架。\n一名 MG 08/15 枪手、三名步枪手\n移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%\n停稳架枪后开火；射程、压制弱于固定枪组"), TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner sets the mounting in a ditch.\nOne MG 08/15 gunner, three riflemen\nFaster movement; deployment and packing 30% quicker\nMust halt and deploy; shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews"), TEXT("MG 08/15 跟上突击队的脚步。\n一名机枪手与三名步枪手，必须停稳架枪后开火。移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%；射程与压制弱于固定枪组。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟中放下枪架。\n一名 MG 08/15 枪手、三名步枪手\n移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%\n停稳架枪后开火；射程、压制弱于固定枪组"), TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner sets the mounting in a ditch.\nOne MG 08/15 gunner, three riflemen\nFaster movement; deployment and packing 30% quicker\nMust halt and deploy; shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 follows the assault.\nOne machine gunner and three riflemen; the gun must halt and deploy to fire. Moves faster, with 30% faster deployment and packing. Range and suppression are lower than the fixed section's.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟中放下枪架。\n一名 MG 08/15 枪手、三名步枪手\n移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%\n停稳架枪后开火；射程、压制弱于固定枪组"), TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner sets the mounting in a ditch.\nOne MG 08/15 gunner, three riflemen\nFaster movement; deployment and packing 30% quicker\nMust halt and deploy; shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews"), TEXT("MG 08/15 随突击队换位。伴随枪组更快接续掩护，射程与压制弱于固定枪组；停稳架枪后开火。\n编制：1挺机枪、3名步枪手；架设与收枪快30%。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手背起弹带箱，枪手在浅沟中放下枪架。\n一名 MG 08/15 枪手、三名步枪手\n移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%\n停稳架枪后开火；射程、压制弱于固定枪组"), TEXT("The bearer shoulders his belt boxes while the gunner sets the mounting in a ditch.\nOne MG 08/15 gunner, three riflemen\nFaster movement; deployment and packing 30% quicker\nMust halt and deploy; shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 changes position with the assault. The mobile section brings covering fire forward sooner, with less range and suppression than a fixed section; it must halt and support the gun to fire.\nSection: 1 machine gun and 3 riflemen; deployment and packing are 30% faster.")},
    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。另一端的炮群等着回话。\n校射条件：停稳 2 秒，同伴在旁、目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布 −30%\n移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡中断校射"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration"), TEXT("观察员与同伴停稳 2 秒并看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布减少 30%。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。另一端的炮群等着回话。\n校射条件：停稳 2 秒，同伴在旁、目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布 −30%\n移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡中断校射"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration"), TEXT("An observer halted for 2 seconds with a companion and a clear view brings artillery and mortar opening groups 2.5 seconds sooner with 30% less scatter. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration.")},
    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。另一端的炮群等着回话。\n校射条件：停稳 2 秒，同伴在旁、目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布 −30%\n移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡中断校射"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration"), TEXT("地图摊开，传令兵等候炮火修正。\n与同伴停稳 2 秒并看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布减少 30%。移动、烟雾、重压或同伴阵亡会中断校射。")},
