    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。另一端的炮群等着回话。\n校射条件：停稳 2 秒，同伴在旁、目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布 −30%\n移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡中断校射"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration"), TEXT("The observer calls a landmark to his orderly. The party corrects fire onto visible targets; movement, smoke, heavy suppression or loss of the escort interrupts observation.\nCorrection: halt for 2s; the first artillery or mortar salvo arrives 2.5s sooner with 30% less scatter.")},
