    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。另一端的炮群等着回话。\n校射条件：停稳 2 秒，同伴在旁、目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布 −30%\n移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡中断校射"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion's death interrupts registration")},
    {TEXT("随身弹袋放到枪旁，枪组卸下搬运用具。\n解锁伴随枪组：移动更快\n架设与收枪快 30%\n射程、压制弱于固定枪组\n整备页切换；共用槽位和整备\n仅影响后续征募"), TEXT("Ammunition pouches go beside the gun as the crew sheds its carrying gear.\nUnlock mobile gun sections: faster movement\nDeployment and packing 30% quicker\nShorter range and weaker suppression than fixed gun sections\nSwitch in preparation; share slots and readiness\nAffects future recruits only"), TEXT("解锁伴随机枪组：移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n可在整备页切换编制，共用槽位和整备，仅影响后续征募。")},
    {TEXT("随身弹袋放到枪旁，枪组卸下搬运用具。\n解锁伴随枪组：移动更快\n架设与收枪快 30%\n射程、压制弱于固定枪组\n整备页切换；共用槽位和整备\n仅影响后续征募"), TEXT("Ammunition pouches go beside the gun as the crew sheds its carrying gear.\nUnlock mobile gun sections: faster movement\nDeployment and packing 30% quicker\nShorter range and weaker suppression than fixed gun sections\nSwitch in preparation; share slots and readiness\nAffects future recruits only"), TEXT("Unlocks mobile gun sections: faster movement, deployment and packing 30% quicker, with shorter range and weaker suppression.\nSwitch formation on the preparation page; both share a slot and readiness, and changes affect future recruits.")},
    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。共用整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。共用整备，切换仅影响后续征募。")},
    {TEXT("固定枪组射程更远、压制更强；伴随枪组移动和架设更快。共用整备，切换仅影响后续征募。"), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share readiness. Switching affects future recruits only."), TEXT("Fixed crews have longer range and stronger suppression; mobile crews move and deploy faster. Both share readiness. Switching affects future recruits only.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("阿拉斯的炮声盖过了城里的钟声。沿白垩路推进，肃清高地后方守军，为后续部队打开通路。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("The guns drown the bells of Arras. Advance along the chalk road and clear the defenders beyond the heights, opening a passage for the following troops.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("雪粒打在钢盔上，阿拉斯城后的钟声已被炮声盖住。连部只收到一条命令：沿白垩路切开防线，把先头排接到高地另一边。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("Sleet rattles on steel helmets. Behind Arras, the bells have disappeared beneath the guns. The company has one order: open the chalk road and bring the leading platoon through to the far side of the heights.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("先用步枪占住中央交通壕，再向下一道敌壕推进。把一队留在后方掩护；攻下这两处支点，就能让补充兵通过。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("你的连队负责巩固前进通路。步枪班先占交通壕，留一队从壕肩掩护轮换；其他专门分队尚未赶到，不要把所有人一次送进开阔地。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("Take the central communication trench, then the first enemy position. Keep a rifle section covering the approach. Securing these two posts opens the route for the following companies.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势已经开始。沿白垩路推进，清除高地后方的守军，为后续部队打开通路。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive has begun. Advance along the chalk road, clear the defenders behind the heights and open a route for the following troops."), TEXT("Your company must secure the approach. Rifle sections occupy communication trenches, leaving one section on the parapet to cover reliefs. Specialist detachments have not yet arrived. Do not send everyone into the open at once.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("阿拉斯前哨的电话只剩杂音。沿白垩路反击，接回失联的枪位，打通后方交通线。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("The Arras outpost telephone carries only static. Counterattack along the chalk road, recover the isolated gun posts and reopen the rear route.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("炮击过后，前哨的电话只剩杂音。沿白垩路找回断线的分队；高地上的机枪若再度开火，失散的人就还有回来的路。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("After the bombardment, the outpost telephone carries only static. Recover the sections cut off along the chalk road. If the guns on the heights speak again, the missing men may still find a way back.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("英军已越过邻段前沿。重新接起中央交通壕，在其后第一处支点挡住追兵；接应从东面失散阵位退下的弟兄。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("守住中央观察壕。步枪班阻止英军抢占空壕，投弹队留待近处反击；机枪组尚未归建，炮火要留给后续集结，不要浪费在零散侦察兵身上。")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("British troops have crossed the neighbouring front. Reconnect the central trench and first opposing post. Cover the men falling back from the broken positions to the east.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯前哨失去电话联络。沿白垩路反击，恢复与各枪位的联系，打通后方交通线。"), TEXT("The Arras outpost has lost telephone contact. Counterattack along the chalk road, restore contact with the gun posts and reopen the rear communications route."), TEXT("Secure the central observation trench. Rifle sections must deny empty trenches to the British; keep bombers for a close counterattack. The machine guns have not returned to the company. Save artillery for following concentrations, not scattered scouts.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("勒厄的砖烟囱还立着，厂房里却处处是枪口。昨日的雪已化成墙根下的污水，投弹班要从这条被堵死的厂外道路上撬开一扇门。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("The brick chimneys of Roeux still stand; every shattered workshop seems to conceal a gun. Yesterday's snow has become black water beneath the walls. The bombers must open the road outside the works.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("投弹班清理近处壕角，步枪班看住开阔地。夺下中央与前沿两处支点；厂房深处仍有机枪，先替下一队清出接近线。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂仍在德军手中，残墙间的机枪封锁着接近壕。投弹班清理壕角，步枪掩护穿过最后一段空地。"), TEXT("The Roeux chemical works remain in German hands. Guns among the broken walls cover the approach trenches. Bombers clear the traverses while rifles cover the last open crossing."), TEXT("Bombers clear the near trench corners while riflemen cover open ground. Take the central and forward posts. Machine guns remain inside the works; open the approach for the next section.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("勒厄工厂仍是防线上一枚钉子。守军等不到新的混凝土，却等来了投弹班；把对手赶出厂外接近壕，厂区才能继续牵制他们。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("Roeux remains a nail in the defence. There is no fresh concrete, but the bombers have arrived. Drive the attackers out of the approach trenches and the works can hold them in place a little longer.")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("借破墙保持交叉掩护，不要拥挤在同一壕口。夺回两处外围支点，便能重新给化工厂守军留下交通。")},
    {TEXT("勒厄化工厂的交通受到威胁。夺回外围接近壕，以破墙间的交叉火力掩护反击。"), TEXT("The route to the Roeux works is threatened. Recover the outer approach trenches, using the broken walls to support the counterattack with crossfire."), TEXT("Keep mutually supporting posts among the broken walls. Recover two outer positions to reopen communication with the chemical-works garrison.")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route.")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("四月的残骸仍横在布勒库尔铁丝前，澳军再次投入进攻。枪榴弹压住胸墙，步兵夺取中央补给湾，接通送弹道路。")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("April's wreckage remains before the Bullecourt wire as the Australians attack again. Rifle grenades cover the parapet; infantry must take the central stores and open the ammunition route.")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("布勒库尔的铁丝前留下了四月的残骸。澳军再次出发，携弹手把 No.23 枪榴弹送到你的队伍；这次，缺口里的火力不能先于步兵耗尽。")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("April's wreckage still lies before the Bullecourt wire. The Australians are going forward again. Ammunition bearers bring No.23 rifle grenades to the company; this time the fire at the breach must outlast the crossing.")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("布勒库尔的铁丝前仍有四月的残骸。枪榴弹从掩护后压住壕角，步枪班穿过缺口。夺下中央补给湾，接通携弹队的道路。")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("April's wreckage remains before the Bullecourt wire. Work the rifle grenades from cover and send the rifles through the gap. Take the central supply bay to open the carrying parties' route.")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("新配属的枪榴弹组从掩护后抛射 No.23 榴弹，步枪与投弹班利用空当接近。夺住中央与第一道敌壕；让携弹手保有安全通路。")},
    {TEXT("澳军再次进攻布勒库尔，四月战斗的残骸仍留在铁丝前。用枪榴弹压制胸墙上的守军，夺取中央补给点，接通送弹道路。"), TEXT("Australian troops attack Bullecourt again, with wreckage from April still before the wire. Suppress the parapet with rifle grenades, take the central supply point and reopen the ammunition route."), TEXT("The new rifle-grenade section lobs No.23 bombs from cover. Riflemen and bombers exploit the interval. Secure the central trench and first enemy line; keep a covered route for the carriers.")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire.")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹正落向兴登堡线。守住中央补给湾，以分散枪位封锁铁丝缺口。")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("The Australians return to Bullecourt. Rifle grenades fall on the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central stores and cover the wire gaps from separated gun posts.")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("澳军重新出现在布勒库尔的铁丝前。枪榴弹越过胸墙，送弹的交通壕成了命脉；只要补给湾还在，前沿就能重新组织反击。")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("The Australians are back before the Bullecourt wire. Rifle grenades pass over the parapet. The ammunition trench is now the lifeline: while its supply bay holds, the forward companies can counterattack.")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("澳军再次逼近布勒库尔的铁丝。枪榴弹越过胸墙，送弹的通路受到威胁。分散枪位，守住中央补给湾。")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("The Australians return to the Bullecourt wire. Rifle grenades pass over the parapet and threaten the ammunition route. Disperse the gun positions and hold the central supply bay.")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("英澳分队正沿铁丝缺口接近。机枪别追逐单个目标，保持对通路的封锁；在两道相连阵位上恢复防线。")},
    {TEXT("澳军重返布勒库尔，枪榴弹开始落向兴登堡防线。守住中央补给点，分散布置枪位，封锁铁丝缺口。"), TEXT("Australian troops return to Bullecourt as rifle grenades strike the Hindenburg Line. Hold the central supply point and spread gun posts to cover the gaps in the wire."), TEXT("British and Australian sections approach through the wire gaps. Machine guns cover those passages rather than chasing individuals. Restore a connected line through two positions.")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights.")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("凌晨三时十分，梅西讷山脊突然升了起来。尘埃还在落，刘易斯组已经向坑岸搬枪；澳新部队在邻段推进，你们必须把爆破留下的裂口接成通路。")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., Messines Ridge rises into the air. Dust is still falling as the Lewis crews carry their guns to the crater rims. Australian and New Zealand troops advance alongside; the company must turn the shattered ground into a passage.")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("沿坑岸逐段推进，机枪看住高地通路。完整接起中央与两道纵深壕，让接替部队能够稳固已夺取的山脊。")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("主攻已经越过前沿，接替部队必须打通观察壕与后方的通路。新配属的投弹队借烟幕清除壕口，步枪班逐段跟进；击溃阻截的守军，让补给纵队通过。")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("Advance along the crater lips with machine guns covering the ridge approaches. Connect the central trench and both deeper lines so the relief companies can consolidate the captured ground.")},
    {TEXT("凌晨三时十分，地下爆破撕开梅西讷山脊。澳新部队正在邻段推进；机枪跟上坑岸，步兵打通破碎高地。"), TEXT("At 3.10 a.m., mines tear open Messines Ridge. Australian and New Zealand troops advance nearby. Bring the guns to the crater rims and open a passage across the broken heights."), TEXT("The main attack has passed the front line. Relieving troops must reopen the route between the observation trench and the rear. Bombers clear the trench mouths under smoke; rifle sections follow bay by bay. Break the blocking force and bring the supply column through.")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts.")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("梅西讷的旧壕道埋在爆破后的碎土里。沿新弹坑收拢守军，夺回补给湾，接通仍在开火的支点。")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("The old Messines trenches lie beneath the debris. Gather the garrison along the new craters, recover the stores and reach the posts still firing.")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("山脊在脚下炸开，熟悉的壕道不见了。幸存者沿新弹坑重新集合，MG 08/15 的枪架陷进碎土；先接回补给湾，再找回仍在开火的支点。")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("The ridge erupts beneath the garrison and familiar trenches disappear. Survivors gather along new craters. MG 08/15 mounts sink into the broken earth. Recover the ammunition bay, then reach the posts still firing.")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("从矿坑边缘重新建立联络。反击夺回本连的交通线，掩护仍在撤出的守军；把还能辨认的壕口接起来，别让伤亡者留在断线后面。")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("先以机枪稳住后沿，再让投弹班靠近前方观察壕。烟幕遮住被英军看穿的交通壕，避免从同一出口连续冒头。")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("Re-establish communication around the mine craters. Recover the company route and cover the withdrawing survivors. Reconnect the remaining trench mouths before the route is cut again.")},
    {TEXT("地下爆破掩埋了梅西讷的旧壕道。沿弹坑组织守军，夺回补给点，恢复与残存枪位的联系。"), TEXT("Mines have buried the old trenches at Messines. Regroup defenders along the craters, retake the supply point and restore contact with the surviving posts."), TEXT("Steady the rear line with machine guns before bombers approach the forward observation trench. Smoke can conceal communication trenches overlooked by the British. Do not keep emerging through the same exit.")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre.")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪守住接近线，预备队接应中央阵位。")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("The new parapets on the ridge are still loose. A counterattack approaches from the east. Guns must hold the approaches, with reserves within reach of the centre.")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("山脊拿下了，炮火却没有停。工兵还没把新壕肩夯实，东面的反击已经开始；昨夜开的路，今天要用留下来的人守住。")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("The ridge is taken, but the guns have not stopped. The new parapets are still loose when the eastern counterattacks begin. The men who opened the road yesterday must keep it open today.")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("梅西讷的新壕肩还没夯实，反击已从东面逼近。用固定枪组守住长射界，伴随枪组接续步兵换位。预备队留在能支援中央的位置。")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("The new parapets at Messines are still loose as a counterattack approaches from the east. Fixed guns hold long fields of fire; mobile sections move with the rifles. Keep a reserve within reach of the centre.")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("中央高地一旦易手，敌军会组织反扑。不要让全部小队向前涌；守住接近线，再夺第一道纵深阵位。")},
    {TEXT("山脊上的新胸墙尚未夯实，东面的反击已经逼近。机枪掩护山脊道路，预备队接应中央阵地。"), TEXT("The new ridge parapets are still loose and a counterattack approaches from the east. Machine guns cover the ridge roads while reserves support the centre."), TEXT("Expect a counterstroke when the central height changes hands. Keep a reserve instead of sending every section forward. Secure the approach, then the first deeper position.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("高地丢了两天，反击的集结令终于送到。晨雾贴着坑岸，携弹队紧跟机枪；夺回中段后，对面的预备队不会给你们喘息。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("Two days after the ridge was lost, the counterattack order arrives. Morning mist clings to the crater rims and ammunition parties follow the guns. Beyond the middle position, the opposing reserves will give no respite.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("爆破翻开了梅西讷的旧阵地。反击队沿弹坑逼近，机枪掩护最后一段空地。占住中央后，对面的预备队仍会赶来。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("Explosions have torn open the old Messines positions. The counterattack follows the craters, with guns covering the final open ground. Opposing reserves will come forward after the centre falls.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("沿仍能相互掩护的壕段反击。英军正在中央支点整备，预备队正沿后方交通壕接近；借烟幕将两处阵位重新接起。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷失守两日，反击命令送到前沿。沿坑岸向中央推进；英军预备队仍在高地后方集结。"), TEXT("Two days after Messines falls, the counterattack order reaches the front. Advance along the crater rims towards the centre. British reserves are gathering beyond the ridge."), TEXT("Counterattack through mutually supporting trenches. British troops are consolidating the central post; reserves approach through the rear communication trenches. Reconnect two positions behind smoke.")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn.")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("皮尔克姆的雨把排水沟灌成了河。担架与弹药车挤在同一条木板路上，Stokes 炮组终于赶到；没有人再相信泥地很快会干。")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Rain at Pilckem has turned the drains into streams. Stretchers and ammunition share the same duckboards. The Stokes crews have arrived; nobody now expects the ground to dry soon.")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("炮击打碎了皮尔克姆的排水沟，炮手在泥水间辨认火点。让机枪占住硬地，迫击炮逐处压制。后续步兵沿清出的通路跟进。")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Shellfire has broken the Pilckem drains, leaving gun posts among pools of water. Place machine guns on firm ground and work the mortars from post to post. Following infantry use the cleared approach.")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("把机枪放在能掩护通路的位置，烟幕盖住壕间空地。不要同时挤进泥泞的缺口；逐段夺下完整防线。")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("刘易斯组已经赶到，用它压住远处枪口，投弹班等炮火压下后再接近。每占一壕就留下守军；漫长的开阔地不适合整齐齐射式的总冲锋。")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Place machine guns where they cover the surviving approaches. Smoke the gaps and avoid crowding the mud-bound passages. Capture the connected line one trench at a time.")},
    {TEXT("皮尔克姆的排水沟已被炮击切断，送弹队挤上残存木板路。壕炮先到，野炮仍陷在后方；逐个压住湿地中的枪位。"), TEXT("Shellfire has severed the Pilckem drains. Ammunition parties crowd the surviving duckboards. Trench mortars arrive ahead of the field batteries; work through the flooded gun posts in turn."), TEXT("The Lewis section has arrived. Use it to pin distant gun positions while bombers wait for the barrage to suppress the defenders. Garrison each captured trench. A long stretch of open ground is no place for a single massed charge.")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches.")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("雨落在皮尔克姆的混凝土顶上，炮弹却照样找得到门口。送弹队只带来能背得动的弹药，士官沿各支点清点人头，壕炮接替了陷在后方的重炮。")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("Rain drums on the concrete at Pilckem, but shells still find the entrances. Bearers bring only what they can carry. NCOs count the men at each post while trench mortars stand in for the heavy guns stranded behind.")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("雨水灌进皮尔克姆的弹坑。枪组在步枪掩护下换到仍能看清通路的位置。壕炮补给较早抵达，野炮还要等待。")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("Rain fills the shell holes at Pilckem. Move the gun crews under rifle cover to positions overlooking the paths. Mortar ammunition arrives first; the field batteries take longer.")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("深泥会拖慢双方，不能代替枪位。守住交通壕，轮换机枪与步枪的掩护；局部反击须等敌军离开烟幕后再判断。")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("中央支点必须有部队实际驻守。以两处枪位组成交叉掩护，让军士组织轮换；英军狙击手出现时，用烟幕打断他的观察。")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("Mud slows both armies but cannot replace a gun position. Preserve the communication trench and alternate rifle and machine-gun cover. Judge counterattacks from visible movement beyond the smoke.")},
    {TEXT("雨水漫过皮尔克姆的旧弹坑。携弹队先把壕炮弹背到前沿，机枪沿尚可通行的硬地换位。"), TEXT("Rain fills the old shell holes at Pilckem. Bearers bring mortar bombs forward first. Move the machine guns along the remaining firm approaches."), TEXT("The central strongpoint needs a real garrison. Arrange two gun positions for mutual cover and use NCOs to organise reliefs. When British snipers appear, break their observation with smoke.")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn.")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩混凝土残墙。迫击炮弹正送往前沿补给湾；夺下补给，压住相互照应的枪位。")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Concrete walls are all that remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are moving to the forward stores. Take the supply bay and silence the supporting gun posts.")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("朗厄马尔克前方，旧地图上的农舍只剩混凝土残墙。一个据点沉默，另一个就接着开火；迫击炮与枪榴弹必须替步兵争出这几步路。")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Beyond Langemarck, the farms on the old map are concrete ruins. As one strongpoint falls silent, another opens fire. Mortars and rifle grenades must buy the few yards the infantry need.")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农舍只剩混凝土残墙。携弹队正把迫击炮弹送往前沿补给湾。夺下补给，再让机枪与观察员分段前移；烟幕也会遮住己方视野。")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Concrete walls are all that remain of the farms before Langemarck. Carrying parties are bringing mortar bombs to the forward supply bay. Take the stores, then move guns and observers forward in stages; smoke also obscures friendly sight.")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("用枪榴弹与壕炮压住第一处据点，再让步枪占壕。只需打通两处相连支点；更远的混凝土堡留给后续部队。")},
    {TEXT("朗厄马尔克的农场只剩残墙，迫击炮弹正运往前沿补给点。夺取补给，用炮火逐个压制敌方枪位。"), TEXT("Only walls remain of the Langemarck farms. Mortar bombs are arriving at the forward supply point. Take the supplies and suppress the enemy gun posts in turn."), TEXT("Rifle grenades and mortars suppress the near strongpoint before riflemen occupy it. Open two linked positions. The farther concrete posts belong to the following formations.")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved.")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("积水把朗厄马尔克的据点分隔开，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给湾，掩护各枪组换防。")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("Floodwater separates the Langemarck posts, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the stores and cover the relief of each gun crew.")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("积水把支点隔成孤岛，英军炮组开始逐个校准。送弹的脚步声从中央湾传来；保住这条线，混凝土后面的守军才不至于各自耗尽。")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("Floodwater has made islands of the posts, and British batteries register them one by one. Ammunition bearers can still be heard at the central bay. Keep that route open or each garrison will run out alone.")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("积水把朗厄马尔克的枪位分成孤岛。中央补给湾仍有通路，迫击炮弹正向那里集中。守住观察员看得清的地段，用伴随枪组接应换防。")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("Floodwater divides the Langemarck gun posts. A route still reaches the central supply bay, where mortar bombs are being gathered. Hold ground the observers can see and cover reliefs with mobile guns.")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("不要把混凝土据点当成孤岛。用交通壕维持侧向支援，夺回中央与第一处敌方支点，阻止对手把局部缺口接成通路。")},
    {TEXT("积水隔开了朗厄马尔克的各处据点，中央送弹路仍可通行。守住补给点，掩护枪组转移和换防。"), TEXT("Floodwater separates the posts at Langemarck, but the central ammunition route remains open. Hold the supply point and cover gun crews as they move or are relieved."), TEXT("Keep the concrete posts connected. Use communication trenches for lateral support and retake the centre and first opposing post before separate breaches become a route.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("梅宁路边的树只剩焦黑的木桩。新的进攻不再赌一次冲到天边：炮兵划定短线，步兵拿下，再等必来的反扑；军官把这一页命令念了两遍。")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("The trees along the Menin Road are black stumps. The new plan no longer stakes everything on one bound: guns mark a limited line, infantry take it, and then meet the inevitable counterstroke. The order is read twice.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("夺下中央与下一道敌壕后即可完成本段任务。敌军会对中央阵位反扑；别越过自己的掩护火线，让预备队接住反击。")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路两侧只剩焦黑树桩。炮兵集中支援短距离推进，德军预备队仍在纵深等待。夺取中央后，准备迎击反扑。"), TEXT("Black stumps line the Menin Road. The batteries support a limited advance; German reserves wait farther back. Expect their counterattack when the centre falls."), TEXT("Take the centre and the next enemy trench to complete this sector’s limited objective. Expect a counterattack against the centre. Keep reserves within supporting fire.")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮火须为接近留出通路。")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault.")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("英军占住的每一小片林地，很快就会伸出新的枪口。反击队不能再各自出发；毒气弹已经送到，炮组等着一条不会吞掉自己人的火线。")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("Every patch of woodland taken by the British soon produces fresh gun muzzles. The counterattack parties must move together. Gas shells have arrived, and the batteries need a firing line that will not swallow their own men.")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("敌军的新枪位已经转向。不要让反击队单独穿过开阔地；借烟幕压近，在两处阵位恢复连队的联络。")},
    {TEXT("英军正在梅宁路林缘加固新阵位。气弹已送到炮位，反击队沿掩蔽地段集结。炮击须为反击队留出通路。"), TEXT("British troops strengthen their new posts along the Menin woodland edge. Gas shells reach the batteries as counterattack parties assemble under cover. Leave an approach clear for the assault."), TEXT("Enemy guns now cover the newly won ground. Do not send counterattacking sections across alone. Close behind smoke and restore company communication through two positions.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面承住了 Mark IV 的履带。坦克压过铁丝，步兵清理遗下的壕道，继续向后方交通线推进。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai carries the Mark IVs. Tanks crush the wire; infantry clear the trenches behind them and press towards the rear communications.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("康布雷的地面终于能托住履带。没有漫长的预先轰炸，Mark IV 从雾里驶出，铁丝在车身下绷断；后方要求的不是一座空壕，而是一条能继续运人的路。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("At Cambrai, the ground finally carries the tracks. Without a long preliminary bombardment, Mark IVs emerge from the mist and break the wire beneath them. Headquarters needs more than an empty trench: it needs a road for the men behind.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("Mark IV 已列入配属。让步枪跟住坦克清理壕口，机枪掩护缺口侧翼；夺下全线后仍要防备反扑。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("本连负责缺口侧翼的步兵地段。连续夺壕后保留机枪守住出口；炮火打散远处集结，预备队留待敌军反扑。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("Mark IV tanks join the attachment list. Riflemen follow to clear trench mouths while machine guns cover the breach’s flank. Secure the entire company line.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面适合 Mark IV 展开。坦克越过铁丝后，步兵清理残存战壕，继续向后方交通线推进。"), TEXT("Firm ground at Cambrai suits the Mark IV. Once tanks cross the wire, infantry clear the remaining trenches and advance towards the rear communications line."), TEXT("Your company holds the infantry sector beside the breach. Leave machine guns covering the exits as you capture successive trenches. Artillery breaks up distant assemblies; keep reserves for the counterattack.")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour.")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷突出部响起德军反击的炮声。缴获的钢铁还躺在修理场，眼下开路的是步枪与 MG 08/15；野炮盯着可能再来的英国坦克。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("On 30 November, German guns announce the counterattack against the Cambrai salient. Captured armour still lies in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s must open the way, with field guns watching for British tanks.")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("三十日晨，反击命令已到。先接通中央交通，再逐壕展开；缴获坦克仍在后方整修，步枪与机枪组先把道路打开。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("让投弹班从被压制的枪位之间渗入。机枪持续掩护，后续步兵负责占壕；抢到前沿后不要只顾继续冲锋，及时挡住英军增援。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("On the morning of the thirtieth, the counterattack order arrives. Reconnect the centre, then work through the trenches. Captured tanks remain under repair; rifles and machine guns must open the road.")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，康布雷反击开始。缴获坦克尚在修理场；步枪与 MG 08/15 打开通路，野炮迎击英军装甲。"), TEXT("On 30 November, the Cambrai counterattack begins. Captured tanks remain in the workshops. Rifles and MG 08/15s open the route while field guns engage British armour."), TEXT("Let bombers infiltrate between suppressed gun positions. Machine guns cover them and following infantry occupy the trenches. Once the front is taken, stop to intercept British reinforcements before pressing on.")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns.")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("布尔隆林边的道路越来越窄，撤出的队伍越来越长。昨日还在向前的坦克停在路旁，机枪组转过枪口；连队要从突出部的咽喉里带出最后一批人。")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("The road beside Bourlon Wood narrows as the withdrawing columns grow. Tanks that advanced yesterday stand beside it; machine guns turn about. The company must bring the last men through the neck of the salient.")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("夺回中央与第一处敌壕，掩护林缘友军撤出。把机枪留在出口旁，待后队通过再轮换；不能让撤出的连队在开阔地失去掩护。")},
    {TEXT("布尔隆林缘的撤退纵队越来越长。夺回出口旁的交通壕，让机枪掩护最后一批部队通过。"), TEXT("The withdrawing columns lengthen beside Bourlon Wood. Recover the communication trench at the exit and cover the last troops with machine guns."), TEXT("Recover the centre and first opposing trench to cover troops leaving the woodland edge. Keep machine guns by the exit until the following men pass. Do not abandon them in the open.")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge.")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，新的机枪阵位封住了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段逼近林缘出口。")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient behind newly placed machine guns. Establish battery contact and close on the woodland exit in stages.")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("布尔隆的林线正在收拢。英国人不会轻易放弃撤运道路，每一次追击都可能撞上重新架好的机枪；把炮兵接上，再逐段压过去。")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("The line around Bourlon is closing. The British will not abandon their evacuation road easily. Each pursuit may meet a machine gun set up afresh; bring the batteries forward and press in connected stages.")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("压住林缘出口，同时让后队保持掩护。敌军会为交通线反扑；拿下两道相连支点，比无掩护地追逐撤退者更重要。")},
    {TEXT("英军正从布尔隆突出部撤出，德军机枪封锁了道路。接通炮兵联络，逐段接近林缘出口。"), TEXT("British troops withdraw from the Bourlon salient as German machine guns block the roads. Restore artillery contact and work towards the exit at the wood’s edge."), TEXT("Cover the woodland exit without losing support from the rear. Expect a counterstroke for the communication route. Two linked posts matter more than an unsupported pursuit.")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned.")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("冬夜巡逻只带轻装装备。沿低地接近前哨，烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮与机队支援。")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("The winter patrol travels light. Approach the outpost through low ground and cover exposed stretches with smoke. Armour, heavy guns and aircraft are unavailable.")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("冬夜里，铁丝响了一下，所有人都停住了。巡逻册上只有几个名字；出发前，炮兵联络被划掉，随队的是轻装步兵和几枚烟弹。")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("Wire rattles once in the winter dark, and every man stops. Only a few names fill the patrol book. Before departure, the battery liaison is struck out: light infantry and smoke will go alone.")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("冬夜的脚步声传过冻硬的沟沿。轻装巡逻沿低地接近，机枪守住通路。今晚只有烟幕支援，重炮与装甲未获配属。")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("Footsteps carry across the frozen ditch in the winter dark. The light patrol follows the low ground while a gun covers the approach. Only smoke support is attached tonight; heavy guns and armour remain behind.")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("接通中央与敌方前哨。为保持行动隐蔽，本次不配属坦克、野炮与空中任务；用步枪、投弹班和烟幕完成短促出击。")},
    {TEXT("冬夜巡逻仅配属轻装部队与烟幕。沿低地接近前哨，用烟幕掩护暴露地段；本次没有装甲、重炮或飞机支援。"), TEXT("The winter night patrol has light troops and smoke only. Approach the outpost through low ground and screen exposed stretches. No armour, heavy guns or aircraft are assigned."), TEXT("Secure the centre and enemy outpost. Tanks, field artillery and air missions are not attached to this small raid. Riflemen, bombers and smoke must carry the short action.")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned.")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("铁丝前留下了新脚印，前哨尚未回话。轻装分队沿低地接近，烟幕掩护通路；重炮与装甲没有配属。")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("Fresh tracks stop before the wire. The outpost has not answered. Light sections move through the low ground under smoke cover; heavy guns and armour are not attached.")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("雪水把脚印留在铁丝前，前哨却没有回话。连部派出一支轻装巡逻，命令不能更短：查清那条壕，再带回消息。")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("Meltwater holds fresh tracks before the wire, but the outpost does not answer. The company sends a light patrol with a short order: clear the trench and bring back word.")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("铁丝前留下新的脚印，敌方前哨没有回话。巡逻队沿地形接近，用烟幕遮住暴露地段。机枪留在能掩护通路的位置。")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("Fresh tracks stop before the wire and the enemy outpost gives no answer. Bring the patrol forward through cover, using smoke on exposed ground. Keep a gun overlooking the approach.")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("巡逻发现对方前哨活动。夺回中央与近处支点，重建观察；此次没有坦克、野炮和机队接令，依靠能互相掩护的分队。")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前出现新脚印，前哨尚未回应。轻装分队沿低地接近，用烟幕掩护通路；本次没有重炮或装甲支援。"), TEXT("Fresh tracks appear before the wire and the outpost has not answered. Light sections approach through low ground under smoke. No heavy guns or armour are assigned."), TEXT("Patrols report activity at the opposing outpost. Restore observation through the centre and near post. No tanks, field artillery or aircraft answer this raid’s orders.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月二十一日的雾里，旧前线已经消失。第五集团军的传令兵不断向西跑，军官带着补充兵赶来；先接回被切断的一段路，才能把更多人带出雾。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("In the fog of 21 March, the old front has vanished. Fifth Army runners hurry west while an officer brings up replacements. Reopen one severed road before more men are lost in the mist.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月的雾里，前沿电话陆续中断。步枪班与机枪接起相邻支点，指挥组观察近处通路。接替部队与首轮炮火将较早抵达。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("Forward telephones fall silent in the March fog. Rifles and machine guns connect the neighbouring posts while the command party watches the approaches. Reliefs and the opening fire are given priority.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("夺回中央与下一处支点，打通被截断的后撤路线。机枪掩护，烟幕遮住轮换；第五集团军仍在后撤，先把断线两侧的人接起来。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("夺回中央交通壕，打通后撤部队的退路。提防穿过烟雾的自动武器突击组；保护观察员，以机枪掩护反击，击溃切断交通线的追兵。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("Retake the centre and next post to reconnect the withdrawal route. Machine guns cover relief behind smoke. Fifth Army is still falling back; link the men on either side of the breach.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("Retake the central communication trench and reopen the withdrawal route. Watch for assault groups advancing through the smoke. Protect the observers, cover the counterstroke with machine guns, and break the pursuit blocking the road.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进；中央补给湾关系到后续攻势。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("The guns of Operation Michael lift deeper. Assault parties pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. The central stores sustain the advance.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势开始，炮声一层层向西滚去。突击队从薄弱处穿过，A7V 紧随其后；战果扩大的速度，已经快过携弹队追赶的脚步。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("Operation Michael begins and the gunfire rolls west in layers. Assault parties pass through the weak points, with A7Vs following. The gains are already outpacing the ammunition bearers.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火向纵深移动。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，MG 08/15 接续掩护。观察员停在能看清守军的位置，为后续炮火校射。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("The guns of Operation Michael move their fire deeper. Assault parties pass through gaps in the fog as MG 08/15s cover the next bound. Halt an observer where the defenders remain visible to correct the following fire.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("A7V 开始列入本连配属。别让装甲独自越过步兵，抢回中继补给湾再展开纵深进攻；储备抵达后才能保持推进。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("已受训的风暴突击队现在配发 MP18。利用晨雾接近，再以短促自动火力压住壕口；机枪和步枪班跟进占领，避免突击组被孤立在前方。")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("A7V tanks become available to the company. Keep infantry with the armour. Reopen the forward supply bay before pushing deeper so ammunition can follow.")},
    {TEXT("米夏埃尔攻势的炮火正向纵深延伸。突击队穿过雾中的缺口，A7V 与机枪跟进。夺取中央补给点，维持后续攻势。"), TEXT("Operation Michael’s guns reach deeper into the defence. Assault troops pass through gaps in the fog, followed by A7Vs and machine guns. Take the central supply point to sustain the advance."), TEXT("Trained stormtroopers now receive the MP 18. Approach through the morning mist and pin the trench mouth with short automatic bursts. Machine guns and rifles must follow to consolidate; do not leave the assault section isolated ahead.")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction.")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("利斯河低地的电话中断，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟接起分散支点，夺回道路交叉口。")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("Telephones fail across the Lys lowlands. The Portuguese sector has been breached. Link the scattered posts along the ditches and recover the road junction.")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("利斯河低地的电话又断了。葡萄牙邻段已经被冲开，路口挤着互不相识的部队；狙击手伏在堤边，连部正把这些零散枪口接成一条线。")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("The telephone is down again in the Lys lowlands. The Portuguese sector has broken, and unfamiliar units crowd the junctions. A sniper lies beside the embankment while the company links scattered guns into a line.")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("侧翼联络已中断。夺回中央交通壕与第一处支点，烟幕盖住道路交叉口；葡萄牙邻段的遭遇提醒你，孤立的枪位守不住整条线。")},
    {TEXT("利斯河低地失去电话联络，葡萄牙邻段已被突破。沿河沟恢复各据点之间的联系，夺回道路交叉口。"), TEXT("Telephone contact is lost in the Lys lowlands and the neighbouring Portuguese sector has been broken. Restore contact between posts along the ditches and retake the road junction."), TEXT("The flank connection is broken. Retake the centre and first post, smoking the road junction. The pressure on the Portuguese neighbour shows why isolated gun positions cannot hold a line.")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach.")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("乔治特的道路从河沟之间伸出去。前方不断报来新的突破，后方却要把弹药从每一道沟里搬过；机枪与突击队必须等到彼此跟上。")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("The roads of Operation Georgette thread between drainage ditches. Reports announce fresh gains ahead, while the bearers carry ammunition over every ditch behind. Guns and assault parties must remain within reach of each other.")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("沿道路缺口接近，观察烟幕后是否还有枪位。先夺两处相连支点，让后续部队通过；推进不能让携弹队掉在河沟后面。")},
    {TEXT("乔治特攻势穿过河沟与低地。送弹队仍在后方涉水；机枪和突击队须互相接应，打开下一段道路。"), TEXT("Operation Georgette crosses ditches and low ground. Ammunition parties struggle through the water behind. Guns and assault troops must support each other into the next approach."), TEXT("Approach through the road gaps and watch for guns beyond smoke. Take two connected posts for the following troops. Keep carriers from falling behind the drainage cuts.")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack.")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的村口传来钢铁互相撞击的声音。敌军坦克已过街，澳军正在集结夜间反击；你的连队要先把通向亚眠的道路从枪口下夺回来。")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("Steel strikes steel outside Villers-Bretonneux. Enemy tanks have crossed the village, and Australian brigades prepare their night counterattack. The company must first recover the road towards Amiens from the guns covering it.")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("从村外接近线反击。让反装甲炮观察到敌车，步枪掩护自己的坦克；接起中央与两道纵深壕，恢复村口通路。")},
    {TEXT("德军已攻入维莱布勒托讷，英军坦克正在村外交战。夺回通往亚眠的道路；澳军将在夜间反击。"), TEXT("German troops have entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fight outside the village. Recover the road to Amiens before the Australian night counterattack."), TEXT("Counterattack through the village approaches. Give the anti-tank gun a view of enemy armour while riflemen accompany your tanks. Reconnect the centre and both deeper trenches.")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens.")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("维莱布勒托讷已经攻入，通往亚眠的道路就在眼前。英国坦克却在村外开火，夜色中的澳军也在集结；步兵不能留在装甲身后太远。")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("Villers-Bretonneux has been entered and the road to Amiens lies ahead. British tanks open fire outside the village, while Australian troops gather in the dark. The infantry cannot fall far behind the armour.")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("村口的进攻命令已经送到。步枪护住坦克侧面，机枪看住道路交叉；夺下通路后立即整备，村外的敌军还会回来。")},
    {TEXT("维莱布勒托讷的进攻已进入村庄，英军坦克从近郊开火。步兵守住装甲两侧，夺取通往亚眠的出口。"), TEXT("The assault has entered Villers-Bretonneux. British tanks fire from the outskirts. Cover the armour's flanks and take the exit towards Amiens."), TEXT("Orders for the village approach have arrived. Riflemen cover the tanks and machine guns watch the junctions. Secure the route and prepare immediately; enemy troops outside the village will return.")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements.")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("八月八日，炮兵表上的时间终于走到四时二十分。加拿大军、澳大利亚军与南侧法军一同推进，Whippet 从晨雾里跟上；每个兵种都必须按同一张表走。")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("On 8 August, the artillery timetable reaches 4.20 a.m. Canadians and Australians advance with the French to the south; Whippets follow through the morning mist. Every arm must keep to the same clock.")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("亚眠晨雾中，坦克从步兵身旁驶过。澳大利亚与加拿大部队在邻段前进。机枪掩护过壕，指挥组从可观察的支点校射。")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("Tanks pass the infantry in the Amiens mist. Australian and Canadian formations advance in neighbouring sectors. Machine guns cover the crossings while command parties correct fire from observation posts.")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("Whippet 可随较快的跟进部队行动。榴霰弹截断暴露的援兵，步枪守住装甲留下的壕口。")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("本连沿主攻侧翼推进。狙击组掩护机枪跃进，军士带投弹班穿过最后的交通壕；在雾中保持预备队，别让反击切断已经取得的进展。")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("Whippets become available for the following movement. Shrapnel catches exposed reinforcements. Riflemen secure the trench mouths left behind the armour.")},
    {TEXT("八月八日清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在亚眠以东推进，法军攻击南侧。坦克随步兵出发，炮火切断守军增援。"), TEXT("At dawn on 8 August, Australians and Canadians advance east of Amiens while the French attack farther south. Tanks move with the infantry; shellfire cuts off the defenders' reinforcements."), TEXT("Your company advances along the assault flank. Snipers cover machine guns moving forward, while NCOs lead bombers through the last communication trenches. Retain a reserve in the fog so a counterattack cannot cut off your gains.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。Captured Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rear guard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("亚眠的前沿接连失去联络。缴获坦克与 Tankgewehr 组抵达，机枪掩护后卫；为撤出的部队重新打开交通。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("Forward posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured tanks and Tankgewehr teams arrive under the rearguard's machine guns. Reopen communications for the withdrawing troops.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("亚眠方向的炮火几乎同时落下。电话里分不清哪一段先被突破，修复的缴获坦克与 Tankgewehr 组刚到；后卫必须争出重新接线的时间。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("The shells fall almost together east of Amiens. On the telephone, nobody can tell which sector broke first. Repaired captured tanks and Tankgewehr teams have just arrived; the rear guard must buy time to reconnect.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("亚眠晨雾里出现坦克轮廓，邻段消息断断续续。反坦克步枪占住有掩护的射界，机枪压住伴随步兵。观察员为炮兵指出可见的装甲目标。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("Tank silhouettes emerge through the Amiens mist amid broken reports from neighbouring sectors. Tank rifles take covered fields of fire while machine guns suppress the escort. Observers identify visible armour for the batteries.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("Tankgewehr 组与整修的缴获坦克归队。重枪架稳后再开火，携弹手守住侧面；夺回中央与第一处支点，把撤出的部队接回交通壕。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("中央壕是后撤的通路。机枪分散设置，风暴队作为近壕反击预备队；辨认英军狙击手和观察员，别把所有弹鼓消耗在远处的人影上。")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("Tankgewehr teams and repaired captured tanks join the company. Support the heavy rifle before firing and keep its carrier beside it. Recover the centre and first post to bring withdrawing troops into the communication trench.")},
    {TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。缴获的 Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"), TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rearguard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."), TEXT("The central trench is the withdrawal route. Disperse the machine guns and keep stormtroopers ready for close counterattacks. Identify British snipers and observers; do not empty every drum at distant targets.")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps.")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("斯卡尔普的白垩被翻到了地表，旧铁丝又一次露出来。工兵把剪钳挂在胸前，炮兵将弹幕向前挪；这一回，步兵不必独自等着敌人的枪口抬起。")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("Chalk has been turned onto the surface beside the Scarpe and the old wire is exposed again. Pioneers hang cutters on their chests while the batteries move the barrage forward. This time the rifles need not wait alone for the enemy guns to rise.")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("工兵随队开路，枪榴弹组压住近壕。编制超出岗位后，先在作战室挑选配属；让炮火、观察和清障各有位置。")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("工兵检查铁丝与可疑弹药，步枪留在能掩护他们的位置。为本次出击选择五支分队的编制，给徐进弹幕保留一条联络。")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("Pioneers open the route while rifle grenades suppress near trenches. Choose the attachments before departure: observation, artillery and clearance each need a place in the company order.")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普的旧铁丝从白垩土中露出。工兵检查未爆弹，步兵随徐进弹幕穿过缺口。"), TEXT("Old wire emerges from the Scarpe chalk. Pioneers inspect unexploded shells as infantry follow the creeping barrage through the gaps."), TEXT("Pioneers inspect the wire and suspicious ammunition while riflemen cover them. Select five detachments for this operation and keep a liaison channel open for the creeping barrage.")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack.")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("撤退道路重新穿过旧阵地，铁丝挡住了己方接近线。工兵开路，Wex 分队与机枪掩护局部反击。")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("The withdrawal returns to old positions, where wire now blocks the German approach. Pioneers clear it while Wex crews and machine guns cover local counterattacks.")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("后撤的路重新穿过两年前的阵地。工兵剪开挡住自己人的铁丝，Wex 分队在短壕里待命；每一次局部反击，都要为更后方的人争出时间。")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("The withdrawal returns to positions dug two years ago. Pioneers cut wire that now blocks their own men, while Wex crews wait in the short trenches. Each local counterattack must buy time for the men farther back.")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("工兵与 Wex 分队已经赶到。夺回中央与近处支点，给后卫留下交通；再以烟幕掩护轮换，沉重装备旁要有人照应。")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("别把工兵当作另一支步枪班。先清理自己需要的通路，再让喷火手借烟幕靠近失守的壕角；机枪要给后卫留下退路。")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("Pioneers and Wex sections have arrived. Recover the centre and near post to preserve the rearguard route. Cover relief with smoke and keep companions beside the heavy equipment.")},
    {TEXT("撤退道路穿过旧阵地，残存铁丝挡住通路。工兵先清障，Wex 分队和机枪掩护反击。"), TEXT("The withdrawal route crosses old positions, with wire still blocking the way. Pioneers clear obstacles while Wex troops and machine guns cover the counterattack."), TEXT("Pioneers are more than another rifle section. Clear the route you need, then let the flamethrowers approach a lost trench corner behind smoke. Keep the machineguns covering a way out.")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing.")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("贝利库尔北面的战报还在传来，南侧里克瓦尔的明渠已横在眼前。破损的坡岸留下两条艰难通路；法军喷火分遣队接入本连电话线，工兵带着剪钳向纤道移动。")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("Reports still arrive from Bellicourt to the north. At Riqueval, the exposed canal cutting lies ahead. Two damaged bank approaches remain. A French flame detachment joins the company telephone circuit as pioneers carry cutters towards the towpath.")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("里克瓦尔的明渠横在面前，炮火打坏了两侧坡岸。工兵沿残存通路前进，步兵与烟幕掩护渡越。指挥组需要看清守军，才能校正炮火。")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("The open canal at Riqueval lies ahead, its banks broken by shellfire. Engineers follow the remaining approaches under infantry and smoke cover. Command parties need a clear view of the defenders to correct fire.")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("工兵先打开明渠两侧的障碍，法军 Schilt 分遣队在烟幕后清理近处掩体。抓住破损坡岸留下的通路；渡口烟幕影响双方观察，炮击前确认自己人的位置。")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("用工兵打开壕前障碍，再让法军 Schilt 分遣队清理近处掩体。澳美主攻在邻段，联络官要求本连控制隧道两侧的接近线。地表旧壕与地下通道交错，逐段查明敌军位置再推进。")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("Pioneers open the obstacles along the cut. The attached French Schilt section clears near shelters behind smoke. Use the damaged bank approaches; crossing smoke blinds both sides, so check friendly positions before ordering fire.")},
    {TEXT("里克瓦尔的运河明渠横在前方。工兵沿破损坡岸接近，法军喷火分遣队清理近处掩体；烟幕掩护渡越。"), TEXT("The open canal cutting at Riqueval lies ahead. Engineers approach along the broken banks; a French flame detachment clears nearby cover while smoke screens the crossing."), TEXT("Pioneers open the obstacles before the French Schilt detachment clears nearby shelters. Australian and American troops lead the assault next door; this company must control the tunnel approaches. Locate the defenders among the old trenches and underground passages before advancing.")},
    {TEXT("运河纤道仍可通行，两侧枪位保持联络。工兵维护通路，预备队准备夺回失守的中央阵地。"), TEXT("The canal towpath remains open and gun posts on either side are still in contact. Pioneers keep the route clear while reserves prepare to retake the centre."), TEXT("运河纤道仍可通行，两侧枪位保持联络。工兵维护通路，预备队准备夺回失守的中央阵地。")},
