    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach the walls of Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the rear for the following troops. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited near the town.")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰人正在向勒凯努瓦城墙靠近。桑布尔河一线还在开火，停战只是传闻；最后一张通行地图仍要由连队自己送到另一头。")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach the walls of Le Quesnoy. The Sambre front still fires; an armistice remains a rumour. The company must carry the final route map to the men at the other end.")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队向勒凯努瓦城墙推进。桑布尔的渡口仍有守军。清出后沿，掩护后续部队通过；城郊继续禁用毒气与航空轰炸。")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops advance towards the walls of Le Quesnoy. The Sambre crossings are still defended. Clear the rear and cover the following troops; gas and aerial bombing remain prohibited near the town.")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("把连队练成的分工带到最后一段通路。工兵先行，步枪占壕，装甲与炮火只打能够确认的目标；让接替部队沿完整交通线通过。")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("在村落边缘保持克制的火力，工兵先行。新西兰人在邻段城墙外作战，本连要控制通路；毒气和空中轰炸均不列入本次命令。")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("Bring the company’s hard-learned cooperation to the final approach. Pioneers lead, rifles occupy, armour and artillery engage observed targets. Open the complete route for the following troops.")},
    {TEXT("十一月四日，新西兰部队逼近勒凯努瓦城墙。桑布尔渡口仍在交火。清除敌军后方守军，为后续部队打开通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("On 4 November, New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Fighting continues at the Sambre crossings. Clear the enemy rearguard and open a route for following troops; gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("Use restrained fire along the village edge and let the pioneers lead. New Zealand troops are fighting by the neighbouring town walls; this company must control the approaches. Gas and aerial bombing are not authorised for this operation.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在开火。机枪守住桑布尔渡口，预备队掩护最后的通路。城郊禁止毒气与空中轰炸。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived. The Western Front still fires. Machine guns hold the Sambre crossing while reserves cover the last route. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited near the town.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("南方停战的电报已经到了，西线停火的命令还没有。军官把纸折回口袋，机枪留在渡口旁；今天的任务不是再画一条箭头，是把还能走的人带过最后一道火线。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("The telegram announcing the southern armistice has arrived; the order to stop firing on the Western Front has not. The officer folds it away. Machine guns remain beside the crossing. Today the task is to bring the men still able to walk through one last line of fire.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("撤退纵队尚未通过桑布尔，机枪留在渡口旁。保留预备队应付反击，再把整支分队带过后沿。城郊的毒气与航空轰炸禁令继续生效。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("The columns have yet to pass the Sambre and machine guns remain beside the crossing. Keep a reserve for the counterattack, then bring complete sections through the rear. Gas and aerial bombing remain prohibited near the town.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("停战电报尚未抵达。先把中央与近处支点重新接起，机枪留在出口掩护；把还能归队的人带回来，再让后卫轮换。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("不要把最后的交通壕变成死胡同。工兵保持出口，机枪交替掩护；居民区邻段不批准毒气与空中轰炸，靠仍能互相支援的小队守住通路。")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("The armistice order has not arrived. Reconnect the centre and near post, keeping machine guns at the exit. Bring back the men who can still return, then relieve the rearguard.")},
    {TEXT("南方停战的电报已到，西线仍在交火。用机枪守住桑布尔渡口，保留预备队，掩护撤退通路；城郊禁用毒气与航空轰炸。"), TEXT("News of the southern armistice has arrived while the Western Front still fires. Hold the Sambre crossings with machine guns and keep reserves to cover withdrawal routes. Gas and aerial bombing are unavailable near the town."), TEXT("Do not let the last communication trench become a dead end. Pioneers keep exits clear while machineguns cover in turn. Gas and bombing are forbidden near the inhabited sector; hold the routes with sections that can support one another.")},
