    {TEXT("靶场操练"), TEXT("Range practice"), TEXT("The sergeant's range")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("步枪命中率提高 10%；距离、掩体与压制仍影响射击。")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Rifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot.")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("先稳住枪托，再扣扳机。反复练熟的 SMLE 射手，更能把弹药用在看清的目标上。")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Gewehr 98 射手在操场上练稳呼吸与扳机。到了壕肩，每一发瞄准射击便多一分把握。")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Stock into the shoulder; then the trigger. Repeated SMLE practice teaches a rifleman to spend his ammunition on a target he can identify.")},
    {TEXT("测距，屏息，预压扳机。靶场的名册一再添上新名字。\n步枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Judge the range, hold the breath, take the first pressure. New names keep filling the depot roll.\nRifle accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Gewehr 98 riflemen practise their breathing and trigger control on the range. At the parapet, each aimed shot carries a little more certainty.")},
