    {TEXT("快速装填"), TEXT("Rapid loading"), TEXT("The hands remember")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Weapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("桥夹、弹盘，各有各的规矩。全连反复练习装填，交火中的空当便能短一些。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("泥水和紧张不能打乱手上的次序。各组反复操练自己的武器，让完整装填少耽搁一些时间。")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Charger clips and pan magazines each have their own drill. Repeated loading practice shortens the dangerous silence in a firefight.")},
    {TEXT("桥夹压入弹仓，弹带穿过进弹口。\n武器装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("Seat the charger; feed the belt through the gun.\nWeapon reload time −15%"), TEXT("Mud and fear must not break the sequence. Every crew repeats its own weapon drill so a full reload costs less time.")},
