    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("机枪造成的压制提高 18%。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("Machine-gun suppression increases by 18%.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("枪手不必追逐每一名敌兵。短促火力压住敌人的枪口，让他们更难抬头还击。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("MG 08/15 按照射界分配点射。火力更有纪律，敌军就更难找到抬头与移动的间隙。")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("A gunner need not chase every enemy. Short bursts pin hostile gun positions and make it harder for their crews to answer.")},
    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手伏在枪旁。\n机枪压制 +18%"), TEXT("Brace the stock; keep the ammunition bearer beside the gun.\nMachine-gun suppression +18%"), TEXT("MG 08/15 crews distribute bursts within assigned arcs. Disciplined fire leaves the enemy fewer chances to raise a head or move.")},
