    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("野炮整备时间缩短 15%。呼叫后的落弹延迟不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("Artillery preparation is 15% shorter. Delivery time after a call is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("传令兵沿壕检查线路，炮位提早备弹。连部呼叫野炮时，整备的等待随之缩短。")},
    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("联络所把前沿呼叫送向炮兵。炮位有了准备，第一轮与后续野炮任务都能更快整备。")},
    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("Runners check the trench line and the battery prepares ammunition in advance. When company headquarters calls, the guns need less time to get ready.")},
    {TEXT("炮位备齐引信，弹药箱沿交通壕前送。\n野炮整备 −15%"), TEXT("Set out the fuzes and bring the ammunition forward.\nArtillery readiness −15%"), TEXT("The liaison post passes front-line calls to the artillery. Better preparation shortens the wait for both the first and later field-gun missions.")},
