    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。")},
    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("Grenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("投弹手学会辨认壕道中的暴露处。落点仍会偏离，但近处的爆炸更有机会击中守军。")},
    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("突击手学会寻找转角与坑岸旁的暴露处。柄式手榴弹仍会偏离，近处的爆炸却更有机会击中守军。")},
    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("Bombers learn to recognise exposed places in the trench. A throw can still stray, but a close explosion is more likely to catch the garrison.")},
    {TEXT("练习弹越过壕角，落在胸墙之后。\n手雷命中率 +12%"), TEXT("Practice bombs clear the traverse and fall beyond the parapet.\nGrenade accuracy +12%"), TEXT("Assault troops learn to spot exposed places beside corners and crater lips. Stick grenades may still stray, but close explosions are more likely to catch the defenders.")},
