    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。")},
    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("All infantry sections prepare 10% sooner.")},
    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("弹药、口粮与替补人员沿交通壕送来。后方分工理顺，新的小队便能更快完成整备。")},
    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("补给人员理清交通壕中的次序。步枪、机枪与突击分队都能更快完成出发前的整备。")},
    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("Ammunition, rations and replacements come forward through the communication trenches. Better work in the rear gets the next section ready sooner.")},
    {TEXT("补充兵循交通壕报到，军需车在后方卸载。\n步兵整备 −10%"), TEXT("Drafts report through the communication trench as supply wagons unload behind the line.\nInfantry readiness −10%"), TEXT("Supply parties establish an orderly route through the communication trenches. Rifles, guns and assault sections all complete their preparations sooner.")},
