    {TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。\n驻壕机枪射击时：附近推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%"), TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while the rifles leave by its flank.\nFiring trench gun: nearby advancing infantry take −35% bullet suppression"), TEXT("正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。")},
    {TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。\n驻壕机枪射击时：附近推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%"), TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while the rifles leave by its flank.\nFiring trench gun: nearby advancing infantry take −35% bullet suppression"), TEXT("Advancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression.")},
    {TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。\n驻壕机枪射击时：附近推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%"), TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while the rifles leave by its flank.\nFiring trench gun: nearby advancing infantry take −35% bullet suppression"), TEXT("壕内的刘易斯刚刚开火，附近步兵便抓住机会向前。持续掩护能减轻他们跨越空地时的压制。")},
    {TEXT("机枪守住胸墙，步枪班从侧旁出壕。\n驻壕机枪射击时：附近推进步兵所受枪弹压制 −35%"), TEXT("The gun holds the parapet while the rifles leave by its flank.\nFiring trench gun: nearby advancing infantry take −35% bullet suppression"), TEXT("As the Lewis opens fire from its trench, nearby infantry seize their chance. Sustained cover reduces the pressure on men crossing open ground.")},
