    {TEXT("枪口横移，点射扫过相邻射孔。\n机枪扩大目标周围的压制范围"), TEXT("The muzzle traverses, carrying bursts past the adjoining loopholes.\nMachine guns suppress a wider area around their target"), TEXT("Machine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("枪口横移，点射扫过相邻射孔。\n机枪扩大目标周围的压制范围"), TEXT("The muzzle traverses, carrying bursts past the adjoining loopholes.\nMachine guns suppress a wider area around their target"), TEXT("枪手学会沿敌阵分配火力。被压住的枪位之外，周围的守军也更难从壕肩探头。")},
