    {TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。\n存活同伴抵达枪位后接替\n沿用刘易斯与剩余弹药"), TEXT("The gunner falls; a crewman takes the stock.\nSurviving crewmen reaching the gun take over the Lewis\nContinue with its remaining ammunition"), TEXT("A surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition.")},
