    {TEXT("射手倒下，同伴接住枪托。\n存活同伴抵达枪位后接替\n沿用刘易斯与剩余弹药"), TEXT("The gunner falls; a crewman takes the stock.\nSurviving crewmen reaching the gun take over the Lewis\nContinue with its remaining ammunition"), TEXT("The ammunition bearer must know the Lewis too. If the gunner is killed, a surviving companion moves to the position and takes over the ammunition and the task.")},
