    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("军士升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，范围扩大，重整间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("Upgrades the sergeant to an officer: command accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus, reach increases, and the rally interval falls from 8 to 6 seconds.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("指挥组长获任军官，以 Webley 自卫，用口令稳住附近部队。学会前沿观察后，他也能为更远处的炮火指引方向。")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("The section leader receives a commission. A Webley protects him while his orders steady the men nearby. Observer training will later let him direct fire farther ahead.")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander’s name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended")},
    {TEXT("委任状送到连部，军士摘下臂章。名册上前任排长的名字已经划去。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 8 秒 → 6 秒；指挥范围扩大"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended"), TEXT("The commission reaches headquarters; the NCO removes his arm badge. The previous commander's name has been struck from the roll.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 8 seconds → 6 seconds; command range extended")},
