    {TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。线断之处，须有人去接。\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒；散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him. A break in the wire needs a man to mend it.\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter −30%"), TEXT("指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。")},
    {TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。线断之处，须有人去接。\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒；散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him. A break in the wire needs a man to mend it.\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter −30%"), TEXT("With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.")},
    {TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。线断之处，须有人去接。\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒；散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him. A break in the wire needs a man to mend it.\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter −30%"), TEXT("射手与指挥组长学会报告所见。目标处于清楚的视线内时，野炮和迫击炮能更早送来首轮火力。")},
    {TEXT("观察员守住电话，携弹手伏在旁边。线断之处，须有人去接。\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒；散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer guards the telephone, his bearer beside him. A break in the wire needs a man to mend it.\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter −30%"), TEXT("Marksmen and command leaders learn to report what they see. A clearly observed target lets field guns and mortars deliver their first salvo sooner.")},
