    {TEXT("烟幕后续射"), TEXT("Smoke follow-up"), TEXT("Fire beyond the smoke")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("己方烟幕标出需要继续压制的地段，野炮在末轮补射。炮手看不见冲进烟里的自己人，步兵仍须等待。")},
    {TEXT("炮位留下预备弹，观察员盯住烟后的枪口。\n向己方烟幕内呼叫野炮：追加一轮补射"), TEXT("Reserve rounds wait at the battery; the observer watches the guns beyond the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke: one additional salvo"), TEXT("Friendly smoke marks the sector that needs continued suppression. The field guns add a final salvo. Gunners cannot see their own men entering the screen; infantry must still wait.")},
