    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪从学校送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE\n射程、精准度提高"), TEXT("Scoped rifles arrive from the school; the marksman checks his sights again.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs\nRange and accuracy increased"), TEXT("精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，射程与精准度提高。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪从学校送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE\n射程、精准度提高"), TEXT("Scoped rifles arrive from the school; the marksman checks his sights again.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs\nRange and accuracy increased"), TEXT("Marksmen receive scoped SMLEs with greater range and accuracy.")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪从学校送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE\n射程、精准度提高"), TEXT("Scoped rifles arrive from the school; the marksman checks his sights again.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs\nRange and accuracy increased"), TEXT("精确射手完成专门操练，领到镜瞄 SMLE。更远处的枪口也能被辨认，沉住气的一枪更有把握。")},
    {TEXT("镜瞄步枪从学校送到前沿，射手重新校正瞄具。\n精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE\n射程、精准度提高"), TEXT("Scoped rifles arrive from the school; the marksman checks his sights again.\nMarksmen receive scoped SMLEs\nRange and accuracy increased"), TEXT("Marksmen complete specialist training and receive telescopic SMLE rifles. They can identify more distant gun positions and place a deliberate shot with greater confidence.")},
