    {TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手优先攻击可见敌军指挥者，其次攻击机枪手"), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners"), TEXT("Snipers watch first for enemy leaders, then machine gunners. Disrupting the opposing formation often matters more than chasing the nearest skirmisher.")},
