    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率 +25% → +50%\n每 6 秒重整；行进中下令"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRallies every 6 seconds, including while moving"), TEXT("士官升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率 +25% → +50%\n每 6 秒重整；行进中下令"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRallies every 6 seconds, including while moving"), TEXT("Upgrades the NCO to an officer: the command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with a rally every 6 seconds, including while moving.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率 +25% → +50%\n每 6 秒重整；行进中下令"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRallies every 6 seconds, including while moving"), TEXT("指挥组长获任配 P08 的军官，推进中也能就近发出命令；留在壕里的步枪手则更善于压住冲来的敌人。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率 +25% → +50%\n每 6 秒重整；行进中下令"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRallies every 6 seconds, including while moving"), TEXT("The command leader is commissioned and issued a P08, allowing him to give orders close to advancing troops. Riflemen remaining in the trench become better at pinning an approaching enemy.")},
