    {TEXT("枪口退入胸墙的暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手：枪弹命中概率、枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet's shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched machine gunner: bullet hit chance and suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("Entrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression.")},
