    {TEXT("枪口退入胸墙的暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手：枪弹命中概率、枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet's shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched machine gunner: bullet hit chance and suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("Deepen the emplacement and dress the breastwork. Entrenched machine gunners become harder to hit and better able to withstand suppressive fire.")},
