    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("A trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("整壕出击时，有枪手的机枪组替步兵留守掩护。若壕内已没有别的步兵，它们仍可奉命向前。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nTrench advance: manned gun sections remain to cover\nWhen only gun sections remain, order another advance to send them forward"), TEXT("When a trench advances, machine-gun sections with a living gunner remain to cover the infantry. If no other infantry remain in the trench, the guns can still be ordered forward.")},
    {TEXT("烟幕渗透"), TEXT("Smoke infiltration"), TEXT("烟幕渗透")},
    {TEXT("烟幕渗透"), TEXT("Smoke infiltration"), TEXT("Smoke infiltration")},
