    {TEXT("炮位测地"), TEXT("Battery survey"), TEXT("炮位测地")},
    {TEXT("炮位测地"), TEXT("Battery survey"), TEXT("Battery survey")},
    {TEXT("炮位测地"), TEXT("Battery survey"), TEXT("炮手的测地本")},
    {TEXT("炮位测地"), TEXT("Battery survey"), TEXT("The gunner's survey book")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮再提前 2.5 秒；散布再 −30%"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter another −30%"), TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮再提前 2.5 秒；散布再 −30%"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter another −30%"), TEXT("Mortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮再提前 2.5 秒；散布再 −30%"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter another −30%"), TEXT("迫击炮组把测地记录与火力表核对清楚。弹着不再散得那么开，爆炸本身却不会因此缩小。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮再提前 2.5 秒；散布再 −30%"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter another −30%"), TEXT("Mortar crews reconcile their survey notes and firing tables. Their rounds fall in a tighter area; the explosions themselves do not become smaller.")},
