    {TEXT("壕内自动火力"), TEXT("Trench automatic fire"), TEXT("Sweep the trench mouth")},
    {TEXT("点射从一道壕角转向另一道，守军伏下身去。\nMP 18 点射压制目标附近的守军"), TEXT("Bursts carry from one traverse to the next; the defenders crouch below the lip.\nMP 18 bursts suppress defenders near the target"), TEXT("MP 18 点射也会压制目标附近的守军。")},
    {TEXT("点射从一道壕角转向另一道，守军伏下身去。\nMP 18 点射压制目标附近的守军"), TEXT("Bursts carry from one traverse to the next; the defenders crouch below the lip.\nMP 18 bursts suppress defenders near the target"), TEXT("MP 18 bursts also suppress defenders beside the target.")},
    {TEXT("点射从一道壕角转向另一道，守军伏下身去。\nMP 18 点射压制目标附近的守军"), TEXT("Bursts carry from one traverse to the next; the defenders crouch below the lip.\nMP 18 bursts suppress defenders near the target"), TEXT("MP 18 突击手练习把短点射送进近处阵位。目标身边的守军也会被这阵突然的火力压住。")},
    {TEXT("点射从一道壕角转向另一道，守军伏下身去。\nMP 18 点射压制目标附近的守军"), TEXT("Bursts carry from one traverse to the next; the defenders crouch below the lip.\nMP 18 bursts suppress defenders near the target"), TEXT("MP 18 troops practise short bursts against close positions. Defenders beside the target are also pinned by the sudden fire.")},
    {TEXT("备用弹鼓"), TEXT("Reserve drums"), TEXT("备用弹鼓")},
    {TEXT("备用弹鼓"), TEXT("Reserve drums"), TEXT("Reserve drums")},
    {TEXT("备用弹鼓"), TEXT("Reserve drums"), TEXT("留一只满弹鼓")},
    {TEXT("备用弹鼓"), TEXT("Reserve drums"), TEXT("Keep a full drum ready")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("Issues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("小盒式呼吸器需要专门操练。口具与鼻夹必须用对，软管与滤盒也要检查，弄湿的滤材必须更换；在警报响起之前，先安排装备配发与训练。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("防毒面具操练从气密检查开始，滤罐必须远离泥水。完成研习后，部队获配面罩与滤罐，警报响起时便可佩戴，减少毒气造成的损失。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("Respirator instruction begins with an airtight seal and a filter kept clear of muddy water. Once trained and equipped, the men can don their masks at the alarm and reduce losses to gas.")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped"), TEXT("The small-box respirator demands practice. Fit the mouthpiece and nose clip correctly; inspect the hose and filter box, and replace wet filter material. Arrange this equipment and training before the alarm sounds.")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("工兵排除爆炸物的速度提高 65%。")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("Pioneers clear explosive hazards 65% faster.")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("工兵练习在掩护下检查引线、标出可疑弹药，再剪开铁丝。通路开得更快，普通步兵却仍须等到他们完成工作。")},
    {TEXT("工兵标出未爆弹的位置，工具放在身旁。\n工兵排爆速度 +65%"), TEXT("The pioneer marks the unexploded shell, his tools beside him.\nPioneer explosive clearance speed +65%"), TEXT("Pioneers practise inspecting leads, marking suspect ammunition and cutting wire under covering fire. They open the route sooner, but ordinary infantry must still wait for the work to finish.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("喷火射程略增；首次燃料耗尽后，可再喷射四次。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Flame reach increases modestly. Four more bursts become available after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("法军分遣队把喷火器的燃料与软管逐一交接。携行储备增加了，却没有让操作者免于枪弹；先掩护接近，再清理近处的掩体。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("Wex 喷火手的背后必须有人照看软管与燃料。整备好的储罐让短促喷射能够延续，步枪手仍要压住远处的枪口。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("A Wex operator needs someone watching his hose and fuel supply. Prepared tanks sustain short bursts; riflemen must still silence the distant guns.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increased slightly\nAfter the first reservoir is empty: 4 additional bursts"), TEXT("The French detachment hands over its fuel and hoses one by one. Extra reserves do not make the operator bulletproof. Cover the approach before clearing nearby shelters.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("徐进弹幕各组推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集；炮弹总数不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("Creeping-barrage groups advance in shorter steps for denser coverage. Shell count is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("炮兵把落点逐段向前推移，在步兵面前留下短暂的低头时刻。核对新的火力表之后，徐进弹幕的每一步更紧密，少给敌人留下重新抬头的空隙。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵表上，下一段弹幕紧接前一段。跟进的人留在炮火刚让出的地上。\n徐进弹幕推进间距缩短，覆盖更密集"), TEXT("The next lift follows closely on the fire plan. The men step onto ground the shells have just left.\nCreeping barrage advances in shorter lifts for denser coverage"), TEXT("The gunners move their fire forward in stages, keeping enemy heads down ahead of the infantry. A revised fire plan closes the gaps between each lift, leaving less time for the defenders to recover.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("榴霰弹由两轮增至三轮，每轮仍为 3 发。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("Shrapnel fire increases from two to three salvos of 3 shells.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("炮手转动引信刻度，弹丸在敌军头顶炸开。熟练的炮组多送来一轮三发榴霰弹；开阔地上的密集步兵最危险，深壕和坚土仍能挡住弹珠。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮尾旁。\n榴霰弹齐射：两轮 → 三轮\n每轮 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nShrapnel: two salvos → three salvos\n3 shells per salvo"), TEXT("The fuze scale turns; the shell bursts above the line. Practised crews add a third three-shell salvo. Crowded infantry in the open are most exposed; deep trenches and earth still screen the balls.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35：徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nFriendly morale below 35: creeping barrage, shrapnel and bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("己方士气低于 35 时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹与轰炸任务整备缩短 22%。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35：徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nFriendly morale below 35: creeping barrage, shrapnel and bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("Below 35 morale, creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions prepare 22% sooner.")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35：徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nFriendly morale below 35: creeping barrage, shrapnel and bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("战线动摇，后方启封预备弹药。士气低落时，徐进弹幕、榴霰弹齐射与投弹任务获得优先补给，缩短再次整备的等待。")},
    {TEXT("求援信号升起，炮位启封预备弹药。省下的炮弹，明日未必还有人领取。\n己方士气低于 35：徐进弹幕、榴霰弹、航空轰炸整备 −22%"), TEXT("A distress signal rises; reserve ammunition is opened. Rounds saved today may find no one left to ask tomorrow.\nFriendly morale below 35: creeping barrage, shrapnel and bombing readiness −22%"), TEXT("As the line falters, headquarters releases reserve ammunition. Low morale gives creeping barrages, shrapnel salvos and bombing missions priority for replenishment, shortening preparation for the next call.")},
    {TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow.\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("铁路行动中，反坦克野炮整备时间缩短 18%。")},
    {TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow.\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank field guns prepare 18% sooner in railway operations.")},
    {TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow.\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("观察员把列车炮位与铁路切口画在同一页上。专门的反装甲联络减少等待，逼迫那段移动的钢铁支点停止开火。")},
    {TEXT("反坦克炮移到路堤旁，弹药车跟随就位。\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Anti-tank guns take position beside the embankment; ammunition wagons follow.\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("Observers mark the train's gun positions and the railway cutting on the same sheet. Dedicated anti-armour liaison shortens the wait to silence this moving strongpoint.")},
    {TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。\n装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches.\nArmoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("装甲列车车体耐久提高 22%；铁路行动中的反坦克野炮整备缩短 18%。")},
    {TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。\n装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches.\nArmoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("Armoured-train hull durability increases by 22%. Anti-tank field guns prepare 18% sooner in railway operations.")},
    {TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。\n装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches.\nArmoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("铁路炮组与前沿接起专线。列车仍被轨道限制，但炮位报告更清楚，后卫争取的片刻便能变成下一次掩护。")},
    {TEXT("车体铆上补强板，炮组核对铁路接近线。\n装甲列车车体耐久 +22%\n铁路行动：反坦克野炮整备 −18%"), TEXT("Reinforcing plates are riveted to the hull; gunners check the railway approaches.\nArmoured-train hull durability +22%\nRailway operations: anti-tank field-gun readiness −18%"), TEXT("A dedicated line connects the railway gun crew to the front. The train remains bound to its rails, but clearer reports turn the rearguard's brief respite into another covering salvo.")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("所有步兵整备再缩短 8%，可与补给训练叠加。")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("All infantry prepare a further 8% sooner, combining with supply training.")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("让走过这些战场的老兵带领新来的补充兵。出发前的整备更快，不是因为他们不再害怕，而是每个人终于知道自己该站在哪里。")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("Veterans who know these battlefields guide the replacements. Preparations take less time because every man knows his place, even when he is afraid.")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section’s kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)")},
    {TEXT("老兵领走补充兵，军需处清出下一队的装备。\n步兵整备 −8%（与补给训练累计）"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)"), TEXT("Veterans take charge of the draft; the depot sets out the next section's kit.\nInfantry readiness −8% (cumulative with supply training)")},
    {TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。\n枪榴弹散布半径 −15%"), TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius −15%"), TEXT("枪榴弹落点散布半径缩小 15%。")},
    {TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。\n枪榴弹散布半径 −15%"), TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius −15%"), TEXT("Rifle-grenade scatter radius is reduced by 15%.")},
    {TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。\n枪榴弹散布半径 −15%"), TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius −15%"), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹把投掷延伸到壕口之外。练习专用发射弹、枪口支架与安全抛射，让散布收拢在观察到的枪位附近；步枪掩护仍不可少。")},
    {TEXT("射手记下仰角，练习弹落在标定地段。\n枪榴弹散布半径 −15%"), TEXT("The gunner records the elevation as practice rounds fall on the marked ground.\nRifle-grenade scatter radius −15%"), TEXT("The No. 23 carries a grenade beyond a hand throw. Drill with launching cartridges, the retaining bracket and safe elevation gathers the shots around an observed post. Rifle cover remains essential.")},
    {TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。\n反坦克步枪散布 −15%\n命中后的击穿概率提高"), TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again.\nTank-rifle scatter −15%\nPenetration chance on a hit increased"), TEXT("反坦克步枪散布缩小 15%，命中后的击穿机会提高。")},
    {TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。\n反坦克步枪散布 −15%\n命中后的击穿概率提高"), TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again.\nTank-rifle scatter −15%\nPenetration chance on a hit increased"), TEXT("Anti-tank rifle scatter is reduced by 15%, with better penetration after a hit.")},
    {TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。\n反坦克步枪散布 −15%\n命中后的击穿概率提高"), TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again.\nTank-rifle scatter −15%\nPenetration chance on a hit increased"), TEXT("Tankgewehr 需要专门的支撑与瞄准训练。射手把沉重枪身稳住，携弹手照看侧面；把瞄准点留在装甲的薄弱处，命中仍不等于必然击穿。")},
    {TEXT("钢板上的弹痕逐发标记，射手重新稳住枪托。\n反坦克步枪散布 −15%\n命中后的击穿概率提高"), TEXT("Strikes on the test plate are marked; the gunner braces the stock again.\nTank-rifle scatter −15%\nPenetration chance on a hit increased"), TEXT("The Tankgewehr demands its own support and aiming drill. The gunner steadies the heavy rifle while his carrier watches the flank. Better aim finds vulnerable armour; a hit still does not guarantee penetration.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("专门射手附近有存活的同队携弹手时，装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("Specialist weapons reload 15% faster while a living squadmate remains nearby.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("枪榴弹与专用发射弹分开携行，携弹手在发射间隙把下一发送到射手身边。有同伴伴随，装填便更顺畅；孤身射手没有这份照应。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("大口径枪弹逐发交到射手手中。携弹手活着并留在小队时，重新装填更从容；失去同伴以后，射手只能独自承担整套工作。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("The heavy cartridges pass to the gunner one at a time. A living carrier beside his section eases each reload. Without that companion, the gunner must manage the whole task alone.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手存活且在附近：专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nLiving bearer nearby in the same section: specialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("Grenades and launching cartridges travel separately. Between shots the carrier brings the next round to the gunner. Reloading is smoother with his companion nearby; a lone gunner loses that help.")},
    {TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。\n据守中央阵地之后第一道敌壕：间接火力首轮提前 2 秒"), TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target.\nHold the first enemy trench beyond the centre: opening indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner"), TEXT("驻守中央之后的第一道敌壕时，间接火力首轮提前 2 秒抵达。")},
    {TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。\n据守中央阵地之后第一道敌壕：间接火力首轮提前 2 秒"), TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target.\nHold the first enemy trench beyond the centre: opening indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner"), TEXT("Garrisoning the first enemy trench beyond the centre brings the first indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner.")},
    {TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。\n据守中央阵地之后第一道敌壕：间接火力首轮提前 2 秒"), TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target.\nHold the first enemy trench beyond the centre: opening indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner"), TEXT("电话线随夺壕向前延伸。让一队驻守中央之后的第一道敌壕，观察员便能缩短间接火力的第一轮传令；空壕与断开的前沿没有这项便利。")},
    {TEXT("电话线敷进新占交通壕，前沿报回目标。\n据守中央阵地之后第一道敌壕：间接火力首轮提前 2 秒"), TEXT("Wire enters the captured communication trench; the forward post reports its target.\nHold the first enemy trench beyond the centre: opening indirect-fire salvo 2 seconds sooner"), TEXT("Lay the telephone wire into captured ground. A section holding the first enemy trench beyond the centre shortens the first indirect-fire request. An empty post cannot maintain that connection.")},
