    {TEXT("可在作战室研究风暴突击队训练。完成后，投弹班可在 1918 年行动中换装 MP 18。"), TEXT("Research assault-troop training in the operations room. Once completed, bombing sections can receive MP 18s during 1918 operations."), TEXT("本连尚未完成冲锋枪训练。先用现有投弹班作战，战后在作战室安排风暴队操练。")},
    {TEXT("可在作战室研究风暴突击队训练。完成后，投弹班可在 1918 年行动中换装 MP 18。"), TEXT("Research assault-troop training in the operations room. Once completed, bombing sections can receive MP 18s during 1918 operations."), TEXT("The company has not completed submachine-gun training. Fight with the existing bombing section, then arrange stormtrooper instruction in the operations room.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班负责占壕与接替防线。胸墙提供掩护，穿越空地时容易受到机枪与炮火打击。"), TEXT("Rifle sections take trenches and relieve the line. Parapets provide cover; open crossings expose them to machine guns and shellfire."), TEXT("步枪班负责占壕与接替防线。胸墙提供掩护，穿越空地时容易受到机枪与炮火打击。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班负责占壕与接替防线。胸墙提供掩护，穿越空地时容易受到机枪与炮火打击。"), TEXT("Rifle sections take trenches and relieve the line. Parapets provide cover; open crossings expose them to machine guns and shellfire."), TEXT("Rifle sections take trenches and relieve the line. Parapets provide cover; open crossings expose them to machine guns and shellfire.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班负责占壕与接替防线。胸墙提供掩护，穿越空地时容易受到机枪与炮火打击。"), TEXT("Rifle sections take trenches and relieve the line. Parapets provide cover; open crossings expose them to machine guns and shellfire."), TEXT("步枪班先到。用壕肩稳住枪托，辨清目标再开火；越过无人区之前，先给身后的同伴留出能掩护你的枪位。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班负责占壕与接替防线。胸墙提供掩护，穿越空地时容易受到机枪与炮火打击。"), TEXT("Rifle sections take trenches and relieve the line. Parapets provide cover; open crossings expose them to machine guns and shellfire."), TEXT("The rifle section arrives first. Rest the stock against the trench shoulder and identify the target before firing. Before crossing no man's land, leave your comrades a position from which they can cover you.")},
