    {TEXT("点击壕旁的小队肖像即可出击。前壕满员时，部队继续寻找前方阵位。"), TEXT("Click a section portrait beside the trench to advance. If the next trench is full, the section seeks a position farther forward."), TEXT("Click a section portrait beside the trench to advance. If the next trench is full, the section seeks a position farther forward.")},
    {TEXT("点击壕旁的小队肖像即可出击。前壕满员时，部队继续寻找前方阵位。"), TEXT("Click a section portrait beside the trench to advance. If the next trench is full, the section seeks a position farther forward."), TEXT("点击壕旁的小队肖像出击。前壕满员时，增援会继续寻找前方的落脚处。")},
    {TEXT("点击壕旁的小队肖像即可出击。前壕满员时，部队继续寻找前方阵位。"), TEXT("Click a section portrait beside the trench to advance. If the next trench is full, the section seeks a position farther forward."), TEXT("Select a section portrait beside the trench to advance. If the next trench is full, reinforcements continue looking for a position farther forward.")},
    {TEXT("突击手携柄式手榴弹加入队列，擅长近距离清壕。烟幕与压制火力有助于接近，投掷仍有散布。"), TEXT("Assault men join the line with stick grenades for close trench fighting. Smoke and covering fire help them approach; throws still scatter."), TEXT("突击手携柄式手榴弹加入队列，擅长近距离清壕。烟幕与压制火力有助于接近，投掷仍有散布。")},
    {TEXT("突击手携柄式手榴弹加入队列，擅长近距离清壕。烟幕与压制火力有助于接近，投掷仍有散布。"), TEXT("Assault men join the line with stick grenades for close trench fighting. Smoke and covering fire help them approach; throws still scatter."), TEXT("Assault men join the line with stick grenades for close trench fighting. Smoke and covering fire help them approach; throws still scatter.")},
    {TEXT("突击手携柄式手榴弹加入队列，擅长近距离清壕。烟幕与压制火力有助于接近，投掷仍有散布。"), TEXT("Assault men join the line with stick grenades for close trench fighting. Smoke and covering fire help them approach; throws still scatter."), TEXT("步枪班旁多了携带柄式手榴弹的突击手。他们不是隔着无人区投弹的神射手；真正的机会来自烟幕、坑岸，以及被友军压住的壕口。")},
    {TEXT("突击手携柄式手榴弹加入队列，擅长近距离清壕。烟幕与压制火力有助于接近，投掷仍有散布。"), TEXT("Assault men join the line with stick grenades for close trench fighting. Smoke and covering fire help them approach; throws still scatter."), TEXT("Bombers carrying stick grenades now accompany the rifles. They cannot throw unerringly across no man's land: their chance comes from smoke, crater lips and a trench mouth suppressed by comrades.")},
    {TEXT("米尔斯 投弹班负责清理壕角与近处守军。手雷可越过低矮掩体，散布会危及附近友军。"), TEXT("Mills bombers clear traverses and close defenders. Grenades pass over low cover, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies."), TEXT("Mills 投弹班负责清理壕角与近处守军。手雷可越过低矮掩体，散布会危及附近友军。")},
    {TEXT("米尔斯 投弹班负责清理壕角与近处守军。手雷可越过低矮掩体，散布会危及附近友军。"), TEXT("Mills bombers clear traverses and close defenders. Grenades pass over low cover, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies."), TEXT("Mills bombers clear traverses and close defenders. Grenades pass over low cover, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies.")},
    {TEXT("米尔斯 投弹班负责清理壕角与近处守军。手雷可越过低矮掩体，散布会危及附近友军。"), TEXT("Mills bombers clear traverses and close defenders. Grenades pass over low cover, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies."), TEXT("投弹手带着 Mills 手榴弹来到本连。壕道的转角遮住步枪火线，手雷便有了用处；但雨水、紧张与奔跑都会让落点偏离预想。")},
    {TEXT("米尔斯 投弹班负责清理壕角与近处守军。手雷可越过低矮掩体，散布会危及附近友军。"), TEXT("Mills bombers clear traverses and close defenders. Grenades pass over low cover, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies."), TEXT("The company receives Mills bombs. A turn in the trench can conceal an enemy from rifle fire and make the grenade indispensable. Rain, fear and a running throw can all send it astray.")},
    {TEXT("机枪压住守军后，投弹班更易接近。友军须避开投掷区域。"), TEXT("Bombers approach more safely under suppressive fire. Keep friendly troops clear of the throwing area."), TEXT("机枪压住守军后，投弹班更易接近。友军须避开投掷区域。")},
    {TEXT("机枪压住守军后，投弹班更易接近。友军须避开投掷区域。"), TEXT("Bombers approach more safely under suppressive fire. Keep friendly troops clear of the throwing area."), TEXT("Bombers approach more safely under suppressive fire. Keep friendly troops clear of the throwing area.")},
    {TEXT("机枪压住守军后，投弹班更易接近。友军须避开投掷区域。"), TEXT("Bombers approach more safely under suppressive fire. Keep friendly troops clear of the throwing area."), TEXT("先压制，再接近。不要把投弹班单独送进机枪射界；贴得太近，手雷也会伤到自己人。")},
    {TEXT("机枪压住守军后，投弹班更易接近。友军须避开投掷区域。"), TEXT("Bombers approach more safely under suppressive fire. Keep friendly troops clear of the throwing area."), TEXT("Suppress first, then close. Never send bombers alone into a machine gun's field of fire. At very close range, their grenades can kill comrades too.")},
    {TEXT("MG 08/15 枪组抵达。机枪守住长射界，同伴掩护枪手；转移前需收枪，到位后重新架设。"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 crew arrives. Its gun covers long approaches while the escorts protect the gunner. Moving requires packing and redeployment."), TEXT("MG 08/15 枪组抵达。机枪守住长射界，同伴掩护枪手；转移前需收枪，到位后重新架设。")},
    {TEXT("MG 08/15 枪组抵达。机枪守住长射界，同伴掩护枪手；转移前需收枪，到位后重新架设。"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 crew arrives. Its gun covers long approaches while the escorts protect the gunner. Moving requires packing and redeployment."), TEXT("The MG 08/15 crew arrives. Its gun covers long approaches while the escorts protect the gunner. Moving requires packing and redeployment.")},
    {TEXT("MG 08/15 枪组抵达。机枪守住长射界，同伴掩护枪手；转移前需收枪，到位后重新架设。"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 crew arrives. Its gun covers long approaches while the escorts protect the gunner. Moving requires packing and redeployment."), TEXT("MG 08/15 组已配属。枪手负责火线，弹药手守住身侧；沉重的装备不适合追逐每一个目标，把它放在能看住通路的阵位。")},
    {TEXT("MG 08/15 枪组抵达。机枪守住长射界，同伴掩护枪手；转移前需收枪，到位后重新架设。"), TEXT("The MG 08/15 crew arrives. Its gun covers long approaches while the escorts protect the gunner. Moving requires packing and redeployment."), TEXT("An MG 08/15 section is attached. The gunner controls the lane while his ammunition bearer guards the flank. Heavy equipment cannot chase every target; place it where the route is in view.")},
    {TEXT("刘易斯枪组抵达，短点射为步枪班提供掩护。枪手停稳架设后开火，同伴留在身旁警戒。"), TEXT("The Lewis crew arrives with covering fire for the rifles. The gunner must halt and deploy before firing, with his escorts guarding the position."), TEXT("刘易斯枪组抵达，短点射为步枪班提供掩护。枪手停稳架设后开火，同伴留在身旁警戒。")},
    {TEXT("刘易斯枪组抵达，短点射为步枪班提供掩护。枪手停稳架设后开火，同伴留在身旁警戒。"), TEXT("The Lewis crew arrives with covering fire for the rifles. The gunner must halt and deploy before firing, with his escorts guarding the position."), TEXT("The Lewis crew arrives with covering fire for the rifles. The gunner must halt and deploy before firing, with his escorts guarding the position.")},
    {TEXT("刘易斯枪组抵达，短点射为步枪班提供掩护。枪手停稳架设后开火，同伴留在身旁警戒。"), TEXT("The Lewis crew arrives with covering fire for the rifles. The gunner must halt and deploy before firing, with his escorts guarding the position."), TEXT("刘易斯组终于跟上了本连。枪手用短促火力为步枪班争取抬头的机会，弹药手留在身边照应。机枪早已在战场上，这一次轮到你安排它的枪位。")},
    {TEXT("刘易斯枪组抵达，短点射为步枪班提供掩护。枪手停稳架设后开火，同伴留在身旁警戒。"), TEXT("The Lewis crew arrives with covering fire for the rifles. The gunner must halt and deploy before firing, with his escorts guarding the position."), TEXT("The Lewis section has caught up with the company. Short bursts give the riflemen a chance to raise their heads, while the ammunition bearer stays close. Machine guns already rule this battlefield; now you must choose where yours will speak.")},
    {TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。"), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap."), TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪分队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。")},
    {TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。"), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap."), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap.")},
    {TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。"), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap."), TEXT("机枪留壕掩护，步枪分队推进。点射间隙与换弹都是真实的空当，别让枪位独自承受反击。")},
    {TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。"), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap."), TEXT("Leave machine guns covering from the trench while rifles advance. Bursts and reloads leave real gaps. Do not leave a gun position to face a counterattack alone.")},
    {TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。"), TEXT("Machine guns cover from the trench as rifles advance. Reloading and movement interrupt fire; neighbouring troops cover the gap."), TEXT("机枪据壕掩护，步枪小队推进。换弹与转移时火力中断，需要相邻部队接替。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先寻找暴露的机枪手。瞄准需要时间与清楚视线，近敌和压制会打断射击。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise exposed machine gunners. Aimed fire requires time and a clear view; close enemies and suppression disrupt it."), TEXT("精确射手优先寻找暴露的机枪手。瞄准需要时间与清楚视线，近敌和压制会打断射击。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先寻找暴露的机枪手。瞄准需要时间与清楚视线，近敌和压制会打断射击。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise exposed machine gunners. Aimed fire requires time and a clear view; close enemies and suppression disrupt it."), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise exposed machine gunners. Aimed fire requires time and a clear view; close enemies and suppression disrupt it.")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先寻找暴露的机枪手。瞄准需要时间与清楚视线，近敌和压制会打断射击。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise exposed machine gunners. Aimed fire requires time and a clear view; close enemies and suppression disrupt it."), TEXT("精确射手会耐心寻找露出的枪手与观察位置。泥泞中的远处人影并不总是好目标；守住视线，才能让慢而稳的一枪值得等待。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先寻找暴露的机枪手。瞄准需要时间与清楚视线，近敌和压制会打断射击。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise exposed machine gunners. Aimed fire requires time and a clear view; close enemies and suppression disrupt it."), TEXT("Marksmen patiently seek exposed gunners and observation posts. A distant shape in the mud is not always a useful target. A clear line of sight makes a slow, deliberate shot worth the wait.")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range.")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("精确射手负责压制敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("Marksmen counter enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training equips them with longer-ranged scoped SMLEs.")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("精确射手加入连队，专门留意敌人的机枪。军士提醒他：先看清，再扣扳机；镜瞄装备仍要经过作战室的专门操练。")},
    {TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"), TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."), TEXT("Marksmen join the company to watch the enemy's guns. The sergeant insists: identify first, fire second. Telescopic sights still require specialist training in the operations room.")},
    {TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。"), TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats."), TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。")},
    {TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。"), TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats."), TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats.")},
    {TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。"), TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats."), TEXT("让射手停在有遮蔽的观察位置。烟幕会同时挡住双方；不要指望隔着浓烟辨认枪手。")},
    {TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。"), TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats."), TEXT("Keep marksmen at sheltered observation positions. Smoke blinds both armies; do not expect them to identify a gunner through a dense screen.")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving.")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("士官联络相邻枪位，提高命中率并缓解压制。升级为军官后，指挥收益增强，行进中也能重整部队。")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("The NCO links neighbouring posts, improving aim and relieving suppression. Commissioning strengthens his command and allows rally orders while moving.")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("指挥组赶到后，零散的枪位重新有了联络。士官把被压住的人喊回岗位；经任命的军官能伴随推进下令，身边的步枪手仍要负责掩护。")},
    {TEXT("军士提高附近友军命中率，帮助受压制的部队重整。晋升为军官后，指挥加成增强，行进中也能重整部队。"), TEXT("NCOs improve nearby accuracy and rally suppressed troops. Promotion strengthens the command bonus and allows officers to rally troops while moving."), TEXT("The command section restores contact between scattered gun positions. NCOs call pinned men back to their posts. Commissioned officers can give orders on the move, but nearby riflemen must still protect them.")},
    {TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。"), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction."), TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。")},
    {TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。"), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction."), TEXT("The sergeant rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction.")},
    {TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。"), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction."), TEXT("军士带着指挥组来到前沿。他的口令能让被火力压住的人重新行动；经过任命后，军官以手枪自卫，把更多注意力留给观察与指挥。")},
    {TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。"), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction."), TEXT("The sergeant brings his command section forward. His orders can get suppressed men moving again. Once commissioned, an officer carries a pistol for protection and gives more attention to observation and command.")},
    {TEXT("军士重整附近部队，提高命中率并缓解压制。战地委任后指挥范围扩大，完成观察研习还可校射炮火。"), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction."), TEXT("The NCO rallies nearby troops, improving aim and relieving suppression. A field commission extends his reach; observation training adds fire correction.")},
    {TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。"), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range."), TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。")},
    {TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。"), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range."), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range.")},
    {TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。"), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range."), TEXT("指挥组靠近需要帮助的部队，别让组长第一个冲出壕口。命令能缓解压制，不能救回阵亡者。")},
    {TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。"), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range."), TEXT("Command sections improve nearby aim and relieve suppression. Protect the leader.")},
    {TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。"), TEXT("Gold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders. The bonus ends if he dies, is heavily suppressed or leaves command range."), TEXT("金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥小队。组长阵亡、受重压或离开范围后，指挥加成失效。")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("修理队改进缴获战车的整备流程。\nCaptured Mark IV 整备时间缩短 15%，A7V 缩短 5%。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews improve preparation of captured tanks.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness time is reduced by 15%, A7V by 5%. Armour types share readiness.")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("缴获战车回到工场，修理队备好熟悉的零件。\n缴获 Mark IV 整备缩短 15%，A7V 缩短 5%。各型装甲共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("Captured tanks return to workshops stocked with familiar parts.\nCaptured Mark IVs prepare 15% sooner; A7Vs, 5% sooner. All armour shares readiness.")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("修车工逐渐摸清缴获车辆的脾气。缴获马克IV各配置整备缩短15%，A7V缩短5%；装甲仍共用整备队列。")},
    {TEXT("修理队逐辆试车，缴获车辆的备件分装入箱。\n缴获的 Mark IV 整备 −15%\nA7V 整备 −5%"), TEXT("Repair crews test the captured vehicles and pack their spare parts.\nCaptured Mark IV readiness −15%\nA7V readiness −5%"), TEXT("Captured machines need familiar hands. Captured Mark IV configurations prepare 15% faster; A7V crews prepare 5% faster. The armour queue remains shared.")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("车组和备件提前就位。\n所有装甲整备时间缩短 10%，两个槽位共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("Crews and spare parts are prepared in advance.\nAll armour readiness time is reduced by 10%; both slots share readiness.")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("发动机、备件与车组集中待命。\n所有装甲整备缩短 10%，两个槽位共用整备。")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("Engines, stores and crews assemble in one place.\nAll armour prepares 10% sooner. Both slots share readiness.")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("修车工将引擎、备件与车组留在一处。所有装甲整备缩短10%，两格仍共用队列。")},
    {TEXT("车组到场，备件箱放在发动机舱旁。\n所有装甲整备 −10%"), TEXT("Crews report; spare parts wait beside the engine compartment.\nAll armour readiness −10%"), TEXT("Fitters keep engines, stores and crews together. All armour preparation is 10% shorter; both slots still share one queue.")},
    {TEXT("备用销轴送到车旁，履带节在泥里逐一接合。断履之后，只有炮声在接近。\n履带耐久 +18%\n抢修恢复强化后半数耐久"), TEXT("Spare pins arrive beside the tank; links are joined in the mud. With a track shed, only the shellfire draws closer.\nTrack durability +18%\nField repair restores half the reinforced durability"), TEXT("加强履带并配发抢修备件。\n履带耐久提高 18%，维修可恢复强化后的一半耐久；车体防护不变。")},
    {TEXT("备用销轴送到车旁，履带节在泥里逐一接合。断履之后，只有炮声在接近。\n履带耐久 +18%\n抢修恢复强化后半数耐久"), TEXT("Spare pins arrive beside the tank; links are joined in the mud. With a track shed, only the shellfire draws closer.\nTrack durability +18%\nField repair restores half the reinforced durability"), TEXT("Reinforces tracks and supplies repair parts.\nTrack durability rises by 18%; repairs restore half the reinforced durability. Hull protection is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("回收队卸下备用履带节，车组扶正断裂的接头。\n履带耐久 +25%\n抢修恢复强化后半数耐久"), TEXT("The recovery crew unloads spare links while the tank crew aligns the broken joint.\nTrack durability +25%\nField repair restores half the reinforced durability"), TEXT("回收分队配发履带节和销轴。\n履带耐久提高 25%，维修可恢复强化后的一半耐久；车体防护不变。")},
    {TEXT("回收队卸下备用履带节，车组扶正断裂的接头。\n履带耐久 +25%\n抢修恢复强化后半数耐久"), TEXT("The recovery crew unloads spare links while the tank crew aligns the broken joint.\nTrack durability +25%\nField repair restores half the reinforced durability"), TEXT("Recovery crews receive track links and pins.\nTrack durability rises by 25%; repairs restore half the reinforced durability. Hull protection is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("铆钉打入补强件，机枪枪座重新试转。\n车载机枪耐久 +35%"), TEXT("Rivets fasten the reinforcement; the gun mounting is tested again.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +35%"), TEXT("补强车载机枪枪座。\n机枪耐久提高 35%，车体和履带耐久不变。")},
    {TEXT("铆钉打入补强件，机枪枪座重新试转。\n车载机枪耐久 +35%"), TEXT("Rivets fasten the reinforcement; the gun mounting is tested again.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +35%"), TEXT("Reinforces vehicle machine-gun mounts.\nMachine-gun durability rises by 35%; hull and track durability are unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("钢制护板装在射孔旁，车组核对枪座间隙。\n车载机枪耐久 +20%"), TEXT("Steel plates go beside the firing ports; the crew checks the mounting clearance.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +20%"), TEXT("增设机枪防护板。\n车载机枪耐久提高 20%，车体防护不变。")},
    {TEXT("钢制护板装在射孔旁，车组核对枪座间隙。\n车载机枪耐久 +20%"), TEXT("Steel plates go beside the firing ports; the crew checks the mounting clearance.\nVehicle machine-gun durability +20%"), TEXT("Adds machine-gun protection plates.\nVehicle machine-gun durability rises by 20%; hull protection is unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("炮手报出射击次序，装填手把炮弹送入膛内。\n坦克炮装填时间 −8%"), TEXT("The gunner calls the firing order; the loader feeds a round into the breech.\nTank cannon reload time −8%"), TEXT("加强炮组装填训练。\n坦克炮装填时间缩短 8%，精度和爆炸范围不变。")},
    {TEXT("炮手报出射击次序，装填手把炮弹送入膛内。\n坦克炮装填时间 −8%"), TEXT("The gunner calls the firing order; the loader feeds a round into the breech.\nTank cannon reload time −8%"), TEXT("Improves gun-crew loading drills.\nTank cannon reload time is reduced by 8%; accuracy and blast radius are unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组随口令推弹，空弹壳移到脚边。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("Sponson crews load on the word of command and move spent cases aside.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("加强侧舱炮组协同训练。\n坦克炮装填时间缩短 12%，精度和爆炸范围不变。")},
    {TEXT("侧舱炮组随口令推弹，空弹壳移到脚边。\n坦克炮装填时间 −12%"), TEXT("Sponson crews load on the word of command and move spent cases aside.\nTank cannon reload time −12%"), TEXT("Improves sponson gun-crew coordination.\nTank cannon reload time is reduced by 12%; accuracy and blast radius are unchanged.")},
    {TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。战车过去，还须给担架留出路。\n解锁工兵配置，占一个装甲位；两名工兵清障、维修\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%\n工兵阵亡后停止作业"), TEXT("Sappers follow the female tank over the trench lip, cutters at their belts. A passage must remain for the stretchers.\nEngineer configuration in one armour slot; two pioneers clear obstacles and repair\nShortest readiness; no anti-tank cannon. Machine-gun burst recovery +75%\nWork stops if the pioneers are killed"), TEXT("两名工兵随雌型 Mark IV 进入前沿。\n解锁工兵伴随配置，占一个装甲位。工兵可清障、维修，阵亡后停止作业。\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。")},
    {TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。战车过去，还须给担架留出路。\n解锁工兵配置，占一个装甲位；两名工兵清障、维修\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%\n工兵阵亡后停止作业"), TEXT("Sappers follow the female tank over the trench lip, cutters at their belts. A passage must remain for the stretchers.\nEngineer configuration in one armour slot; two pioneers clear obstacles and repair\nShortest readiness; no anti-tank cannon. Machine-gun burst recovery +75%\nWork stops if the pioneers are killed"), TEXT("Two pioneers accompany a female Mark IV to the front.\nUnlocks the engineer configuration in one armour slot. The pioneers clear obstacles and make repairs while alive.\nThe shortest preparation, no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。战车过去，还须给担架留出路。\n解锁工兵配置，占一个装甲位；两名工兵清障、维修\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%\n工兵阵亡后停止作业"), TEXT("Sappers follow the female tank over the trench lip, cutters at their belts. A passage must remain for the stretchers.\nEngineer configuration in one armour slot; two pioneers clear obstacles and repair\nShortest readiness; no anti-tank cannon. Machine-gun burst recovery +75%\nWork stops if the pioneers are killed"), TEXT("铁丝网与断裂履带，需要车外的人来处理。解锁雌型马克IV工兵配属：两名真实工兵随车赶来，能够清障、维修，也会阵亡。占一个装甲位；工程纵队整备最快，但没有反坦克炮，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
    {TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。战车过去，还须给担架留出路。\n解锁工兵配置，占一个装甲位；两名工兵清障、维修\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%\n工兵阵亡后停止作业"), TEXT("Sappers follow the female tank over the trench lip, cutters at their belts. A passage must remain for the stretchers.\nEngineer configuration in one armour slot; two pioneers clear obstacles and repair\nShortest readiness; no anti-tank cannon. Machine-gun burst recovery +75%\nWork stops if the pioneers are killed"), TEXT("Wire and disabled tracks demand men outside the armour. Unlocks a female Mark IV with two dismounted pioneers. They can clear obstacles and repair modules, and can be killed. Uses one armour slot; its prepared engineering column has the shortest shared preparation, but no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("工兵随雌型战车穿过壕沿，剪钳挂在腰间。战车过去，还须给担架留出路。\n解锁工兵配置，占一个装甲位；两名工兵清障、维修\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%\n工兵阵亡后停止作业"), TEXT("Sappers follow the female tank over the trench lip, cutters at their belts. A passage must remain for the stretchers.\nEngineer configuration in one armour slot; two pioneers clear obstacles and repair\nShortest readiness; no anti-tank cannon. Machine-gun burst recovery +75%\nWork stops if the pioneers are killed"), TEXT("Two pioneers accompany a female Mark IV to the front.\nUnlocks the engineer configuration in one armour slot. The pioneers clear obstacles and make repairs. Work stops if they are killed.\nThe shortest preparation, no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen\n配属资格：1918 年行动；无反坦克炮，仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior.\nUnlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration\nEligibility: 1918 operations; no anti-tank cannon. Only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501 的早期配置以机枪取代前炮。\n解锁 1918 年行动中的八机枪型 Gretchen，无反坦克炮。同时仅一辆在役。")},
    {TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen\n配属资格：1918 年行动；无反坦克炮，仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior.\nUnlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration\nEligibility: 1918 operations; no anti-tank cannon. Only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501's early configuration carried machine guns in place of the front cannon.\nUnlocks the eight-gun Gretchen for 1918 operations. No anti-tank cannon; only one may be active.")},
    {TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen\n配属资格：1918 年行动；无反坦克炮，仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior.\nUnlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration\nEligibility: 1918 operations; no anti-tank cannon. Only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501曾以机枪替代前炮参战。解锁1918年行动中的八机枪配置，同时只能有一辆在役；没有反坦克炮。")},
    {TEXT("前部射孔换装双机枪，弹带箱填满车内。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪型 Gretchen\n配属资格：1918 年行动；无反坦克炮，仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin guns fill the front ports; belt boxes occupy the interior.\nUnlocks A7V 501 in the eight-gun Gretchen configuration\nEligibility: 1918 operations; no anti-tank cannon. Only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501 served briefly with machine guns in place of the forward cannon. Unlocks its original eight-gun configuration in the 1918 operations. Only one may be active. No anti-tank cannon.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male from August 1918\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV; longer readiness"), TEXT("Mark V 改进了菱形战车的操纵机构。\n解锁 1918 年八月起的雄型配置。机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male from August 1918\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV; longer readiness"), TEXT("The Mark V improves the steering of the rhomboid tank.\nUnlocks the male configuration from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, with longer preparation.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male from August 1918\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV; longer readiness"), TEXT("马克V为菱形战车带来改进的操纵机构。1918年八月攻势起可配属雄型；更好的机动与防护，以更长整备换取。马克IV仍是较快抵达的选择。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male from August 1918\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV; longer readiness"), TEXT("The Mark V brings improved steering to the rhomboid tank. Unlocks the male configuration for the August 1918 offensive. Better mobility and protection cost a longer preparation; it does not replace the cheaper Mark IV.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male from August 1918\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV; longer readiness"), TEXT("Mark V 改进了菱形战车的操纵机构。\n解锁 1918 年 8 月起的雄型配置。机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack.")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("步兵观察车体两侧的死角。\n九米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%。同类加成不叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("Infantry watch the ground hidden beside the hull.\nLiving friendly infantry within nine metres give tank machine guns 10% more accuracy. The bonus does not stack.")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("步兵替驾驶员盯住看不见的地面。有友军步兵在九米内掩护时，坦克机枪命中提高10%；多支部队不会叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("Infantry watch the ground the driver cannot see. A tank's machine guns gain 10% accuracy while living friendly infantry are within nine metres. Multiple sections do not stack this benefit.")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("工兵把备用枪机送到受损枪位。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久。需连续作业 8 秒，且十一米内无敌军。车体无法维修。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("Pioneers bring a spare action to the disabled gun mount.\nOne machine gun per tank can be restored to half strength. Requires 8 uninterrupted seconds with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("工兵可为每辆车抢修一个损坏机枪，恢复一半耐久。需在车旁连续作业八秒，且十一米内没有敌人；不能修复车体。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable"), TEXT("Pioneers can restore one disabled machine gun per vehicle to half strength. Requires eight uninterrupted seconds beside the tank, with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks.")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. More mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, with longer preparation. Infantry must guard the flanks.")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("里卡多发动机与新的传动机构减轻了驾驶员的负担。双侧炮攻打坚固阵位、迎击装甲；机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备更久，仍需步兵守住侧翼。")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("The Ricardo engine and epicyclic transmission ease the driver's burden. Twin sponson guns break strongpoints and fight armour. Faster and tougher than a Mark IV, but slower to prepare; infantry must still guard its flanks.")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks"), TEXT("新的传动机构让驾驶员独自操纵车身。双侧炮适合突破坚固阵位，整备更久；近侧仍需步兵守护。")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts.")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest preparation, with 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("雌型车掩护两名皇家工兵穿过空地。工兵剪开铁丝、清除地雷并抢修履带；一旦阵亡，清障与修理便随之停止。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A female tank shelters two Royal Engineers on the approach. They clear wire and mines and repair broken tracks. Protect them: casualties end their work. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest armour preparation, traded for 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳在车后剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The female tank covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire behind it.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nFive machine guns, no cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("雌型车掩护两名随车工兵清除铁丝、地雷并抢修履带。工兵会阵亡；已编成的工程纵队整备最快，但工程补给挤占弹药，机枪连射后的补给间隔更长。")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置，前部双机枪取代主炮。\n密集火力克制步兵，无法损伤坦克车体。同时仅一辆在役。")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active"), TEXT("A7V 501 in its eight-gun configuration, with twin front guns replacing the cannon.\nConcentrated fire counters infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active.")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active"), TEXT("501 号 Gretchen 的罕见机枪配置。前部双机枪取代主炮，近处步兵承受密集扫射；遇到火炮坦克必须依靠反坦克火力。同一时间仅配属一辆。")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active"), TEXT("The rare machine-gun configuration of A7V 501. Twin front guns replace the cannon for close infantry fighting. Cannot duel cannon tanks; only one Gretchen may be active at a time.")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active"), TEXT("前部双机枪取代火炮的罕见雌型配置。近距多枪位反步兵，无反坦克火炮；同一时间仅配属一辆。")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts.")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A repaired captured female covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. No cannon. The shortest preparation, with 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名工兵前进。工兵打开铁丝与雷区通路，并能抢修履带；保存他们，通路才能保持畅通。没有主炮；工程纵队整备最快，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A repaired female tank shelters two Pioniere. They open wire and mine lanes and can restore a broken track. Keep them alive to keep the advance moving. No cannon. This ready engineering column has the shortest armour preparation, but 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("修理后的缴获战车驶向残障，工兵跟在侧后。\n两名德军工兵清障、抢修履带；阵亡后停止作业\n无主炮；整备最快，点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The repaired captured tank heads for the wire with pioneers beside its rear.\nTwo pioneers clear obstacles and repair tracks; work stops on their death\nNo cannon; shortest readiness, burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("缴获雌型掩护两名工兵打开障碍带、抢修履带。车身没有反坦克炮，整备快于战斗坦克，工程补给使机枪点射间隔更长；工兵仍会阵亡。")},
    {TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"), TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."), TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。")},
    {TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"), TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."), TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded.")},
