    {TEXT("梅西讷攻击前，测绘员复核爆破点。澳新邻段送来接合部草图，炮兵据此修订火力表。"), TEXT("Before Messines, surveyors check the mine positions. A sketch from the neighbouring ANZAC sector helps the batteries revise their fire plan."), TEXT("Before Messines, surveyors check the mine positions. A sketch from the neighbouring ANZAC sector helps the batteries revise their fire plan.")},
