    {TEXT("坚实田地、长射界与密集兴登堡防线铁丝并存。"), TEXT("Firm fields and long sightlines meet dense Hindenburg Line wire."), TEXT("Firmer ground permits quick moves. Long sightlines expose machine guns and give telescopic riflemen their chance.")},
