    {TEXT("清除敌军后方守军，整队越过交通线；或击溃敌军士气。"), TEXT("Clear the enemy rearguard and cross the communications line with a whole surviving section, or break enemy morale."), TEXT("肃清敌军后沿并整队突破，或击溃敌军士气。")},
