    {TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，德军在塞勒河一带组织后卫。铁路运送物资并掩护撤离；装甲列车只能沿连通轨道行动，步兵须守住铁路通路。"), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached and German rearguards hold the Selle. The railway carries supplies and covers the evacuation. The armoured train needs connected track, with infantry guarding its approaches."), TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，德军在塞勒河一带组织后卫。铁路运送物资并掩护撤离；装甲列车只能沿连通轨道行动，步兵须守住铁路通路。")},
    {TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，德军在塞勒河一带组织后卫。铁路运送物资并掩护撤离；装甲列车只能沿连通轨道行动，步兵须守住铁路通路。"), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached and German rearguards hold the Selle. The railway carries supplies and covers the evacuation. The armoured train needs connected track, with infantry guarding its approaches."), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached and German rearguards hold the Selle. The railway carries supplies and covers the evacuation. The armoured train needs connected track, with infantry guarding its approaches.")},
    {TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，德军在塞勒河一带组织后卫。铁路运送物资并掩护撤离；装甲列车只能沿连通轨道行动，步兵须守住铁路通路。"), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached and German rearguards hold the Selle. The railway carries supplies and covers the evacuation. The armoured train needs connected track, with infantry guarding its approaches."), TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，塞勒河一带成为新的后卫阵地。铁路把撤运与火力绑在一起：装甲列车只能沿仍然连通的轨道行动，护路比盲目向前更重要。")},
    {TEXT("兴登堡防线已被突破，德军在塞勒河一带组织后卫。铁路运送物资并掩护撤离；装甲列车只能沿连通轨道行动，步兵须守住铁路通路。"), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached and German rearguards hold the Selle. The railway carries supplies and covers the evacuation. The armoured train needs connected track, with infantry guarding its approaches."), TEXT("The Hindenburg Line has been breached. The Selle becomes a new rearguard position. Rail binds evacuation and firepower together: an armoured train can move only along connected track. Guarding the route matters more than a blind advance.")},
    {TEXT("澳大利亚军团在十月初得到休整，其他部队继续渡过塞勒河。命令要求本连控制铁路切口。敌方装甲列车掩护着最后的撤运通路，炮兵必须先压住车上的枪口。"), TEXT("The Australian Corps is relieved in early October while other formations cross the Selle. Your company must secure the railway cutting. An enemy armoured train covers the last evacuation route; the artillery must first silence its guns."), TEXT("澳大利亚军团在十月初得到休整，其他部队继续渡过塞勒河。命令要求本连控制铁路切口。敌方装甲列车掩护着最后的撤运通路，炮兵必须先压住车上的枪口。")},
