    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Arras, 1917"), TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917")},
    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Arras, 1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Arras, 1917")},
    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，一九一五年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from nineteen fifteen. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915年起统率第三集团军。阿拉斯攻势中，他试图以密集炮火打开斯卡普河谷；雪幕下的突进很快又受到德军阵地与补给距离的牵制。")},
    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，一九一五年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from nineteen fifteen. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("A cavalry officer who commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras he sought to open the Scarpe valley with concentrated artillery. The advance through snow soon met the limits imposed by German positions and lengthening supply routes.")},
    {TEXT("赫伯特·普卢默"), TEXT("Herbert Plumer"), TEXT("赫伯特·普卢默")},
    {TEXT("赫伯特·普卢默"), TEXT("Herbert Plumer"), TEXT("Herbert Plumer")},
    {TEXT("英军第二集团军 · 梅西讷，1917"), TEXT("British Second Army · Messines, 1917"), TEXT("英军第二集团军 · 梅西讷，1917")},
    {TEXT("英军第二集团军 · 梅西讷，1917"), TEXT("British Second Army · Messines, 1917"), TEXT("British Second Army · Messines, 1917")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("一位重视周密准备的集团军司令。梅西讷的地道、炮兵与步兵计划在他麾下合为一体：先夺山脊，再稳固阵地，让反击撞上已经转向的炮口。")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("An army commander known for thorough preparation. At Messines he brought mining, artillery and infantry plans together: take the ridge, consolidate, then meet the counterattack with guns already trained on its approach.")},
    {TEXT("休伯特·高夫"), TEXT("Hubert Gough"), TEXT("休伯特·高夫")},
    {TEXT("休伯特·高夫"), TEXT("Hubert Gough"), TEXT("Hubert Gough")},
    {TEXT("英军第五集团军 · 伊普尔与圣康坦"), TEXT("British Fifth Army · Ypres and St Quentin"), TEXT("英军第五集团军 · 伊普尔与圣康坦")},
    {TEXT("英军第五集团军 · 伊普尔与圣康坦"), TEXT("British Fifth Army · Ypres and St Quentin"), TEXT("British Fifth Army · Ypres and St Quentin")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。一九一八年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In nineteen seventeen, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring nineteen eighteen, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("1917年，他指挥第五集团军向皮尔肯山脊进攻；1918年春，同一支部队又被拉到漫长的圣康坦正面。从追求突破到掩护撤退，他的战绩始终伴随着激烈争议。")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。一九一八年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In nineteen seventeen, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring nineteen eighteen, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("He led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge in 1917. In spring 1918 the same army held an extended front around St Quentin. From seeking a breakthrough to covering a retreat, his record remained fiercely disputed.")},
    {TEXT("朱利安·宾"), TEXT("Julian Byng"), TEXT("朱利安·宾")},
    {TEXT("朱利安·宾"), TEXT("Julian Byng"), TEXT("Julian Byng")},
    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 康布雷，1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Cambrai, 1917"), TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 康布雷，1917")},
    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 康布雷，1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Cambrai, 1917"), TEXT("British Third Army · Cambrai, 1917")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("曾率加拿大军攻取维米岭，随后接掌第三集团军。康布雷的坦克、步兵与炮火协同显示了新的突破可能；十天后的德军反击，也暴露了突出部难以巩固的代价。")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("After commanding the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took over Third Army. Cambrai showed the promise of tanks, infantry and artillery working together. The German counterattack ten days later exposed the cost of holding a vulnerable salient.")},
    {TEXT("亨利·罗林森"), TEXT("Henry Rawlinson"), TEXT("亨利·罗林森")},
    {TEXT("亨利·罗林森"), TEXT("Henry Rawlinson"), TEXT("Henry Rawlinson")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 亚眠，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Amiens, 1918"), TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 亚眠，1918")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 亚眠，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Amiens, 1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Amiens, 1918")},
    {TEXT("一九一八年八月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进；法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August nineteen eighteen, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme after concealed preparations, supported by tanks and guns. French First Army fought on their southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("1918年8月，他在亚眠组织第四集团军的突击。英国第三军与澳大利亚、加拿大两军分据索姆河两侧，在隐蔽集结与炮坦协同下展开攻势；法国第一集团军在南翼并肩作战。")},
    {TEXT("一九一八年八月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进；法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August nineteen eighteen, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme after concealed preparations, supported by tanks and guns. French First Army fought on their southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("He organised Fourth Army's attack at Amiens in August 1918. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced on either side of the Somme after concealed preparations, with coordinated guns and tanks. French First Army fought on the southern flank.")},
    {TEXT("路德维希·冯·法尔肯豪森"), TEXT("Ludwig von Falkenhausen"), TEXT("路德维希·冯·法尔肯豪森")},
    {TEXT("路德维希·冯·法尔肯豪森"), TEXT("Ludwig von Falkenhausen"), TEXT("Ludwig von Falkenhausen")},
    {TEXT("德军第六集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917"), TEXT("German Sixth Army · Arras, 1917"), TEXT("德军第六集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917")},
    {TEXT("德军第六集团军 · 阿拉斯，1917"), TEXT("German Sixth Army · Arras, 1917"), TEXT("German Sixth Army · Arras, 1917")},
    {TEXT("这位普奥、普法战争老将于一九一七年四月率第六集团军守卫阿拉斯。阵地与预备队未能止住英军最初的突进；他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。"), TEXT("A veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars, he commanded Sixth Army at Arras in April nineteen seventeen. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance. He left his front-line command that month."), TEXT("经历过普奥、普法战争的普鲁士老将。1917年4月，他统率第六集团军面对阿拉斯攻势。阵地与预备队未能及时止住英军最初的突入，他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。")},
    {TEXT("这位普奥、普法战争老将于一九一七年四月率第六集团军守卫阿拉斯。阵地与预备队未能止住英军最初的突进；他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。"), TEXT("A veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars, he commanded Sixth Army at Arras in April nineteen seventeen. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance. He left his front-line command that month."), TEXT("A Prussian veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars. Sixth Army faced the Arras offensive under his command in April 1917. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance; he left his front-line command that month.")},
    {TEXT("弗里德里希·西克斯特·冯·阿尔明"), TEXT("Friedrich Sixt von Armin"), TEXT("弗里德里希·西克斯特·冯·阿尔明")},
    {TEXT("弗里德里希·西克斯特·冯·阿尔明"), TEXT("Friedrich Sixt von Armin"), TEXT("Friedrich Sixt von Armin")},
    {TEXT("德军第四集团军 · 佛兰德，1917"), TEXT("German Fourth Army · Flanders, 1917"), TEXT("德军第四集团军 · 佛兰德，1917")},
    {TEXT("德军第四集团军 · 佛兰德，1917"), TEXT("German Fourth Army · Flanders, 1917"), TEXT("German Fourth Army · Flanders, 1917")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。"), TEXT("In nineteen seventeen, his Fourth Army defended Flanders. At Messines and Ypres, concrete posts, positions in depth and counterattack troops faced Allied mines and artillery. The fighting in the mud cost his army heavily."), TEXT("1917年指挥第四集团军守卫佛兰德。从梅西讷山脊到伊普尔突出部，他的部队依托混凝土据点、纵深阵地与反击部队抵挡协约国攻势，也承受了矿坑与泥海中的惨重消耗。")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。"), TEXT("In nineteen seventeen, his Fourth Army defended Flanders. At Messines and Ypres, concrete posts, positions in depth and counterattack troops faced Allied mines and artillery. The fighting in the mud cost his army heavily."), TEXT("He commanded Fourth Army in Flanders in 1917. From Messines Ridge to the Ypres salient, his troops relied on concrete strongpoints, defence in depth and counterattacks, enduring severe losses among the mine craters and mud.")},
    {TEXT("格奥尔格·冯·德·马维茨"), TEXT("Georg von der Marwitz"), TEXT("格奥尔格·冯·德·马维茨")},
    {TEXT("格奥尔格·冯·德·马维茨"), TEXT("Georg von der Marwitz"), TEXT("Georg von der Marwitz")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 康布雷至亚眠"), TEXT("German Second Army · Cambrai to Amiens"), TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 康布雷至亚眠")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 康布雷至亚眠"), TEXT("German Second Army · Cambrai to Amiens"), TEXT("German Second Army · Cambrai to Amiens")},
    {TEXT("他的第二集团军参加了一九一七年康布雷反击与一九一八年春的米夏埃尔攻势。到亚眠，进攻者转为守军，面对协约国炮兵、坦克与步兵的协同突击。"), TEXT("His Second Army fought in the Cambrai counterattack of nineteen seventeen and the Michael offensive in spring nineteen eighteen. At Amiens, the attackers had become defenders, facing coordinated Allied artillery, tanks and infantry."), TEXT("第二集团军司令。1917年康布雷反击、1918年春的迈克尔攻势，都有他麾下部队的身影；到了亚眠，这支军队转而面对协约国的炮兵、坦克和步兵协同突击。")},
    {TEXT("他的第二集团军参加了一九一七年康布雷反击与一九一八年春的米夏埃尔攻势。到亚眠，进攻者转为守军，面对协约国炮兵、坦克与步兵的协同突击。"), TEXT("His Second Army fought in the Cambrai counterattack of nineteen seventeen and the Michael offensive in spring nineteen eighteen. At Amiens, the attackers had become defenders, facing coordinated Allied artillery, tanks and infantry."), TEXT("Commander of Second Army. His formations fought in the Cambrai counterattack of 1917 and Operation Michael in spring 1918. At Amiens they instead faced an Allied assault combining artillery, tanks and infantry.")},
    {TEXT("亨利·霍恩"), TEXT("Henry Horne"), TEXT("亨利·霍恩")},
    {TEXT("亨利·霍恩"), TEXT("Henry Horne"), TEXT("Henry Horne")},
    {TEXT("英军第一集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918"), TEXT("British First Army · Scarpe, 1918"), TEXT("英军第一集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918")},
    {TEXT("英军第一集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918"), TEXT("British First Army · Scarpe, 1918"), TEXT("British First Army · Scarpe, 1918")},
    {TEXT("八月二十六日，他的第一集团军以加拿大军展开斯卡尔普攻势。部队越过旧阵地向东推进；炮兵与补给仍要沿破损道路跟进。"), TEXT("On twenty-six August, the Canadian Corps of his First Army opened the Scarpe attack. Troops advanced east through the old positions; guns and supplies still had to follow over damaged roads."), TEXT("第一集团军司令。八月二十六日，他的部队以加拿大军为先导，在斯卡尔普河与桑塞河掩护的翼侧向东推进。眼前的任务是越过旧阵地，让炮兵与补给跟上持续变化的战线。")},
    {TEXT("八月二十六日，他的第一集团军以加拿大军展开斯卡尔普攻势。部队越过旧阵地向东推进；炮兵与补给仍要沿破损道路跟进。"), TEXT("On twenty-six August, the Canadian Corps of his First Army opened the Scarpe attack. Troops advanced east through the old positions; guns and supplies still had to follow over damaged roads."), TEXT("Commander of First Army. On 26 August his troops advanced east with the Canadian Corps in the lead and their flanks protected by the Scarpe and Sensee rivers. The task was to cross old positions while bringing guns and supplies up behind the moving front.")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918"), TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918")},
    {TEXT("第四集团军从亚眠推进到兴登堡防线。澳大利亚与配属美军在贝利库尔作战；深切的运河渡口需要炮兵、步兵与工兵协同。防线终于被打开。"), TEXT("Fourth Army advanced from Amiens to the Hindenburg Line. Australians and attached American troops fought at Bellicourt; the deeply cut canal demanded cooperation between guns, infantry and engineers. The line was eventually broken."), TEXT("第四集团军由亚眠继续向兴登堡防线推进。澳大利亚与配属美军在贝利库尔作战，其他渡口同样需要炮火、步兵与工兵配合；运河的深切地形让每一条通路都至关重要。")},
    {TEXT("第四集团军从亚眠推进到兴登堡防线。澳大利亚与配属美军在贝利库尔作战；深切的运河渡口需要炮兵、步兵与工兵协同。防线终于被打开。"), TEXT("Fourth Army advanced from Amiens to the Hindenburg Line. Australians and attached American troops fought at Bellicourt; the deeply cut canal demanded cooperation between guns, infantry and engineers. The line was eventually broken."), TEXT("Fourth Army advanced from Amiens towards the Hindenburg Line. Australian and attached American troops fought at Bellicourt, while other crossings also demanded close cooperation between gunners, infantry and pioneers. The deep canal cutting made every approach vital.")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 塞勒河，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Selle, 1918"), TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 塞勒河，1918")},
    {TEXT("英军第四集团军 · 塞勒河，1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Selle, 1918"), TEXT("British Fourth Army · Selle, 1918")},
    {TEXT("突破兴登堡防线后，他率第四集团军追到塞勒河。桥头、村落和道路重新成为争夺目标；炮兵与邻军保持联络，部队继续越过河谷向东推进。"), TEXT("After breaking the Hindenburg Line, he led Fourth Army to the Selle. Bridgeheads, villages and roads became the next objectives. Keeping touch with artillery and neighbouring formations, his troops continued east across the river valley."), TEXT("突破兴登堡防线之后，第四集团军继续追击到塞勒河。曾经依托连续战壕的战争再次转入河谷与村落，桥头、道路和邻军联络决定了推进能否持续。")},
    {TEXT("突破兴登堡防线后，他率第四集团军追到塞勒河。桥头、村落和道路重新成为争夺目标；炮兵与邻军保持联络，部队继续越过河谷向东推进。"), TEXT("After breaking the Hindenburg Line, he led Fourth Army to the Selle. Bridgeheads, villages and roads became the next objectives. Keeping touch with artillery and neighbouring formations, his troops continued east across the river valley."), TEXT("After breaking the Hindenburg Line, Fourth Army pursued the enemy to the Selle. The war moved from continuous trench systems into valleys and villages. Bridgeheads, roads and contact with neighbouring formations determined whether the advance could continue.")},
    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918"), TEXT("British Third Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918"), TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918")},
    {TEXT("英军第三集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918"), TEXT("British Third Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918"), TEXT("British Third Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918")},
    {TEXT("百日攻势中，他率第三集团军继续向东，新西兰师亦在其列。勒凯努瓦城墙与桑布尔村落仍有守军；停战前的最后一周，前线继续交战。"), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice."), TEXT("第三集团军在百日攻势中继续向东推进，新西兰师也在其序列内。勒凯努瓦的城墙与桑布尔战区的村落仍有守军；停战以前的最后一周，前线的任务并没有因胜利将近而变得轻松。")},
    {TEXT("百日攻势中，他率第三集团军继续向东，新西兰师亦在其列。勒凯努瓦城墙与桑布尔村落仍有守军；停战前的最后一周，前线继续交战。"), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice."), TEXT("Third Army continued east during the Hundred Days, with the New Zealand Division among its formations. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages still held defenders. The last week before the armistice brought no easy duty at the front.")},
    {TEXT("百日攻势中，他率第三集团军继续向东，新西兰师亦在其列。勒凯努瓦城墙与桑布尔村落仍有守军；停战前的最后一周，前线继续交战。"), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice."), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy’s walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice.")},
    {TEXT("百日攻势中，他率第三集团军继续向东，新西兰师亦在其列。勒凯努瓦城墙与桑布尔村落仍有守军；停战前的最后一周，前线继续交战。"), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice."), TEXT("During the Hundred Days, his Third Army continued east with the New Zealand Division in its ranks. Le Quesnoy's walls and the Sambre villages were still defended. Fighting continued through the final week before the armistice.")},
    {TEXT("奥托·冯·贝洛"), TEXT("Otto von Below"), TEXT("奥托·冯·贝洛")},
    {TEXT("奥托·冯·贝洛"), TEXT("Otto von Below"), TEXT("Otto von Below")},
    {TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Scarpe, 1918"), TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918")},
    {TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 斯卡尔普，1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Scarpe, 1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Scarpe, 1918")},
    {TEXT("他历经东线、马其顿与意大利战场，二月起执掌第十七集团军。春季攻势转为夏末防御；斯卡尔普方向的旧阵地与后卫未能使战线停止后移。"), TEXT("After service on the Eastern, Macedonian and Italian fronts, he took Seventeenth Army in February. Spring offensives gave way to late-summer defence. Old positions and rearguards on the Scarpe could delay the retreat, but could not stop it."), TEXT("先后经历东线、马其顿和意大利战场，二月起接掌第十七集团军。春季的进攻已转为夏末的防御，他的部队需要用旧阵地和后卫争取时间，抵挡斯卡尔普方向的持续压力。")},
    {TEXT("他历经东线、马其顿与意大利战场，二月起执掌第十七集团军。春季攻势转为夏末防御；斯卡尔普方向的旧阵地与后卫未能使战线停止后移。"), TEXT("After service on the Eastern, Macedonian and Italian fronts, he took Seventeenth Army in February. Spring offensives gave way to late-summer defence. Old positions and rearguards on the Scarpe could delay the retreat, but could not stop it."), TEXT("After service on the Eastern, Macedonian and Italian fronts, he took command of Seventeenth Army in February. Spring's offensive had become late summer's defence. Old positions and rearguards had to buy time against sustained pressure along the Scarpe.")},
    {TEXT("阿道夫·冯·卡洛维茨"), TEXT("Adolph von Carlowitz"), TEXT("阿道夫·冯·卡洛维茨")},
    {TEXT("阿道夫·冯·卡洛维茨"), TEXT("Adolph von Carlowitz"), TEXT("Adolph von Carlowitz")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918"), TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 圣康坦运河，1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · St Quentin Canal, 1918")},
    {TEXT("这位萨克森前战争大臣曾指挥军级部队。九月下旬接掌第二集团军时，协约国军正攻向兴登堡防线。分散据点仍需相互支援，防线却已难守。"), TEXT("The former Saxon war minister had commanded corps before taking Second Army in late September. Allied forces were attacking the Hindenburg Line. Its scattered strongpoints still depended on mutual support, but the line could no longer hold."), TEXT("萨克森军人，曾任王国战争大臣并指挥军级部队。九月下旬接掌第二集团军时，兴登堡防线正面临协约军的新一轮攻势；他的职责是让分散的支点继续构成能够互相支援的防御。")},
    {TEXT("这位萨克森前战争大臣曾指挥军级部队。九月下旬接掌第二集团军时，协约国军正攻向兴登堡防线。分散据点仍需相互支援，防线却已难守。"), TEXT("The former Saxon war minister had commanded corps before taking Second Army in late September. Allied forces were attacking the Hindenburg Line. Its scattered strongpoints still depended on mutual support, but the line could no longer hold."), TEXT("A Saxon officer, former war minister and corps commander. When he took over Second Army in late September, the Hindenburg Line faced another Allied offensive. His task was to keep scattered strongpoints fighting as a mutually supporting defence.")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 塞勒河，1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · Selle, 1918"), TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 塞勒河，1918")},
    {TEXT("德军第二集团军 · 塞勒河，1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · Selle, 1918"), TEXT("German Second Army · Selle, 1918")},
    {TEXT("第二集团军沿河流和铁路后撤，后卫争取时间，步兵守住通路。从纵深防线退到河谷之后，维持部队联络与保存兵力同样困难。撤退仍在继续。"), TEXT("Second Army fell back along rivers and railways. Rearguards bought time while infantry held the approaches. After leaving the defences in depth for the river valleys, keeping units in touch was as difficult as preserving their strength. The retreat continued."), TEXT("第二集团军在持续后撤中寻找新的立足点。河流和铁路可以帮助后卫争取时间，却无法替代步兵守住通路；从纵深防线到河谷阵地，保存联络已和保存兵力同样困难。")},
    {TEXT("第二集团军沿河流和铁路后撤，后卫争取时间，步兵守住通路。从纵深防线退到河谷之后，维持部队联络与保存兵力同样困难。撤退仍在继续。"), TEXT("Second Army fell back along rivers and railways. Rearguards bought time while infantry held the approaches. After leaving the defences in depth for the river valleys, keeping units in touch was as difficult as preserving their strength. The retreat continued."), TEXT("Second Army sought fresh footholds during its continuing retreat. Rivers and railways could buy the rearguards time but could not replace infantry on the approaches. Maintaining communications was becoming as difficult as preserving manpower.")},
    {TEXT("布鲁诺·冯·穆德拉"), TEXT("Bruno von Mudra"), TEXT("布鲁诺·冯·穆德拉")},
    {TEXT("布鲁诺·冯·穆德拉"), TEXT("Bruno von Mudra"), TEXT("Bruno von Mudra")},
    {TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918"), TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918")},
    {TEXT("德军第十七集团军 · 桑布尔北翼，1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918"), TEXT("German Seventeenth Army · Northern Sambre Sector, 1918")},
    {TEXT("工兵出身的他长期从事要塞事务，曾在阿尔贡作战。十月十二日接掌第十七集团军后，部队仍在后撤；河岸、村落与有限道路成了后卫的依托。"), TEXT("An engineer officer experienced in fortifications, he had commanded in the Argonne. After taking Seventeenth Army on twelve October, he faced a retreating front. Riverbanks, villages and the few available roads became positions for his rearguards."), TEXT("工兵出身，长期从事工程兵与要塞事务，曾在阿尔贡指挥作战。十月十二日接掌第十七集团军之后，他面对的是不断后移的战线；河岸、村落与有限的交通线成为最后的后卫依托。")},
    {TEXT("工兵出身的他长期从事要塞事务，曾在阿尔贡作战。十月十二日接掌第十七集团军后，部队仍在后撤；河岸、村落与有限道路成了后卫的依托。"), TEXT("An engineer officer experienced in fortifications, he had commanded in the Argonne. After taking Seventeenth Army on twelve October, he faced a retreating front. Riverbanks, villages and the few available roads became positions for his rearguards."), TEXT("An engineer officer with long experience of fortifications and earlier command in the Argonne. After taking over Seventeenth Army on 12 October, he faced a steadily receding front. Riverbanks, villages and limited roads became the last rearguard positions.")},
