    {TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."), TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。")},
    {TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when preparation is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies.")},
    {TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."), TEXT("从肖像召集本次配属的小队。补员共用整备队列；肖像阴影退去且前方有接纳余量即可再次召集。精确射手优先打击机枪；军士以口令缓解同壕压制。")},
    {TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."), TEXT("Call the sections assigned to this action from their portraits. Reinforcements share a preparation queue; call again when the portrait's shadow clears. Marksmen watch for machine guns, while NCOs use orders to relieve suppression in their trench.")},
    {TEXT("点击肖像征募本次配属的小队。步兵共用整备队列，整备完成且前方有空位时可再次征募。精确射手优先攻击机枪手，军士缓解附近友军的压制。"), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies."), TEXT("Select a portrait to recruit an assigned section. Infantry share a readiness queue; recruit again when readiness is complete and there is room ahead. Marksmen prioritise machine gunners, while NCOs relieve suppression on nearby allies.")},
    {TEXT("每壕 3 席，靠近战壕显示驻军；点击小队头像即出击。关闭入壕后，后续部队继续向前，驻军不动；满员友壕也可通过。也可让当前战壕整队出击。敌军驻守的战壕必须先夺下。"), TEXT("Each trench holds three sections. Move the pointer near it to reveal its garrison; select a portrait to advance that section. Closing entry sends arrivals onward without moving the garrison. Full friendly trenches can be passed. You may also order the whole trench forward. Enemy-occupied trenches must first be captured."), TEXT("每壕 3 席，靠近战壕显示驻军；点击小队头像即出击。关闭入壕后，后续部队继续向前，驻军不动；满员友壕也可通过。也可让当前战壕整队出击。敌军驻守的战壕必须先夺下。")},
    {TEXT("每壕 3 席，靠近战壕显示驻军；点击小队头像即出击。关闭入壕后，后续部队继续向前，驻军不动；满员友壕也可通过。也可让当前战壕整队出击。敌军驻守的战壕必须先夺下。"), TEXT("Each trench holds three sections. Move the pointer near it to reveal its garrison; select a portrait to advance that section. Closing entry sends arrivals onward without moving the garrison. Full friendly trenches can be passed. You may also order the whole trench forward. Enemy-occupied trenches must first be captured."), TEXT("Each trench holds three sections. Move the pointer near it to reveal its garrison; select a portrait to advance that section. Closing entry sends arrivals onward without moving the garrison. Full friendly trenches can be passed. You may also order the whole trench forward. Enemy-occupied trenches must first be captured.")},
    {TEXT("野炮、烟幕与壕炮分开联络；毒气、反装甲野炮和飞机随行动配属。在纵深范围内指定覆盖地段，再等待弹药抵达。炮火、毒气与扫射不分敌我；烟幕遮挡双方观察。"), TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Smoke blocks observation for both sides."), TEXT("野炮、烟幕与壕炮分开联络；毒气、反装甲野炮和飞机随行动配属。在纵深范围内指定覆盖地段，再等待弹药抵达。炮火、毒气与扫射不分敌我；烟幕遮挡双方观察。")},
    {TEXT("野炮、烟幕与壕炮分开联络；毒气、反装甲野炮和飞机随行动配属。在纵深范围内指定覆盖地段，再等待弹药抵达。炮火、毒气与扫射不分敌我；烟幕遮挡双方观察。"), TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Smoke blocks observation for both sides."), TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Lay smoke between your men and enemy guns to cross open ground or conceal a change of position; it blinds both sides but does not stop shells.")},
    {TEXT("野炮、烟幕与壕炮分开联络；毒气、反装甲野炮和飞机随行动配属。在纵深范围内指定覆盖地段，再等待弹药抵达。炮火、毒气与扫射不分敌我；烟幕遮挡双方观察。"), TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Smoke blocks observation for both sides."), TEXT("Field guns, smoke and trench mortars have separate liaison. Gas, anti-armour guns and aircraft are attached as the campaign develops. Select an area, then wait for ammunition to arrive. Shells, gas and strafing threaten both armies. Smoke blocks observation for both sides.")},
    {TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."), TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。")},
    {TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure.")},
    {TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."), TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方远端防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守都会动摇士气。保留预备队，别让零散步兵逐队送入机枪火力。")},
    {TEXT("按行动命令夺取并守住阵地；突破敌方后方防线，或将敌军士气压至零也能取胜。伤亡与失守会削弱士气。预备队可接替伤兵，并支援受困的小队。"), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders to take and hold positions. Breaking through the enemy rear line or reducing enemy morale to zero also wins. Casualties and lost ground weaken morale. Keep reserves to relieve depleted sections and support those under pressure."), TEXT("Follow the operation's orders: secure key positions, break through the enemy rear line, or destroy enemy morale. Casualties and lost positions shake morale. Keep a reserve instead of feeding isolated sections into a machine gun one at a time.")},
