    {TEXT("弹幕逐段向敌后推进，压制沿途阵地。步兵可在炮火经过后跟进，须与弹着区保持距离，避免遭到己方炮击。"), TEXT("The barrage advances into enemy positions in stages. Infantry can follow after the fire passes, keeping clear of the impact area to avoid friendly shellfire."), TEXT("The barrage advances from the registered line in stages. Infantry must follow the smoke and dust; moving too soon puts them under their own shells.")},
    {TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."), TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。")},
    {TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops.")},
    {TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."), TEXT("联络机飞越指定战线，临时为炮兵校射。浓烟仍会遮住地面枪手，飞行员不能替他们扣动扳机。")},
    {TEXT("联络机飞越指定地段，为炮兵提供临时观察。烟幕仍会遮住地面部队的视线。"), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the selected sector and provides temporary artillery observation. Smoke still obscures the view of ground troops."), TEXT("A contact aircraft crosses the assigned sector and temporarily helps the artillery observe. Smoke still hides targets from ground troops; the pilot cannot aim their rifles for them.")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane.")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("飞机抵达后连续投下八枚炸弹。落弹横向散开，沟通迟缓与气流决定了它无法代替精确射击。")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定航线连续投下十二枚炸弹。航线在下令时固定，移动目标可能在炸弹抵达前离开；友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("The aircraft releases twelve bombs along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered, so moving targets may leave before impact. Friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("The aircraft releases eight bombs in succession. Their spread, uncertain communications and shifting air make bombing a poor substitute for a precise shot.")},
    {TEXT("炮位接令后分轮覆盖指定地段。落弹分散，进攻的自己人也必须等炮火停下。"), TEXT("The battery covers the selected area in several salvos. Rounds are dispersed; your own advancing men must wait until the fire lifts."), TEXT("炮位接令后分轮覆盖指定地段。落弹分散，进攻的自己人也必须等炮火停下。")},
    {TEXT("炮位接令后分轮覆盖指定地段。落弹分散，进攻的自己人也必须等炮火停下。"), TEXT("The battery covers the selected area in several salvos. Rounds are dispersed; your own advancing men must wait until the fire lifts."), TEXT("The battery covers the selected area in several salvos. Rounds are dispersed; your own advancing men must wait until the fire lifts.")},
    {TEXT("烟幕分次铺开，掩住双方的观察。趁遮蔽转移，别指望隔着浓烟瞄准。"), TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through."), TEXT("烟幕分次铺开，掩住双方的观察。趁遮蔽转移，别指望隔着浓烟瞄准。")},
    {TEXT("烟幕分次铺开，掩住双方的观察。趁遮蔽转移，别指望隔着浓烟瞄准。"), TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through."), TEXT("Lay smoke between your men and an enemy gun. Use the screen to cross open ground, change trenches, or deny observers a clear shot at your armour. Both armies lose sight through it; shells still pass through.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"), TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."), TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"), TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."), TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact.")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"), TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."), TEXT("壕炮要先传令、装定，再送来数轮落弹。适合打散停留的枪位，不适合追逐奔跑的散兵。")},
    {TEXT("迫击炮接令、瞄准后进行多轮炮击，适合打击固定枪位。响应较慢，移动步兵可能在炮弹抵达前离开。"), TEXT("After receiving the order and laying the gun, the mortar fires several salvos at fixed positions. Its slow response lets moving infantry leave before impact."), TEXT("Orders must be relayed and the mortar laid before several salvos arrive. It can break up stationary gun positions, but cannot follow every running skirmisher.")},
    {TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."), TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。")},
    {TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection.")},
    {TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."), TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，低处的毒云随风偏移。它会阻断观察、压住枪位，久留有致死危险；风不分敌我。")},
    {TEXT("气弹在指定地段散落，毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并杀伤持续暴露的步兵。毒气也会伤及友军，烟幕无法提供防毒保护。"), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. The drifting cloud obscures sight and harms infantry who remain exposed, including friendly troops. Smoke provides no gas protection."), TEXT("Gas shells scatter over the selected ground. Low clouds drift with the wind, obscure observation and threaten crews who remain exposed. Research respirators before entering gas; smoke provides no protection from it.")},
    {TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"), TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."), TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。")},
    {TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"), TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."), TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area.")},
    {TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"), TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."), TEXT("野炮转为直射，分次瞄准指定地段内看得见的装甲。近弹可打断履带；目标离开后，炮手不会追着整条战线射击。")},
    {TEXT("野炮以直射迎击指定地段内可见的装甲。命中可能打断履带；坦克离开目标区域后，炮手停止追击。"), TEXT("The field gun engages visible armour with direct fire in the selected area. Hits may break tracks; the crew stops engaging a tank once it leaves the target area."), TEXT("The field gun switches to direct fire, engaging visible armour in the selected area. Near hits can break tracks. Once the target leaves, the crew does not pursue it along the entire front.")},
    {TEXT("双翼机低空扫射指定地段，适合打击暴露步兵。机枪弹无法击穿坦克装甲。"), TEXT("A biplane makes low strafing passes over the selected area, attacking exposed infantry. Its machine-gun rounds cannot penetrate tank armour."), TEXT("双翼机低空扫射指定地段，适合打击暴露步兵。机枪弹无法击穿坦克装甲。")},
