    {TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."), TEXT("Mark IV Female 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。")},
    {TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls.")},
    {TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."), TEXT("低矮侧舱里的机枪沿壕沟交叉扫射。比雄型更快完成整备，适合伴随步兵压住枪位；没有主炮，无法击穿坦克。")},
    {TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 以机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型。没有主炮，无法损伤坦克车体。"), TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with machine guns and prepares sooner than the male. Without cannon, it cannot damage tank hulls."), TEXT("Machine guns in shallow sponsons sweep the trenches. A shorter preparation than the male favours infantry support; without cannon it cannot penetrate tanks.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的雌型 Mark IV 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的雌型 Mark IV 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的雌型 Mark IV 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."), TEXT("修复车间让缴获的雌型车重回前线。五挺机枪构成移动火墙；维修整备快于火炮型，但必须依靠反坦克炮对付敌方装甲。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的雌型 Mark IV 以五挺机枪支援步兵，整备快于火炮型。遭遇敌方装甲时需要反坦克火力。"), TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female supports infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. Enemy armour requires anti-tank support."), TEXT("Repair workshops return a captured female tank to the front. Five machine guns cover the advance, with a shorter preparation than cannon tanks; enemy armour requires anti-tank support.")},
    {TEXT("两侧六磅炮压住阵位，刘易斯机枪掩护步兵。履带受损后仍可留在原地射击。"), TEXT("Six-pounders in the sponsons strike enemy positions while Lewis guns cover the infantry. Even with damaged tracks, the tank can continue firing from its position."), TEXT("两侧六磅炮压住阵位，刘易斯机枪掩护步兵。履带受损后仍可留在原地射击。")},
    {TEXT("两侧六磅炮压住阵位，刘易斯机枪掩护步兵。履带受损后仍可留在原地射击。"), TEXT("Six-pounders in the sponsons strike enemy positions while Lewis guns cover the infantry. Even with damaged tracks, the tank can continue firing from its position."), TEXT("Six-pounders in the sponsons strike enemy positions while Lewis guns cover the infantry. Even with damaged tracks, the tank can continue firing from its position.")},
