    {TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。可向拍摄区域呼叫炮火。"), TEXT("Reconnaissance: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed area."), TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。可向拍摄区域呼叫炮火。")},
    {TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。可向拍摄区域呼叫炮火。"), TEXT("Reconnaissance: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed area."), TEXT("Reconnaissance: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed area.")},
    {TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。可向拍摄区域呼叫炮火。"), TEXT("Reconnaissance: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed area."), TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。向已拍摄地域呼叫炮火。")},
    {TEXT("侦察报告：步兵 %d，机枪 %d，坦克 %d。可向拍摄区域呼叫炮火。"), TEXT("Reconnaissance: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed area."), TEXT("Aircraft reporting: %d infantry, %d machine guns, %d tanks. Call artillery into the photographed sector.")},
    {TEXT("先用飞机侦察，再呼叫炮火。报告显示可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；45 秒内，向拍摄区域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小。航空联络训练可延长至 60 秒。烟幕会遮住目标，报告不会继续追踪敌军。"), TEXT("Reconnoitre by aircraft before calling fire. The report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, artillery called into the photographed area arrives sooner with less scatter; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets and the report does not track later enemy movement."), TEXT("先用飞机侦察，再呼叫炮火。报告显示可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；45 秒内，向拍摄区域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小。航空联络训练可延长至 60 秒。烟幕会遮住目标，报告不会继续追踪敌军。")},
    {TEXT("先用飞机侦察，再呼叫炮火。报告显示可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；45 秒内，向拍摄区域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小。航空联络训练可延长至 60 秒。烟幕会遮住目标，报告不会继续追踪敌军。"), TEXT("Reconnoitre by aircraft before calling fire. The report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, artillery called into the photographed area arrives sooner with less scatter; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets and the report does not track later enemy movement."), TEXT("Reconnoitre by aircraft before calling fire. The report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, artillery called into the photographed area arrives sooner with less scatter; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets and the report does not track later enemy movement.")},
    {TEXT("先用飞机侦察，再呼叫炮火。报告显示可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；45 秒内，向拍摄区域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小。航空联络训练可延长至 60 秒。烟幕会遮住目标，报告不会继续追踪敌军。"), TEXT("Reconnoitre by aircraft before calling fire. The report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, artillery called into the photographed area arrives sooner with less scatter; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets and the report does not track later enemy movement."), TEXT("先让飞机飞越敌方炮线，再呼叫炮火。飞行员会报告可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；此后四十五秒内，向拍摄地域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小，航空联络科技可将效力延长到六十秒。烟幕会遮挡目标，飞机飞过后的报告不会追踪敌军移动。")},
    {TEXT("先用飞机侦察，再呼叫炮火。报告显示可见的步兵、机枪和坦克；45 秒内，向拍摄区域呼叫的炮火抵达更快、散布更小。航空联络训练可延长至 60 秒。烟幕会遮住目标，报告不会继续追踪敌军。"), TEXT("Reconnoitre by aircraft before calling fire. The report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, artillery called into the photographed area arrives sooner with less scatter; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets and the report does not track later enemy movement."), TEXT("Send the aircraft over an enemy gun line before calling artillery. Its report counts visible infantry, machine guns and tanks. For 45 seconds, fire called into the photographed sector arrives sooner and scatters less; aerial liaison extends this to 60 seconds. Smoke conceals targets, and the report does not track men after the pass.")},
    {TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定航线依次落下。航线在下令时固定，不追踪移动目标；新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射，友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定航线依次落下。航线在下令时固定，不追踪移动目标；新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射，友军须避开轰炸带。")},
    {TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定航线依次落下。航线在下令时固定，不追踪移动目标；新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射，友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane.")},
    {TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定航线依次落下。航线在下令时固定，不追踪移动目标；新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射，友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定地域依次落下。一旦下令，飞行员便无法追逐移动目标。新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射；务必让己方部队远离轰炸线。")},
    {TEXT("十二枚炸弹沿指定航线依次落下。航线在下令时固定，不追踪移动目标；新鲜的侦察报告可改善校射，友军须避开轰炸带。"), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall along the selected flight path. The path is fixed when ordered and does not track moving targets. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; friendly troops must keep clear of the bombing lane."), TEXT("Twelve bombs fall in a committed line across the selected ground. The airmen cannot chase a moving target once the run is ordered. A fresh reconnaissance report improves registration; keep your own men clear.")},
    {TEXT("待命野炮迅速响应，以最多六发瞄准射击迎击指定地域中可见的装甲目标。缺少观察员或没有清晰射界时暂缓开火。命中可能打断履带；驶离地域的坦克不会受到追击。"), TEXT("A ready field gun answers quickly with up to six aimed rounds against visible armour in the selected sector. It holds fire without an observer or a clear gun line. Tracks may be broken; armour that leaves the sector is not pursued."), TEXT("待命野炮迅速响应，以最多六发瞄准射击迎击指定地域中可见的装甲目标。缺少观察员或没有清晰射界时暂缓开火。命中可能打断履带；驶离地域的坦克不会受到追击。")},
    {TEXT("待命野炮迅速响应，以最多六发瞄准射击迎击指定地域中可见的装甲目标。缺少观察员或没有清晰射界时暂缓开火。命中可能打断履带；驶离地域的坦克不会受到追击。"), TEXT("A ready field gun answers quickly with up to six aimed rounds against visible armour in the selected sector. It holds fire without an observer or a clear gun line. Tracks may be broken; armour that leaves the sector is not pursued."), TEXT("A ready field gun answers quickly with up to six aimed rounds against visible armour in the selected sector. It holds fire without an observer or a clear gun line. Tracks may be broken; armour that leaves the sector is not pursued.")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定地域进行两次低空扫射，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重型装甲；航线在下令时固定。"), TEXT("Two low passes strafe the selected area, attacking exposed infantry and marching columns. Earth cover blocks some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. The flight path is fixed when ordered."), TEXT("飞机沿指定地域进行两次低空扫射，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重型装甲；航线在下令时固定。")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定地域进行两次低空扫射，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重型装甲；航线在下令时固定。"), TEXT("Two low passes strafe the selected area, attacking exposed infantry and marching columns. Earth cover blocks some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. The flight path is fixed when ordered."), TEXT("Two low passes strafe the selected area, attacking exposed infantry and marching columns. Earth cover blocks some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. The flight path is fixed when ordered.")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定地域进行两次低空扫射，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重型装甲；航线在下令时固定。"), TEXT("Two low passes strafe the selected area, attacking exposed infantry and marching columns. Earth cover blocks some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. The flight path is fixed when ordered."), TEXT("飞机两次低空掠过，用交错的狭窄弹道扫射指定地域，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒仍能提供掩护，机枪弹无法击穿重型装甲，飞行员也不会在接令后追逐目标。")},
    {TEXT("飞机沿指定地域进行两次低空扫射，适合打击暴露步兵与行进纵队。土垒可挡住部分枪弹，机枪无法击穿重型装甲；航线在下令时固定。"), TEXT("Two low passes strafe the selected area, attacking exposed infantry and marching columns. Earth cover blocks some rounds and machine guns cannot penetrate heavy armour. The flight path is fixed when ordered."), TEXT("Two low passes rake narrow, overlapping lanes through the selected ground. Best against exposed infantry and advancing columns. Earth cover still protects men, the rounds cannot penetrate heavy armour, and the pilot does not follow targets after the order.")},
