    {TEXT("梅宁路的进攻集中炮火，逐段夺取有限目标。步兵占领后立即巩固阵地，预备队准备迎击德军反攻。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack concentrates artillery on limited objectives. Infantry consolidate each gain while reserves prepare for German counterattacks."), TEXT("梅宁路的进攻集中炮火，逐段夺取有限目标。步兵占领后立即巩固阵地，预备队准备迎击德军反攻。")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路的进攻集中炮火，逐段夺取有限目标。步兵占领后立即巩固阵地，预备队准备迎击德军反攻。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack concentrates artillery on limited objectives. Infantry consolidate each gain while reserves prepare for German counterattacks."), TEXT("The Menin Road attack concentrates artillery on limited objectives. Infantry consolidate each gain while reserves prepare for German counterattacks.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路的进攻集中炮火，逐段夺取有限目标。步兵占领后立即巩固阵地，预备队准备迎击德军反攻。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack concentrates artillery on limited objectives. Infantry consolidate each gain while reserves prepare for German counterattacks."), TEXT("梅宁路的进攻把炮兵计划压在有限的地段上，预备队等着对付德军反击。少走的几百码并不轻松；只是命令终于为占领之后发生的事留下了位置。")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路的进攻集中炮火，逐段夺取有限目标。步兵占领后立即巩固阵地，预备队准备迎击德军反攻。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack concentrates artillery on limited objectives. Infantry consolidate each gain while reserves prepare for German counterattacks."), TEXT("At the Menin Road, artillery plans concentrate on limited ground and reserves wait for the German counterattacks. A few hundred fewer yards are no easier; the orders finally make room for what follows the capture.")},
    {TEXT("反击队集合处"), TEXT("The Counterattack Assembly Point"), TEXT("反击队集合处")},
    {TEXT("反击队集合处"), TEXT("The Counterattack Assembly Point"), TEXT("The Counterattack Assembly Point")},
    {TEXT("英军正把新占的地段筑成枪线。炮兵观察员与反击队改在同一处路口交换消息，毒气弹也已送到；若失去联络，这些火力同样会封住自己的路。"), TEXT("The British turn each new gain into a gun line. Observers and counterattack parties now exchange reports at the same junction. Gas shells have arrived, but without liaison their fire can close German roads as easily as British ones."), TEXT("英军正把新占的地段筑成枪线。炮兵观察员与反击队改在同一处路口交换消息，毒气弹也已送到；若失去联络，这些火力同样会封住自己的路。")},
    {TEXT("英军正把新占的地段筑成枪线。炮兵观察员与反击队改在同一处路口交换消息，毒气弹也已送到；若失去联络，这些火力同样会封住自己的路。"), TEXT("The British turn each new gain into a gun line. Observers and counterattack parties now exchange reports at the same junction. Gas shells have arrived, but without liaison their fire can close German roads as easily as British ones."), TEXT("The British turn each new gain into a gun line. Observers and counterattack parties now exchange reports at the same junction. Gas shells have arrived, but without liaison their fire can close German roads as easily as British ones.")},
