    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面给了坦克一次难得的机会。炮兵使用预先计算的射击数据，步兵与履带按时出发；最初的突破之后，补给与接替仍要沿原路跟上。"), TEXT("The firm ground at Cambrai gives tanks an unusual opportunity. Guns use predicted fire and the infantry move to the same timetable as the tracks. Beyond the first success, supplies and relief must still follow the original road."), TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面给了坦克一次难得的机会。炮兵使用预先计算的射击数据，步兵与履带按时出发；最初的突破之后，补给与接替仍要沿原路跟上。")},
    {TEXT("康布雷的坚实地面给了坦克一次难得的机会。炮兵使用预先计算的射击数据，步兵与履带按时出发；最初的突破之后，补给与接替仍要沿原路跟上。"), TEXT("The firm ground at Cambrai gives tanks an unusual opportunity. Guns use predicted fire and the infantry move to the same timetable as the tracks. Beyond the first success, supplies and relief must still follow the original road."), TEXT("The firm ground at Cambrai gives tanks an unusual opportunity. Guns use predicted fire and the infantry move to the same timetable as the tracks. Beyond the first success, supplies and relief must still follow the original road.")},
    {TEXT("康布雷反击令"), TEXT("Orders for the Cambrai Counterattack"), TEXT("康布雷反击令")},
    {TEXT("康布雷反击令"), TEXT("Orders for the Cambrai Counterattack"), TEXT("Orders for the Cambrai Counterattack")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，德军反击康布雷突出部，重新争夺道路。直射炮迎击坦克，机枪掩护步兵接替；缴获车辆仍在工场修复。"), TEXT("On 30 November, German troops counterattack the Cambrai salient and contest its roads. Direct-fire guns engage tanks, machine guns cover infantry reliefs, and captured vehicles remain in the repair workshops."), TEXT("十一月三十日，德军反击康布雷突出部，重新争夺道路。直射炮迎击坦克，机枪掩护步兵接替；缴获车辆仍在工场修复。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，德军反击康布雷突出部，重新争夺道路。直射炮迎击坦克，机枪掩护步兵接替；缴获车辆仍在工场修复。"), TEXT("On 30 November, German troops counterattack the Cambrai salient and contest its roads. Direct-fire guns engage tanks, machine guns cover infantry reliefs, and captured vehicles remain in the repair workshops."), TEXT("On 30 November, German troops counterattack the Cambrai salient and contest its roads. Direct-fire guns engage tanks, machine guns cover infantry reliefs, and captured vehicles remain in the repair workshops.")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，德军反击康布雷突出部，重新争夺道路。直射炮迎击坦克，机枪掩护步兵接替；缴获车辆仍在工场修复。"), TEXT("On 30 November, German troops counterattack the Cambrai salient and contest its roads. Direct-fire guns engage tanks, machine guns cover infantry reliefs, and captured vehicles remain in the repair workshops."), TEXT("英军突出部已经形成，十一月三十日的反击重新争夺那些道路。直射炮盯住坦克，机枪替步兵接续掩护；缴获车辆要等修复，不会因为战报漂亮就立刻归队。")},
    {TEXT("十一月三十日，德军反击康布雷突出部，重新争夺道路。直射炮迎击坦克，机枪掩护步兵接替；缴获车辆仍在工场修复。"), TEXT("On 30 November, German troops counterattack the Cambrai salient and contest its roads. Direct-fire guns engage tanks, machine guns cover infantry reliefs, and captured vehicles remain in the repair workshops."), TEXT("The British salient has formed. On 30 November the counterattack contests its roads again. Direct-fire guns watch the tanks and machine guns cover the infantry relief. Captured vehicles must wait for repairs, whatever the reports claim.")},
