    {TEXT("铁丝前的脚印"), TEXT("Tracks Before the Wire"), TEXT("铁丝前的脚印")},
    {TEXT("铁丝前的脚印"), TEXT("Tracks Before the Wire"), TEXT("Tracks Before the Wire")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前哨先查探敌军换防。巡逻队携烟弹沿低地接近，今晚没有重炮支援。"), TEXT("As preparations for the spring offensive continue, outposts investigate enemy reliefs. Patrols approach through low ground with smoke bombs and no heavy artillery support tonight."), TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前哨先查探敌军换防。巡逻队携烟弹沿低地接近，今晚没有重炮支援。")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前哨先查探敌军换防。巡逻队携烟弹沿低地接近，今晚没有重炮支援。"), TEXT("As preparations for the spring offensive continue, outposts investigate enemy reliefs. Patrols approach through low ground with smoke bombs and no heavy artillery support tonight."), TEXT("As preparations for the spring offensive continue, outposts investigate enemy reliefs. Patrols approach through low ground with smoke bombs and no heavy artillery support tonight.")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前哨先查探敌军换防。巡逻队携烟弹沿低地接近，今晚没有重炮支援。"), TEXT("As preparations for the spring offensive continue, outposts investigate enemy reliefs. Patrols approach through low ground with smoke bombs and no heavy artillery support tonight."), TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前沿先要弄清对面换来了谁。巡逻携带的烟弹比口粮还仔细地包好；重炮一开火，今晚的任务就变成了另一回事。")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势尚在准备，前哨先查探敌军换防。巡逻队携烟弹沿低地接近，今晚没有重炮支援。"), TEXT("As preparations for the spring offensive continue, outposts investigate enemy reliefs. Patrols approach through low ground with smoke bombs and no heavy artillery support tonight."), TEXT("The spring offensive is still being prepared. First the outposts must discover who now holds the opposite line. Patrols wrap their smoke bombs as carefully as their rations. Heavy gunfire would turn tonight into a different operation.")},
