    {TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的攻势再次进入白垩田野。加拿大军越过旧阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝和村落组织防御。工兵须清除通路上的未爆弹。"), TEXT("The Scarpe advance returns to chalk fields. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rearguards defend behind wire and villages. Pioneers must clear unexploded shells from the approaches."), TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的推进重新进入白垩田野。加拿大军正越过旧有阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝与村落组织火力；翻出的未爆弹散在工兵要打开的通路上。")},
    {TEXT("斯卡尔普方向的攻势再次进入白垩田野。加拿大军越过旧阵地，德军后卫依托铁丝和村落组织防御。工兵须清除通路上的未爆弹。"), TEXT("The Scarpe advance returns to chalk fields. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rearguards defend behind wire and villages. Pioneers must clear unexploded shells from the approaches."), TEXT("The advance beside the Scarpe returns to chalk country. Canadian troops cross old positions while German rear guards organise their fire around wire and villages. Unexploded ammunition lies on the routes that pioneers must open.")},
    {TEXT("圣康坦运河与兴登堡防线横在前方。贝利库尔隧道上方，澳大利亚和配属美军正在进攻；草坡掩住地下通路，地表铁丝与枪位仍保护着各处出口。"), TEXT("The St Quentin Canal and Hindenburg defences lie ahead. Australian and attached American troops attack above the Bellicourt tunnel. Grass slopes conceal the underground passage, while wire and gun positions protect the exits at the surface."), TEXT("圣康坦运河与兴登堡防线横在前方。贝利库尔隧道上方，澳大利亚和配属美军正在进攻；草坡掩住地下通路，地表铁丝与枪位仍保护着各处出口。")},
    {TEXT("圣康坦运河与兴登堡防线横在前方。贝利库尔隧道上方，澳大利亚和配属美军正在进攻；草坡掩住地下通路，地表铁丝与枪位仍保护着各处出口。"), TEXT("The St Quentin Canal and Hindenburg defences lie ahead. Australian and attached American troops attack above the Bellicourt tunnel. Grass slopes conceal the underground passage, while wire and gun positions protect the exits at the surface."), TEXT("The St Quentin Canal and Hindenburg defences lie ahead. Australian and attached American troops attack above the Bellicourt tunnel. Grass slopes conceal the underground passage, while wire and gun positions protect the exits at the surface.")},
    {TEXT("塞勒河的渡口、路堤和铁路切口正在遭受争夺。德军后卫掩护物资与部队后撤，协约国炮兵寻找能压住河谷的观察位置；湿冷天气让每条通路都更加拥挤。"), TEXT("Crossings, embankments and railway cuttings along the Selle are contested. German rearguards cover the movement of stores and troops while Allied batteries seek observation over the valley. Cold, wet conditions crowd every usable route."), TEXT("塞勒河的渡口、路堤和铁路切口正在遭受争夺。德军后卫掩护物资与部队后撤，协约国炮兵寻找能压住河谷的观察位置；湿冷天气让每条通路都更加拥挤。")},
    {TEXT("塞勒河的渡口、路堤和铁路切口正在遭受争夺。德军后卫掩护物资与部队后撤，协约国炮兵寻找能压住河谷的观察位置；湿冷天气让每条通路都更加拥挤。"), TEXT("Crossings, embankments and railway cuttings along the Selle are contested. German rearguards cover the movement of stores and troops while Allied batteries seek observation over the valley. Cold, wet conditions crowd every usable route."), TEXT("Crossings, embankments and railway cuttings along the Selle are contested. German rear guards cover the movement of stores and troops while Allied batteries seek observation over the valley. Cold, wet conditions crowd every usable route.")},
    {TEXT("加拿大军正在逼近瓦朗谢讷，城镇里仍有平民。守军占住外围道路与枪位，协约国炮兵重新核对射界；军车、手推车与担架共用城外的通路。"), TEXT("Canadian troops approach Valenciennes, where civilians remain inside the town. The defenders hold the outer roads and gun positions while Allied batteries check their fields of fire. Army wagons, handcarts and stretchers share the approaches."), TEXT("加拿大军正在逼近瓦朗谢讷，城镇里仍有平民。守军占住外围道路与枪位，协约国炮兵重新核对射界；军车、手推车与担架共用城外的通路。")},
    {TEXT("加拿大军正在逼近瓦朗谢讷，城镇里仍有平民。守军占住外围道路与枪位，协约国炮兵重新核对射界；军车、手推车与担架共用城外的通路。"), TEXT("Canadian troops approach Valenciennes, where civilians remain inside the town. The defenders hold the outer roads and gun positions while Allied batteries check their fields of fire. Army wagons, handcarts and stretchers share the approaches."), TEXT("Canadian troops approach Valenciennes, where civilians remain inside the town. The defenders hold the outer roads and gun positions while Allied batteries check their fields of fire. Army wagons, handcarts and stretchers share the approaches.")},
    {TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"), TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."), TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。")},
    {TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"), TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."), TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire.")},
    {TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"), TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."), TEXT("桑布尔方向的进攻正在展开，新西兰部队已接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫枪位仍挡在前方；西线尚未停火，各连继续接收当天的作战命令。")},
    {TEXT("桑布尔攻势已经开始，新西兰部队接近勒凯努瓦城墙。运河、居民区和后卫阵地仍挡在前方，西线尚未停火。"), TEXT("The Sambre offensive has begun and New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited areas and rearguard posts remain ahead. The Western Front has not yet ceased fire."), TEXT("The Sambre offensive is under way, and New Zealand troops approach the walls of Le Quesnoy. Canals, inhabited streets and rear-guard guns still bar the routes. The Western Front has not ceased fire; companies receive their orders for the day.")},
