    {TEXT("射手将枪口对准通路，携弹手伏于枪架旁。\n展开施瓦茨洛泽机枪，掩护接近路；携弹手持步枪。"), TEXT("The gunner covers the approach while his bearer lies beside the mount.\nDeploy the Schwarzlose to cover approaches; bearers carry rifles."), TEXT("射手将枪口对准通路，携弹手伏于枪架旁。\n展开施瓦茨洛泽机枪，掩护接近路；携弹手持步枪。")},
    {TEXT("射手将枪口对准通路，携弹手伏于枪架旁。\n展开施瓦茨洛泽机枪，掩护接近路；携弹手持步枪。"), TEXT("The gunner covers the approach while his bearer lies beside the mount.\nDeploy the Schwarzlose to cover approaches; bearers carry rifles."), TEXT("The gunner covers the approach while his bearer lies beside the mount.\nDeploy the Schwarzlose to cover approaches; bearers carry rifles.")},
    {TEXT("手榴弹越过壕角，步枪手跟随弹着接近。\n协同使用步枪与手榴弹，清理近处壕沟阵位。"), TEXT("Grenades pass the traverse; riflemen close behind the bursts.\nCoordinate rifles and hand grenades to clear nearby trench positions."), TEXT("手榴弹越过壕角，步枪手跟随弹着接近。\n协同使用步枪与手榴弹，清理近处壕沟阵位。")},
    {TEXT("手榴弹越过壕角，步枪手跟随弹着接近。\n协同使用步枪与手榴弹，清理近处壕沟阵位。"), TEXT("Grenades pass the traverse; riflemen close behind the bursts.\nCoordinate rifles and hand grenades to clear nearby trench positions."), TEXT("Grenades pass the traverse; riflemen close behind the bursts.\nCoordinate rifles and hand grenades to clear nearby trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("射手伏在暗处，观察员辨认对面的动静。\n精选 M95 步枪配合观察员，攻击暴露目标。"), TEXT("The marksman waits in shadow while his observer watches the opposite line.\nA selected M95 rifle and observer engage exposed targets."), TEXT("射手伏在暗处，观察员辨认对面的动静。\n精选 M95 步枪配合观察员，攻击暴露目标。")},
