    {TEXT("炮火向前延伸，工兵望向尚存的铁丝。走在弹着后方的人仍须过网。\n推进炮火掩护接近；工兵清除障碍。"), TEXT("The barrage moves forward; sappers watch the surviving wire. The men behind the bursts must still cross it.\nAn advancing bombardment covers approaches; sappers clear obstacles."), TEXT("炮火向前延伸，工兵望向尚存的铁丝。走在弹着后方的人仍须过网。\n推进炮火掩护接近；工兵清除障碍。")},
    {TEXT("炮火向前延伸，工兵望向尚存的铁丝。走在弹着后方的人仍须过网。\n推进炮火掩护接近；工兵清除障碍。"), TEXT("The barrage moves forward; sappers watch the surviving wire. The men behind the bursts must still cross it.\nAn advancing bombardment covers approaches; sappers clear obstacles."), TEXT("The barrage moves forward; sappers watch the surviving wire. The men behind the bursts must still cross it.\nAn advancing bombardment covers approaches; sappers clear obstacles.")},
    {TEXT("装填手核对引信，炮长放下手臂。\n以定时引信榴霰弹压制有限区域。"), TEXT("The loader checks the fuze and the gun commander lowers his arm.\nSuppress a limited area with time-fused shrapnel."), TEXT("装填手核对引信，炮长放下手臂。\n以定时引信榴霰弹压制有限区域。")},
    {TEXT("装填手核对引信，炮长放下手臂。\n以定时引信榴霰弹压制有限区域。"), TEXT("The loader checks the fuze and the gun commander lowers his arm.\nSuppress a limited area with time-fused shrapnel."), TEXT("The loader checks the fuze and the gun commander lowers his arm.\nSuppress a limited area with time-fused shrapnel.")},
    {TEXT("地面收到预警，机影随即越过阵地。\n有限航空轰炸；投弹到达前预警。"), TEXT("A warning reaches the ground before the aircraft crosses the position.\nLimited bombing support; warning precedes the bombs."), TEXT("地面收到预警，机影随即越过阵地。\n有限航空轰炸；投弹到达前预警。")},
    {TEXT("地面收到预警，机影随即越过阵地。\n有限航空轰炸；投弹到达前预警。"), TEXT("A warning reaches the ground before the aircraft crosses the position.\nLimited bombing support; warning precedes the bombs."), TEXT("A warning reaches the ground before the aircraft crosses the position.\nLimited bombing support; warning precedes the bombs.")},
    {TEXT("炮位依口令开火，观察员守着目标地段。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。"), TEXT("The guns answer the order while the observer watches the target ground.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before the shells arrive."), TEXT("炮位依口令开火，观察员守着目标地段。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。")},
    {TEXT("炮位依口令开火，观察员守着目标地段。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。"), TEXT("The guns answer the order while the observer watches the target ground.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before the shells arrive."), TEXT("The guns answer the order while the observer watches the target ground.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before the shells arrive.")},
    {TEXT("白烟贴近壕沿，通路上的身影隐去。\n烟幕掩护接近，降低覆盖地带的可见度。"), TEXT("White smoke reaches the trench lip and hides movement on the route.\nScreen an approach and reduce visibility through the covered ground."), TEXT("白烟贴近壕沿，通路上的身影隐去。\n烟幕掩护接近，降低覆盖地带的可见度。")},
    {TEXT("白烟贴近壕沿，通路上的身影隐去。\n烟幕掩护接近，降低覆盖地带的可见度。"), TEXT("White smoke reaches the trench lip and hides movement on the route.\nScreen an approach and reduce visibility through the covered ground."), TEXT("White smoke reaches the trench lip and hides movement on the route.\nScreen an approach and reduce visibility through the covered ground.")},
