    {TEXT("射击口令传到装填手，炮闩合拢。电话再次接通，那端已换了一个声音。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。"), TEXT("The firing order reaches the loader and the breech closes. When the telephone answers again, the voice has changed.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before arrival."), TEXT("射击口令传到装填手，炮闩合拢。电话再次接通，那端已换了一个声音。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。")},
    {TEXT("射击口令传到装填手，炮闩合拢。电话再次接通，那端已换了一个声音。\n压制选定区域；炮弹抵达前标示弹着区。"), TEXT("The firing order reaches the loader and the breech closes. When the telephone answers again, the voice has changed.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before arrival."), TEXT("The firing order reaches the loader and the breech closes. When the telephone answers again, the voice has changed.\nSuppress the selected area; mark the impact zone before arrival.")},
