    {TEXT("战役回顾：守军于 1915 年 3 月 19 日突围失败，3 月 22 日投降。\n本次任务：19 日外围守备。"), TEXT("Siege account: the garrison's sortie failed on 19 March 1915; it surrendered on 22 March.\nAssignment: hold an outer siege position on 19 March."), TEXT("战役回顾：守军于 1915 年 3 月 19 日突围失败，3 月 22 日投降。\n本次任务：19 日外围守备。")},
    {TEXT("战役回顾：守军于 1915 年 3 月 19 日突围失败，3 月 22 日投降。\n本次任务：19 日外围守备。"), TEXT("Siege account: the garrison's sortie failed on 19 March 1915; it surrendered on 22 March.\nAssignment: hold an outer siege position on 19 March."), TEXT("Siege account: the garrison’s sortie failed on 19 March 1915; it surrendered on 22 March.\nAssignment: hold an outer siege position on 19 March.")},
    {TEXT("战役回顾：守军于 1915 年 3 月 19 日突围失败，3 月 22 日投降。\n本次任务：19 日外围守备。"), TEXT("Siege account: the garrison's sortie failed on 19 March 1915; it surrendered on 22 March.\nAssignment: hold an outer siege position on 19 March."), TEXT("Siege account: the garrison's sortie failed on 19 March 1915; it surrendered on 22 March.\nAssignment: hold an outer siege position on 19 March.")},
    {TEXT("德军攻势已扩展到默兹河西岸，战火烧向死人岭。岭下树林正在炮火中消失，凡尔登的侧翼岌岌可危。你的连队奉命接替这段防线的守军，守住高地与后方之间的联系，直到换防部队赶来。"), TEXT("The German attack has reached the west bank of the Meuse. Mort-Homme commands the approaches to Verdun; the woods below it are breaking under shellfire. Your company must keep the ridge connected to the rear while fresh troops come up. The relief can only reach a line that still holds."), TEXT("德军攻势已扩展到默兹河西岸，战火烧向死人岭。岭下树林正在炮火中消失，凡尔登的侧翼岌岌可危。你的连队奉命接替这段防线的守军，守住高地与后方之间的联系，直到换防部队赶来。")},
    {TEXT("德军攻势已扩展到默兹河西岸，战火烧向死人岭。岭下树林正在炮火中消失，凡尔登的侧翼岌岌可危。你的连队奉命接替这段防线的守军，守住高地与后方之间的联系，直到换防部队赶来。"), TEXT("The German attack has reached the west bank of the Meuse. Mort-Homme commands the approaches to Verdun; the woods below it are breaking under shellfire. Your company must keep the ridge connected to the rear while fresh troops come up. The relief can only reach a line that still holds."), TEXT("The German attack has reached the west bank of the Meuse. Mort-Homme commands the approaches to Verdun; the woods below it are breaking under shellfire. Your company must keep the ridge connected to the rear while fresh troops come up. The relief can only reach a line that still holds.")},
    {TEXT("弹坑遍布山脊，弯折的战壕穿过断木林带，泥水积在坡褶之间。"), TEXT("Shell craters break the ridge. Bent trenches, shattered woodland and pools of muddy water lie between its folds."), TEXT("弹坑遍布山脊，弯折的战壕穿过断木林带，泥水积在坡褶之间。")},
    {TEXT("弹坑遍布山脊，弯折的战壕穿过断木林带，泥水积在坡褶之间。"), TEXT("Shell craters break the ridge. Bent trenches, shattered woodland and pools of muddy water lie between its folds."), TEXT("Shell craters break the ridge. Bent trenches, shattered woodland and pools of muddy water lie between its folds.")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、控制集合点，同时守住前沿阵地。\n三、抵达撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Secure the assembly point while holding the forward position.\n3. Reach the withdrawal route."), TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、控制集合点，同时守住前沿阵地。\n三、抵达撤退通路。")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、控制集合点，同时守住前沿阵地。\n三、抵达撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Secure the assembly point while holding the forward position.\n3. Reach the withdrawal route."), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Secure the assembly point while holding the forward position.\n3. Reach the withdrawal route.")},
    {TEXT("沃堡再次遭到猛攻。堡外村路已被炮火切断，运送物资的队伍只能穿过无遮蔽的地面。你的连队守在外围，必须维持前沿与联络岗的联系。敌军压上来时，命令和撤回的士兵都要经过这条窄路。"), TEXT("Fort Vaux is under renewed attack. Beyond its walls, shellfire has cut the village roads and driven the carrying parties into the open. Your company holds the outer approaches. Keep a way through to the liaison post: when the forward line is pressed, that narrow connection will carry the orders and the men back."), TEXT("沃堡再次遭到猛攻。堡外村路已被炮火切断，运送物资的队伍只能穿过无遮蔽的地面。你的连队守在外围，必须维持前沿与联络岗的联系。敌军压上来时，命令和撤回的士兵都要经过这条窄路。")},
    {TEXT("沃堡再次遭到猛攻。堡外村路已被炮火切断，运送物资的队伍只能穿过无遮蔽的地面。你的连队守在外围，必须维持前沿与联络岗的联系。敌军压上来时，命令和撤回的士兵都要经过这条窄路。"), TEXT("Fort Vaux is under renewed attack. Beyond its walls, shellfire has cut the village roads and driven the carrying parties into the open. Your company holds the outer approaches. Keep a way through to the liaison post: when the forward line is pressed, that narrow connection will carry the orders and the men back."), TEXT("Fort Vaux is under renewed attack. Beyond its walls, shellfire has cut the village roads and driven the carrying parties into the open. Your company holds the outer approaches. Keep a way through to the liaison post: when the forward line is pressed, that narrow connection will carry the orders and the men back.")},
    {TEXT("破损村墙与林坡夹住通往堡垒的地带，凹陷小径蜿蜒于瓦砾和壕岸之间。"), TEXT("Broken village walls and wooded slopes crowd the approaches to the fort. Sunken paths wind between rubble and trench banks."), TEXT("破损村墙与林坡夹住通往堡垒的地带，凹陷小径蜿蜒于瓦砾和壕岸之间。")},
    {TEXT("破损村墙与林坡夹住通往堡垒的地带，凹陷小径蜿蜒于瓦砾和壕岸之间。"), TEXT("Broken village walls and wooded slopes crowd the approaches to the fort. Sunken paths wind between rubble and trench banks."), TEXT("Broken village walls and wooded slopes crowd the approaches to the fort. Sunken paths wind between rubble and trench banks.")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵联络岗。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守联络岗。"), TEXT("1. Reach the liaison post.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the liaison post."), TEXT("一、进抵联络岗。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守联络岗。")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵联络岗。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守联络岗。"), TEXT("1. Reach the liaison post.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the liaison post."), TEXT("1. Reach the liaison post.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the liaison post.")},
    {TEXT("杜奥蒙自二月陷落后，一直压在凡尔登守军的心头。十月反攻已经就绪，堡前却仍是弹坑、铁丝网和残存火力点。你的连队正接近南侧工事。炮火能够摧毁掩体，夺回的土地仍须由步兵守住。"), TEXT("Douaumont has been in German hands since February. The October counterattack is ready, but the fort still rises above torn ground and belts of wire. Your company is among the troops approaching its southern works. The guns can break the defenders' positions; the infantry must cross the wreckage and keep what it takes."), TEXT("杜奥蒙自二月陷落后，一直压在凡尔登守军的心头。十月反攻已经就绪，堡前却仍是弹坑、铁丝网和残存火力点。你的连队正接近南侧工事。炮火能够摧毁掩体，夺回的土地仍须由步兵守住。")},
    {TEXT("杜奥蒙自二月陷落后，一直压在凡尔登守军的心头。十月反攻已经就绪，堡前却仍是弹坑、铁丝网和残存火力点。你的连队正接近南侧工事。炮火能够摧毁掩体，夺回的土地仍须由步兵守住。"), TEXT("Douaumont has been in German hands since February. The October counterattack is ready, but the fort still rises above torn ground and belts of wire. Your company is among the troops approaching its southern works. The guns can break the defenders' positions; the infantry must cross the wreckage and keep what it takes."), TEXT("Douaumont has been in German hands since February. The October counterattack is ready, but the fort still rises above torn ground and belts of wire. Your company is among the troops approaching its southern works. The guns can break the defenders' positions; the infantry must cross the wreckage and keep what it takes.")},
    {TEXT("高地上弹坑相互叠压，堡垒下方的坡面被战壕切开，只余稀疏树桩。"), TEXT("The high ground is scarred by overlapping craters. Cut trenches and sparse tree stumps interrupt the slopes below the fort."), TEXT("高地上弹坑相互叠压，堡垒下方的坡面被战壕切开，只余稀疏树桩。")},
    {TEXT("高地上弹坑相互叠压，堡垒下方的坡面被战壕切开，只余稀疏树桩。"), TEXT("The high ground is scarred by overlapping craters. Cut trenches and sparse tree stumps interrupt the slopes below the fort."), TEXT("The high ground is scarred by overlapping craters. Cut trenches and sparse tree stumps interrupt the slopes below the fort.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、就地固守。"), TEXT("1. Pioneers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、就地固守。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、就地固守。"), TEXT("1. Pioneers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("1. Pioneers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it.")},
    {TEXT("十月反攻夺回杜奥蒙后，法军继续向堡垒以北推进。十二月的卢沃蒙只剩残墙和冻泥，春天失去的村路已难以辨认。你的连队须穿过这片废墟，让前沿与后续部队保持联系，在敌军重整之前站稳脚跟。"), TEXT("The October advance has carried the French back to Douaumont. Now the December attack pushes beyond the forts towards Louvemont. Snow and churned earth hide the village roads; the men can barely recognise the ground they lost in spring. Your company must keep the advance together before the winter closes around it."), TEXT("十月反攻夺回杜奥蒙后，法军继续向堡垒以北推进。十二月的卢沃蒙只剩残墙和冻泥，春天失去的村路已难以辨认。你的连队须穿过这片废墟，让前沿与后续部队保持联系，在敌军重整之前站稳脚跟。")},
    {TEXT("十月反攻夺回杜奥蒙后，法军继续向堡垒以北推进。十二月的卢沃蒙只剩残墙和冻泥，春天失去的村路已难以辨认。你的连队须穿过这片废墟，让前沿与后续部队保持联系，在敌军重整之前站稳脚跟。"), TEXT("The October advance has carried the French back to Douaumont. Now the December attack pushes beyond the forts towards Louvemont. Snow and churned earth hide the village roads; the men can barely recognise the ground they lost in spring. Your company must keep the advance together before the winter closes around it."), TEXT("The October advance has carried the French back to Douaumont. Now the December attack pushes beyond the forts towards Louvemont. Snow and churned earth hide the village roads; the men can barely recognise the ground they lost in spring. Your company must keep the advance together before the winter closes around it.")},
    {TEXT("残破庭院没入冬日泥泞，低墙、凹路与受损林地分割着村庄周围的地面。"), TEXT("Ruined courtyards merge into winter mud. Low walls, hollow lanes and torn woodland break the ground around the village."), TEXT("残破庭院没入冬日泥泞，低墙、凹路与受损林地分割着村庄周围的地面。")},
    {TEXT("残破庭院没入冬日泥泞，低墙、凹路与受损林地分割着村庄周围的地面。"), TEXT("Ruined courtyards merge into winter mud. Low walls, hollow lanes and torn woodland break the ground around the village."), TEXT("Ruined courtyards merge into winter mud. Low walls, hollow lanes and torn woodland break the ground around the village.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Hold the forward position.")},
    {TEXT("尼韦尔的攻势在贵妇小径打响。士兵被许诺一场突破，山脊上的德军工事和地下采石场却仍在抵抗。你的连队位于长坡下方。第一个立足点不会轻易到手，随后投入的部队还要穿过同一片暴露地带。"), TEXT("Nivelle's offensive opens on the Chemin des Dames. The men have been promised a breakthrough; above them, German positions survive along the crest and in the quarries. Your company faces the slope below the ridge. The first foothold will be costly, and the troops sent after it will have to cross the same exposed ground."), TEXT("尼韦尔的攻势在贵妇小径打响。士兵被许诺一场突破，山脊上的德军工事和地下采石场却仍在抵抗。你的连队位于长坡下方。第一个立足点不会轻易到手，随后投入的部队还要穿过同一片暴露地带。")},
    {TEXT("尼韦尔的攻势在贵妇小径打响。士兵被许诺一场突破，山脊上的德军工事和地下采石场却仍在抵抗。你的连队位于长坡下方。第一个立足点不会轻易到手，随后投入的部队还要穿过同一片暴露地带。"), TEXT("Nivelle's offensive opens on the Chemin des Dames. The men have been promised a breakthrough; above them, German positions survive along the crest and in the quarries. Your company faces the slope below the ridge. The first foothold will be costly, and the troops sent after it will have to cross the same exposed ground."), TEXT("Nivelle's offensive opens on the Chemin des Dames. The men have been promised a breakthrough; above them, German positions survive along the crest and in the quarries. Your company faces the slope below the ridge. The first foothold will be costly, and the troops sent after it will have to cross the same exposed ground.")},
    {TEXT("长坡升向狭窄脊线，战壕横切山脊，坡下散布弹坑与残破林带。"), TEXT("Long slopes rise to a narrow crest. Trenches cut across the ridge, with shell holes and broken woodland below."), TEXT("长坡升向狭窄脊线，战壕横切山脊，坡下散布弹坑与残破林带。")},
    {TEXT("长坡升向狭窄脊线，战壕横切山脊，坡下散布弹坑与残破林带。"), TEXT("Long slopes rise to a narrow crest. Trenches cut across the ridge, with shell holes and broken woodland below."), TEXT("Long slopes rise to a narrow crest. Trenches cut across the ridge, with shell holes and broken woodland below.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it.")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势失败后，法军再次回到这条山脊。拉马尔梅松的目标已经收紧，炮兵为这次进攻做了周密准备。你的连队将随炮火接近设防高地。沟壑中仍可能藏着未被摧毁的机枪，后续分队必须及时接上前队。"), TEXT("After the failed spring offensive, the army returns to the ridge with a narrower purpose. At La Malmaison, the artillery has prepared the ground for a deliberate attack. Your company follows the guns towards the fortified height. Every ravine can conceal a surviving gun; success depends on bringing the next section through before the defenders recover."), TEXT("春季攻势失败后，法军再次回到这条山脊。拉马尔梅松的目标已经收紧，炮兵为这次进攻做了周密准备。你的连队将随炮火接近设防高地。沟壑中仍可能藏着未被摧毁的机枪，后续分队必须及时接上前队。")},
    {TEXT("春季攻势失败后，法军再次回到这条山脊。拉马尔梅松的目标已经收紧，炮兵为这次进攻做了周密准备。你的连队将随炮火接近设防高地。沟壑中仍可能藏着未被摧毁的机枪，后续分队必须及时接上前队。"), TEXT("After the failed spring offensive, the army returns to the ridge with a narrower purpose. At La Malmaison, the artillery has prepared the ground for a deliberate attack. Your company follows the guns towards the fortified height. Every ravine can conceal a surviving gun; success depends on bringing the next section through before the defenders recover."), TEXT("After the failed spring offensive, the army returns to the ridge with a narrower purpose. At La Malmaison, the artillery has prepared the ground for a deliberate attack. Your company follows the guns towards the fortified height. Every ravine can conceal a surviving gun; success depends on bringing the next section through before the defenders recover.")},
    {TEXT("设防脊线俯瞰满布弹坑的坡地，短折战壕与木护射击位嵌在土工事之间。"), TEXT("The fortified crest overlooks cratered slopes. Short trench turns and timbered gun positions sit among the earthworks."), TEXT("设防脊线俯瞰满布弹坑的坡地，短折战壕与木护射击位嵌在土工事之间。")},
    {TEXT("设防脊线俯瞰满布弹坑的坡地，短折战壕与木护射击位嵌在土工事之间。"), TEXT("The fortified crest overlooks cratered slopes. Short trench turns and timbered gun positions sit among the earthworks."), TEXT("The fortified crest overlooks cratered slopes. Short trench turns and timbered gun positions sit among the earthworks.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it.")},
    {TEXT("德军沿马茨河推进，巴黎方向再次告急。六月十一日，法军向其侧翼发起反击。你的连队穿过高地与谷地道路之间的残破农田。其他地段的敌军仍在前进，反击展开时，身后的集结路口不能失守。"), TEXT("The German advance along the Matz has opened another threat towards Paris. On 11 June, French troops counterattack its flank. Your company moves across the broken fields between the heights and the valley road. The enemy is still advancing elsewhere; the rear junction must remain in French hands while the counterstroke goes in."), TEXT("德军沿马茨河推进，巴黎方向再次告急。六月十一日，法军向其侧翼发起反击。你的连队穿过高地与谷地道路之间的残破农田。其他地段的敌军仍在前进，反击展开时，身后的集结路口不能失守。")},
    {TEXT("德军沿马茨河推进，巴黎方向再次告急。六月十一日，法军向其侧翼发起反击。你的连队穿过高地与谷地道路之间的残破农田。其他地段的敌军仍在前进，反击展开时，身后的集结路口不能失守。"), TEXT("The German advance along the Matz has opened another threat towards Paris. On 11 June, French troops counterattack its flank. Your company moves across the broken fields between the heights and the valley road. The enemy is still advancing elsewhere; the rear junction must remain in French hands while the counterstroke goes in."), TEXT("The German advance along the Matz has opened another threat towards Paris. On 11 June, French troops counterattack its flank. Your company moves across the broken fields between the heights and the valley road. The enemy is still advancing elsewhere; the rear junction must remain in French hands while the counterstroke goes in.")},
    {TEXT("破碎农田铺展在浅缓坡褶之间，农路、旧壕沟与零散弹坑交错于开阔坡面。"), TEXT("Broken fields spread between shallow folds of ground. Farm tracks, old trench cuts and scattered craters cross the open slopes."), TEXT("破碎农田铺展在浅缓坡褶之间，农路、旧壕沟与零散弹坑交错于开阔坡面。")},
    {TEXT("破碎农田铺展在浅缓坡褶之间，农路、旧壕沟与零散弹坑交错于开阔坡面。"), TEXT("Broken fields spread between shallow folds of ground. Farm tracks, old trench cuts and scattered craters cross the open slopes."), TEXT("Broken fields spread between shallow folds of ground. Farm tracks, old trench cuts and scattered craters cross the open slopes.")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、在控制集合点的同时坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守集合点。"), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position with the assembly point secure.\n3. Hold the assembly point."), TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、在控制集合点的同时坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守集合点。")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、在控制集合点的同时坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守集合点。"), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position with the assembly point secure.\n3. Hold the assembly point."), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position with the assembly point secure.\n3. Hold the assembly point.")},
    {TEXT("德军攻势再次指向香槟。古罗的部队以警戒阵地迎敌，主防线留在更深处。你的连队守着前方接近路。按令撤离可以保存下一线所需的兵力；一旦失去联系，撤退的队伍就会被困在两道壕线之间。"), TEXT("The German offensive has returned to Champagne. Gouraud's army waits behind an outpost line, with its main defence farther back. Your company occupies the forward approaches. A position abandoned in good order can spare the troops needed for the next line; a withdrawal that loses contact can leave them cut off between the trenches."), TEXT("德军攻势再次指向香槟。古罗的部队以警戒阵地迎敌，主防线留在更深处。你的连队守着前方接近路。按令撤离可以保存下一线所需的兵力；一旦失去联系，撤退的队伍就会被困在两道壕线之间。")},
    {TEXT("德军攻势再次指向香槟。古罗的部队以警戒阵地迎敌，主防线留在更深处。你的连队守着前方接近路。按令撤离可以保存下一线所需的兵力；一旦失去联系，撤退的队伍就会被困在两道壕线之间。"), TEXT("The German offensive has returned to Champagne. Gouraud's army waits behind an outpost line, with its main defence farther back. Your company occupies the forward approaches. A position abandoned in good order can spare the troops needed for the next line; a withdrawal that loses contact can leave them cut off between the trenches."), TEXT("The German offensive has returned to Champagne. Gouraud's army waits behind an outpost line, with its main defence farther back. Your company occupies the forward approaches. A position abandoned in good order can spare the troops needed for the next line; a withdrawal that loses contact can leave them cut off between the trenches.")},
    {TEXT("开阔田野随低缓坡褶起伏，分散壕线与弹坑带切分着无遮蔽的地面。"), TEXT("Open fields rise and fall in low folds. Separated trench lines and cratered strips divide the exposed ground."), TEXT("开阔田野随低缓坡褶起伏，分散壕线与弹坑带切分着无遮蔽的地面。")},
    {TEXT("开阔田野随低缓坡褶起伏，分散壕线与弹坑带切分着无遮蔽的地面。"), TEXT("Open fields rise and fall in low folds. Separated trench lines and cratered strips divide the exposed ground."), TEXT("Open fields rise and fall in low folds. Separated trench lines and cratered strips divide the exposed ground.")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守左侧接近路。\n二、令指定小队进抵集合点。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Hold the left approach.\n2. Bring a designated section to the assembly point.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("一、坚守左侧接近路。\n二、令指定小队进抵集合点。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守左侧接近路。\n二、令指定小队进抵集合点。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Hold the left approach.\n2. Bring a designated section to the assembly point.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("1. Hold the left approach.\n2. Bring a designated section to the assembly point.\n3. Hold the forward position.")},
    {TEXT("七月十八日，法军与协约国军队从雷茨森林掩蔽下出击，威胁苏瓦松方向维系德军突出部的道路。你的连队正走出林缘。最后一排树木之外，残存铁丝网和侧射火力随时可能切断前队与后续部队。"), TEXT("On 18 July, French and Allied forces strike from the cover of the Retz forest. The attack towards Soissons threatens the roads sustaining the German salient. Your company emerges from the woods onto open fields. Beyond the last trees, intact wire and flank fire can separate the first wave from the troops trying to follow it."), TEXT("七月十八日，法军与协约国军队从雷茨森林掩蔽下出击，威胁苏瓦松方向维系德军突出部的道路。你的连队正走出林缘。最后一排树木之外，残存铁丝网和侧射火力随时可能切断前队与后续部队。")},
    {TEXT("七月十八日，法军与协约国军队从雷茨森林掩蔽下出击，威胁苏瓦松方向维系德军突出部的道路。你的连队正走出林缘。最后一排树木之外，残存铁丝网和侧射火力随时可能切断前队与后续部队。"), TEXT("On 18 July, French and Allied forces strike from the cover of the Retz forest. The attack towards Soissons threatens the roads sustaining the German salient. Your company emerges from the woods onto open fields. Beyond the last trees, intact wire and flank fire can separate the first wave from the troops trying to follow it."), TEXT("On 18 July, French and Allied forces strike from the cover of the Retz forest. The attack towards Soissons threatens the roads sustaining the German salient. Your company emerges from the woods onto open fields. Beyond the last trees, intact wire and flank fire can separate the first wave from the troops trying to follow it.")},
    {TEXT("林地外缘接向破碎田野与村落边地，曲折小路经过低墙、浅洼和战壕转角。"), TEXT("Woodland opens onto broken fields and village edges. Winding tracks pass low walls, shallow hollows and trench bends."), TEXT("林地外缘接向破碎田野与村落边地，曲折小路经过低墙、浅洼和战壕转角。")},
    {TEXT("林地外缘接向破碎田野与村落边地，曲折小路经过低墙、浅洼和战壕转角。"), TEXT("Woodland opens onto broken fields and village edges. Winding tracks pass low walls, shallow hollows and trench bends."), TEXT("Woodland opens onto broken fields and village edges. Winding tracks pass low walls, shallow hollows and trench bends.")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、令工兵清通铁丝网缺口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Clear the wire gap with pioneers.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、令工兵清通铁丝网缺口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、令工兵清通铁丝网缺口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Clear the wire gap with pioneers.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Clear the wire gap with pioneers.\n3. Hold the forward position.")},
    {TEXT("协约国军队在香槟重新展开进攻，法军与美军向阿登方向推进。索姆皮已处于德军战线之后四年。你的连队沿南侧接近路前进，田野早被反复轰击剥去表土。守军仍有纵深壕线，也有通路把预备队送入村庄。"), TEXT("The Allied offensive opens again in Champagne, with French and American troops pressing towards the Ardennes. Somme-Py has stood behind the German front for four years. Your company approaches its southern defences across fields stripped by repeated bombardment. The defenders still have deep trenches and a way to bring reserves into the village."), TEXT("协约国军队在香槟重新展开进攻，法军与美军向阿登方向推进。索姆皮已处于德军战线之后四年。你的连队沿南侧接近路前进，田野早被反复轰击剥去表土。守军仍有纵深壕线，也有通路把预备队送入村庄。")},
    {TEXT("协约国军队在香槟重新展开进攻，法军与美军向阿登方向推进。索姆皮已处于德军战线之后四年。你的连队沿南侧接近路前进，田野早被反复轰击剥去表土。守军仍有纵深壕线，也有通路把预备队送入村庄。"), TEXT("The Allied offensive opens again in Champagne, with French and American troops pressing towards the Ardennes. Somme-Py has stood behind the German front for four years. Your company approaches its southern defences across fields stripped by repeated bombardment. The defenders still have deep trenches and a way to bring reserves into the village."), TEXT("The Allied offensive opens again in Champagne, with French and American troops pressing towards the Ardennes. Somme-Py has stood behind the German front for four years. Your company approaches its southern defences across fields stripped by repeated bombardment. The defenders still have deep trenches and a way to bring reserves into the village.")},
    {TEXT("裸露农田被凹路与战壕切开，零散弹坑落在宽阔而低缓的坡面上。"), TEXT("Exposed farmland is cut by sunken tracks and trench lines. Scattered shell holes interrupt the broad, low slopes."), TEXT("裸露农田被凹路与战壕切开，零散弹坑落在宽阔而低缓的坡面上。")},
    {TEXT("裸露农田被凹路与战壕切开，零散弹坑落在宽阔而低缓的坡面上。"), TEXT("Exposed farmland is cut by sunken tracks and trench lines. Scattered shell holes interrupt the broad, low slopes."), TEXT("Exposed farmland is cut by sunken tracks and trench lines. Scattered shell holes interrupt the broad, low slopes.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with pioneers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it.")},
    {TEXT("俄军在加利西亚推进，奥匈军沿格尼拉利帕河组织抵抗。你的连队来到林间高地下的一处渡口。河岸湿滑，窄桥容不下整支纵队，守军枪组却可以在队伍渡河前封住出口。前进的部队需要在对岸站稳脚跟。"), TEXT("The armies have met in Galicia, where the Russian advance is pressing the Austro-Hungarian line along the Gnila Lipa. Your company reaches a crossing below wooded heights. The banks are wet, the bridge is narrow, and the defenders can bring their gun teams to bear before the column has crossed. The advance needs a foothold on the far side."), TEXT("俄军在加利西亚推进，奥匈军沿格尼拉利帕河组织抵抗。你的连队来到林间高地下的一处渡口。河岸湿滑，窄桥容不下整支纵队，守军枪组却可以在队伍渡河前封住出口。前进的部队需要在对岸站稳脚跟。")},
    {TEXT("俄军在加利西亚推进，奥匈军沿格尼拉利帕河组织抵抗。你的连队来到林间高地下的一处渡口。河岸湿滑，窄桥容不下整支纵队，守军枪组却可以在队伍渡河前封住出口。前进的部队需要在对岸站稳脚跟。"), TEXT("The armies have met in Galicia, where the Russian advance is pressing the Austro-Hungarian line along the Gnila Lipa. Your company reaches a crossing below wooded heights. The banks are wet, the bridge is narrow, and the defenders can bring their gun teams to bear before the column has crossed. The advance needs a foothold on the far side."), TEXT("The armies have met in Galicia, where the Russian advance is pressing the Austro-Hungarian line along the Gnila Lipa. Your company reaches a crossing below wooded heights. The banks are wet, the bridge is narrow, and the defenders can bring their gun teams to bear before the column has crossed. The advance needs a foothold on the far side.")},
    {TEXT("曲折河流隔开草岸与林坡，窄桥跨过浅水，泥路沿堤岸延伸。"), TEXT("A winding river separates grassy banks and wooded rises. Narrow bridges cross the shallows; muddy tracks follow the embankments."), TEXT("曲折河流隔开草岸与林坡，窄桥跨过浅水，泥路沿堤岸延伸。")},
    {TEXT("曲折河流隔开草岸与林坡，窄桥跨过浅水，泥路沿堤岸延伸。"), TEXT("A winding river separates grassy banks and wooded rises. Narrow bridges cross the shallows; muddy tracks follow the embankments."), TEXT("A winding river separates grassy banks and wooded rises. Narrow bridges cross the shallows; muddy tracks follow the embankments.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Sappers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Sappers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("1. Sappers to clear the assigned passage.\n2. Reach the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position.")},
    {TEXT("普热梅希尔已被围困数月。饥饿正在削弱守军，堡垒的火炮却仍控制道路，围城线上还要防备突围。你的连队警戒高地下的林间接近路。要塞尚未投降，包围圈出现缺口，就可能让守军冲出俄军防线。"), TEXT("Przemyśl has endured months of siege. Hunger is weakening the garrison, but the forts still cover the roads and another sortie may reach the outer ring. Your company watches the wooded approaches below the heights. The fortress has not surrendered; a gap in the cordon could still let troops break through the Russian line."), TEXT("普热梅希尔已被围困数月。饥饿正在削弱守军，堡垒的火炮却仍控制道路，围城线上还要防备突围。你的连队警戒高地下的林间接近路。要塞尚未投降，包围圈出现缺口，就可能让守军冲出俄军防线。")},
    {TEXT("普热梅希尔已被围困数月。饥饿正在削弱守军，堡垒的火炮却仍控制道路，围城线上还要防备突围。你的连队警戒高地下的林间接近路。要塞尚未投降，包围圈出现缺口，就可能让守军冲出俄军防线。"), TEXT("Przemyśl has endured months of siege. Hunger is weakening the garrison, but the forts still cover the roads and another sortie may reach the outer ring. Your company watches the wooded approaches below the heights. The fortress has not surrendered; a gap in the cordon could still let troops break through the Russian line."), TEXT("Przemyśl has endured months of siege. Hunger is weakening the garrison, but the forts still cover the roads and another sortie may reach the outer ring. Your company watches the wooded approaches below the heights. The fortress has not surrendered; a gap in the cordon could still let troops break through the Russian line.")},
    {TEXT("村落废墟与林间高地围住攻城地带，道路下沉穿过低洼庭院，再爬向土工事。"), TEXT("Village ruins and wooded heights surround the siege ground. Roads dip through low courtyards before climbing toward the earthworks."), TEXT("村落废墟与林间高地围住攻城地带，道路下沉穿过低洼庭院，再爬向土工事。")},
    {TEXT("村落废墟与林间高地围住攻城地带，道路下沉穿过低洼庭院，再爬向土工事。"), TEXT("Village ruins and wooded heights surround the siege ground. Roads dip through low courtyards before climbing toward the earthworks."), TEXT("Village ruins and wooded heights surround the siege ground. Roads dip through low courtyards before climbing toward the earthworks.")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守林缘。"), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the wood line."), TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守林缘。")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵山脊。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守林缘。"), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the wood line."), TEXT("1. Reach the ridge.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the wood line.")},
    {TEXT("德军与奥匈军在戈尔利采发起进攻，重炮轰击正在摧毁原以为稳固的阵地。后方部队开始重整，你的连队仍留在山脊。命令已转向东面的道路：维持撤退队伍的联系，在林间通路被截断前带回后卫。"), TEXT("The German and Austro-Hungarian bombardment has opened the attack at Gorlice. Positions thought secure are disappearing under heavy shells. Your company is left on the ridge while the troops behind it reorganise. The orders now concern the road east: keep the retreat connected, and bring the rearguard back before the wooded approaches close."), TEXT("德军与奥匈军在戈尔利采发起进攻，重炮轰击正在摧毁原以为稳固的阵地。后方部队开始重整，你的连队仍留在山脊。命令已转向东面的道路：维持撤退队伍的联系，在林间通路被截断前带回后卫。")},
    {TEXT("德军与奥匈军在戈尔利采发起进攻，重炮轰击正在摧毁原以为稳固的阵地。后方部队开始重整，你的连队仍留在山脊。命令已转向东面的道路：维持撤退队伍的联系，在林间通路被截断前带回后卫。"), TEXT("The German and Austro-Hungarian bombardment has opened the attack at Gorlice. Positions thought secure are disappearing under heavy shells. Your company is left on the ridge while the troops behind it reorganise. The orders now concern the road east: keep the retreat connected, and bring the rearguard back before the wooded approaches close."), TEXT("The German and Austro-Hungarian bombardment has opened the attack at Gorlice. Positions thought secure are disappearing under heavy shells. Your company is left on the ridge while the troops behind it reorganise. The orders now concern the road east: keep the retreat connected, and bring the rearguard back before the wooded approaches close.")},
    {TEXT("林坡向遭破坏的村地落下，凹路与残墙切分山坡上的接近地带。"), TEXT("Wooded slopes descend toward battered village ground. Hollow lanes and broken walls divide the hillside approaches."), TEXT("林坡向遭破坏的村地落下，凹路与残墙切分山坡上的接近地带。")},
    {TEXT("林坡向遭破坏的村地落下，凹路与残墙切分山坡上的接近地带。"), TEXT("Wooded slopes descend toward battered village ground. Hollow lanes and broken walls divide the hillside approaches."), TEXT("Wooded slopes descend toward battered village ground. Hollow lanes and broken walls divide the hillside approaches.")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、进抵集合点。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Reach the assembly point.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route."), TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、进抵集合点。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守山脊。\n二、进抵集合点。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Reach the assembly point.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route."), TEXT("1. Hold the ridge.\n2. Reach the assembly point.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route.")},
    {TEXT("夏季大撤退已延至华沙。德军进入城内，俄军正向维斯瓦河对岸与铁路沿线撤离。你的连队掩护东侧的一处渡口。火炮、辎重和掉队士兵仍在经过，后卫必须维持一道能抵抗的防线，直到纵队通过。"), TEXT("The summer retreat has reached Warsaw. German troops are entering the city as Russian formations withdraw across the Vistula and towards the railways. Your company covers a crossing on the eastern approaches. Guns, wagons and stragglers still need the route; the rearguard must leave a fighting line long enough for the column to pass."), TEXT("夏季大撤退已延至华沙。德军进入城内，俄军正向维斯瓦河对岸与铁路沿线撤离。你的连队掩护东侧的一处渡口。火炮、辎重和掉队士兵仍在经过，后卫必须维持一道能抵抗的防线，直到纵队通过。")},
    {TEXT("夏季大撤退已延至华沙。德军进入城内，俄军正向维斯瓦河对岸与铁路沿线撤离。你的连队掩护东侧的一处渡口。火炮、辎重和掉队士兵仍在经过，后卫必须维持一道能抵抗的防线，直到纵队通过。"), TEXT("The summer retreat has reached Warsaw. German troops are entering the city as Russian formations withdraw across the Vistula and towards the railways. Your company covers a crossing on the eastern approaches. Guns, wagons and stragglers still need the route; the rearguard must leave a fighting line long enough for the column to pass."), TEXT("The summer retreat has reached Warsaw. German troops are entering the city as Russian formations withdraw across the Vistula and towards the railways. Your company covers a crossing on the eastern approaches. Guns, wagons and stragglers still need the route; the rearguard must leave a fighting line long enough for the column to pass.")},
    {TEXT("河流在低岸与林地之间弯折，窄小渡口连接堤坡下方的泥泞道路。"), TEXT("The river bends between low banks and wooded ground. Narrow crossings link muddy approaches beneath the embankments."), TEXT("河流在低岸与林地之间弯折，窄小渡口连接堤坡下方的泥泞道路。")},
    {TEXT("河流在低岸与林地之间弯折，窄小渡口连接堤坡下方的泥泞道路。"), TEXT("The river bends between low banks and wooded ground. Narrow crossings link muddy approaches beneath the embankments."), TEXT("The river bends between low banks and wooded ground. Narrow crossings link muddy approaches beneath the embankments.")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守渡口。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the crossing.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route."), TEXT("一、坚守渡口。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。")},
    {TEXT("一、坚守渡口。\n二、进抵铁路切口。\n三、令指定小队进抵撤退通路。"), TEXT("1. Hold the crossing.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route."), TEXT("1. Hold the crossing.\n2. Reach the rail cutting.\n3. Bring a designated section to the withdrawal route.")},
    {TEXT("纳罗奇湖附近的进攻意在牵制德军，减轻凡尔登承受的压力。俄军补充了兵员，解冻的土地却正在吞没接近路。你的连队面对湿洼另一端的铁丝网，后续部队只能反复经过那几段尚能落脚的干地。"), TEXT("The attack near Lake Naroch is meant to draw German strength away from the fighting at Verdun. The Russian army has replenished its ranks, but the thaw is swallowing the approaches. Your company faces wire beyond a waterlogged strip. Each following section will have to use the same few stretches of firm ground under the defenders' guns."), TEXT("纳罗奇湖附近的进攻意在牵制德军，减轻凡尔登承受的压力。俄军补充了兵员，解冻的土地却正在吞没接近路。你的连队面对湿洼另一端的铁丝网，后续部队只能反复经过那几段尚能落脚的干地。")},
    {TEXT("纳罗奇湖附近的进攻意在牵制德军，减轻凡尔登承受的压力。俄军补充了兵员，解冻的土地却正在吞没接近路。你的连队面对湿洼另一端的铁丝网，后续部队只能反复经过那几段尚能落脚的干地。"), TEXT("The attack near Lake Naroch is meant to draw German strength away from the fighting at Verdun. The Russian army has replenished its ranks, but the thaw is swallowing the approaches. Your company faces wire beyond a waterlogged strip. Each following section will have to use the same few stretches of firm ground under the defenders' guns."), TEXT("The attack near Lake Naroch is meant to draw German strength away from the fighting at Verdun. The Russian army has replenished its ranks, but the thaw is swallowing the approaches. Your company faces wire beyond a waterlogged strip. Each following section will have to use the same few stretches of firm ground under the defenders' guns.")},
