    {TEXT("布鲁西洛夫攻势以事先准备的接近路和宽正面的攻击展开。在卢茨克附近，俄军已把壕沟推近奥匈阵地。你的连队等待通路打开。第一道防线可能很快松动，更深处的工事与回援部队仍能挡住后续梯队。"), TEXT("Brusilov's offensive begins with prepared approaches and attacks spread across a broad front. Near Lutsk, Russian troops have brought their trenches close to the Austro-Hungarian positions. Your company waits for a passage to open. The first line may give way quickly; deeper positions and returning reserves can still stop the following echelons."), TEXT("布鲁西洛夫攻势以事先准备的接近路和宽正面的攻击展开。在卢茨克附近，俄军已把壕沟推近奥匈阵地。你的连队等待通路打开。第一道防线可能很快松动，更深处的工事与回援部队仍能挡住后续梯队。")},
    {TEXT("布鲁西洛夫攻势以事先准备的接近路和宽正面的攻击展开。在卢茨克附近，俄军已把壕沟推近奥匈阵地。你的连队等待通路打开。第一道防线可能很快松动，更深处的工事与回援部队仍能挡住后续梯队。"), TEXT("Brusilov's offensive begins with prepared approaches and attacks spread across a broad front. Near Lutsk, Russian troops have brought their trenches close to the Austro-Hungarian positions. Your company waits for a passage to open. The first line may give way quickly; deeper positions and returning reserves can still stop the following echelons."), TEXT("Brusilov's offensive begins with prepared approaches and attacks spread across a broad front. Near Lutsk, Russian troops have brought their trenches close to the Austro-Hungarian positions. Your company waits for a passage to open. The first line may give way quickly; deeper positions and returning reserves can still stop the following echelons.")},
    {TEXT("低矮山脊分割破碎农田，战壕转角、农路和弹坑散落于开阔接近地带。"), TEXT("Low ridges divide broken farmland. Trench bends, farm tracks and shell holes interrupt the open approaches."), TEXT("低矮山脊分割破碎农田，战壕转角、农路和弹坑散落于开阔接近地带。")},
    {TEXT("低矮山脊分割破碎农田，战壕转角、农路和弹坑散落于开阔接近地带。"), TEXT("Low ridges divide broken farmland. Trench bends, farm tracks and shell holes interrupt the open approaches."), TEXT("Low ridges divide broken farmland. Trench bends, farm tracks and shell holes interrupt the open approaches.")},
