    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、进抵前沿阵地。\n三、守住阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with sappers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with sappers.\n2. Reach the forward position.\n3. Hold it.")},
    {TEXT("攻势已推进至切尔诺维茨和布科维纳的道路。奥匈防线正在后撤，河上渡口仍决定俄军能够追出多远。你的连队穿过树林，接近一处村落路口。若身后的渡口重落敌手，前方夺下的阵地也难以守住。"), TEXT("The advance has reached Czernowitz and the roads through Bukovina. The Austro-Hungarian line is retreating, but the river crossings still govern how far the Russian troops can follow. Your company moves through the woods towards a village junction. A position gained ahead is of little use if the crossing behind it falls back into enemy hands."), TEXT("攻势已推进至切尔诺维茨和布科维纳的道路。奥匈防线正在后撤，河上渡口仍决定俄军能够追出多远。你的连队穿过树林，接近一处村落路口。若身后的渡口重落敌手，前方夺下的阵地也难以守住。")},
    {TEXT("攻势已推进至切尔诺维茨和布科维纳的道路。奥匈防线正在后撤，河上渡口仍决定俄军能够追出多远。你的连队穿过树林，接近一处村落路口。若身后的渡口重落敌手，前方夺下的阵地也难以守住。"), TEXT("The advance has reached Czernowitz and the roads through Bukovina. The Austro-Hungarian line is retreating, but the river crossings still govern how far the Russian troops can follow. Your company moves through the woods towards a village junction. A position gained ahead is of little use if the crossing behind it falls back into enemy hands."), TEXT("The advance has reached Czernowitz and the roads through Bukovina. The Austro-Hungarian line is retreating, but the river crossings still govern how far the Russian troops can follow. Your company moves through the woods towards a village junction. A position gained ahead is of little use if the crossing behind it falls back into enemy hands.")},
    {TEXT("林间坡地接向零散村落，曲折小路穿行于低洼庭院、堤坡和浅沟之间。"), TEXT("Wooded rises meet scattered village ground. Curving lanes run between low courtyards, embankments and shallow hollows."), TEXT("林间坡地接向零散村落，曲折小路穿行于低洼庭院、堤坡和浅沟之间。")},
    {TEXT("林间坡地接向零散村落，曲折小路穿行于低洼庭院、堤坡和浅沟之间。"), TEXT("Wooded rises meet scattered village ground. Curving lanes run between low courtyards, embankments and shallow hollows."), TEXT("Wooded rises meet scattered village ground. Curving lanes run between low courtyards, embankments and shallow hollows.")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守渡口。"), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the crossing."), TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守渡口。")},
    {TEXT("一、进抵林缘。\n二、坚守前沿阵地。\n三、坚守渡口。"), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the crossing."), TEXT("1. Reach the wood line.\n2. Hold the forward position.\n3. Hold the crossing.")},
    {TEXT("科韦利的铁路枢纽仍在斯托霍德河彼岸。德军增援加强了防御，沼泽只留下几条可供攻击的窄路。你的连队奉命接近渡口。南方捷报已至，这里的通路仍在火力之下，每支分队都要经过路堤下的湿地瓶颈。"), TEXT("The railway junction at Kovel remains beyond the Stokhod. German reinforcements have stiffened the defence, and the marshes leave only narrow approaches for another Russian attack. Your company is sent towards a crossing. The successes farther south offer little shelter here: every section must pass through the same wet bottleneck beneath the railway embankment."), TEXT("科韦利的铁路枢纽仍在斯托霍德河彼岸。德军增援加强了防御，沼泽只留下几条可供攻击的窄路。你的连队奉命接近渡口。南方捷报已至，这里的通路仍在火力之下，每支分队都要经过路堤下的湿地瓶颈。")},
    {TEXT("科韦利的铁路枢纽仍在斯托霍德河彼岸。德军增援加强了防御，沼泽只留下几条可供攻击的窄路。你的连队奉命接近渡口。南方捷报已至，这里的通路仍在火力之下，每支分队都要经过路堤下的湿地瓶颈。"), TEXT("The railway junction at Kovel remains beyond the Stokhod. German reinforcements have stiffened the defence, and the marshes leave only narrow approaches for another Russian attack. Your company is sent towards a crossing. The successes farther south offer little shelter here: every section must pass through the same wet bottleneck beneath the railway embankment."), TEXT("The railway junction at Kovel remains beyond the Stokhod. German reinforcements have stiffened the defence, and the marshes leave only narrow approaches for another Russian attack. Your company is sent towards a crossing. The successes farther south offer little shelter here: every section must pass through the same wet bottleneck beneath the railway embankment.")},
    {TEXT("沼湿田野包围铁路接近地带，湿洼、壕沟与林带之间只留下狭窄干地。"), TEXT("Marshy fields surround the railway approaches. Wet hollows, trench cuts and wooded strips leave narrow stretches of firm ground."), TEXT("沼湿田野包围铁路接近地带，湿洼、壕沟与林带之间只留下狭窄干地。")},
    {TEXT("沼湿田野包围铁路接近地带，湿洼、壕沟与林带之间只留下狭窄干地。"), TEXT("Marshy fields surround the railway approaches. Wet hollows, trench cuts and wooded strips leave narrow stretches of firm ground."), TEXT("Marshy fields surround the railway approaches. Wet hollows, trench cuts and wooded strips leave narrow stretches of firm ground.")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、坚守渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with sappers.\n2. Hold the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、坚守渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。")},
    {TEXT("一、令工兵清通指定通路。\n二、坚守渡口。\n三、坚守前沿阵地。"), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with sappers.\n2. Hold the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position."), TEXT("1. Clear the assigned passage with sappers.\n2. Hold the crossing.\n3. Hold the forward position.")},
    {TEXT("临时政府下令在加利西亚再次进攻。帝国的徽记已经撤去，战争的命令仍在。你的连队面对德军与奥匈军占据的山脊。前队需要有人接应，一旦攻势瓦解，生还者也需要一条能够返回的路。"), TEXT("The Provisional Government has ordered another offensive in Galicia. The old imperial badges have gone; the war and its demands remain. Your company faces a ridge held by German and Austro-Hungarian troops. The attack needs men willing to follow the first wave, and a road back for those who survive if the advance comes apart."), TEXT("临时政府下令在加利西亚再次进攻。帝国的徽记已经撤去，战争的命令仍在。你的连队面对德军与奥匈军占据的山脊。前队需要有人接应，一旦攻势瓦解，生还者也需要一条能够返回的路。")},
    {TEXT("临时政府下令在加利西亚再次进攻。帝国的徽记已经撤去，战争的命令仍在。你的连队面对德军与奥匈军占据的山脊。前队需要有人接应，一旦攻势瓦解，生还者也需要一条能够返回的路。"), TEXT("The Provisional Government has ordered another offensive in Galicia. The old imperial badges have gone; the war and its demands remain. Your company faces a ridge held by German and Austro-Hungarian troops. The attack needs men willing to follow the first wave, and a road back for those who survive if the advance comes apart."), TEXT("The Provisional Government has ordered another offensive in Galicia. The old imperial badges have gone; the war and its demands remain. Your company faces a ridge held by German and Austro-Hungarian troops. The attack needs men willing to follow the first wave, and a road back for those who survive if the advance comes apart.")},
    {TEXT("长脊俯瞰破碎田野与稀疏林地，战壕顺着坡褶延伸，周围散布弹坑。"), TEXT("A long ridge overlooks broken fields and thin woodland. Trenches follow the folds of the slope among scattered craters."), TEXT("长脊俯瞰破碎田野与稀疏林地，战壕顺着坡褶延伸，周围散布弹坑。")},
