    {TEXT("长枪倚在胸墙上，军士核对名册。空出的名字留在原处。\n勒贝尔步枪与刺刀；承担持续推进。"), TEXT("Rifles rest on the parapet while the NCO checks the roll. Missing names remain on the page.\nLebel rifles and bayonets; sustain the advance."), TEXT("长枪倚在胸墙上，军士核对名册。空出的名字留在原处。\n勒贝尔步枪与刺刀；承担持续推进。")},
    {TEXT("长枪倚在胸墙上，军士核对名册。空出的名字留在原处。\n勒贝尔步枪与刺刀；承担持续推进。"), TEXT("Rifles rest on the parapet while the NCO checks the roll. Missing names remain on the page.\nLebel rifles and bayonets; sustain the advance."), TEXT("Rifles rest on the parapet while the NCO checks the roll. Missing names remain on the page.\nLebel rifles and bayonets; sustain the advance.")},
    {TEXT("枪架停稳，携弹手沿壕递送弹药。\n一名机枪手与持步枪的携弹手；停步展开，掩护接近路。"), TEXT("The mount settles; bearers pass ammunition along the trench.\nOne gunner with rifle-armed bearers; halt and deploy to cover the approaches."), TEXT("枪架停稳，携弹手沿壕递送弹药。\n一名机枪手与持步枪的携弹手；停步展开，掩护接近路。")},
    {TEXT("枪架停稳，携弹手沿壕递送弹药。\n一名机枪手与持步枪的携弹手；停步展开，掩护接近路。"), TEXT("The mount settles; bearers pass ammunition along the trench.\nOne gunner with rifle-armed bearers; halt and deploy to cover the approaches."), TEXT("The mount settles; bearers pass ammunition along the trench.\nOne gunner with rifle-armed bearers; halt and deploy to cover the approaches.")},
    {TEXT("投弹手伏在壕角，听候前队的哨音。回应只隔一道胸墙。\n贝尔蒂埃步枪与手榴弹协同清壕。"), TEXT("The grenadier waits at the traverse for the leading men's whistle. The answer comes from beyond the parapet.\nBerthier rifles and hand grenades for coordinated trench clearing."), TEXT("投弹手伏在壕角，听候前队的哨音。回应只隔一道胸墙。\n贝尔蒂埃步枪与手榴弹协同清壕。")},
    {TEXT("投弹手伏在壕角，听候前队的哨音。回应只隔一道胸墙。\n贝尔蒂埃步枪与手榴弹协同清壕。"), TEXT("The grenadier waits at the traverse for the leading men's whistle. The answer comes from beyond the parapet.\nBerthier rifles and hand grenades for coordinated trench clearing."), TEXT("The grenadier waits at the traverse for the leading men’s whistle. The answer comes from beyond the parapet.\nBerthier rifles and hand grenades for coordinated trench clearing.")},
    {TEXT("投弹手伏在壕角，听候前队的哨音。回应只隔一道胸墙。\n贝尔蒂埃步枪与手榴弹协同清壕。"), TEXT("The grenadier waits at the traverse for the leading men's whistle. The answer comes from beyond the parapet.\nBerthier rifles and hand grenades for coordinated trench clearing."), TEXT("The grenadier waits at the traverse for the leading men's whistle. The answer comes from beyond the parapet.\nBerthier rifles and hand grenades for coordinated trench clearing.")},
    {TEXT("观察员指向胸墙上的缺口，射手缓缓移枪。\n精选步枪射手与观察员配合，攻击暴露目标。"), TEXT("The observer points to a gap in the parapet; the rifle follows.\nA selected-rifle marksman and observer engage exposed targets."), TEXT("观察员指向胸墙上的缺口，射手缓缓移枪。\n精选步枪射手与观察员配合，攻击暴露目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员指向胸墙上的缺口，射手缓缓移枪。\n精选步枪射手与观察员配合，攻击暴露目标。"), TEXT("The observer points to a gap in the parapet; the rifle follows.\nA selected-rifle marksman and observer engage exposed targets."), TEXT("The observer points to a gap in the parapet; the rifle follows.\nA selected-rifle marksman and observer engage exposed targets.")},
    {TEXT("指挥者在壕口发出口令。哨音把留下与前进的人分开。\n维持护卫，协调小队移动与射击。"), TEXT("The commander gives his order at the trench exit. A whistle parts those who stay from those who advance.\nMaintain the escort screen and coordinate movement and fire."), TEXT("指挥者在壕口发出口令。哨音把留下与前进的人分开。\n维持护卫，协调小队移动与射击。")},
    {TEXT("指挥者在壕口发出口令。哨音把留下与前进的人分开。\n维持护卫，协调小队移动与射击。"), TEXT("The commander gives his order at the trench exit. A whistle parts those who stay from those who advance.\nMaintain the escort screen and coordinate movement and fire."), TEXT("The commander gives his order at the trench exit. A whistle parts those who stay from those who advance.\nMaintain the escort screen and coordinate movement and fire.")},
    {TEXT("剪钳探入铁丝下，后队沿着工兵来时的路等待。\n剪开铁丝，保持接近路畅通。"), TEXT("The cutters reach beneath the wire; the following men wait along the sappers' approach.\nClear wire and keep approaches open."), TEXT("剪钳探入铁丝下，后队沿着工兵来时的路等待。\n剪开铁丝，保持接近路畅通。")},
    {TEXT("剪钳探入铁丝下，后队沿着工兵来时的路等待。\n剪开铁丝，保持接近路畅通。"), TEXT("The cutters reach beneath the wire; the following men wait along the sappers' approach.\nClear wire and keep approaches open."), TEXT("The cutters reach beneath the wire; the following men wait along the sappers’ approach.\nClear wire and keep approaches open.")},
    {TEXT("剪钳探入铁丝下，后队沿着工兵来时的路等待。\n剪开铁丝，保持接近路畅通。"), TEXT("The cutters reach beneath the wire; the following men wait along the sappers' approach.\nClear wire and keep approaches open."), TEXT("The cutters reach beneath the wire; the following men wait along the sappers' approach.\nClear wire and keep approaches open.")},
    {TEXT("射手抬高枪口，护卫监视近处壕角。\n一名枪榴弹射手与步枪护卫，清理近处壕沟阵位。"), TEXT("The launcher rises while the escorts watch the nearby traverse.\nOne rifle-grenade operator with rifle escorts clears nearby trench positions."), TEXT("射手抬高枪口，护卫监视近处壕角。\n一名枪榴弹射手与步枪护卫，清理近处壕沟阵位。")},
    {TEXT("射手抬高枪口，护卫监视近处壕角。\n一名枪榴弹射手与步枪护卫，清理近处壕沟阵位。"), TEXT("The launcher rises while the escorts watch the nearby traverse.\nOne rifle-grenade operator with rifle escorts clears nearby trench positions."), TEXT("The launcher rises while the escorts watch the nearby traverse.\nOne rifle-grenade operator with rifle escorts clears nearby trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手跟随枪手抵近，步枪组掩护其展开。\n小容量弹匣，近程火力；须与步枪组、固定机枪协同。"), TEXT("The bearer follows the gun forward while riflemen cover its deployment.\nSmall magazine and short-range fire; coordinate with rifles and positional guns."), TEXT("携弹手跟随枪手抵近，步枪组掩护其展开。\n小容量弹匣，近程火力；须与步枪组、固定机枪协同。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手跟随枪手抵近，步枪组掩护其展开。\n小容量弹匣，近程火力；须与步枪组、固定机枪协同。"), TEXT("The bearer follows the gun forward while riflemen cover its deployment.\nSmall magazine and short-range fire; coordinate with rifles and positional guns."), TEXT("The bearer follows the gun forward while riflemen cover its deployment.\nSmall magazine and short-range fire; coordinate with rifles and positional guns.")},
    {TEXT("电话兵沿壕敷线。断线处的呼叫，须有人走过去接回。\n维持前沿联络，接应预定支援。"), TEXT("The signaller lays wire along the trench. A broken call needs someone to cross the ground and reconnect it.\nMaintain forward liaison for planned support."), TEXT("电话兵沿壕敷线。断线处的呼叫，须有人走过去接回。\n维持前沿联络，接应预定支援。")},
    {TEXT("电话兵沿壕敷线。断线处的呼叫，须有人走过去接回。\n维持前沿联络，接应预定支援。"), TEXT("The signaller lays wire along the trench. A broken call needs someone to cross the ground and reconnect it.\nMaintain forward liaison for planned support."), TEXT("The signaller lays wire along the trench. A broken call needs someone to cross the ground and reconnect it.\nMaintain forward liaison for planned support.")},
    {TEXT("刺刀随步枪上肩，名册在出发前传至排尾。回来时，还要再点一遍。\n莫辛步枪，五发弹仓；借地形与观察组织进攻。"), TEXT("Bayonets accompany the rifles as the roll passes down the ranks. It will be read again on their return.\nFive-round Mosin rifles; use terrain and observation to organise the assault."), TEXT("刺刀随步枪上肩，名册在出发前传至排尾。回来时，还要再点一遍。\n莫辛步枪，五发弹仓；借地形与观察组织进攻。")},
    {TEXT("刺刀随步枪上肩，名册在出发前传至排尾。回来时，还要再点一遍。\n莫辛步枪，五发弹仓；借地形与观察组织进攻。"), TEXT("Bayonets accompany the rifles as the roll passes down the ranks. It will be read again on their return.\nFive-round Mosin rifles; use terrain and observation to organise the assault."), TEXT("Bayonets accompany the rifles as the roll passes down the ranks. It will be read again on their return.\nFive-round Mosin rifles; use terrain and observation to organise the assault.")},
    {TEXT("水冷枪身安放就位，携弹手收拢弹药。\n停步展开马克沁机枪；携弹手持步枪。"), TEXT("The water-cooled gun settles into position; the bearers gather its ammunition.\nHalt and deploy the Maxim; bearers carry rifles."), TEXT("水冷枪身安放就位，携弹手收拢弹药。\n停步展开马克沁机枪；携弹手持步枪。")},
    {TEXT("水冷枪身安放就位，携弹手收拢弹药。\n停步展开马克沁机枪；携弹手持步枪。"), TEXT("The water-cooled gun settles into position; the bearers gather its ammunition.\nHalt and deploy the Maxim; bearers carry rifles."), TEXT("The water-cooled gun settles into position; the bearers gather its ammunition.\nHalt and deploy the Maxim; bearers carry rifles.")},
    {TEXT("手榴弹分送到壕口，步枪手等候信号。先头小队已经离开视线。\n步枪与手榴弹协同，攻击侦察确认的薄弱处。"), TEXT("Grenades reach the trench exit and riflemen await the signal. The leading section is already out of sight.\nUse rifles and grenades against a reconnoitred weak point."), TEXT("手榴弹分送到壕口，步枪手等候信号。先头小队已经离开视线。\n步枪与手榴弹协同，攻击侦察确认的薄弱处。")},
    {TEXT("手榴弹分送到壕口，步枪手等候信号。先头小队已经离开视线。\n步枪与手榴弹协同，攻击侦察确认的薄弱处。"), TEXT("Grenades reach the trench exit and riflemen await the signal. The leading section is already out of sight.\nUse rifles and grenades against a reconnoitred weak point."), TEXT("Grenades reach the trench exit and riflemen await the signal. The leading section is already out of sight.\nUse rifles and grenades against a reconnoitred weak point.")},
    {TEXT("线盘沿壕滚动，接头送进联络岗。听筒无声时，电话兵便须出发。\n联络前沿与炮兵；部署到位后协助支援整备。"), TEXT("Wire pays out along the trench and reaches the liaison post. A silent receiver sends the signaller out again.\nLink the front and artillery; deploy to assist support readiness."), TEXT("线盘沿壕滚动，接头送进联络岗。听筒无声时，电话兵便须出发。\n联络前沿与炮兵；部署到位后协助支援整备。")},
    {TEXT("线盘沿壕滚动，接头送进联络岗。听筒无声时，电话兵便须出发。\n联络前沿与炮兵；部署到位后协助支援整备。"), TEXT("Wire pays out along the trench and reaches the liaison post. A silent receiver sends the signaller out again.\nLink the front and artillery; deploy to assist support readiness."), TEXT("Wire pays out along the trench and reaches the liaison post. A silent receiver sends the signaller out again.\nLink the front and artillery; deploy to assist support readiness.")},
    {TEXT("炮手在壕内立起炮筒，弹药沿壕送来。\n对近壕目标实施小范围曲射支援。"), TEXT("The mortar rises inside the trench as ammunition passes forward.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("炮手在壕内立起炮筒，弹药沿壕送来。\n对近壕目标实施小范围曲射支援。")},
    {TEXT("炮手在壕内立起炮筒，弹药沿壕送来。\n对近壕目标实施小范围曲射支援。"), TEXT("The mortar rises inside the trench as ammunition passes forward.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("The mortar rises inside the trench as ammunition passes forward.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("炮手伏在壕内，听候目标方位。\n对近壕阵位提供有限范围的曲射支援。"), TEXT("The mortar crew waits inside the trench for the target bearing.\nLimited-area indirect fire against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("炮手伏在壕内，听候目标方位。\n对近壕阵位提供有限范围的曲射支援。")},
    {TEXT("炮手伏在壕内，听候目标方位。\n对近壕阵位提供有限范围的曲射支援。"), TEXT("The mortar crew waits inside the trench for the target bearing.\nLimited-area indirect fire against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("The mortar crew waits inside the trench for the target bearing.\nLimited-area indirect fire against nearby trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("炮弹沿交通壕传来，炮手转向近处目标。\n有限范围曲射，支援近壕作战。"), TEXT("Rounds pass along the communication trench and the crew turns towards the nearby target.\nLimited-area indirect support against trench positions."), TEXT("炮弹沿交通壕传来，炮手转向近处目标。\n有限范围曲射，支援近壕作战。")},
    {TEXT("炮弹沿交通壕传来，炮手转向近处目标。\n有限范围曲射，支援近壕作战。"), TEXT("Rounds pass along the communication trench and the crew turns towards the nearby target.\nLimited-area indirect support against trench positions."), TEXT("Rounds pass along the communication trench and the crew turns towards the nearby target.\nLimited-area indirect support against trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("炮组在壕后接令，搬来的炮弹放在手边。\n对近壕目标实施有限范围曲射支援。"), TEXT("The crew receives its order behind the trench and sets the rounds within reach.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("炮组在壕后接令，搬来的炮弹放在手边。\n对近壕目标实施有限范围曲射支援。")},
    {TEXT("炮组在壕后接令，搬来的炮弹放在手边。\n对近壕目标实施有限范围曲射支援。"), TEXT("The crew receives its order behind the trench and sets the rounds within reach.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions."), TEXT("The crew receives its order behind the trench and sets the rounds within reach.\nLimited-area indirect support against nearby trench positions.")},
    {TEXT("短履带碾向前沿，侧面枪口监视接近路。\n侧置 75 毫米炮攻击野战阵位；侧面机枪掩护接近。"), TEXT("Short tracks carry the tank forward as its side guns watch the approaches.\nOffset 75 mm gun attacks field positions; flank machine guns cover the approach."), TEXT("短履带碾向前沿，侧面枪口监视接近路。\n侧置 75 毫米炮攻击野战阵位；侧面机枪掩护接近。")},
    {TEXT("短履带碾向前沿，侧面枪口监视接近路。\n侧置 75 毫米炮攻击野战阵位；侧面机枪掩护接近。"), TEXT("Short tracks carry the tank forward as its side guns watch the approaches.\nOffset 75 mm gun attacks field positions; flank machine guns cover the approach."), TEXT("Short tracks carry the tank forward as its side guns watch the approaches.\nOffset 75 mm gun attacks field positions; flank machine guns cover the approach.")},
    {TEXT("长车体越过坚地，炮口朝向前方阵位。\n前向 75 毫米炮提供火力支援；狭窄切口、陡峭弹坑限制机动。"), TEXT("The long hull crosses firm ground with its gun facing the forward positions.\nFrontal 75 mm gun supports the advance; narrow cuts and steep crater lips restrict movement."), TEXT("长车体越过坚地，炮口朝向前方阵位。\n前向 75 毫米炮提供火力支援；狭窄切口、陡峭弹坑限制机动。")},
    {TEXT("长车体越过坚地，炮口朝向前方阵位。\n前向 75 毫米炮提供火力支援；狭窄切口、陡峭弹坑限制机动。"), TEXT("The long hull crosses firm ground with its gun facing the forward positions.\nFrontal 75 mm gun supports the advance; narrow cuts and steep crater lips restrict movement."), TEXT("The long hull crosses firm ground with its gun facing the forward positions.\nFrontal 75 mm gun supports the advance; narrow cuts and steep crater lips restrict movement.")},
    {TEXT("炮塔转向壕角，步兵跟随小车穿过缺口。\n旋转炮塔搭载 SA18 炮；通过较窄地段，轻装甲难耐持续炮击。"), TEXT("The turret turns towards the traverse as infantry follow the compact tank through the gap.\nRotating SA18 turret; follows infantry through tight ground. Light armour cannot endure sustained gunfire."), TEXT("炮塔转向壕角，步兵跟随小车穿过缺口。\n旋转炮塔搭载 SA18 炮；通过较窄地段，轻装甲难耐持续炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮塔转向壕角，步兵跟随小车穿过缺口。\n旋转炮塔搭载 SA18 炮；通过较窄地段，轻装甲难耐持续炮击。"), TEXT("The turret turns towards the traverse as infantry follow the compact tank through the gap.\nRotating SA18 turret; follows infantry through tight ground. Light armour cannot endure sustained gunfire."), TEXT("The turret turns towards the traverse as infantry follow the compact tank through the gap.\nRotating SA18 turret; follows infantry through tight ground. Light armour cannot endure sustained gunfire.")},
    {TEXT("车轮沿坚实路面前行，炮塔监视各自射界。\n两座马克沁炮塔覆盖不同射界；道路机动快，车轮与薄装甲易受野炮攻击。"), TEXT("Wheels follow the firm road while the turrets watch separate sectors.\nTwo Maxim turrets cover infantry targets. Fast on firm routes; wheels and thin armour are vulnerable to field guns."), TEXT("车轮沿坚实路面前行，炮塔监视各自射界。\n两座马克沁炮塔覆盖不同射界；道路机动快，车轮与薄装甲易受野炮攻击。")},
    {TEXT("车轮沿坚实路面前行，炮塔监视各自射界。\n两座马克沁炮塔覆盖不同射界；道路机动快，车轮与薄装甲易受野炮攻击。"), TEXT("Wheels follow the firm road while the turrets watch separate sectors.\nTwo Maxim turrets cover infantry targets. Fast on firm routes; wheels and thin armour are vulnerable to field guns."), TEXT("Wheels follow the firm road while the turrets watch separate sectors.\nTwo Maxim turrets cover infantry targets. Fast on firm routes; wheels and thin armour are vulnerable to field guns.")},
    {TEXT("装甲车厢驶过铁轨，步兵在侧面射孔掩护下离车。\n三节车厢沿铁路行动；列车被毁会动摇整个阵地。"), TEXT("Armoured cars follow the rails; side ports cover the men dismounting.\nThree-car detachment restricted to the railway; losing the train shakes the whole position."), TEXT("装甲车厢驶过铁轨，步兵在侧面射孔掩护下离车。\n三节车厢沿铁路行动；列车被毁会动摇整个阵地。")},
    {TEXT("装甲车厢驶过铁轨，步兵在侧面射孔掩护下离车。\n三节车厢沿铁路行动；列车被毁会动摇整个阵地。"), TEXT("Armoured cars follow the rails; side ports cover the men dismounting.\nThree-car detachment restricted to the railway; losing the train shakes the whole position."), TEXT("Armoured cars follow the rails; side ports cover the men dismounting.\nThree-car detachment restricted to the railway; losing the train shakes the whole position.")},
    {TEXT("1918年9月29日 · 突击兴登堡防线"), TEXT("29 SEPTEMBER 1918 · THE HINDENBURG ASSAULT"), TEXT("1918年9月29日 · 突击兴登堡线")},
    {TEXT("1918年9月29日 · 突击兴登堡防线"), TEXT("29 SEPTEMBER 1918 · THE HINDENBURG ASSAULT"), TEXT("29 SEPTEMBER 1918 · THE HINDENBURG ASSAULT")},
    {TEXT("守军沿胸墙接管阵位。\n独占战壕 8 秒后接管工事；需两名守军留驻\n炮击可摧毁工事\n\n"), TEXT("Defenders take their posts along the parapet.\nCapture after 8 uncontested seconds; requires two defenders\nShellfire can destroy the works\n\n"), TEXT("独占战壕8秒后接管工事。至少两名守军留驻时可用，炮击可将其摧毁。\n\n")},
    {TEXT("守军沿胸墙接管阵位。\n独占战壕 8 秒后接管工事；需两名守军留驻\n炮击可摧毁工事\n\n"), TEXT("Defenders take their posts along the parapet.\nCapture after 8 uncontested seconds; requires two defenders\nShellfire can destroy the works\n\n"), TEXT("Hold the trench uncontested for 8 seconds to capture it. Two defenders must remain to operate the works. Shellfire can destroy them.\n\n")},
    {TEXT("炮口朝向进攻通路。\n烟幕、近战或侧翼接近可避开火力\n夺取后沿用原有余弹\n余弹 {count} 发；装填需 6 秒\n距离 6–48 米；前方 70 度射界"), TEXT("The gun faces the approach.\nSmoke, close assault or flanking can evade its fire\nCaptured guns retain their remaining ammunition\n{count} shells; reloads in 6 seconds\nRange 6–48 metres; 70-degree forward arc"), TEXT("火炮封锁正面通路，步兵可借烟幕掩护接近，或从侧翼绕行。夺取炮位后不会补充弹药。\n\n余弹 {count} 发，装填需 6 秒。可射击前方 70 度射界内、距离 6–48 米的目标。")},
    {TEXT("炮口朝向进攻通路。\n烟幕、近战或侧翼接近可避开火力\n夺取后沿用原有余弹\n余弹 {count} 发；装填需 6 秒\n距离 6–48 米；前方 70 度射界"), TEXT("The gun faces the approach.\nSmoke, close assault or flanking can evade its fire\nCaptured guns retain their remaining ammunition\n{count} shells; reloads in 6 seconds\nRange 6–48 metres; 70-degree forward arc"), TEXT("The gun covers the forward approach. Smoke, close assault and flanking allow troops to evade its fire. Capturing it does not replenish the ammunition.\n\nThe gun has {count} shells and reloads in 6 seconds. It fires at targets 6–48 metres away within a 70-degree forward arc.")},
    {TEXT("工兵在壕肩钉入木桩。\n施工 {work}%\n无争夺友壕内连续作业 12 秒；压制中断施工\n留守两人，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%\n炮火可毁工事；火焰、侧翼绕过掩护"), TEXT("Pioneers drive stakes into the parapet.\nConstruction {work}%\nNeeds 12 uninterrupted seconds in an uncontested friendly trench\nSuppression interrupts construction\nTwo defenders reduce frontal bullet hit chance by 22%\nShellfire destroys the works; flame and flanking bypass them"), TEXT("施工{work}%。工兵可在无争夺的友壕内连续作业12秒，加固壕肩；压制会中断施工。完成后留守两人，可使正面枪弹命中率降低22%。炮火可摧毁工事，火焰与背后射击不受影响。")},
    {TEXT("工兵在壕肩钉入木桩。\n施工 {work}%\n无争夺友壕内连续作业 12 秒；压制中断施工\n留守两人，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%\n炮火可毁工事；火焰、侧翼绕过掩护"), TEXT("Pioneers drive stakes into the parapet.\nConstruction {work}%\nNeeds 12 uninterrupted seconds in an uncontested friendly trench\nSuppression interrupts construction\nTwo defenders reduce frontal bullet hit chance by 22%\nShellfire destroys the works; flame and flanking bypass them"), TEXT("Construction {work}%. Pioneers need 12 uninterrupted seconds in an uncontested friendly trench; suppression interrupts work. Keep two defenders here to reduce frontal bullet hit chance by 22%. Shellfire can destroy the works; flame and flanking bypass the cover.")},
    {TEXT("携弹兵沿交通壕赶来。\n一支投弹小队从后方增援，不占用步兵整备\n双方各能得到一次增援"), TEXT("Grenadiers bring ammunition up the communication trench.\nOne grenade squad arrives without spending infantry readiness\nEach army receives this reinforcement once"), TEXT("接管弹药后，一支投弹增援从后方赶来，不占用步兵整备。双方各能得到一次增援。")},
    {TEXT("携弹兵沿交通壕赶来。\n一支投弹小队从后方增援，不占用步兵整备\n双方各能得到一次增援"), TEXT("Grenadiers bring ammunition up the communication trench.\nOne grenade squad arrives without spending infantry readiness\nEach army receives this reinforcement once"), TEXT("Securing the ammunition releases one grenade section from the rear, without spending infantry readiness. Each army may receive this relief once.")},
    {TEXT("枪口追随掠过的敌机。\n留守枪手可逼退飞越阵地的敌机\n已经投下的炸弹继续落地\n烟幕、炮击或步兵突击可压住枪位"), TEXT("The gun follows the passing aircraft.\nDefenders can drive off aircraft crossing the position\nReleased bombs continue to fall\nSmoke, shellfire or infantry assault can silence the gun"), TEXT("留守枪手可逼退飞越阵地的敌机。已投下的炸弹仍会落地。烟幕、炮击或步兵突击可压住枪位。")},
    {TEXT("枪口追随掠过的敌机。\n留守枪手可逼退飞越阵地的敌机\n已经投下的炸弹继续落地\n烟幕、炮击或步兵突击可压住枪位"), TEXT("The gun follows the passing aircraft.\nDefenders can drive off aircraft crossing the position\nReleased bombs continue to fall\nSmoke, shellfire or infantry assault can silence the gun"), TEXT("A manned gun can drive off aircraft crossing the position. Released bombs still fall. Smoke, shellfire or an infantry assault can silence the gun.")},
    {TEXT("木料紧抵胸墙。\n静止守军遭步枪、机枪命中率降低 28%\n爆炸直接命中和火焰可绕过掩护"), TEXT("Timber braces the trench wall.\nStationary defenders suffer 28% fewer rifle and machine-gun hits\nDirect explosive hits and flame bypass the cover"), TEXT("加固木材和胸墙让静止守军被步枪、机枪命中的概率降低28%。直接命中的爆炸和火焰不会因此减弱。")},
    {TEXT("木料紧抵胸墙。\n静止守军遭步枪、机枪命中率降低 28%\n爆炸直接命中和火焰可绕过掩护"), TEXT("Timber braces the trench wall.\nStationary defenders suffer 28% fewer rifle and machine-gun hits\nDirect explosive hits and flame bypass the cover"), TEXT("Reinforced timber and revetments reduce the chance of rifle and machine-gun bullets striking stationary defenders by 28%. They do not protect against a landed explosive hit or flame.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日\n\n城下的坑道里，士兵等着炮火转向远处。雨雪打在白垩坡上。进攻向东展开，牵制当面的德军，接应即将到来的法军攻势。\n\n携弹队沿白垩路上行，担架从同一条路下来。坡脊之后传来机枪声，军士把各班的名字再念一遍，前队的回答被炮声盖住。\n\n阿拉斯攻势与法军埃纳河攻势同属春季作战计划。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen\n\nMen wait in the tunnels beneath the town for the guns to lift. Sleet strikes the chalk slopes. The attack goes east to hold the German forces here ahead of the coming French offensive.\n\nAmmunition parties go up the chalk road; stretchers come down it. Machine guns answer beyond the crest. The NCO reads out the sections again, but the guns drown the reply from the leading infantry in front.\n\nArras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan."), TEXT("一九一七年四月九日，英军在雨雪中向阿拉斯以东进攻，试图牵制德军，为即将开始的埃纳河法军攻势提供支援。白垩高地、洞穴和交通壕构成守军阵地，炮击之后仍有枪位继续射击。\n\n本连沿白垩路接近高地，坡脊遮住了后面的守军。残存壕道与枪位控制接近地段，英军携弹队和担架队也使用这条道路。战斗围绕坡面及其后方通路展开，前沿部队尚未接通所有邻段。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日\n\n城下的坑道里，士兵等着炮火转向远处。雨雪打在白垩坡上。进攻向东展开，牵制当面的德军，接应即将到来的法军攻势。\n\n携弹队沿白垩路上行，担架从同一条路下来。坡脊之后传来机枪声，军士把各班的名字再念一遍，前队的回答被炮声盖住。\n\n阿拉斯攻势与法军埃纳河攻势同属春季作战计划。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen\n\nMen wait in the tunnels beneath the town for the guns to lift. Sleet strikes the chalk slopes. The attack goes east to hold the German forces here ahead of the coming French offensive.\n\nAmmunition parties go up the chalk road; stretchers come down it. Machine guns answer beyond the crest. The NCO reads out the sections again, but the guns drown the reply from the leading infantry in front.\n\nArras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan."), TEXT("On 9 April 1917, British forces attack east of Arras in rain and snow. The offensive is intended to draw German troops away from the coming French attack on the Aisne. Chalk heights, caves and communication trenches support the German defence, and some gun positions remain active after the bombardment.\n\nThe company advances along the chalk road towards the high ground. Surviving defenders behind the crest cover the approaches, while ammunition bearers and stretcher parties use the same road. The local fighting centres on these slopes and the passages linking the ridge to the rear.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日")},
