    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日\n\n厂墙缺口里有机枪开火，弹屑打在铁路堤下。炮击揭开了屋顶，地下掩体却还通着。投弹兵在壕角停下，把手榴弹逐个递向前队。\n\n步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。\n\n阿拉斯攻势延续至五月十六日。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen\n\nA machine gun fires through a gap in the factory wall. Fragments strike below the railway bank. The roof has gone, but the underground shelters remain connected. Bombers halt at a traverse and pass grenades forward by hand.\n\nRiflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works.\n\nThe Arras offensive continued until sixteen May."), TEXT("一九一七年四月十二日，阿拉斯以东的英军推进在勒厄遇到抵抗。化工厂、铁路堤和地下掩体相互支撑，炮击打碎厂墙，却未清除后面的全部枪位。双方仍在争夺外围接近壕。\n\n本连沿这些壕沟接近厂区。投弹兵进入短促壕角与残墙之间，步枪手照看相邻空地，携弹队沿狭窄通路跟进。厂内守军控制着附近道路，英军各队只能从破墙间观察前方，铁路堤仍遮住部分阵位。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日\n\n厂墙缺口里有机枪开火，弹屑打在铁路堤下。炮击揭开了屋顶，地下掩体却还通着。投弹兵在壕角停下，把手榴弹逐个递向前队。\n\n步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。\n\n阿拉斯攻势延续至五月十六日。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen\n\nA machine gun fires through a gap in the factory wall. Fragments strike below the railway bank. The roof has gone, but the underground shelters remain connected. Bombers halt at a traverse and pass grenades forward by hand.\n\nRiflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works.\n\nThe Arras offensive continued until sixteen May."), TEXT("By 12 April 1917, the British advance east of Arras is encountering resistance around Roeux. The chemical works, railway embankment and underground shelters support one another. Bombardment has broken the factory walls without removing all the guns behind them, and the outer trenches remain contested.\n\nThe company is approaching through those trenches towards the factory outskirts. Bombing parties encounter short bends and broken masonry, while riflemen cover the open ground between them. Carrying parties follow along the confined approach. German positions in the works still threaten the roads needed by the British advance.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen")},
