    {TEXT("步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。"), TEXT("Riflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works."), TEXT("步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。")},
    {TEXT("步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。"), TEXT("Riflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works."), TEXT("Riflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works.")},
