    {TEXT("枪组把枪架拖过松土，携弹手试着踩出一条硬路。原先标定的地形已经改变，担架队在后面停住，等前队报回尚能通行的缺口。"), TEXT("The gun crew drags its mounting over loose earth. A bearer tests each step for firm ground. The landmarks on the sketch have gone. Behind them, the stretcher party waits for word of a gap that will carry a loaded stretcher."), TEXT("The gun crew drags its mounting over loose earth. A bearer tests each step for firm ground. The landmarks on the sketch have gone. Behind them, the stretcher party waits for word of a gap that will carry a loaded stretcher.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."), TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n新胸墙还缺着一角，枪组已把枪口转向东坡。进攻过去两日，阵地上的铁锹没有停过。换防队循弹坑间的小路上来，先问哪一道壕沟还能走。\n\n预备队在脊后集合，携弹手从伤员身旁挤过。德军在对面坡下活动，军士伏在新垒的土袋间观察。壕底还有旧枪架留下的凹痕。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nA corner is missing from the new parapet. The gun already faces the eastern slope. Two days have passed since the attack, and spades are still at work. Reliefs follow the crater path and ask which trench remains open.\n\nReserves gather behind the crest. Bearers edge past the wounded with their ammunition. German parties move below the opposite slope. The NCO watches through the fresh sandbags; the floor still bears the marks of the former gun mounting.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("梅西讷进攻过去两日，英军仍在加固山脊上的新前线。枪位转向德军后方，胸墙正在修补，坑岸小路输送弹药与换防人员。东面坡后的德军已开始集结反击队。\n\n本连守着新占阵地的一段，更广地段还有英军和澳新部队。枪组照看接近线，预备队在山脊后集合。受损道路同时承担前送补给与后送伤员，尚未完成的土工使部分阵位暴露。新旧壕道的朝向不同，部队联络仍在调整。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n新胸墙还缺着一角，枪组已把枪口转向东坡。进攻过去两日，阵地上的铁锹没有停过。换防队循弹坑间的小路上来，先问哪一道壕沟还能走。\n\n预备队在脊后集合，携弹手从伤员身旁挤过。德军在对面坡下活动，军士伏在新垒的土袋间观察。壕底还有旧枪架留下的凹痕。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nA corner is missing from the new parapet. The gun already faces the eastern slope. Two days have passed since the attack, and spades are still at work. Reliefs follow the crater path and ask which trench remains open.\n\nReserves gather behind the crest. Bearers edge past the wounded with their ammunition. German parties move below the opposite slope. The NCO watches through the fresh sandbags; the floor still bears the marks of the former gun mounting.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("Two days after the attack at Messines, the British front on the ridge is still being consolidated. Gun positions face towards the German rear, breastworks are being repaired, and crater paths carry ammunition and reliefs. German counterattack parties are gathering on the eastern slopes.\n\nThe company is holding part of this newly occupied line alongside British, Australian and New Zealand troops in the wider sector. Its guns cover the approaches while reserves assemble behind the ridge. The damaged paths support both forward supply and evacuation, with unfinished earthworks leaving parts of the position exposed to renewed attack.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Nine June nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日")},
