    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日\n\n农舍只剩一面墙，墙后的混凝土掩体仍在射击。前队沿湿田接近，邻队的钢盔隔着积水时隐时现。观察员伏在碎砖上，辨认射孔的位置。\n\n迫击炮弹由后方传来，一箱接着一箱。通往农场的硬路很窄，担架队已在路边停下。军士把手举过残墙，让失去联系的步枪手看见。\n\n伊普尔攻势直到秋季仍未取得预期突破。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · Sixteen August nineteen seventeen\n\nOne wall remains of the farmhouse. A concrete shelter behind it is still firing. Men approach across the wet field; helmets on the next sector appear and disappear beyond the pools. The observer lies on broken bricks, searching for the loophole.\n\nMortar ammunition arrives from the rear, box after box. The firm track to the farm is narrow. A stretcher party has stopped beside it. The NCO raises a hand over the wall for riflemen who have lost contact.\n\nThe Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough."), TEXT("一九一七年八月十六日，英军在朗厄马尔克穿过湿田进攻。农场废墟与混凝土掩体散布其间，德军据点隔着剩余干路相互支撑。邻近部队各自接近不同阵位，积水和破碎地面打断彼此联系。\n\n本连接近农场残墙，迫击炮弹从后方运来，观察员辨认仍有人据守的掩体。少数硬路同时运送补给和伤员，分散阵位之间难以通行。控制干路的德军枪位能够威胁多个接近方向，英军各队受到不同程度的阻挡。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日\n\n农舍只剩一面墙，墙后的混凝土掩体仍在射击。前队沿湿田接近，邻队的钢盔隔着积水时隐时现。观察员伏在碎砖上，辨认射孔的位置。\n\n迫击炮弹由后方传来，一箱接着一箱。通往农场的硬路很窄，担架队已在路边停下。军士把手举过残墙，让失去联系的步枪手看见。\n\n伊普尔攻势直到秋季仍未取得预期突破。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · Sixteen August nineteen seventeen\n\nOne wall remains of the farmhouse. A concrete shelter behind it is still firing. Men approach across the wet field; helmets on the next sector appear and disappear beyond the pools. The observer lies on broken bricks, searching for the loophole.\n\nMortar ammunition arrives from the rear, box after box. The firm track to the farm is narrow. A stretcher party has stopped beside it. The NCO raises a hand over the wall for riflemen who have lost contact.\n\nThe Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough."), TEXT("The British attack at Langemarck on 16 August 1917 advances through wet fields containing farm ruins and concrete shelters. German strongpoints cover one another across the remaining dry approaches. Neighbouring formations are moving towards separate positions, with water and broken ground interrupting their contact.\n\nThe company approaches the ruined farms while mortar ammunition comes forward from the rear. Observers are identifying occupied shelters among the masonry. The few firm tracks also carry supplies and casualties, making movement between the scattered positions difficult. German guns on those tracks can threaten troops advancing towards more than one farm.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · Sixteen August nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日")},
