    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日\n\n树桩之间落着刚翻起的土，炮火正向林地深处移动。前队越过一道浅脊，邻班便从视野中消失。枪组停下来，把枪架放在残根之间。\n\n携弹队还带着铁锹，新占的地段来不及挖深。德军哨位在断木后射击，后面的道路又有增援上来。步枪手把枯枝拨开，枪口朝着林缘。\n\n梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · Twenty September nineteen seventeen\n\nFresh earth falls between the stumps as the barrage moves deeper into the wood. The leading men cross a low ridge and lose sight of the next section. The gun crew sets its mounting among the exposed roots.\n\nBearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line.\n\nThe Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("一九一七年九月二十日，英军在梅宁路以集中炮火支援有限推进。路旁树林只剩树桩和断路，德军预备队仍在前沿之后，准备反击林缘失去的地段。残存坡脊分割着双方视野。\n\n本连进入受损林地，枪组跟进朝向德军接近线的位置，携弹队运来弹药和工具。树桩与地形遮住邻军动静。眼前地段既有幸存德军哨位，也有正在组织防御的新占土地。道路拥挤，前送人员与后送伤员从相同通路经过。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日\n\n树桩之间落着刚翻起的土，炮火正向林地深处移动。前队越过一道浅脊，邻班便从视野中消失。枪组停下来，把枪架放在残根之间。\n\n携弹队还带着铁锹，新占的地段来不及挖深。德军哨位在断木后射击，后面的道路又有增援上来。步枪手把枯枝拨开，枪口朝着林缘。\n\n梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · Twenty September nineteen seventeen\n\nFresh earth falls between the stumps as the barrage moves deeper into the wood. The leading men cross a low ridge and lose sight of the next section. The gun crew sets its mounting among the exposed roots.\n\nBearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line.\n\nThe Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("On 20 September 1917, the British attack along the Menin Road uses concentrated artillery support for a limited advance. The woods beside the road have been reduced to stumps and broken paths. German reserves remain behind the forward positions, ready to counterattack ground lost near the tree line.\n\nThe company advances through this damaged woodland. Gun crews follow towards positions facing the German approaches, while carrying parties bring ammunition and tools. Ridges and tree remnants interrupt observation between neighbouring units. The immediate sector contains both surviving German posts and newly occupied ground still being organised for defence.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · Twenty September nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日")},
