    {TEXT("携弹队还带着铁锹，新占的地段来不及挖深。德军哨位在断木后射击，后面的道路又有增援上来。步枪手把枯枝拨开，枪口朝着林缘。"), TEXT("Bearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line."), TEXT("Bearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line.")},
