    {TEXT("梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日\n\n履带压进坚实田地，铁丝在战车前面倒下。步兵跟着Mark IV来到壕边，壕底的转角却还在射击。炮声盖过发动机，前车已越过下一道障碍。\n\n步枪手伏在履带留下的沟里，投弹兵向掩蔽部接近。携弹队从缺口进入，先来的人员指着深壕让他们绕行。战车的背影逐渐被坡脊遮住。\n\n英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · Twenty November nineteen seventeen\n\nTracks bite into firm ground and wire falls before the tanks. Infantry follow a Mark IV to the trench, but a bend below is still firing. The guns drown the engine. The leading tank has crossed another obstacle.\n\nRiflemen lie in the track marks while bombers approach a dugout. Bearers enter through the gap with their boxes. Men already across point out the deep trench and direct them around it. The tank disappears behind the next rise.\n\nBritain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai."), TEXT("一九一七年十一月二十日，英军在康布雷附近以大量坦克进攻兴登堡线。坚实田地承住Mark IV履带，铁丝后的德军深壕保护着通往重要公路和铁路枢纽的路线。炮兵支援初次推进。\n\n本连跟在坦克之后越过受损障碍。装甲经过的壕角和掩蔽部里仍有守军，第一道防线后面的道路输送双方弹药与增援。壕沟内的争夺影响着后续英军能走哪些接近路，坦克与步兵的进度并不完全一致。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日\n\n履带压进坚实田地，铁丝在战车前面倒下。步兵跟着Mark IV来到壕边，壕底的转角却还在射击。炮声盖过发动机，前车已越过下一道障碍。\n\n步枪手伏在履带留下的沟里，投弹兵向掩蔽部接近。携弹队从缺口进入，先来的人员指着深壕让他们绕行。战车的背影逐渐被坡脊遮住。\n\n英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · Twenty November nineteen seventeen\n\nTracks bite into firm ground and wire falls before the tanks. Infantry follow a Mark IV to the trench, but a bend below is still firing. The guns drown the engine. The leading tank has crossed another obstacle.\n\nRiflemen lie in the track marks while bombers approach a dugout. Bearers enter through the gap with their boxes. Men already across point out the deep trench and direct them around it. The tank disappears behind the next rise.\n\nBritain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai."), TEXT("On 20 November 1917, British forces attack the Hindenburg Line near Cambrai with massed tanks. Firm fields allow Mark IVs to approach the wire, beyond which deep German trenches protect the routes to a major road and railway centre. Artillery supports the opening advance.\n\nThe company follows the tanks through the damaged obstacles. German defenders remain in trench bends and shelters passed by the armour. Roads beyond the first line carry ammunition and reinforcements for both sides. Infantry fighting in these trenches determines which approaches the following British troops and their supplies can use.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · Twenty November nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日")},
