    {TEXT("断树后传来步枪声，浅洼遮住侧翼的动静。军士把返回的人引进交通壕，再让前送的队伍通过。担架的木柄擦过壕壁，刮下一层湿土。"), TEXT("Rifle fire comes from behind broken trees. A hollow conceals the flank. The NCO guides returning men into the communication trench, then lets the carrying party through. A stretcher handle scrapes wet earth from the wall; the bearers turn it carefully at the bend."), TEXT("Rifle fire comes from behind broken trees. A hollow conceals the flank. The NCO guides returning men into the communication trench, then lets the carrying party through. A stretcher handle scrapes wet earth from the wall; the bearers turn it carefully at the bend.")},
