    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n联络兵带来邻段失守的消息，电话里却无人回答。河沟把田野分成窄块，机枪声沿水面传来。侧翼的步枪手离开旧枪位，向路口的零散哨兵靠拢。\n\n渡口旁有队伍重新集合，携弹队也要从这里经过。军士用地图核对前哨，把一名传令兵留在路边。对岸的枪还在响，名册上几个阵位没有回报。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nA runner brings word of a breach on the neighbouring sector. The telephone is silent. Ditches divide the fields, carrying the sound of machine guns across the water. Riflemen leave their old position to join scattered sentries at the junction.\n\nTroops gather beside the crossing. The carrying party needs that road too. The NCO checks the posts against his map and leaves a runner beside the track. Guns still fire across the bank. Several marked positions have sent no report.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("一九一八年四月九日，德军乔治特攻势在利斯河低地开始。葡萄牙与英军阵位受到攻击，邻段被突破的报告传到英军后方。河沟分开田野，弹药交通依赖少数道路。\n\n本连沿受威胁侧翼移动，接起道路交叉口附近的分散哨位。电话线中断，邻近阵位情况不明。德军分队穿过低地，英军在尚可使用的渡口和公路附近重新组织，携弹队也需要从这些路线靠近前沿，河岸两侧仍有阵位抵抗。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n联络兵带来邻段失守的消息，电话里却无人回答。河沟把田野分成窄块，机枪声沿水面传来。侧翼的步枪手离开旧枪位，向路口的零散哨兵靠拢。\n\n渡口旁有队伍重新集合，携弹队也要从这里经过。军士用地图核对前哨，把一名传令兵留在路边。对岸的枪还在响，名册上几个阵位没有回报。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nA runner brings word of a breach on the neighbouring sector. The telephone is silent. Ditches divide the fields, carrying the sound of machine guns across the water. Riflemen leave their old position to join scattered sentries at the junction.\n\nTroops gather beside the crossing. The carrying party needs that road too. The NCO checks the posts against his map and leaves a runner beside the track. Guns still fire across the bank. Several marked positions have sent no report.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("The German Georgette offensive begins on 9 April 1918 in the Lys lowlands. Portuguese and British positions are under attack, and reports of a breach in the neighbouring sector reach the British rear. River ditches divide the fields, leaving ammunition traffic dependent on a few roads.\n\nThe company moves along the threatened flank to reconnect scattered posts near a road junction. Telephone lines are interrupted, and the condition of neighbouring positions is uncertain. German parties are advancing through the low ground while British troops reorganise around the crossings and roads still available to them.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日")},
