    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日\n\n果园外传来履带声，村里的路口已经被德军占据。英军战车从残墙旁转出，步兵贴着沟边跟上。车组看不见墙后的动静，枪声却从巷口传来。\n\n通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。\n\n这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen\n\nTracks sound beyond the orchard. German troops hold the village junction. A British tank turns beside a broken wall and infantry follow the ditch. Its crew cannot see behind the masonry, where firing comes from a lane.\n\nThe road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins.\n\nThe first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."), TEXT("一九一八年四月二十四日，德军步兵和坦克进攻亚眠接近路上的维莱布勒托讷。英军装甲在村外迎战，断墙、果园和路口遮断车辆与步兵之间的视野。澳大利亚部队准备入夜反击。\n\n本连在通向亚眠的道路周围交战。德军已进入村庄，英军仍留在接近地段。车组只能从车内看见部分地面，步枪手在废墟与小巷遇到守军。村道把这些分散部队与后方相连，墙后的阵位仍难以直接观察。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日\n\n果园外传来履带声，村里的路口已经被德军占据。英军战车从残墙旁转出，步兵贴着沟边跟上。车组看不见墙后的动静，枪声却从巷口传来。\n\n通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。\n\n这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen\n\nTracks sound beyond the orchard. German troops hold the village junction. A British tank turns beside a broken wall and infantry follow the ditch. Its crew cannot see behind the masonry, where firing comes from a lane.\n\nThe road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins.\n\nThe first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."), TEXT("On 24 April 1918, German infantry and tanks attack Villers-Bretonneux on the approaches to Amiens. British armour engages near the village outskirts. Broken walls, orchards and road junctions interrupt views between the vehicles and the infantry, while Australian troops prepare for a counterattack after dark.\n\nThe company is fighting around the routes leading towards Amiens. German troops have entered the village, and British parties remain on its approaches. Tank crews see only parts of the ground from their vehicles; riflemen encounter defenders among the ruins and lanes. The village roads connect these separated groups with their rear.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen")},
