    {TEXT("通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。"), TEXT("The road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins."), TEXT("通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。")},
    {TEXT("通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。"), TEXT("The road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins."), TEXT("The road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins.")},
