    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日\n\n铁路切口里传出炮声，列车还在掩护后方撤运。雨水顺路堤流下，工兵贴着坡脚接近铁轨。步兵在两侧展开，反装甲枪组寻找能看见车体的位置。\n\n公路上挤着运弹车辆和担架，河谷入口越来越窄。观察员爬到高处，把列车的枪位报回。枪组搬开挡在脚边的枕木，远处的车轮仍未转动。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · Seventeen October nineteen eighteen\n\nGunfire comes from the railway cutting. The train is still covering the evacuation. Rain runs down the embankment as engineers approach the rails along its foot. Infantry spread to either side; the anti-armour crew searches for a view of the carriage.\n\nAmmunition vehicles and stretchers crowd the road into the valley. An observer climbs higher and reports the train's guns. The crew moves a sleeper out of its way. Beyond the cutting, the visible wheels have not yet begun to turn.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."), TEXT("一九一八年十月十七日，协约国沿塞勒河进攻。德军后卫掩护部队与物资撤离，河谷里的道路、路堤和铁路切口承载交通。湿冷天气限制通行，协约国观察员寻找俯瞰守军后路的位置。\n\n本连所在的局部地段，一列武装列车仍在切口掩护撤运。工兵接近铁路，步兵沿路堤展开，反装甲武器攻击车载枪炮。附近公路也运送弹药与伤员，多路交通聚向狭窄河谷入口，阵位两侧的动静难以看清。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日\n\n铁路切口里传出炮声，列车还在掩护后方撤运。雨水顺路堤流下，工兵贴着坡脚接近铁轨。步兵在两侧展开，反装甲枪组寻找能看见车体的位置。\n\n公路上挤着运弹车辆和担架，河谷入口越来越窄。观察员爬到高处，把列车的枪位报回。枪组搬开挡在脚边的枕木，远处的车轮仍未转动。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · Seventeen October nineteen eighteen\n\nGunfire comes from the railway cutting. The train is still covering the evacuation. Rain runs down the embankment as engineers approach the rails along its foot. Infantry spread to either side; the anti-armour crew searches for a view of the carriage.\n\nAmmunition vehicles and stretchers crowd the road into the valley. An observer climbs higher and reports the train's guns. The crew moves a sleeper out of its way. Beyond the cutting, the visible wheels have not yet begun to turn.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."), TEXT("The Allied attack along the Selle begins on 17 October 1918. German rear guards cover the withdrawal of troops and stores through a valley crossed by river roads, embankments and railway cuttings. Wet weather restricts traffic while Allied observers seek positions overlooking the routes behind the defence.\n\nIn the company's sector, an armed train remains in a cutting to cover evacuation. Engineers approach the railway while infantry spread along the embankment and anti-armour weapons engage the train's guns. The surrounding roads also carry ammunition and casualties, concentrating several movements around the same narrow valley approaches.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · Seventeen October nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日")},
