    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日\n\n当天的作战命令仍送到了连部，工兵带着工具走向运河。别处停战的消息已经传来，眼前的德军哨位却还在射击。城郊道路上有人推着家当经过。\n\n步枪手沿渡口接近，军士让担架队留在墙边。后续部队等着前面的回报，携弹手把箱盖重新压紧。运河对岸冒出枪口的火光，传令兵又伏了下去。\n\n十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen\n\nThe day's orders reach headquarters. Sappers carry their tools towards the canal. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived, but the German posts ahead are still firing. A cart of household goods passes along the road through the outskirts.\n\nRiflemen approach the crossing. The NCO keeps the stretcher party beside a wall while the following troops wait for a report. A bearer presses his ammunition lid shut. A muzzle flashes across the canal, and the runner lies down again beside the ditch.\n\nThe Western Front armistice took effect at eleven on eleven November."), TEXT("一九一八年十一月四日，协约国向桑布尔方向进攻，新西兰部队在另一段战线接近勒凯努瓦。运河、居民区和德军后卫仍阻挡通行。其他地区停战的消息已到，西线却尚未停火。\n\n本连在运河接近路与城郊道路附近行动，工兵查看剩余障碍，步兵面对照看通路的德军哨位。居民区仍有平民，后续部队、弹药与伤员使用同样路线。渡口和当地出口周围的战斗继续，各连仍接收当天作战命令。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日\n\n当天的作战命令仍送到了连部，工兵带着工具走向运河。别处停战的消息已经传来，眼前的德军哨位却还在射击。城郊道路上有人推着家当经过。\n\n步枪手沿渡口接近，军士让担架队留在墙边。后续部队等着前面的回报，携弹手把箱盖重新压紧。运河对岸冒出枪口的火光，传令兵又伏了下去。\n\n十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen\n\nThe day's orders reach headquarters. Sappers carry their tools towards the canal. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived, but the German posts ahead are still firing. A cart of household goods passes along the road through the outskirts.\n\nRiflemen approach the crossing. The NCO keeps the stretcher party beside a wall while the following troops wait for a report. A bearer presses his ammunition lid shut. A muzzle flashes across the canal, and the runner lies down again beside the ditch.\n\nThe Western Front armistice took effect at eleven on eleven November."), TEXT("On 4 November 1918, Allied forces attack towards the Sambre while New Zealand troops approach Le Quesnoy on another part of the front. Canals, settlements and German rear guards still obstruct movement. Reports of armistices elsewhere have not brought a ceasefire to the Western Front.\n\nThe company operates near canal approaches and the roads through the outskirts. Engineers examine remaining obstacles while infantry face German posts overlooking the passages. Civilians are still present in the settlements. Following troops, ammunition and casualties use the same routes as fighting continues around the crossings and local exits.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日")},
