    {TEXT("反击队在白垩路旁集合。联络兵循断线找去，坡后的机枪继续射击。携弹手把箱子搬过担架，几个失联哨位尚未报回点名结果。"), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble beside the chalk road. A runner follows the broken wire while the guns beyond the crest keep firing. Bearers carry their boxes past stretchers. Several silent posts have yet to return their rolls."), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble beside the chalk road. A runner follows the broken wire while the guns beyond the crest keep firing. Bearers carry their boxes past stretchers. Several silent posts have yet to return their rolls.")},
