    {TEXT("反击队沿铁路堤下集合，携弹兵把箱子交给仍在射击的枪组。军士指着被炮火切断的交通壕，重新安排去路。厂墙另一面的脚步听得很近。"), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble below the railway bank. Bearers hand boxes to a gun still firing. The NCO points to the communication trench cut by shellfire and directs men along another passage. Footsteps sound close on the other side of the wall."), TEXT("反击队沿铁路堤下集合，携弹兵把箱子交给仍在射击的枪组。军士指着被炮火切断的交通壕，重新安排去路。厂墙另一面的脚步听得很近。")},
    {TEXT("反击队沿铁路堤下集合，携弹兵把箱子交给仍在射击的枪组。军士指着被炮火切断的交通壕，重新安排去路。厂墙另一面的脚步听得很近。"), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble below the railway bank. Bearers hand boxes to a gun still firing. The NCO points to the communication trench cut by shellfire and directs men along another passage. Footsteps sound close on the other side of the wall."), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble below the railway bank. Bearers hand boxes to a gun still firing. The NCO points to the communication trench cut by shellfire and directs men along another passage. Footsteps sound close on the other side of the wall.")},
