    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日\n\n旧壕入口被土埋住，报告里标出的树也找不到了。地下爆炸过后，英军炮火越过山脊。幸存枪位隔着新坑射击，联络兵爬上坑岸再伏下来。\n\n前来的步枪手沿碎土收拢人员，携弹兵试着下到塌壕里。对面出现新的英军枪口，军士把地图折回原处。他要找的交通壕已在陡壁另一面。\n\n梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen\n\nEarth has buried the old trench entrance. The tree marked in the report has disappeared. British shellfire passes over the ridge after the underground explosions. A surviving gun fires across a fresh crater; the runner climbs its lip and drops down.\n\nArriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank.\n\nUnderground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened."), TEXT("一九一七年六月七日破晓前，梅西讷的地下爆炸埋住部分德军前线。英军炮火与步兵随后越过山脊。旧壕入口没入碎土，新坑壁截断通往幸存枪位的道路，邻近阵位陆续失去联系。\n\n本连向受创地段移动，收拢守军，恢复联络。部分枪组仍从弹坑另一面射击，报告中的旧地标却已改变。人员和弹药越过破碎坡面赶来，英军在初次进攻所得地段修筑阵位，新的枪口开始照看坑岸。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日\n\n旧壕入口被土埋住，报告里标出的树也找不到了。地下爆炸过后，英军炮火越过山脊。幸存枪位隔着新坑射击，联络兵爬上坑岸再伏下来。\n\n前来的步枪手沿碎土收拢人员，携弹兵试着下到塌壕里。对面出现新的英军枪口，军士把地图折回原处。他要找的交通壕已在陡壁另一面。\n\n梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen\n\nEarth has buried the old trench entrance. The tree marked in the report has disappeared. British shellfire passes over the ridge after the underground explosions. A surviving gun fires across a fresh crater; the runner climbs its lip and drops down.\n\nArriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank.\n\nUnderground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened."), TEXT("The mine explosions at Messines before dawn on 7 June 1917 have buried parts of the German front. British artillery and infantry follow across the ridge. Old trench entrances are lost beneath rubble, and fresh crater walls interrupt the routes to surviving gun positions.\n\nThe company is moving towards the shattered sector to gather defenders and restore contact. Some crews are still firing from positions beyond the craters, but reports no longer match the former landmarks. Men and ammunition approach through damaged slopes while British formations establish themselves on ground taken in the opening attack.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen")},
