    {TEXT("前来的步枪手沿碎土收拢人员，携弹兵试着下到塌壕里。对面出现新的英军枪口，军士把地图折回原处。他要找的交通壕已在陡壁另一面。"), TEXT("Arriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank."), TEXT("Arriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened."), TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened."), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n集合处的军士指着坑岸，新接近路从那里转过去。山脊上的英军正在加固胸墙，旧德军壕道已被爆破切断。步枪手轮流爬高，辨认幸存哨位的方向。\n\n携弹队从东坡赶来，鞋上带着松土。枪组在狭路尽头等候，前面的联络兵尚未回来。反击队沿坡伏下，能看见对面有人搬动新装满的土袋。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nThe NCO points from the assembly place towards a crater lip. The new approach turns there. British troops strengthen the ridge parapet above German trenches cut by explosions. Riflemen climb in turn to locate the surviving posts.\n\nBearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("一九一七年六月九日，德军准备向梅西讷山脊实施局部反击。英军正在加固爆破后夺取的阵位，预备队聚在坡脊另一面。新弹坑和塌壕改变了原先的德军接近路。\n\n本连在山脊东面集结，向坑岸移动。幸存德军哨位需要接回后方，也需要对付新出现的英军防线。携弹队从破碎坡面间剩余通路赶来。此时英军胸墙和补给路线尚未完全整理，双方都在利用还能通行的地段组织部队。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n集合处的军士指着坑岸，新接近路从那里转过去。山脊上的英军正在加固胸墙，旧德军壕道已被爆破切断。步枪手轮流爬高，辨认幸存哨位的方向。\n\n携弹队从东坡赶来，鞋上带着松土。枪组在狭路尽头等候，前面的联络兵尚未回来。反击队沿坡伏下，能看见对面有人搬动新装满的土袋。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nThe NCO points from the assembly place towards a crater lip. The new approach turns there. British troops strengthen the ridge parapet above German trenches cut by explosions. Riflemen climb in turn to locate the surviving posts.\n\nBearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("On 9 June 1917, German troops prepare a local counterattack towards Messines ridge. British forces are strengthening the positions taken after the mines, while their reserves gather beyond the crest. Fresh craters and collapsed trenches have altered the former German approaches.\n\nThe company assembles east of the ridge and moves towards the crater banks. Surviving German posts need contact with the rear as well as support against the new British line. Ammunition parties use the remaining passages through the broken slopes. The counterattack takes place before the new breastworks and supply routes have fully settled.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · Nine June nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日")},
