    {TEXT("携弹队从东坡赶来，鞋上带着松土。枪组在狭路尽头等候，前面的联络兵尚未回来。反击队沿坡伏下，能看见对面有人搬动新装满的土袋。"), TEXT("Bearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side."), TEXT("Bearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日\n\n携弹兵停在陷下去的木板前，箱子只能从手上传过去。前沿各枪位被水隔开，英军在雨烟中接近。壕炮组等着炮弹，守望的人不断擦去镜片上的水。\n\n一条硬路从坑岸后通过，换防队蹲在路边等候。军士让送信的人先走，又向远处枪声张望。邻近的机枪还在响，后方却没有找到过去的路。\n\n第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen\n\nA bearer stops at a sunken plank. His box must pass from hand to hand. Water separates the forward guns as British troops approach through rain and smoke. The mortar crew waits for ammunition. Its lookout keeps wiping the glass.\n\nA firm track passes behind the crater bank. Reliefs crouch beside it while the NCO sends a messenger ahead. He turns towards the distant firing again. The next machine gun can still be heard, but the men behind have found no path to it.\n\nThe Third Battle of Ypres began on thirty-one July."), TEXT("一九一七年七月三十一日，英军向皮尔克姆进攻。雨水和炮击使伊普尔周围田野积水，德军前沿被分成相隔的哨位。剩余硬路运送弹药、消息和换防人员，许多阵位无法直接互相观察。\n\n本连守着这片湿地的一段，枪组占据可用坑岸与掩体，壕炮弹沿尚存通路送上来。英军动静在雨烟中断续出现。道路损坏时，即使相邻枪位仍在，补给也可能中断。后方携弹队正寻找能够继续靠近前沿的地段。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日\n\n携弹兵停在陷下去的木板前，箱子只能从手上传过去。前沿各枪位被水隔开，英军在雨烟中接近。壕炮组等着炮弹，守望的人不断擦去镜片上的水。\n\n一条硬路从坑岸后通过，换防队蹲在路边等候。军士让送信的人先走，又向远处枪声张望。邻近的机枪还在响，后方却没有找到过去的路。\n\n第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen\n\nA bearer stops at a sunken plank. His box must pass from hand to hand. Water separates the forward guns as British troops approach through rain and smoke. The mortar crew waits for ammunition. Its lookout keeps wiping the glass.\n\nA firm track passes behind the crater bank. Reliefs crouch beside it while the NCO sends a messenger ahead. He turns towards the distant firing again. The next machine gun can still be heard, but the men behind have found no path to it.\n\nThe Third Battle of Ypres began on thirty-one July."), TEXT("The British attack towards Pilckem begins on 31 July 1917. Rain and artillery damage have flooded the fields around Ypres, breaking the German forward area into separated posts. The remaining firm paths carry ammunition, messages and reliefs between positions that often cannot see one another.\n\nThe company defends part of this wet ground. Gun crews occupy usable banks and shelters, while mortar ammunition is carried forward along the surviving routes. British movement is visible only intermittently through rain and smoke. Damage to a path can interrupt supply even where the neighbouring gun positions remain intact.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日")},
