    {TEXT("幸存哨位夹在两军之间，携弹兵不知道该在哪个壕口转弯。军士向断树后打出手势，前队逐人穿过开阔处。观察员的铅笔仍压在那条刚画出的线上。"), TEXT("Surviving posts lie between the forces. A bearer is unsure which trench mouth to take. The NCO signals beyond a shattered tree, and the leading men cross the open patch one at a time. The observer's pencil rests on his fresh line."), TEXT("Surviving posts lie between the forces. A bearer is unsure which trench mouth to take. The NCO signals beyond a shattered tree, and the leading men cross the open patch one at a time. The observer's pencil rests on his fresh line.")},
