    {TEXT("梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n反击命令送到枪位。田野里散着上次进攻留下的战车，英军正在修补新胸墙。炮兵向接近线开火，步枪手等待 MG 08/15 枪组收好弹带。\n\n交通壕转过一处路口，前面的射孔便看不见了。携弹队在壕角让出通路，担架沿原路回送。修理场里的缴获车辆还未归队，枪手先用两肩把机枪送上坡。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nThe counterattack order reaches the gun post. Tanks from the earlier fighting lie in the fields. British troops are repairing their new parapets. Our batteries fire on the approaches while the riflemen wait for the MG 08/15 crews to pack their belts.\n\nA bend in the communication trench hides the next loophole. Bearers stand aside at the junction and stretchers pass back along the route. Captured vehicles have not left the repair yard; the crew carries its gun up the slope on their shoulders.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai."), TEXT("一九一七年十一月三十日，德军开始反击康布雷突出部。此前的英军坦克攻势打乱了兴登堡线附近的道路与阵位，英军正在加固所得地段。损坏和缴获坦克仍留在德军后方。\n\n本连的步枪手与MG 08/15枪组向受威胁交通线前进，德军炮兵迎击接近路上的英军装甲。深壕切过开阔田野，遮住阵位之间的移动。双方仍依靠这些公路和路口输送补给，旧有前线已经改变，部分壕道方向尚未调整。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n反击命令送到枪位。田野里散着上次进攻留下的战车，英军正在修补新胸墙。炮兵向接近线开火，步枪手等待 MG 08/15 枪组收好弹带。\n\n交通壕转过一处路口，前面的射孔便看不见了。携弹队在壕角让出通路，担架沿原路回送。修理场里的缴获车辆还未归队，枪手先用两肩把机枪送上坡。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nThe counterattack order reaches the gun post. Tanks from the earlier fighting lie in the fields. British troops are repairing their new parapets. Our batteries fire on the approaches while the riflemen wait for the MG 08/15 crews to pack their belts.\n\nA bend in the communication trench hides the next loophole. Bearers stand aside at the junction and stretchers pass back along the route. Captured vehicles have not left the repair yard; the crew carries its gun up the slope on their shoulders.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai."), TEXT("On 30 November 1917, German forces begin their counterattack around the Cambrai salient. The earlier British tank offensive has disrupted roads and positions near the Hindenburg Line. British troops are strengthening captured ground, while damaged and captured tanks remain behind the German front.\n\nThe company advances towards the threatened communications with riflemen and MG 08/15 crews. German artillery engages British armour along the approaches. Deep trenches interrupt the open fields and conceal movement between positions. The counterattack is directed through this altered front, where supply roads and junctions remain important to both armies.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · Thirty November nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日")},
