    {TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai."), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n浅洼里的人压低枪口，前面林缘又响起一阵机枪声。英军把枪位转向道路，突出部的伤员还在往外送。反击队沿受损壕沟接近，携弹兵跟着最后一人。\n\n断树把邻队遮住，炮兵联络兵在壕口停下来核对位置。道路上有车辆逆着退回的人流前行。军士伏到沟边，伸手拦住准备穿过缺口的步枪手。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nMen in the hollow lower their muzzles as another burst comes from the tree line. British guns face the road, where wounded men are still leaving the salient. The counterattack follows a damaged trench with bearers behind the last rifleman.\n\nBroken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("德军在康布雷附近的反击正在接近布尔隆林。英军守着突出部出口，同时把伤员与部分部队送往后方。弹药车辆仍逆向前行，新的英军枪位照看破碎林地旁的道路。双方都在争夺出口交通。\n\n本连沿浅洼和受损壕沟接近，炮兵联络随着战线变化重新建立。步枪手在林缘遭遇连续阵位，英军防御后面的道路仍在使用。断树遮住交通，也遮住邻近德军队伍；携弹兵正沿尚存路线跟上前沿。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n浅洼里的人压低枪口，前面林缘又响起一阵机枪声。英军把枪位转向道路，突出部的伤员还在往外送。反击队沿受损壕沟接近，携弹兵跟着最后一人。\n\n断树把邻队遮住，炮兵联络兵在壕口停下来核对位置。道路上有车辆逆着退回的人流前行。军士伏到沟边，伸手拦住准备穿过缺口的步枪手。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nMen in the hollow lower their muzzles as another burst comes from the tree line. British guns face the road, where wounded men are still leaving the salient. The counterattack follows a damaged trench with bearers behind the last rifleman.\n\nBroken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("The German counterattack near Cambrai is reaching the approaches to Bourlon Wood. British forces are defending the salient's exits while moving wounded men and some troops towards the rear. Ammunition traffic continues in the opposite direction. New British gun positions cover the roads beside the broken woodland.\n\nThe company approaches these exits through hollows and damaged trenches. Artillery liaison is being restored as the front changes, while riflemen encounter successive positions near the tree line. The roads remain in use behind the British defence. Broken trees restrict observation of both the traffic and neighbouring German parties.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日")},
