    {TEXT("断树把邻队遮住，炮兵联络兵在壕口停下来核对位置。道路上有车辆逆着退回的人流前行。军士伏到沟边，伸手拦住准备穿过缺口的步枪手。"), TEXT("Broken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap."), TEXT("Broken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap.")},
