    {TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月\n\n壕边的雪里有新脚印，前哨却没有回话。接线兵收起断头，顺着湿沟查找另一段线。轻装队把松动的器材系紧，等天色暗下来再离开胸墙。\n\n留守的枪组听见远处零星射击，换防队已经到达后壕。巡逻队在拐角留下一个人，前队消失在铁丝后面。军士靠着壕壁等候，手里的电话没有响。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen\n\nFresh tracks mark the snow beside the trench, but the outpost gives no answer. The linesman collects a broken end and searches along the wet ditch. A light party fastens its loose equipment before leaving the parapet after dark.\n\nThe remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("一九一八年二月，康布雷附近的德军继续修筑壕沟，在冬季前线组织巡逻。铁丝前出现新脚印，一处前哨没有回话。雨雪遮住低田，双方换防活动也使前方动静难以辨认。\n\n本连集结轻装队，准备天黑后查看前沿。相邻壕道与湿沟提供短距离接近路，视野十分有限。巡逻队身后仍有哨兵值守，电话联络也在尝试恢复。这次行动针对本地前哨的异常，附近阵线尚未发生大规模变化。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月\n\n壕边的雪里有新脚印，前哨却没有回话。接线兵收起断头，顺着湿沟查找另一段线。轻装队把松动的器材系紧，等天色暗下来再离开胸墙。\n\n留守的枪组听见远处零星射击，换防队已经到达后壕。巡逻队在拐角留下一个人，前队消失在铁丝后面。军士靠着壕壁等候，手里的电话没有响。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen\n\nFresh tracks mark the snow beside the trench, but the outpost gives no answer. The linesman collects a broken end and searches along the wet ditch. A light party fastens its loose equipment before leaving the parapet after dark.\n\nThe remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("By February 1918, German troops near Cambrai are repairing trenches and conducting patrols along the winter front. Fresh tracks have appeared before the wire, and an outpost has not answered. Rain and snow obscure the low fields, while relief movements on both sides make activity difficult to identify.\n\nThe company assembles a light party to investigate the forward ground after dark. Nearby trenches and wet ditches provide short approaches with little visibility. Sentries remain behind the patrol, and attempts to restore the outpost telephone continue. The action concerns this local interruption along an otherwise established sector.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen")},
