    {TEXT("留守的枪组听见远处零星射击，换防队已经到达后壕。巡逻队在拐角留下一个人，前队消失在铁丝后面。军士靠着壕壁等候，手里的电话没有响。"), TEXT("The remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear."), TEXT("The remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日\n\n先遣步枪手越过破壕，雾里只看得见最近的人。英军第五集团军的支点之间有缺口，炮火继续向后延伸。枪组抬着器材跟上，携弹队还在寻找穿过旧铁丝的路。\n\n前队已经接近公路，侧翼却没有报回位置。联络兵在壕口摊开地图，军士向他指了指身后的长路。弹箱上的绳子磨松了，携弹手停下重新打结。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen\n\nThe leading riflemen cross a broken trench. Only the nearest men show in the fog. Gaps open between British Fifth Army strongpoints while the barrage moves farther back. The gun crew follows with its equipment; bearers search for a path through the old wire.\n\nThe road is close ahead, but the flank has sent no position. A runner opens his map at the trench mouth. The NCO points back along their lengthening route. A loose rope on an ammunition box needs tying again.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("一九一八年三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势以炮击英军前线和后方联络开始。浓雾限制观察，德军突击队寻找支点之间的缺口。英军第五集团军正面宽阔，阵位分散，幸存哨位仍在接近路上抵抗。\n\n本连穿过受损壕沟，向旧前线之外的道路推进。机枪组与携弹队跟随先遣步枪手，炮火逐渐移向纵深，侧翼报告却还不完整。进入英军阵位的部队与原先补给路线之间，距离正在拉长。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日\n\n先遣步枪手越过破壕，雾里只看得见最近的人。英军第五集团军的支点之间有缺口，炮火继续向后延伸。枪组抬着器材跟上，携弹队还在寻找穿过旧铁丝的路。\n\n前队已经接近公路，侧翼却没有报回位置。联络兵在壕口摊开地图，军士向他指了指身后的长路。弹箱上的绳子磨松了，携弹手停下重新打结。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen\n\nThe leading riflemen cross a broken trench. Only the nearest men show in the fog. Gaps open between British Fifth Army strongpoints while the barrage moves farther back. The gun crew follows with its equipment; bearers search for a path through the old wire.\n\nThe road is close ahead, but the flank has sent no position. A runner opens his map at the trench mouth. The NCO points back along their lengthening route. A loose rope on an ammunition box needs tying again.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("Operation Michael begins on 21 March 1918 with artillery striking the British front and rear communications. Fog restricts observation as German assault parties seek gaps between strongpoints. The British Fifth Army's wide sector offers separated positions, but surviving posts continue to resist along the approaches.\n\nThe company advances through damaged trenches towards roads beyond the former front. Machine gun crews and ammunition parties follow the leading riflemen. The artillery is shifting deeper while flank reports remain incomplete. Forward movement has extended the distance from the German supply routes to the troops entering British positions.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日")},
