    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n枪架在软土里陷下去，后面的携弹兵赶来帮忙。前队已经越过河沟，向葡英阵位之间的缺口前进。路口还有英军哨位射击，水沟两侧的人都伏下来。\n\n军士沿较硬的地面寻找邻队，传令兵从另一条沟里回来。后方的补给尚在渡口，枪组只能先把现有弹箱搬上岸。前队的手势隔着水面显得很小。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nThe mounting sinks into soft ground. Bearers behind the crew help lift it. The leading men have crossed the ditch towards a gap between Portuguese and British positions. A British post still fires from the junction, forcing both banks down.\n\nThe NCO follows firmer ground in search of the next party. A runner returns through another ditch. Supplies remain at the crossing. The crew carries its remaining boxes onto the bank, watching a small hand signal from the men across the water.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("一九一八年四月九日，德军乔治特攻势越过利斯河低地，攻击葡萄牙与英军阵位。水沟和河道截断平田，前排继续推进，后面的携弹队却仍依靠同样有限的道路与河岸入口。\n\n本连向联系当地通路的路口前进。机枪组沿较实地面移动，突击分队穿过相邻河沟，英军哨位仍分散在这一地段。积水、损坏通信和补给距离使德军先遣部队难以互相联系，后续人员正在从原有接近路赶来。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n枪架在软土里陷下去，后面的携弹兵赶来帮忙。前队已经越过河沟，向葡英阵位之间的缺口前进。路口还有英军哨位射击，水沟两侧的人都伏下来。\n\n军士沿较硬的地面寻找邻队，传令兵从另一条沟里回来。后方的补给尚在渡口，枪组只能先把现有弹箱搬上岸。前队的手势隔着水面显得很小。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nThe mounting sinks into soft ground. Bearers behind the crew help lift it. The leading men have crossed the ditch towards a gap between Portuguese and British positions. A British post still fires from the junction, forcing both banks down.\n\nThe NCO follows firmer ground in search of the next party. A runner returns through another ditch. Supplies remain at the crossing. The crew carries its remaining boxes onto the bank, watching a small hand signal from the men across the water.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("On 9 April 1918, German forces open Georgette across the Lys lowlands against Portuguese and British positions. Ditches and watercourses interrupt the flat fields. The initial pressure is carrying the attack forward, while ammunition parties behind the infantry must use the same restricted roads and riverbank approaches.\n\nThe company advances towards a junction linking the local routes. Machine gun crews move along the firmer ground as assault parties pass through neighbouring ditches. British posts remain separated across the sector. Water, damaged communications and the distance from the following supplies complicate contact between German forward groups.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen")},
