    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日\n\n纤道上落满碎土，送弹队要从这里到达岸上枪位。烟把对面坡脚遮住，英军正在接近运河。工兵沿受损岸路查看，枪手俯身从高处寻找水边的动静。\n\n预备队在前哨后等候，换防人员带回道路被打断的消息。军士让两个人抬起一只弹箱，改从斜坡接近。枪声没有停，纤道尽头却已看不到联络兵。\n\n英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen\n\nLoose earth covers the towpath carrying ammunition to the guns above. Smoke hides the opposite slope as British troops approach the canal. Pioneers examine the damaged bank route. A gunner bends over his position to watch the water below.\n\nReserves wait behind the posts. Returning reliefs report a break in the path. The NCO has two men lift a box and take it towards the slope instead. The guns continue firing, but the runner at the far end of the towpath is gone.\n\nBritish troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September."), TEXT("一九一八年九月二十九日，里克瓦尔附近的德军运河阵地遭到英军攻击，协约国也向北面的隧道地段推进。圣康坦运河形成深障碍，纤道和受损岸路联系守军哨位，烟遮住对岸移动。\n\n本连守着一段运河接近线，枪组从岸上射击，工兵照看剩余通路，预备队聚在前哨后。换防与弹药依靠同样狭路。土坡或纤道损坏时，即使武器仍能开火，阵位之间也可能失去联系，后方人员难以靠近。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日\n\n纤道上落满碎土，送弹队要从这里到达岸上枪位。烟把对面坡脚遮住，英军正在接近运河。工兵沿受损岸路查看，枪手俯身从高处寻找水边的动静。\n\n预备队在前哨后等候，换防人员带回道路被打断的消息。军士让两个人抬起一只弹箱，改从斜坡接近。枪声没有停，纤道尽头却已看不到联络兵。\n\n英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen\n\nLoose earth covers the towpath carrying ammunition to the guns above. Smoke hides the opposite slope as British troops approach the canal. Pioneers examine the damaged bank route. A gunner bends over his position to watch the water below.\n\nReserves wait behind the posts. Returning reliefs report a break in the path. The NCO has two men lift a box and take it towards the slope instead. The guns continue firing, but the runner at the far end of the towpath is gone.\n\nBritish troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September."), TEXT("On 29 September 1918, the German canal positions near Riqueval face a British attack while Allied forces also advance around the tunnel sector to the north. The St Quentin Canal forms a deep obstacle, with towpaths and damaged bank routes connecting the defending posts. Smoke obscures movement across the water.\n\nThe company defends part of the canal approaches. Gun crews maintain fire from the banks, engineers tend the remaining passages, and reserves assemble behind the forward positions. Reliefs and ammunition depend on the same narrow routes. Damage along a slope or towpath can separate posts even before their weapons are silenced.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日")},
