    {TEXT("英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。"), TEXT("British troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September."), TEXT("British troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月\n\n车站还在装运，切口里的列车向谷口开火。公路上有部队撤过来，炮弹落在路堤另一面。守着接近路的步枪手回头，看见携弹兵正从车站跑来。\n\n换防队沿河岸进入阵地，军士把来路交代给新枪手。路堤遮住列车侧面，只露出上面的枪位。车站方向又响起装车声，担架队等着前面的车辆先走。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October nineteen eighteen\n\nLoading continues at the station. The train in the cutting fires towards the valley entrance as troops withdraw along the road. Shells fall beyond the embankment. Riflemen covering the approach turn to see bearers coming from the station.\n\nReliefs enter along the riverbank. The NCO explains the approach to a new gunner. The embankment hides the train's side, leaving its upper guns visible. More loading can be heard behind them. The stretcher party waits for the vehicles ahead to move out.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."), TEXT("一九一八年十月，塞勒河谷的德军后卫在协约国压力下掩护部队和物资撤离。渡口与铁路路堤限制后路，车站仍在装车，炮火搜索河谷道路和切口。撤出的交通尚未全部通过。\n\n本连所在的地段有武装列车从铁路切口支援撤运，步兵占据旁边接近路，河岸与路堤遮住部分车辆侧翼。携弹兵和换防队往返车站与前哨之间。协约国进攻进入谷地时，河岸公路仍然拥挤，各处枪组继续照看来路。")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月\n\n车站还在装运，切口里的列车向谷口开火。公路上有部队撤过来，炮弹落在路堤另一面。守着接近路的步枪手回头，看见携弹兵正从车站跑来。\n\n换防队沿河岸进入阵地，军士把来路交代给新枪手。路堤遮住列车侧面，只露出上面的枪位。车站方向又响起装车声，担架队等着前面的车辆先走。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October nineteen eighteen\n\nLoading continues at the station. The train in the cutting fires towards the valley entrance as troops withdraw along the road. Shells fall beyond the embankment. Riflemen covering the approach turn to see bearers coming from the station.\n\nReliefs enter along the riverbank. The NCO explains the approach to a new gunner. The embankment hides the train's side, leaving its upper guns visible. More loading can be heard behind them. The stretcher party waits for the vehicles ahead to move out.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."), TEXT("In October 1918, German rear guards in the Selle valley are protecting the withdrawal of troops and stores under Allied pressure. River crossings and railway embankments restrict the routes to the rear. Loading continues at the station while artillery searches the roads and cuttings.\n\nThe company's sector includes an armed train covering evacuation from the railway cutting. Infantry occupy the approaches beside it, where banks and embankments conceal parts of the train's flanks. Ammunition bearers and reliefs pass between the station and forward posts. The river roads remain crowded as the Allied attack reaches the valley.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月")},
