    {TEXT("路上挤着伤员和军车，军士不断示意前面继续走。步枪手伏在浅沟里等候，墙另一侧有射击声。手推车卡在一块砖上，旁边的人伸手扶了一把。"), TEXT("Wounded men and military vehicles fill the road. The NCO keeps signalling those ahead to move. Riflemen wait in a shallow ditch, hearing shots beyond the wall. The handcart catches on a brick beside them; a passing man reaches over to steady its loaded frame."), TEXT("Wounded men and military vehicles fill the road. The NCO keeps signalling those ahead to move. Riflemen wait in a shallow ditch, hearing shots beyond the wall. The handcart catches on a brick beside them; a passing man reaches over to steady its loaded frame.")},
