    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 勒莫尔奥姆 · 一九一六年三月\n\n换防队从林后上来，先看见哈奇开斯枪组身旁的空弹箱。山脊上的炮击还没有停，勒贝尔步枪手伏在相邻入口。军士交代去路，声音被近处爆炸打断。\n\n携弹手沿坡后的交通壕赶到，把箱子放在枪架旁。树木挡着邻哨，前面的人抬手示意继续伏低。新到的枪手擦去射孔边的泥，接过了上一班的位置。\n\n德军在三月把凡尔登进攻扩展到默兹河西岸。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Le Mort-Homme · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe relief comes from behind the wood and finds empty boxes beside the Hotchkiss crew. Shellfire continues along the ridge. Lebel riflemen lie at the neighbouring approach. The NCO explains the route, pausing when a near burst drowns his voice.\n\nBearers arrive through the trench behind the slope and put their boxes beside the mounting. Trees hide the next post. A raised hand tells the men to stay low. The new gunner wipes mud from the loophole and takes his predecessor's place.\n\nGerman attacks extended to the Meuse's west bank in March."), TEXT("一九一六年三月，凡尔登战役中的德军攻击延伸到默兹河西岸。勒莫尔奥姆高出谷地，是这一岸法军防御的一部分。炮击破坏山脊与接近地段，法国部队持续轮换，接替前沿守军。\n\n本连位于山脊与林地之间，勒贝尔步枪手和哈奇开斯枪组分别照看相邻入口。坡后的交通壕运送弹药与接替人员，德军压力同时威胁前哨和后方联系。林木、坡脊遮断视线，各处阵位难以直接互相观察。")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 勒莫尔奥姆 · 一九一六年三月\n\n换防队从林后上来，先看见哈奇开斯枪组身旁的空弹箱。山脊上的炮击还没有停，勒贝尔步枪手伏在相邻入口。军士交代去路，声音被近处爆炸打断。\n\n携弹手沿坡后的交通壕赶到，把箱子放在枪架旁。树木挡着邻哨，前面的人抬手示意继续伏低。新到的枪手擦去射孔边的泥，接过了上一班的位置。\n\n德军在三月把凡尔登进攻扩展到默兹河西岸。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Le Mort-Homme · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe relief comes from behind the wood and finds empty boxes beside the Hotchkiss crew. Shellfire continues along the ridge. Lebel riflemen lie at the neighbouring approach. The NCO explains the route, pausing when a near burst drowns his voice.\n\nBearers arrive through the trench behind the slope and put their boxes beside the mounting. Trees hide the next post. A raised hand tells the men to stay low. The new gunner wipes mud from the loophole and takes his predecessor's place.\n\nGerman attacks extended to the Meuse's west bank in March."), TEXT("In March 1916, German attacks extend to the western bank of the Meuse during the battle of Verdun. Mort-Homme stands above the valley and forms part of the French defence on this bank. Shellfire damages the ridge and its approaches as French units rotate through the sector.\n\nThe company occupies ground between the ridge and the woodland. Its Lebel riflemen and Hotchkiss crews cover separate approaches, with a communication trench behind the slope carrying ammunition and reliefs. German pressure threatens the forward posts as well as the routes linking them to the French rear.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 勒莫尔奥姆 · 一九一六年三月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Le Mort-Homme · March nineteen sixteen"), TEXT("行军作战日志 · 勒莫尔奥姆 · 一九一六年三月")},
