    {TEXT("机枪转向废墟缺口，步枪手沿墙根分开。军士让联络兵留在近处，自己探头观察对面的壕口。堡垒还在更远的地方，眼前一段村道已经落满弹屑。"), TEXT("A machine gun turns towards a gap in the ruins. Riflemen spread along the wall. The NCO keeps the runner close and looks towards the opposite trench mouth. The fort lies farther away; fragments already cover the short village road before them."), TEXT("A machine gun turns towards a gap in the ruins. Riflemen spread along the wall. The NCO keeps the runner close and looks towards the opposite trench mouth. The fort lies farther away; fragments already cover the short village road before them.")},
