    {TEXT("坡脊挡住了后面的枪位。携弹手贴着坑岸前送，军士沿两条接近路传下出发口令。电话线拖过积水，接线兵跪在泥里；连部等着第一声来自高处的回话。"), TEXT("The crest hides the guns behind it. Bearers follow the crater banks. Orders pass down both approaches. A telephone wire drags through water; the linesman kneels in the mud. Headquarters waits for the first answer from the heights."), TEXT("坡脊挡住了后面的枪位。携弹手贴着坑岸前送，军士沿两条接近路传下出发口令。电话线拖过积水，接线兵跪在泥里；连部等着第一声来自高处的回话。")},
    {TEXT("坡脊挡住了后面的枪位。携弹手贴着坑岸前送，军士沿两条接近路传下出发口令。电话线拖过积水，接线兵跪在泥里；连部等着第一声来自高处的回话。"), TEXT("The crest hides the guns behind it. Bearers follow the crater banks. Orders pass down both approaches. A telephone wire drags through water; the linesman kneels in the mud. Headquarters waits for the first answer from the heights."), TEXT("The crest hides the guns behind it. Bearers follow the crater banks. Orders pass down both approaches. A telephone wire drags through water; the linesman kneels in the mud. Headquarters waits for the first answer from the heights.")},
    {TEXT("法军在这次反攻中收复杜奥蒙堡垒。"), TEXT("French forces recovered Fort Douaumont in this counteroffensive."), TEXT("法军在这次反攻中收复杜奥蒙堡垒。")},
