    {TEXT("凡尔登战役持续约三百日。"), TEXT("The Battle of Verdun lasted about three hundred days."), TEXT("The Battle of Verdun lasted about three hundred days.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贵妇小径 · 一九一七年四月十六日\n\n第一道壕沟露在坡上，脊后却还有机枪开火。尼韦尔攻势已经开始，前队伏在铁丝前等候。炮击过的土在靴边滑下，投弹兵盯着更高处的射孔。\n\n军士从弹坑间逐人传话，携弹手把箱子拖到壕口。较近枪位一停，后面又响起射击声。步枪手伸手扶住要起身的同伴，坡顶的土又被打了下来。\n\n贵妇小径进攻失败后，法军爆发大规模抗命。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Chemin des Dames · Sixteen April nineteen seventeen\n\nThe first trench shows on the slope, but machine guns still fire from behind the crest. The Nivelle offensive has begun. Men wait below the wire while shelled earth slips beside their boots. A bomber watches a loophole higher up.\n\nThe NCO passes orders between the shell holes. A bearer drags his box to the trench mouth. When the nearer gun stops, another opens behind it. A rifleman holds down a companion starting to rise. More earth falls from the crest.\n\nWidespread mutinies followed the failed Chemin des Dames offensive."), TEXT("一九一七年四月十六日，尼韦尔攻势在埃纳河地区展开。法军试图突破贵妇小径沿线的德军阵线，山脊却遮住了顶后阵地。大规模进攻面对的是一套纵深防御，其中许多枪位从法国接近地段无法直接观察。\n\n本连面前的据点控制着坡上的入口，近处有铁丝网，更高处和山脊后面仍有火力阵位。最先看见的壕沟只是敌军防线的一部分。这段高地上的战斗同时受到不同纵深枪位的威胁，炮火准备后的坡地仍然暴露在敌军射界内。")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贵妇小径 · 一九一七年四月十六日\n\n第一道壕沟露在坡上，脊后却还有机枪开火。尼韦尔攻势已经开始，前队伏在铁丝前等候。炮击过的土在靴边滑下，投弹兵盯着更高处的射孔。\n\n军士从弹坑间逐人传话，携弹手把箱子拖到壕口。较近枪位一停，后面又响起射击声。步枪手伸手扶住要起身的同伴，坡顶的土又被打了下来。\n\n贵妇小径进攻失败后，法军爆发大规模抗命。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Chemin des Dames · Sixteen April nineteen seventeen\n\nThe first trench shows on the slope, but machine guns still fire from behind the crest. The Nivelle offensive has begun. Men wait below the wire while shelled earth slips beside their boots. A bomber watches a loophole higher up.\n\nThe NCO passes orders between the shell holes. A bearer drags his box to the trench mouth. When the nearer gun stops, another opens behind it. A rifleman holds down a companion starting to rise. More earth falls from the crest.\n\nWidespread mutinies followed the failed Chemin des Dames offensive."), TEXT("On 16 April 1917, the Nivelle offensive begins on the Aisne. French attacks seek to break the German line along the Chemin des Dames, where the ridge conceals positions beyond its crest. The planned breakthrough depends on overcoming defences that cannot all be seen from the French approaches.\n\nThe company faces a strongpoint commanding the slope. Wire obstructs the nearer ground, with further gun positions behind the height. The first trench is only part of the German defence. Fighting on this stretch of the ridge proceeds under fire from positions at different depths.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贵妇小径 · 一九一七年四月十六日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Chemin des Dames · Sixteen April nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贵妇小径 · 一九一七年四月十六日")},
