    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贝卢瓦接近路 · 一九一八年六月十一日\n\n树篱外响起炮声，高地上的法军开始向德军侧翼反击。谷地公路还有部队通过，枪组把枪架朝林缘摆正。步枪手贴着田边观察，隔一块地便看不见彼此。\n\n携弹队从后侧集合地赶来，在路口问前队去了哪里。军士伸手指向坡上，又叫留下的人转向树林。一辆车在树篱后停下，路边的人伏进浅沟。\n\n六月十一日，法军反击马茨地区的德军侧翼。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Belloy Approaches · Eleven June nineteen eighteen\n\nGuns sound beyond the hedge as French troops on the heights counterattack the German flank. Men still pass along the valley road. A crew faces its mounting towards the trees. Riflemen watch from the field edges, losing sight of each other across the plots.\n\nBearers arrive from the assembly ground and ask where the leading party went. The NCO points uphill, then turns the remaining men towards the wood. A vehicle stops behind the hedge. Men beside the road lie in the ditch.\n\nFrench forces counterattacked the German flank at the Matz on eleven June."), TEXT("一九一八年六月十一日，法军在马茨河谷反击德军侧翼。德军攻势已向瓦兹地区的贡比涅方向深入，法国部队从贝卢瓦附近的高地出击。农田、树篱与林地把接近地段分成许多短促而互不相通的视野。\n\n本连掩护附近高地下方的谷地公路，那里连接交战部队与后侧集结的人员，两翼却受到树篱遮蔽。德军若从这一地段反击，便可能分隔前进中的法国步兵和后方。公路与林缘的交火，发生在主反击的侧面。")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贝卢瓦接近路 · 一九一八年六月十一日\n\n树篱外响起炮声，高地上的法军开始向德军侧翼反击。谷地公路还有部队通过，枪组把枪架朝林缘摆正。步枪手贴着田边观察，隔一块地便看不见彼此。\n\n携弹队从后侧集合地赶来，在路口问前队去了哪里。军士伸手指向坡上，又叫留下的人转向树林。一辆车在树篱后停下，路边的人伏进浅沟。\n\n六月十一日，法军反击马茨地区的德军侧翼。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Belloy Approaches · Eleven June nineteen eighteen\n\nGuns sound beyond the hedge as French troops on the heights counterattack the German flank. Men still pass along the valley road. A crew faces its mounting towards the trees. Riflemen watch from the field edges, losing sight of each other across the plots.\n\nBearers arrive from the assembly ground and ask where the leading party went. The NCO points uphill, then turns the remaining men towards the wood. A vehicle stops behind the hedge. Men beside the road lie in the ditch.\n\nFrench forces counterattacked the German flank at the Matz on eleven June."), TEXT("On 11 June 1918, French forces counterattack the German flank in the Matz valley. The German offensive has driven into the Oise towards Compiègne; the French attack strikes from the plateau near Belloy. Farmland, hedges and woodland divide the approaches into short fields of view.\n\nThe company covers the valley road beneath the nearby height. This road links the fighting with troops gathering behind it, while hedges conceal the flanks. German counterattacks into this sector could separate the advancing French infantry from their rear. Fire along the road and woodland edges develops beside the main counterattack.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贝卢瓦接近路 · 一九一八年六月十一日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Belloy Approaches · Eleven June nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贝卢瓦接近路 · 一九一八年六月十一日")},
