    {TEXT("两条交通壕通向后方，携弹手站在转角让出路。军士查过回来的人，再派联络兵去找邻哨。沟外地面被枪弹扫过，报信的人把帽子压低，重新向前走。"), TEXT("Two communication trenches lead back. A bearer stands aside at a traverse. The NCO checks the returning men and sends a runner towards the next post. Bullets cross the ground outside. The messenger lowers his cap and starts forward along the trench again."), TEXT("两条交通壕通向后方，携弹手站在转角让出路。军士查过回来的人，再派联络兵去找邻哨。沟外地面被枪弹扫过，报信的人把帽子压低，重新向前走。")},
    {TEXT("两条交通壕通向后方，携弹手站在转角让出路。军士查过回来的人，再派联络兵去找邻哨。沟外地面被枪弹扫过，报信的人把帽子压低，重新向前走。"), TEXT("Two communication trenches lead back. A bearer stands aside at a traverse. The NCO checks the returning men and sends a runner towards the next post. Bullets cross the ground outside. The messenger lowers his cap and starts forward along the trench again."), TEXT("Two communication trenches lead back. A bearer stands aside at a traverse. The NCO checks the returning men and sends a runner towards the next post. Bullets cross the ground outside. The messenger lowers his cap and starts forward along the trench again.")},
    {TEXT("德军七月进攻未能突破香槟防线。"), TEXT("The German July attack failed to break through in Champagne."), TEXT("德军七月进攻未能突破香槟防线。")},
    {TEXT("德军七月进攻未能突破香槟防线。"), TEXT("The German July attack failed to break through in Champagne."), TEXT("The German July attack failed to break through in Champagne.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日\n\n林间岔路挤着等候出发的人，树下听得见外面的炮声。反攻指向德军马恩突出部西翼，先头队已到林缘。铁丝横在开阔地上，村边侧壕朝这里射击。\n\n后续人员从维莱科特雷方向赶来，军士把各班引向两条小路。携弹手摸过箱盖，跟着前队跨出树影。刚到田地的人伏了下去，林口又空出一段路。\n\n七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen\n\nMen waiting to move fill the forest fork. Guns can be heard beyond the trees as the counterattack turns towards the German salient's western flank. The leading party reaches the edge. Wire crosses the field, covered by a trench beside the village.\n\nMore men arrive from the Villers-Cotterêts direction. The NCO directs sections along two paths. A bearer checks his box lid and follows the first men out of the shade. They drop in the field, leaving a space at the forest exit.\n\nThe Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July."), TEXT("一九一八年七月十八日，协约国反攻指向德军马恩突出部的西翼。法国部队从维莱科特雷周围的森林向苏瓦松出击，林木遮蔽出发地段，出林后的乡野却进入德军观察范围，林缘外的接近地因此受到威胁。\n\n本连位于通向村落外围的林间岔路。铁丝网横在林缘之外，德军侧壕能够横扫开阔地面。这里的进攻从林中掩护转入暴露田野，发生在德军突出部西侧。后续人员仍从林中通路赶来，林口与村道构成这段交战的连接处。")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日\n\n林间岔路挤着等候出发的人，树下听得见外面的炮声。反攻指向德军马恩突出部西翼，先头队已到林缘。铁丝横在开阔地上，村边侧壕朝这里射击。\n\n后续人员从维莱科特雷方向赶来，军士把各班引向两条小路。携弹手摸过箱盖，跟着前队跨出树影。刚到田地的人伏了下去，林口又空出一段路。\n\n七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen\n\nMen waiting to move fill the forest fork. Guns can be heard beyond the trees as the counterattack turns towards the German salient's western flank. The leading party reaches the edge. Wire crosses the field, covered by a trench beside the village.\n\nMore men arrive from the Villers-Cotterêts direction. The NCO directs sections along two paths. A bearer checks his box lid and follows the first men out of the shade. They drop in the field, leaving a space at the forest exit.\n\nThe Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July."), TEXT("On 18 July 1918, the Allied counteroffensive opens against the western flank of the German Marne salient. French troops emerge from the forest around Villers-Cotterêts towards Soissons. The wooded starting ground conceals their approach, but the country beyond the trees opens under German observation.\n\nThe company is at a forest junction leading into the village approaches. Wire lies beyond the woodline, and a German flank trench can fire across the open ground. The attack here passes from covered woodland into exposed fields on the western side of the German salient, facing trenches overlooking the forest edge.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen")},
