    {TEXT("七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。"), TEXT("The Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July."), TEXT("七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。")},
    {TEXT("七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。"), TEXT("The Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July."), TEXT("The Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 索姆皮南侧 · 一九一八年九月二十六日\n\n老铁丝横过田野，炮火已经转向更深的阵地。第四集团军向索姆皮方向进攻，步枪手在南坡寻找缺口。坡前少有遮蔽，枪组刚抬起器材便又伏下。\n\n后壕里有人向德军前沿移动，侧面的射孔也在开火。军士沿沟传下口令，携弹手把弹箱推到前队脚旁。工兵在铁丝下伸进剪钳，断丝落在湿土上。\n\n九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · South of Somme-Py · Twenty-six September nineteen eighteen\n\nOld wire crosses the fields as the barrage moves onto deeper positions. Fourth Army advances towards Somme-Py. Riflemen search for a gap from the southern slope. There is little cover ahead; a crew lifts its equipment, then lies down again.\n\nMen move through a rear trench towards the German front. A loophole on the flank also fires. The NCO passes orders along the ditch. A bearer pushes his box to the leading men. A sapper reaches under the wire with cutters.\n\nAllied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September."), TEXT("一九一八年九月二十六日，法国第四集团军在香槟向索姆皮展开攻势，与更东侧的协约国攻击相呼应。城镇南面，德军旧壕沟和铁丝网控制着开阔入口，秋季进攻面对的是多年战斗中形成的设防地面。\n\n本连位于德军阵线下方的南侧坡地。铁丝网横过田野，后壕仍给守军提供增援和反击的道路。纵横连接的工事延伸到不同深度，坡前缺少遮蔽，接近旧阵地的法国步兵面临正面及侧方火力威胁。")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 索姆皮南侧 · 一九一八年九月二十六日\n\n老铁丝横过田野，炮火已经转向更深的阵地。第四集团军向索姆皮方向进攻，步枪手在南坡寻找缺口。坡前少有遮蔽，枪组刚抬起器材便又伏下。\n\n后壕里有人向德军前沿移动，侧面的射孔也在开火。军士沿沟传下口令，携弹手把弹箱推到前队脚旁。工兵在铁丝下伸进剪钳，断丝落在湿土上。\n\n九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · South of Somme-Py · Twenty-six September nineteen eighteen\n\nOld wire crosses the fields as the barrage moves onto deeper positions. Fourth Army advances towards Somme-Py. Riflemen search for a gap from the southern slope. There is little cover ahead; a crew lifts its equipment, then lies down again.\n\nMen move through a rear trench towards the German front. A loophole on the flank also fires. The NCO passes orders along the ditch. A bearer pushes his box to the leading men. A sapper reaches under the wire with cutters.\n\nAllied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September."), TEXT("On 26 September 1918, the French Fourth Army begins its Champagne offensive towards Somme-Py, alongside the Allied attacks farther east. South of the town, established German trenches and wire cover the open approaches. The autumn attack meets positions built into ground repeatedly fought over during the war.\n\nThe company is on an exposed southern slope below the German line. Wire stretches across the fields, while a rear trench gives defenders a route for reinforcement and counterattack. The trenches connect positions at different depths, exposing the approaching French infantry to fire from the front and from the flanks.")},
    {TEXT("行军作战日志 · 索姆皮南侧 · 一九一八年九月二十六日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · South of Somme-Py · Twenty-six September nineteen eighteen"), TEXT("行军作战日志 · 索姆皮南侧 · 一九一八年九月二十六日")},
