    {TEXT("九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。"), TEXT("Allied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September."), TEXT("九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。")},
    {TEXT("九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。"), TEXT("Allied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September."), TEXT("Allied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 格尼拉利帕河 · 一九一四年八月\n\n桥头有人停下，马克沁枪组还在后面等着过桥。对岸的奥匈枪位朝渡口射击，林木遮住了河岸。工兵沿桥边伏低，步枪手从路堤旁寻找另一条接近路。\n\n弹箱和器材在窄处逐件送来，后续队伍挤在树下。军士走到桥口交代次序，前队的人抬手回应。水面映着断枝，枪组把轮架往前推了一步。\n\n俄军在一九一四年占领加利西亚大片地区。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gnila Lipa · August nineteen fourteen\n\nMen halt at the bridgehead while the Maxim crew waits behind to cross. An Austro-Hungarian gun fires from the opposite bank, partly hidden by trees. Engineers crouch beside the bridge. Riflemen search along the embankment for another approach.\n\nBoxes and equipment pass one at a time through the narrow space. Following troops gather under the trees. The NCO gives the order of passage at the bridge mouth. A man ahead raises his hand, and the crew pushes its wheeled mounting another step.\n\nRussian forces occupied much of Galicia in nineteen fourteen."), TEXT("一九一四年八月，俄军进入加利西亚，与奥匈军队交战。格尼拉利帕河沿线的战斗围绕渡口和林木遮蔽的河岸展开。短桥使行进队伍集中，林缘路堤另有接近方向；奥匈枪组控制着对岸地段。\n\n本连的步枪手、工兵和马克沁枪组来到这处渡口。桥头狭窄，前排与后续人员被通路分隔，弹药和器材也从相同路线通过。河岸附近的地形限制观察，战斗逐渐向另一岸延伸，后方部队仍在接近。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 格尼拉利帕河 · 一九一四年八月\n\n桥头有人停下，马克沁枪组还在后面等着过桥。对岸的奥匈枪位朝渡口射击，林木遮住了河岸。工兵沿桥边伏低，步枪手从路堤旁寻找另一条接近路。\n\n弹箱和器材在窄处逐件送来，后续队伍挤在树下。军士走到桥口交代次序，前队的人抬手回应。水面映着断枝，枪组把轮架往前推了一步。\n\n俄军在一九一四年占领加利西亚大片地区。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gnila Lipa · August nineteen fourteen\n\nMen halt at the bridgehead while the Maxim crew waits behind to cross. An Austro-Hungarian gun fires from the opposite bank, partly hidden by trees. Engineers crouch beside the bridge. Riflemen search along the embankment for another approach.\n\nBoxes and equipment pass one at a time through the narrow space. Following troops gather under the trees. The NCO gives the order of passage at the bridge mouth. A man ahead raises his hand, and the crew pushes its wheeled mounting another step.\n\nRussian forces occupied much of Galicia in nineteen fourteen."), TEXT("In August 1914, Russian forces advance into Galicia against the Austro-Hungarian armies. Fighting along the Gnila Lipa brings river crossings and wooded banks into the opening campaign. A short bridge concentrates movement, while an embankment beside the woodland provides another approach. Austro-Hungarian gun crews are covering the ground beyond the river.\n\nThe company reaches this crossing with riflemen, pioneers and Maxim crews. The forward parties are separated from their following troops by the narrow bridge approaches. Ammunition and equipment pass along the same confined routes as the fighting moves towards the far bank.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 格尼拉利帕河 · 一九一四年八月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gnila Lipa · August nineteen fourteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 格尼拉利帕河 · 一九一四年八月")},
