    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月\n\n林口的哨兵举手示意，枪组把枪口转向低隘。要塞的补给已被围困切断，守军仍可能从树林出击。俄军警戒队沿山脊展开，前后的人只能看见最近一段路。\n\n军士派联络兵绕到邻哨，携弹手留在山脊背后等候。林间响起射击声，步枪手贴住土坡。望远镜扫过树干之间的空隙，没有看见送信的人回来。\n\n普热梅希尔于一九一五年三月向俄军投降。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen\n\nA sentry signals from the tree line. The gun turns towards the low pass. The siege has cut the fortress's supply routes, but its defenders may still come out through the woods. Russian posts spread along the ridge with only short views between them.\n\nThe NCO sends a runner around to the next post. Bearers wait behind the crest. Shots sound among the trees and riflemen press against the bank. Glasses search the gaps between trunks. The messenger has not returned.\n\nPrzemyśl surrendered to Russian forces in March nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("一九一五年三月，俄军继续围困加利西亚的普热梅希尔。奥匈堡垒与外部的正常补给联系被切断，守军仍可出击，威胁包围线。俄罗斯阵地分布在主体工事之外的乡野，围城并未使外围停止交火。\n\n本连位于山脊、低隘和林口分隔的一段警戒地带。这些入口相互遮挡，难以从同一处观察。树林能够掩护堡内出击的人员，山脊则俯瞰部分外线。眼前战斗集中于堡垒周围的警戒阵地，俄军步枪与机枪面对来自不同入口的威胁。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月\n\n林口的哨兵举手示意，枪组把枪口转向低隘。要塞的补给已被围困切断，守军仍可能从树林出击。俄军警戒队沿山脊展开，前后的人只能看见最近一段路。\n\n军士派联络兵绕到邻哨，携弹手留在山脊背后等候。林间响起射击声，步枪手贴住土坡。望远镜扫过树干之间的空隙，没有看见送信的人回来。\n\n普热梅希尔于一九一五年三月向俄军投降。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen\n\nA sentry signals from the tree line. The gun turns towards the low pass. The siege has cut the fortress's supply routes, but its defenders may still come out through the woods. Russian posts spread along the ridge with only short views between them.\n\nThe NCO sends a runner around to the next post. Bearers wait behind the crest. Shots sound among the trees and riflemen press against the bank. Glasses search the gaps between trunks. The messenger has not returned.\n\nPrzemyśl surrendered to Russian forces in March nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("In March 1915, Russian troops maintain the siege of Przemyśl in Galicia. The Austro-Hungarian fortress is cut off from its normal supply connections, but its garrison can still threaten the surrounding siege line with sorties. Russian positions extend across the outer country, beyond the main fortifications.\n\nThe company occupies a perimeter sector divided by a ridge, a low pass and a woodland entrance. These approaches are hidden from one another. The woods provide cover for troops leaving the fortress, while the ridge overlooks part of the outer line. The pass and forest entrance present separate fields of fire.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen")},
