    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 戈尔利采方向 · 一九一五年五月二日\n\n树枝从头顶落下，山脊前面的隘口已被炮火覆盖。德军与奥匈军正在进攻，林下集合地开始撤离。枪组留在脊线上，携弹手把箱子拖进浅壕。\n\n军士听过前哨报告，让步枪手守住林道入口。山下的队伍还没有全部走完，路上有人转身回来接伤员。敌军步兵在近坡露出身影，枪架被推向壕肩。\n\n戈尔利采突破迫使俄军从加利西亚后撤。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gorlice Sector · Two May nineteen fifteen\n\nBranches fall overhead as shells cover the pass before the ridge. German and Austro-Hungarian troops are attacking. Men begin leaving the assembly ground below the wood. The gun crew stays on the crest while a bearer drags boxes into the shallow trench.\n\nThe NCO hears the outpost report and places riflemen at the forest path. The column below has not all gone. Men turn back for wounded comrades. Enemy infantry appear on the nearer slope, and the mounting is pushed towards the parapet.\n\nThe Gorlice breakthrough forced a Russian retreat from Galicia."), TEXT("一九一五年五月二日，德军与奥匈军的炮火轰向戈尔利采—塔尔努夫。俄军在加利西亚的防线开始崩溃。\n\n本连守在集合地前方的林间山脊，附近隘口已遭敌军火力覆盖。山下部队正准备沿林道撤离，本连仍留在脊线上，阻挡正在接近的敌军步兵。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 戈尔利采方向 · 一九一五年五月二日\n\n树枝从头顶落下，山脊前面的隘口已被炮火覆盖。德军与奥匈军正在进攻，林下集合地开始撤离。枪组留在脊线上，携弹手把箱子拖进浅壕。\n\n军士听过前哨报告，让步枪手守住林道入口。山下的队伍还没有全部走完，路上有人转身回来接伤员。敌军步兵在近坡露出身影，枪架被推向壕肩。\n\n戈尔利采突破迫使俄军从加利西亚后撤。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gorlice Sector · Two May nineteen fifteen\n\nBranches fall overhead as shells cover the pass before the ridge. German and Austro-Hungarian troops are attacking. Men begin leaving the assembly ground below the wood. The gun crew stays on the crest while a bearer drags boxes into the shallow trench.\n\nThe NCO hears the outpost report and places riflemen at the forest path. The column below has not all gone. Men turn back for wounded comrades. Enemy infantry appear on the nearer slope, and the mounting is pushed towards the parapet.\n\nThe Gorlice breakthrough forced a Russian retreat from Galicia."), TEXT("On 2 May 1915, German and Austro-Hungarian artillery opens the Gorlice–Tarnów offensive. The Russian line in Galicia is breaking under the concentrated attack.\n\nThe company holds a wooded ridge in front of an assembly area. Enemy fire already reaches the nearby pass. Below the crest, Russian troops are preparing to withdraw along the woodland tracks, while the company remains between them and the approaching infantry.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 戈尔利采方向 · 一九一五年五月二日"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gorlice Sector · Two May nineteen fifteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 戈尔利采方向 · 一九一五年五月二日")},
