    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 华沙以东 · 一九一五年八月\n\n渡口出口挤满撤出城市的部队，桥头枪组仍朝西面射击。铁路切口把退路压成窄道，携弹队从人群旁边靠近。前哨传来的消息越来越短，德军已逼近入口。\n\n军士把后卫留在路堤边，让返回的人逐队经过。伤员坐在弹箱上等担架，步枪手向侧面树林张望。桥上传来车轮声，岸边的人又往壕壁贴紧一些。\n\n俄军在一九一五年夏撤出波兰。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · East of Warsaw · August nineteen fifteen\n\nTroops leaving the city crowd the crossing's exit. The bridgehead gun still fires westwards. A railway cutting narrows the route, and bearers move beside the returning column. Reports from the posts grow shorter as German troops approach the entrance.\n\nThe NCO keeps the rearguard by the embankment and lets parties pass in turn. A wounded man sits on a box, waiting for a stretcher. Riflemen watch the trees on the flank. Wheels sound on the bridge, pressing men closer against the bank.\n\nRussian armies withdrew from Poland in the summer of nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("一九一五年八月，德军在波兰的推进迫使俄军撤出华沙。撤退转向维斯瓦河以东的道路，渡口与铁路路堤使交通集中于少数地段。城市正被放弃，俄罗斯后卫仍隔在前进的德军与离开的部队之间。\n\n本连位于城东外围，桥头与铁路切口在这里相连。人员经过渡口及其出口，汇入狭窄的一段退路。德军压向任何一侧入口，都可能威胁正在通过的队伍；河流和路堤又限制着通往更后方道路的移动，使桥边阵地承受持续压力。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 华沙以东 · 一九一五年八月\n\n渡口出口挤满撤出城市的部队，桥头枪组仍朝西面射击。铁路切口把退路压成窄道，携弹队从人群旁边靠近。前哨传来的消息越来越短，德军已逼近入口。\n\n军士把后卫留在路堤边，让返回的人逐队经过。伤员坐在弹箱上等担架，步枪手向侧面树林张望。桥上传来车轮声，岸边的人又往壕壁贴紧一些。\n\n俄军在一九一五年夏撤出波兰。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · East of Warsaw · August nineteen fifteen\n\nTroops leaving the city crowd the crossing's exit. The bridgehead gun still fires westwards. A railway cutting narrows the route, and bearers move beside the returning column. Reports from the posts grow shorter as German troops approach the entrance.\n\nThe NCO keeps the rearguard by the embankment and lets parties pass in turn. A wounded man sits on a box, waiting for a stretcher. Riflemen watch the trees on the flank. Wheels sound on the bridge, pressing men closer against the bank.\n\nRussian armies withdrew from Poland in the summer of nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("In August 1915, German advances through Poland force Russian troops to evacuate Warsaw. The withdrawal turns towards the roads east of the Vistula, where river crossings and railway embankments concentrate traffic. The city is being abandoned while Russian rearguards remain between the advancing Germans and the departing troops.\n\nThe company is on the eastern approaches, beside a bridgehead connected to a railway cutting. The crossing and its exits carry the withdrawal through a narrow sector. German pressure on either entrance threatens this movement, while the river and embankment restrict access to the roads beyond.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 华沙以东 · 一九一五年八月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · East of Warsaw · August nineteen fifteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 华沙以东 · 一九一五年八月")},
