    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 纳罗奇湖 · 一九一六年三月\n\n枪组在窄堤前停住，轮架旁边尽是泥水。德军铁丝横在堤道出口，步枪手从林缘观察那条受火力监视的路。后面的人已经赶到，前队却无法向两侧散开。\n\n军士沿路堤传下口令，携弹手把箱子放在硬地尽头。有人试着踏进沼地，随即被同伴拉回。射击声从铁丝后传来，枪手伏到轮架下面等候。\n\n纳罗奇攻势未能突破德军防线。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Lake Naroch · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe gun crew stops before the narrow causeway. Muddy water surrounds its wheels. German wire blocks the exit, and enemy guns cover the approach. Riflemen watch it from the trees. More men arrive behind them, but the leading party cannot spread to either side.\n\nThe NCO passes orders along the embankment. Bearers set their boxes at the end of the firm ground. One man steps into the marsh and is pulled back. Shots come from behind the wire. The gunner waits beneath the mounting.\n\nThe Naroch offensive failed to break the German line."), TEXT("一九一六年三月，俄军向纳罗奇湖附近的德军阵线发起进攻。湖东南的潮湿地面使可用入口收窄，也妨碍步兵和支援武器移动。德军壕沟与铁丝网控制着沼泽间较坚实的地段，进攻队伍难以在宽广正面展开。\n\n本连面前的窄堤通向已受火力覆盖的铁丝网，林间路堤另有接近地，周围土地却仍泥泞。步兵与机枪组集中在少数能够通行的路面附近。敌军防御监视着俄军穿过湿地的地点，堤道与林缘因而成为交火集中的地段。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 纳罗奇湖 · 一九一六年三月\n\n枪组在窄堤前停住，轮架旁边尽是泥水。德军铁丝横在堤道出口，步枪手从林缘观察那条受火力监视的路。后面的人已经赶到，前队却无法向两侧散开。\n\n军士沿路堤传下口令，携弹手把箱子放在硬地尽头。有人试着踏进沼地，随即被同伴拉回。射击声从铁丝后传来，枪手伏到轮架下面等候。\n\n纳罗奇攻势未能突破德军防线。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Lake Naroch · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe gun crew stops before the narrow causeway. Muddy water surrounds its wheels. German wire blocks the exit, and enemy guns cover the approach. Riflemen watch it from the trees. More men arrive behind them, but the leading party cannot spread to either side.\n\nThe NCO passes orders along the embankment. Bearers set their boxes at the end of the firm ground. One man steps into the marsh and is pulled back. Shots come from behind the wire. The gunner waits beneath the mounting.\n\nThe Naroch offensive failed to break the German line."), TEXT("In March 1916, Russian forces attack the German line near Lake Naroch. Southeast of the lake, wet ground narrows the usable approaches and complicates the movement of infantry and supporting weapons. German trenches and wire cover the firmer strips of land across this marshy sector.\n\nThe company faces a narrow causeway leading towards wire already under fire. A woodland embankment provides another approach, but the surrounding ground remains wet. Riflemen and machine-gun crews are concentrated around these few firm paths. The German defence commands the places where the Russian infantry can cross the marsh.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 纳罗奇湖 · 一九一六年三月\n\n枪组在窄堤前停住，轮架旁边尽是泥水。德军铁丝横在堤道出口，步枪手从林缘观察那条受火力监视的路。后面的人已经赶到，前队却无法向两侧散开。\n\n军士沿路堤传下口令，携弹手把箱子放在硬地尽头。有人试着踏进沼地，随即被同伴拉回。射击声从铁丝后传来，枪手伏到轮架下面等候。\n\n纳罗奇攻势未能突破德军防线。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Lake Naroch · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe gun crew stops before the narrow causeway. Muddy water surrounds its wheels. German wire blocks the exit, and enemy guns cover the approach. Riflemen watch it from the trees. More men arrive behind them, but the leading party cannot spread to either side.\n\nThe NCO passes orders along the embankment. Bearers set their boxes at the end of the firm ground. One man steps into the marsh and is pulled back. Shots come from behind the wire. The gunner waits beneath the mounting.\n\nThe Naroch offensive failed to break the German line."), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 纳罗奇湖 · 一九一六年三月\n\n枪组在窄堤前停住，轮架旁边尽是泥水。德军铁丝横在堤道出口，步枪手从林缘观察那条受火力监视的路。后面的人已经赶到，前队却无法向两侧散开。\n\n军士沿路堤传下口令，携弹手把箱子放在硬地尽头。有人试着踏进沼地，随即被同伴拉回。射击声从铁丝后传来，枪手伏到轮架下面等候。\n\n纳罗奇攻势未能突破德军防线。")},
