    {TEXT("布鲁西洛夫攻势突破了奥匈军在卢茨克一带的防御。"), TEXT("Brusilov's offensive broke the Austro-Hungarian defences around Lutsk."), TEXT("Brusilov's offensive broke the Austro-Hungarian defences around Lutsk.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 切尔诺维茨 · 一九一六年六月\n\n渡河后先头队来到林边，村道交叉口已经响起枪声。布鲁西洛夫攻势推进到布科维纳，奥匈部队还在争夺街巷。装甲列车从铁路驶来，房屋挡住了前面的路。\n\n步枪手在墙下寻找邻队，携弹兵带着箱子穿过路口。军士抬头听了一下车轮声，再指向林外空地。列车露出一截车身，枪组把器材搬到门旁。\n\n布鲁西洛夫攻势重创了奥匈军队。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Czernowitz · June nineteen sixteen\n\nThe leading party reaches the trees after crossing the river. Firing has begun at the village junction. The Brusilov offensive has reached Bukovina, where Austro-Hungarian troops still contest the streets. An armoured train approaches along rails hidden by houses.\n\nRiflemen search for the next party below a wall. Bearers cross the junction with their boxes. The NCO listens to the wheels, then points towards the open ground beyond the trees. A length of carriage appears, and the crew moves its equipment beside a doorway.\n\nBrusilov's offensive inflicted severe losses on the Austro-Hungarian army."), TEXT("一九一六年六月，布鲁西洛夫攻势把俄军南翼带入布科维纳。切尔诺维茨周围的战斗沿村道展开，渡河后的步兵已抵达林地边缘。\n\n本连占据林旁的村道交叉口。奥匈部队仍在争夺街巷，装甲列车正沿铁路驶入这一地段。房屋和树木遮住了接近路线，村落之间的空地却没有掩护。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 切尔诺维茨 · 一九一六年六月\n\n渡河后先头队来到林边，村道交叉口已经响起枪声。布鲁西洛夫攻势推进到布科维纳，奥匈部队还在争夺街巷。装甲列车从铁路驶来，房屋挡住了前面的路。\n\n步枪手在墙下寻找邻队，携弹兵带着箱子穿过路口。军士抬头听了一下车轮声，再指向林外空地。列车露出一截车身，枪组把器材搬到门旁。\n\n布鲁西洛夫攻势重创了奥匈军队。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Czernowitz · June nineteen sixteen\n\nThe leading party reaches the trees after crossing the river. Firing has begun at the village junction. The Brusilov offensive has reached Bukovina, where Austro-Hungarian troops still contest the streets. An armoured train approaches along rails hidden by houses.\n\nRiflemen search for the next party below a wall. Bearers cross the junction with their boxes. The NCO listens to the wheels, then points towards the open ground beyond the trees. A length of carriage appears, and the crew moves its equipment beside a doorway.\n\nBrusilov's offensive inflicted severe losses on the Austro-Hungarian army."), TEXT("In June 1916, the Brusilov offensive carries the Russian southern armies into Bukovina. Around Czernowitz, the advance reaches wooded villages and the roads beyond the river.\n\nThe company holds a village junction at the edge of the woods. Austro-Hungarian troops still contest the lanes, and the railway brings their armoured detachment into the sector. Houses and trees conceal the approaches; the open ground between them remains exposed.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 切尔诺维茨 · 一九一六年六月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Czernowitz · June nineteen sixteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 切尔诺维茨 · 一九一六年六月")},
