    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 斯托霍德河 · 一九一六年七月\n\n铁路路堤上排着前进的队伍，短桥对岸却有机枪开火。通往科韦利的接近地一片潮湿，铁丝挡在河岸前。步枪手伏在窄路旁，等后面的枪组把器材送来。\n\n德军增援已经到达这一带，桥头的枪声更密了。军士向河边观察，传令兵从沼泽旁返回。后续人员又挤上路堤，携弹手把箱子抱在胸前给担架让路。\n\n俄军向科韦利的推进受阻于斯托霍德河。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Stokhod River · July nineteen sixteen\n\nMen line the railway embankment, but a machine gun fires beyond the short bridge. Wet ground covers the approaches towards Kovel. Wire bars the riverbank. Riflemen lie beside the narrow path, waiting for the crew to bring its equipment forward.\n\nGerman reinforcements have reached the sector, and firing thickens at the bridgehead. The NCO watches the river while a runner returns beside the marsh. Following troops crowd the embankment. A bearer holds his box against his chest to let a stretcher through.\n\nThe Russian advance towards Kovel was halted on the Stokhod."), TEXT("一九一六年七月，俄军向科韦利推进，在斯托霍德河遭遇德军增援和坚固防御。潮湿地面使接近渡口更加困难，人员集中于少数坚实路径。德军阵位监视着河边入口和渡口后面的地段，限制俄军继续向前展开。\n\n本连位于沼泽间的铁路路堤与短桥附近，铁丝网挡住河岸接近地。路堤把后侧人员带向渡口，桥边狭窄地面却处于德军火力范围内。由后方赶来的步兵经过同一段窄路，桥面与河岸交火影响着这部分俄军的连续移动。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 斯托霍德河 · 一九一六年七月\n\n铁路路堤上排着前进的队伍，短桥对岸却有机枪开火。通往科韦利的接近地一片潮湿，铁丝挡在河岸前。步枪手伏在窄路旁，等后面的枪组把器材送来。\n\n德军增援已经到达这一带，桥头的枪声更密了。军士向河边观察，传令兵从沼泽旁返回。后续人员又挤上路堤，携弹手把箱子抱在胸前给担架让路。\n\n俄军向科韦利的推进受阻于斯托霍德河。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Stokhod River · July nineteen sixteen\n\nMen line the railway embankment, but a machine gun fires beyond the short bridge. Wet ground covers the approaches towards Kovel. Wire bars the riverbank. Riflemen lie beside the narrow path, waiting for the crew to bring its equipment forward.\n\nGerman reinforcements have reached the sector, and firing thickens at the bridgehead. The NCO watches the river while a runner returns beside the marsh. Following troops crowd the embankment. A bearer holds his box against his chest to let a stretcher through.\n\nThe Russian advance towards Kovel was halted on the Stokhod."), TEXT("In July 1916, the Russian advance towards Kovel meets German reinforcements and strong defences along the Stokhod. Wet ground makes the river approaches difficult to cross, concentrating movement around the few firm paths. The German positions cover these approaches and the ground beyond the crossings.\n\nThe company is beside a railway embankment and a short bridge through the marsh. Wire obstructs the river approach, while the embankment carries troops towards the crossing. German fire can reach the confined ground around the bridge. Infantry arriving from the rear must pass through the same narrow stretch below the enemy positions.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 斯托霍德河 · 一九一六年七月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Stokhod River · July nineteen sixteen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 斯托霍德河 · 一九一六年七月")},
