    {TEXT("德军增援已经到达这一带，桥头的枪声更密了。军士向河边观察，传令兵从沼泽旁返回。后续人员又挤上路堤，携弹手把箱子抱在胸前给担架让路。"), TEXT("German reinforcements have reached the sector, and firing thickens at the bridgehead. The NCO watches the river while a runner returns beside the marsh. Following troops crowd the embankment. A bearer holds his box against his chest to let a stretcher through."), TEXT("German reinforcements have reached the sector, and firing thickens at the bridgehead. The NCO watches the river while a runner returns beside the marsh. Following troops crowd the embankment. A bearer holds his box against his chest to let a stretcher through.")},
