    {TEXT("俄军向科韦利的推进受阻于斯托霍德河。"), TEXT("The Russian advance towards Kovel was halted on the Stokhod."), TEXT("The Russian advance towards Kovel was halted on the Stokhod.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 东加利西亚 · 一九一七年七月\n\n临时政府的进攻命令已经传下，前队在林地边缘集合。山脊把奥匈阵地分成几段，近坡上有枪口，脊后却看不清。排长沿着树根走过去，逐班交代出发方向。\n\n携弹手等在接近路旁，联络兵从林间找来。相邻队伍的消息只传到一半，炮声又盖过人声。前排步枪手把刺刀避开树枝，等排长再次举手。\n\n俄军一九一七年的夏季攻势终告失败。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Eastern Galicia · July nineteen seventeen\n\nThe Provisional Government's attack orders have arrived. Men assemble at the edge of the wood. Ridges divide the Austro-Hungarian positions; a muzzle shows on the near slope, but the ground behind is hidden. The platoon commander gives each section its direction.\n\nBearers wait beside the approach while a runner finds them through the trees. News from the neighbouring party breaks off under the guns. A rifleman keeps his bayonet clear of the branches and waits for the commander to raise his hand again.\n\nThe Russian summer offensive of nineteen seventeen ended in failure."), TEXT("一九一七年七月，二月革命后的俄国临时政府继续参战，军队在东加利西亚发起进攻。攻势面对起伏地面上的奥匈阵地，山脊与林地遮断观察，使双方阵线分成几段各自能够看见的地段，较近坡地和脊线后方难以同时掌握。\n\n本连面对一片被地形起伏分隔的山脊，林地位于接近地侧面，林中联系尚不稳定。敌军枪位监视部分近坡，后侧移动也受到同样地形遮蔽。交战分布在山脊与林缘之间，起伏的坡面不断截断相邻阵位的视线。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 东加利西亚 · 一九一七年七月\n\n临时政府的进攻命令已经传下，前队在林地边缘集合。山脊把奥匈阵地分成几段，近坡上有枪口，脊后却看不清。排长沿着树根走过去，逐班交代出发方向。\n\n携弹手等在接近路旁，联络兵从林间找来。相邻队伍的消息只传到一半，炮声又盖过人声。前排步枪手把刺刀避开树枝，等排长再次举手。\n\n俄军一九一七年的夏季攻势终告失败。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Eastern Galicia · July nineteen seventeen\n\nThe Provisional Government's attack orders have arrived. Men assemble at the edge of the wood. Ridges divide the Austro-Hungarian positions; a muzzle shows on the near slope, but the ground behind is hidden. The platoon commander gives each section its direction.\n\nBearers wait beside the approach while a runner finds them through the trees. News from the neighbouring party breaks off under the guns. A rifleman keeps his bayonet clear of the branches and waits for the commander to raise his hand again.\n\nThe Russian summer offensive of nineteen seventeen ended in failure."), TEXT("In July 1917, Russia's Provisional Government continues the war after the February Revolution, and the army attacks in eastern Galicia. The offensive confronts Austro-Hungarian positions across rolling ground. Ridges and woodland interrupt observation along the front, separating the visible parts of the opposing lines.\n\nThe company faces a crest divided into several stretches by the terrain. Woodland lies beside the approaches, but contact through it is uncertain. Enemy positions overlook parts of the nearer slope, while rearward movement follows ground hidden by the same folds. The fighting develops between the ridge and the wooded flank.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 东加利西亚 · 一九一七年七月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Eastern Galicia · July nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 东加利西亚 · 一九一七年七月")},
