    {TEXT("俄军一九一七年的夏季攻势终告失败。"), TEXT("The Russian summer offensive of nineteen seventeen ended in failure."), TEXT("The Russian summer offensive of nineteen seventeen ended in failure.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月\n\n铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。\n\n军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。\n\n德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen\n\nThe bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men.\n\nThe NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession.\n\nGerman troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("一九一七年九月，德军渡过道加瓦河，威胁里加俄军的退路。战斗已越过前沿壕沟，向城外道路蔓延。\n\n本连留守铁路路堤旁的桥头。撤下来的部队穿过树林，德军步兵正在逼近渡口。桥面尚能通行，河岸枪声却已越来越近。")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月\n\n铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。\n\n军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。\n\n德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen\n\nThe bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men.\n\nThe NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession.\n\nGerman troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("In September 1917, the German attack across the Daugava threatens to cut off Russian troops around Riga. The offensive reaches beyond the forward trenches towards the city's exits.\n\nThe company holds a bridgehead beside the railway embankment. Retreating units approach through the woods as German infantry closes on the crossing. The bridge is still open; firing along the bank is drawing nearer.")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月")},
    {TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen"), TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。"), TEXT("The bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men."), TEXT("铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。")},
    {TEXT("铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。"), TEXT("The bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men."), TEXT("The bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men.")},
    {TEXT("军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。"), TEXT("The NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession."), TEXT("军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。")},
    {TEXT("军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。"), TEXT("The NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession."), TEXT("The NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession.")},
    {TEXT("德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。"), TEXT("German troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。")},
    {TEXT("德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。"), TEXT("German troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("German troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen.")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年初，他率第二集团军守卫凡尔登，组织防御与轮换。补给车沿巴勒迪克公路驶来，这条路后来被称为圣路。"), TEXT("In early nineteen sixteen, he commanded Second Army at Verdun, organising its defence and rotating the troops. Supply lorries followed the road from Bar-le-Duc, later known as the Sacred Way."), TEXT("法军将领，1916年初在凡尔登指挥第2集团军，负责战役初期的防御部署与部队轮换。")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年初，他率第二集团军守卫凡尔登，组织防御与轮换。补给车沿巴勒迪克公路驶来，这条路后来被称为圣路。"), TEXT("In early nineteen sixteen, he commanded Second Army at Verdun, organising its defence and rotating the troops. Supply lorries followed the road from Bar-le-Duc, later known as the Sacred Way."), TEXT("French general who commanded the Second Army at Verdun in early 1916. He organised the defence and rotation of troops during the opening phase.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵出身，一九一六年在凡尔登统率第二集团军。一九一七年任总司令，四月贵妇小径攻势未能突破；五月，他被撤换。"), TEXT("An artillery officer, he commanded Second Army at Verdun in nineteen sixteen. As commander-in-chief in nineteen seventeen, he directed the failed April offensive on the Chemin des Dames. In May, he was replaced."), TEXT("法军炮兵出身的将领，1916年指挥凡尔登第2集团军，1917年任法军总司令，主持了未能实现预定突破的四月进攻。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵出身，一九一六年在凡尔登统率第二集团军。一九一七年任总司令，四月贵妇小径攻势未能突破；五月，他被撤换。"), TEXT("An artillery officer, he commanded Second Army at Verdun in nineteen sixteen. As commander-in-chief in nineteen seventeen, he directed the failed April offensive on the Chemin des Dames. In May, he was replaced."), TEXT("French artillery officer and Second Army commander at Verdun in 1916. As commander-in-chief in 1917, he directed the unsuccessful April offensive on the Chemin des Dames.")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年率凡尔登攻击集群作战，一九一八年六月指挥马茨反击。七月，他率第十集团军向苏瓦松方向进攻。"), TEXT("He led an attack group at Verdun in nineteen sixteen and the Matz counterattack in June nineteen eighteen. In July, his Tenth Army attacked towards Soissons."), TEXT("法军将领，1916年指挥凡尔登攻击集群，1918年六月率部在马茨反击，七月指挥第10集团军参加苏瓦松方向的进攻。")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年率凡尔登攻击集群作战，一九一八年六月指挥马茨反击。七月，他率第十集团军向苏瓦松方向进攻。"), TEXT("He led an attack group at Verdun in nineteen sixteen and the Matz counterattack in June nineteen eighteen. In July, his Tenth Army attacked towards Soissons."), TEXT("French general who led a Verdun attack group in 1916 and the June 1918 Matz counterattack. He commanded the Tenth Army in the July offensive near Soissons.")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年十月，他在拉马尔梅松指挥第六集团军。集中炮火之后，部队向预定的有限目标推进。"), TEXT("He commanded Sixth Army at La Malmaison in October nineteen seventeen. Concentrated artillery preparation supported the army's advance towards its limited objectives."), TEXT("法军将领，1917年十月在拉马尔迈松指挥第6集团军，组织了以集中炮火支援的有限目标进攻。")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年十月，他在拉马尔梅松指挥第六集团军。集中炮火之后，部队向预定的有限目标推进。"), TEXT("He commanded Sixth Army at La Malmaison in October nineteen seventeen. Concentrated artillery preparation supported the army's advance towards its limited objectives."), TEXT("French general who commanded the Sixth Army at La Malmaison in October 1917. He prepared the limited attack with concentrated artillery support.")},
    {TEXT("他在香槟指挥第四集团军，组织一九一八年七月的防御战。九月，司令部又向索姆皮方向下达进攻命令。"), TEXT("He commanded Fourth Army in Champagne during the defensive battle of July nineteen eighteen. In September, his headquarters directed the offensive towards Somme-Py."), TEXT("法军将领，任香槟方向第4集团军司令，其司令部组织了1918年七月防御战和九月向索姆皮方向的进攻。")},
    {TEXT("他在香槟指挥第四集团军，组织一九一八年七月的防御战。九月，司令部又向索姆皮方向下达进攻命令。"), TEXT("He commanded Fourth Army in Champagne during the defensive battle of July nineteen eighteen. In September, his headquarters directed the offensive towards Somme-Py."), TEXT("French general and Fourth Army commander in Champagne. His headquarters directed the July 1918 defensive battle and the September offensive towards Sommepy.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵上将，一九一四至一九一五年任西南方面军司令。所部曾在加利西亚与喀尔巴阡作战，随后在戈尔利采突破中后撤。"), TEXT("An artillery general, he commanded the Southwestern Front in nineteen fourteen and nineteen fifteen. His armies fought in Galicia and the Carpathians before retreating after the Gorlice breakthrough."), TEXT("俄军炮兵上将，1914至1915年指挥西南方面军，所部在加利西亚与喀尔巴阡作战，并在戈尔利采突破后退却。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵上将，一九一四至一九一五年任西南方面军司令。所部曾在加利西亚与喀尔巴阡作战，随后在戈尔利采突破中后撤。"), TEXT("An artillery general, he commanded the Southwestern Front in nineteen fourteen and nineteen fifteen. His armies fought in Galicia and the Carpathians before retreating after the Gorlice breakthrough."), TEXT("Russian artillery general who commanded the Southwestern Front in 1914–1915. His armies fought in Galicia and the Carpathians before retreating during the Gorlice offensive.")},
    {TEXT("步兵上将，率第十一集团军围困普热梅希尔，这支部队也称围城军。一九一五年三月，要塞向其所部投降。"), TEXT("An infantry general, he commanded Eleventh Army, also known as the Siege Army, around Przemyśl. The fortress surrendered to his forces in March nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("俄军步兵上将，指挥围困普热梅希尔的第11集团军，即围城军；要塞于1915年三月向其所部投降。")},
    {TEXT("步兵上将，率第十一集团军围困普热梅希尔，这支部队也称围城军。一九一五年三月，要塞向其所部投降。"), TEXT("An infantry general, he commanded Eleventh Army, also known as the Siege Army, around Przemyśl. The fortress surrendered to his forces in March nineteen fifteen."), TEXT("Russian infantry general who commanded the Eleventh, or Siege, Army surrounding Przemyśl. The fortress surrendered to his forces in March 1915.")},
    {TEXT("一九一五年从波兰撤退期间，他指挥西北方面军。随后转赴俄军最高统帅部，任参谋长。"), TEXT("He commanded the Northwestern Front during the retreat from Poland in nineteen fifteen. He subsequently became chief of staff at the Russian Supreme Headquarters."), TEXT("俄军将领，1915年从波兰撤退期间任西北方面军司令，随后转任俄军最高统帅部参谋长。")},
    {TEXT("一九一五年从波兰撤退期间，他指挥西北方面军。随后转赴俄军最高统帅部，任参谋长。"), TEXT("He commanded the Northwestern Front during the retreat from Poland in nineteen fifteen. He subsequently became chief of staff at the Russian Supreme Headquarters."), TEXT("Russian general and Northwestern Front commander during the 1915 retreat from Poland. He subsequently became chief of staff at the Russian Supreme Headquarters.")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年三月，他以西部方面军司令身份指挥纳罗奇进攻。所属部队攻击德军筑垒阵地，未能取得预定突破。"), TEXT("He commanded the Western Front during the Naroch offensive in March nineteen sixteen. Its armies attacked fortified German positions without achieving the intended breakthrough."), TEXT("俄军将领，1916年三月纳罗奇进攻时任西部方面军司令，其所属部队攻击德军筑垒阵地，但未实现预定突破。")},
    {TEXT("一九一六年三月，他以西部方面军司令身份指挥纳罗奇进攻。所属部队攻击德军筑垒阵地，未能取得预定突破。"), TEXT("He commanded the Western Front during the Naroch offensive in March nineteen sixteen. Its armies attacked fortified German positions without achieving the intended breakthrough."), TEXT("Russian general who commanded the Western Front during the Naroch offensive in March 1916. Its armies attacked fortified German positions without achieving the intended breakthrough.")},
    {TEXT("骑兵出身，一九一六年率西南方面军进攻。一九一七年任最高统帅，夏季攻势在其任内展开。进攻失败后，他被科尔尼洛夫取代。"), TEXT("A cavalry general, he led the Southwestern Front offensive in nineteen sixteen. He became Supreme Commander in nineteen seventeen and held that post when the summer offensive began. After its failure, Kornilov replaced him."), TEXT("俄军骑兵上将，主持西南方面军1916年攻势，1917年出任俄军最高统帅，任内开始了夏季进攻。")},
    {TEXT("骑兵出身，一九一六年率西南方面军进攻。一九一七年任最高统帅，夏季攻势在其任内展开。进攻失败后，他被科尔尼洛夫取代。"), TEXT("A cavalry general, he led the Southwestern Front offensive in nineteen sixteen. He became Supreme Commander in nineteen seventeen and held that post when the summer offensive began. After its failure, Kornilov replaced him."), TEXT("Russian cavalry general who led the Southwestern Front's 1916 offensive. He became Supreme Commander in 1917 and held that post when the summer offensive began.")},
    {TEXT("中将，一九一七年九月德军进攻里加时，指挥第十二集团军。他的司令部先组织防御，继而指挥部队退却。"), TEXT("A lieutenant general, he commanded Twelfth Army during the German attack on Riga in September nineteen seventeen. His headquarters directed the defence and the subsequent retreat."), TEXT("俄军中将，1917年九月德军进攻里加时任第12集团军司令，其司令部指挥了该集团军的防御与退却。")},
    {TEXT("中将，一九一七年九月德军进攻里加时，指挥第十二集团军。他的司令部先组织防御，继而指挥部队退却。"), TEXT("A lieutenant general, he commanded Twelfth Army during the German attack on Riga in September nineteen seventeen. His headquarters directed the defence and the subsequent retreat."), TEXT("Russian lieutenant general who commanded the Twelfth Army during the German assault on Riga in September 1917. His headquarters directed the army's defence and retreat.")},
    {TEXT("德皇威廉二世之子，在凡尔登指挥第五集团军。他在西线还统率以德国皇储命名的集团军群。"), TEXT("The son of Kaiser Wilhelm II, he commanded Fifth Army at Verdun. On the Western Front, he also led the Army Group German Crown Prince."), TEXT("德皇威廉二世之子，在凡尔登任德军第5集团军司令，并在西线指挥以德国皇储命名的集团军群。")},
    {TEXT("德皇威廉二世之子，在凡尔登指挥第五集团军。他在西线还统率以德国皇储命名的集团军群。"), TEXT("The son of Kaiser Wilhelm II, he commanded Fifth Army at Verdun. On the Western Front, he also led the Army Group German Crown Prince."), TEXT("Son of Kaiser Wilhelm II. He commanded the German Fifth Army at Verdun and the Army Group German Crown Prince on the Western Front.")},
    {TEXT("德军元帅，一九一四至一九一六年任东方总司令。随后转任德国最高陆军统帅部首长。"), TEXT("A German field marshal, he served as Eastern commander-in-chief from nineteen fourteen to nineteen sixteen. He then became chief of the German Supreme Army Command."), TEXT("德军元帅，1914至1916年任德军东方总司令，随后转任德国最高陆军统帅部首长。")},
    {TEXT("德军元帅，一九一四至一九一六年任东方总司令。随后转任德国最高陆军统帅部首长。"), TEXT("A German field marshal, he served as Eastern commander-in-chief from nineteen fourteen to nineteen sixteen. He then became chief of the German Supreme Army Command."), TEXT("German field marshal and Eastern commander-in-chief during 1914–1916. He later became chief of the German Supreme Army Command.")},
    {TEXT("巴伐利亚元帅，一九一五年八月五日德军进入华沙时，指挥第九集团军。随后统率以其命名的集团军群，并任东方总司令。"), TEXT("A Bavarian field marshal, he commanded Ninth Army when it entered Warsaw on five August nineteen fifteen. He subsequently led the army group bearing his name and became Eastern commander-in-chief."), TEXT("巴伐利亚元帅，1915年8月5日德军进入华沙时任第9集团军司令，随后指挥以其命名的集团军群，并出任东方总司令。")},
    {TEXT("巴伐利亚元帅，一九一五年八月五日德军进入华沙时，指挥第九集团军。随后统率以其命名的集团军群，并任东方总司令。"), TEXT("A Bavarian field marshal, he commanded Ninth Army when it entered Warsaw on five August nineteen fifteen. He subsequently led the army group bearing his name and became Eastern commander-in-chief."), TEXT("Bavarian field marshal who commanded the German Ninth Army when it entered Warsaw on 5 August 1915. He subsequently commanded the named army group and the Eastern high command.")},
    {TEXT("他先后指挥布格集团军与林辛根集团军群。一九一六年抵御布鲁西洛夫攻势期间，其司令部设在科韦利。"), TEXT("He commanded the Bug Army and then Army Group Linsingen. During the fighting against the Brusilov offensive in nineteen sixteen, his headquarters stood at Kovel."), TEXT("德军将领，先后指挥布格集团军与林辛根集团军群，1916年抵御布鲁西洛夫攻势期间，司令部设于科韦利。")},
    {TEXT("他先后指挥布格集团军与林辛根集团军群。一九一六年抵御布鲁西洛夫攻势期间，其司令部设在科韦利。"), TEXT("He commanded the Bug Army and then Army Group Linsingen. During the fighting against the Brusilov offensive in nineteen sixteen, his headquarters stood at Kovel."), TEXT("German general who commanded the Bug Army and Army Group Linsingen. His headquarters was at Kovel during the fighting against the Brusilov offensive in 1916.")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年率第八集团军进攻里加，一九一八年在法国指挥第十八集团军。六月，其部队向贡比涅方向进攻。"), TEXT("He commanded Eighth Army in the Riga offensive of nineteen seventeen, then Eighteenth Army in France in nineteen eighteen. In June, his troops attacked towards Compiègne."), TEXT("德军将领，1917年进攻里加时指挥第8集团军，1918年在法国指挥第18集团军，参加六月向贡比涅方向的进攻。")},
    {TEXT("一九一七年率第八集团军进攻里加，一九一八年在法国指挥第十八集团军。六月，其部队向贡比涅方向进攻。"), TEXT("He commanded Eighth Army in the Riga offensive of nineteen seventeen, then Eighteenth Army in France in nineteen eighteen. In June, his troops attacked towards Compiègne."), TEXT("German general who commanded the Eighth Army in the 1917 Riga offensive and the Eighteenth Army in France in 1918, including the June attack towards Compiègne.")},
    {TEXT("战争初期，他任奥匈军队总司令。总参谋长康拉德·冯·赫岑多夫主持作战筹划。"), TEXT("He served as Austro-Hungarian army commander during the early war years. Operational planning at his headquarters was directed by the chief of staff, Conrad von Hötzendorf."), TEXT("一战初期任奥匈军队总司令部司令，作战筹划由总参谋长康拉德·冯·赫岑多夫主持。")},
    {TEXT("战争初期，他任奥匈军队总司令。总参谋长康拉德·冯·赫岑多夫主持作战筹划。"), TEXT("He served as Austro-Hungarian army commander during the early war years. Operational planning at his headquarters was directed by the chief of staff, Conrad von Hötzendorf."), TEXT("Austro-Hungarian army commander at the Army High Command during the early war years. Operational planning was directed by chief of staff Conrad von Hötzendorf.")},
    {TEXT("他任普热梅希尔要塞司令。一九一五年三月十九日突围失败，二十二日，已陷入困境的守军在其指挥下投降。"), TEXT("He commanded the fortress of Przemyśl. The sortie of nineteen March nineteen fifteen failed; on twenty-two March, he surrendered the exhausted garrison."), TEXT("奥匈将领，任普热梅希尔要塞司令；1915年3月19日突围失败后，于22日率已陷入困境的守军投降。")},
    {TEXT("他任普热梅希尔要塞司令。一九一五年三月十九日突围失败，二十二日，已陷入困境的守军在其指挥下投降。"), TEXT("He commanded the fortress of Przemyśl. The sortie of nineteen March nineteen fifteen failed; on twenty-two March, he surrendered the exhausted garrison."), TEXT("Austro-Hungarian general and fortress commander at Przemyśl. After the failed sortie of 19 March 1915, he surrendered the exhausted garrison on 22 March.")},
    {TEXT("他在加利西亚指挥第二集团军，后来统率一个集团军群。一九一七年俄军夏季攻势到来时，其集团军群在此迎战。"), TEXT("He commanded Second Army and later an army group in Galicia. His army group faced the Russian summer offensive in nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("奥匈将领，指挥第2集团军及加利西亚方向的集团军群，其集团军群在1917年应对俄军夏季攻势。")},
    {TEXT("他在加利西亚指挥第二集团军，后来统率一个集团军群。一九一七年俄军夏季攻势到来时，其集团军群在此迎战。"), TEXT("He commanded Second Army and later an army group in Galicia. His army group faced the Russian summer offensive in nineteen seventeen."), TEXT("Austro-Hungarian general who commanded the Second Army and an army group in Galicia. His army group faced the Russian summer offensive in 1917.")},
